[ṣoḍaśaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(antaryāganirūpaṇapratijñā)

athāntaryajanaṃ vakṣye caturvargaphalapradam || 1 ||

(nirguṇasyāpi paramātmanaḥ sṛṣṭipravṛttiḥ)

ekamāsīt paraṃ brahma sūkṣmaṃ nityamatīndriyam |
jalīyabhāge cātīte sisṛkṣā samapadyata || 2 ||


<1 |> evaṃ pañcadaśabhiḥ prakāśairnyāsaprakriyāntamabhidhāya avasarasaṅgatyā pūjākrame 
vaktavye (-)

ātmasthāṃ devatāṃ tyaktvā bahirdevaṃ vicinvate |
karasthaṃ kaustubhaṃ tyaktvā bhramate kācatṛṣṇayā ||

pratyakṣīkṛtya hṛdaye bahisthāṃ pūjayecchivām |
yasya yasya ca devasya yathā bhūṣaṇavāhanam ||

tadeva pūjane tasya cintayet parameśvari |

ityādi(-)śāktānandataraṅgiṇīṣaṣṭhollāsavacanena(,)

antaryāgavidhiṃ kṛtvā bahiryāgaṃ samācaret |
bahiryāge nādhikārī antaryāgavivarjitaḥ ||

bahiryāgaphalaṃ nāsti vinā'ntaryajanaṃ kadā |
tasmāt prayatnato vīraścāntaryāgaṃ samārabhet ||

iti kaulāvalīnirṇayatṛtīyollāsavacanena ca bahiryāgasyāntaryāgapūrvakatvaśravaṇāt 
prakāśe'sminnantaryāgakramamabhidhatte (-) athetyādinā | atheti 
pūjāṅganyāsanirūpaṇānantaramityarthaḥ |

<2 |> evamantaryāgakramanirūpaṇaṃ pratijñāya (-)

kāraṇe sarvabhūtānāṃ tattvānyapi ca cintayet |
bījabhāvena līnāni vyutkramāt paramātmani ||

<p. 543> (samāsataḥ sṛṣṭiprakriyā)

saṃhārasyāntaraṃ sṛṣṭaṃ budbudākāramuttamam |
tadantarbhuvanāni syustadaṇḍaṃ dvividhaṃ bhavet || 3 ||


evaṃ vicintya deveśi pārthivāṃśaṃ jale gatam |
jalañca tejaso rūpaṃ tejorūpaṃ vicintayet ||

ityādi(-)gandharvatantraikādaśapaṭaloktadiśā tattvāntarāṇāṃ krameṇa kāraṇabhūtāyāṃ prakṛtau 
prakṛteśca paramātmani laye tanmātrasvarūpanirbhāsalakṣaṇāmavasthāmabhidhatte (-) 
ekamāsīdityādinā | tathāca prāguktalayakramamabhidhāya

mahāntaṃ prakṛtau līnaṃ cintayet parameśvari |
mumukṣuścintayellīnāṃ prakṛtiṃ paramātmani ||

ityantena prakṛtyantānāṃ paramātmani layamuktvā

nāho na rātrirna sandhyā na sūryo naiva candramāḥ |
idaṃ tamomayaṃ sarvamāsīd bhuvanavarjitam |
aprajñātamalakṣyañca prasuptamiva sarvataḥ |
cintayitvā maheśāni na kiñcidapi bhāvayet ||
ekamāsīt paraṃ brahma nityaṃ sūkṣmamatīndriyam |
nityānandamayaṃ dhāma tejorūpaṃ sanātanam | 

ityādinā tātkālikī paramātmanirbhāsamātrātmikā'vasthā tatraivābhihitā | bhagavatā 
manunā'pi (-)

āsīdidaṃ tamobhūtamaprajñātamalakṣaṇam |
apratarkyamavijñeyaṃ prasuptamiva sarvataḥ ||

ityādinā mahāpralayāvasthā'nayaiva diśopavarṇitā | sisṛkṣāyāṃ hetumāha(-) jalīyabhāga iti | 
jalamantareṇa sṛṣṭeḥ sṛṣṭānāṃ jīvānāṃ sthiteścāsasambhavādityarthaḥ | sisṛkṣeyam āpo 
jāyantāṃ kṣitirjāyatāmityādyabhidhānamātreṇa(,) tadaikṣata bahu syāṃ prajāyeye ti 
chāndogyaśruteḥ |

<3-4 |> atha sṛṣṭiparipāṭīṃ darśayati (-) saṃhārasyetyādinā | etena prathamameva jalasṛṣṭirityuktaṃ 
bhavati | gandharvatantrīyaikādaśapaṭale'pi (-)

<p. 544> brahmāṇḍābhyantare toyaṃ tatraiva bhekamavyayam |

(niruktabhekapṛṣṭhe kālādyarcā)

yajet pṛṣṭhe tasya mantrī kālāgnirudrarūpakam || 4 ||

(ādhāraśaktyādīnāṃ svarūpaṃ pūjanopadeśaśca)

ādhāraśaktiṃ tatraiva mūlaprakṛtirūpiṇīm | 
śaraccandranibhāṃ devīṃ paṅkajadvayadhāriṇīm || 5 ||

kūrmākāraśilārūḍhāṃ kūrmañca mūrdhni dhāriṇīm |
nīlābhaṃ pūjayet kūrmamanantaṃ kundasannibham || 6 ||

ūrdhvaṃ brahma samāsīnaṃ pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ || 7 ||


tayoryogādabhūd vṛṣṭiḥ paramāmṛtarūpiṇī |
paripūrṇamidaṃ devi samastaṃ plāvayettu yā ||

tatrāmbhasi svamātmānaṃ cintayet sādhakottamaḥ |
budbadaṃ cintayettatra prakṛtiṃ cintayet parām ||

ityādinā'yamevārtho'bhihitaḥ | tadantariti | vyaktamāha gandharvatantra ekādaśapaṭale (-)

prakṛterhi mahāntaṃ vai ahañca mahatastathā |
ahaṅkārānmanaścaiva manasaḥ khaṃ samutthitam ||

ākāśād vāyumākṛṣya vāyostejaḥ samutthitam |
tejaso jalamāsādya jalācca pṛthivīṃ smaret ||

iti | dvividhamiti bhāgadvayena vibhaktamityarthaḥ(,) vibhāgaśca praṇavena karttavyaḥ | taduktaṃ 
tatraiva (-)

praṇavena dvidhā kṛtvā jalaughaiḥ paripūrayet | iti |

<p. 545> tasya mūrdhni sthitaṃ devaṃ śvetaṃ vārāharūpakam | 
tamālaśyāmalāṃ dante dhārayantaṃ vasundharām || 8 ||

nīlendīvarahastāñca hārakeyūrabhūṣitām |
abhyarcayed vasumatīṃ sphuratsāgaramekhalām || 9 ||

raktānnamamṛtaṃ divyaṃ śuddhalākṣārasopamam || 10 ||

hastābhyāṃ pūjayedapsu dvīpaṃ vidrumasannibham |
navaratnasamākīrṇamaṣṭasiddhisamanvitam || 11 ||

(pīṭhacatuṣṭayārcā)

śaktinābhikayormadhye uḍḍīyānaṃ prapūjayet |
jālandharaṃ tathā vaktre gude ca kāmarūpakam || 12 ||

pūrṇagiriṃ hṛdimadhye śrīhaṭṭaṃ tālukopari |
pūrṇagirau svarṇagiripīṭhaṃ saṃpūjayennaraḥ || 13 ||

(kalpodyānārcā)

kalpodyānaṃ yajettasya parito gandhapuṣpakaiḥ |

(kalpavṛkṣasya svarūpamarcanopadeśaśca)

madhye kalpataruṃ mantrī sarvāśā paripūrakam || 14 ||

sarvabhūtāśrayaṃ vṛkṣaṃ nityaṃ varṇamayaṃ param |
pañcaiva mādanaṃ bījaṃ bindunādamahāśipham || 15 ||


<12 |> śaktinābhikayormadhya iti | anāhatamaṇipūrayormadhya ityarthaḥ |
<14 |> sarvāśāparipūrakamiti | śākhāpraśākhābhiḥ sarvadikparivyāpakamityarthaḥ |

<p. 546> pṛthivyakṣaraśākhābhiḥ sarvāśāsu vijṛmbhitam |
salilākṣarapatraiḥ svaiḥ saṃchāditajagattrayam || 16 ||

vahnivarṇāṅkurairdīptaṃ prabālāṅkurasannibhaiḥ |
marudvarṇalasatpuṣpairdyotayantaṃ vapuḥśriyam || 17 ||

ākāśārṇaphalairnamraṃ sarvabhūtāśrayaṃ param |
parāmṛtākhyamadhubhiḥ siñcantaṃ parameśvarīm || 18 ||

vedāgamādibhiḥ kḷptaṃ samunnatamanoharam |
śivaśaktimayaṃ sākṣādāśritañca jagattrayam || 19 ||

(parijātādicintā)

tanmadhye bhāvayenmantrī pārijātaṃ manoharam |
kadambanāgapunnāgacampakādīn vibhāvayet || 20 ||

kalpamūle ratnabhūmiṃ bālukāṃ kāñcanaprabhām |

(cintāmaṇigṛhādeḥ svarūpaṃ taccintanopadeśaśca)

cintāmaṇigṛhaṃ madhye jyotīrūpamanuttamam || 21 ||

udyadādityasaṅkāśaṃ vyāptabrahmāṇḍamaṇḍalam |
śatayojanavistīrṇaṃ nānāratnopaśobhitam || 22 ||

caturdvārasamāyuktaṃ hemaprākāra śobhitam |
ratnasaṃkḷptasaṃśobhi kavāṭāṣṭakaśobhitam || 23 ||

navaratnena saṃkḷptaṃ tuṅgatoraṇaśobhitam |
hemadaṇḍaśikhālambidhvajāvalipariṣkṛtam || 24 ||

<p. 547> madhyakoṇasthitastambha (-) navaratnasamanvitam |
mahāmāṇikyavaidūryaratnacāmarabhūṣitam || 25 ||

muktādāmavitānāḍhyaṃ svarṇastambhairvirājitam |
mandavāyusamāyuktaṃ gandhapuṣpairalaṅkṛtam || 26 ||

bahuratnaśaṅkhaghaṇṭā (-) nānādravyavibhūṣitam |
madhumattabhramattuṅgabhramaradhvaniśobhitam || 27 ||

gṛhaprākārasaṃlagnaphalakā(śi?li)vimaṇḍitam |
indrādibhirdevagaṇairvinamritadigantaram || 28 ||

suvarṇaratnaracitaṃ chatrantu maṇḍalopari |
paramojjvalarūpantu tanmadhye ratnamaṇḍalam || 29 ||

nandanodyānamadhyasthaṃ

(ratnavedikādeḥ svarūpaṃ taccintanopadeśaśca)

vedikāṃ ratnanirmitām |
tatrasthāṃ cintayedraktāṃ caturasropaśobhitām || 30 ||

nānāratnasamāyuktaṃ siṃhāsanaṃ tadantare |
tasya madhye mahācakraṃ pīyūṣapūrapūritam || 31 ||

tanmadhye sphuritaṃ dhyāyettiśṛṅgaṃ jyotirātmakam |

(rakṣaṇādiparipāṭī)

astreṇa rakṣaṇaṃ kuryādrakṣecca dhenumudrayā || 32 ||

(yonimudrā)

yonimudrāṃ tato vakṣye bāhyamabhyantaraṃ tathā |
cintayed gudamākuñcya brahmasūtraṃ tathā'param || 33 ||

<p. 548> jvaladdīpaśikhākārāṃ(?) saṃkṣobhyāmṛtamaṇḍalam |
sudhādhārāmṛte bhūya āyāti mūlapaṅkaje || 34 ||

evañca saptadhā kuryāddevīsannidhihetave |

(dhyānakramaḥ)

mūlena dhyānayogena smṛtvā brahmamayīṃ parām || 35 ||

pūrakeṇa samāpūrya saṃgopya kumbhakena ca |
sundarīṃ tāṃ samārādhya yoginīgaṇaveṣṭitām || 36 ||

sravadamṛtasaṃyuktāṃ devyaṅgakamalāntare |
brahmaviṣṇubhavairvandyāṃ mahātripurasundarīm || 37 ||

(saśaktikadvārapāladhyānopadeśaḥ)

tato dhyāyed dvārapālān pratidvāre saśaktikān || 38 ||

(sahasrāre devīsaṃsthāpanam)

sahasradalamadhye tu sthāpayet sundarīṃ parām |
bhairavānandaliṅgantu tanmadhye yonisaṃsthitam || 39 ||

(tayorekatvacintā)

ekībhāvaṃ tayoḥ kṛtvā śrāvayedamṛtaṃ budhaḥ |
jihvānanasamāyogāt pibettadamṛtaṃ sadā || 40 ||

(devīpūjā, mānasayāga āvāhananiṣedhaśca)

hṛdaye tu samānīya sundarīṃ pūjayettataḥ |
atraivā''vāhanaṃ nāsti hṛdaye mānasārcane || 41 ||


<34 |> mūleti | mūlādhārasthapaṅkaja ityarthaḥ |

<40 |> ekībhāvamiti | tayoḥ sundarībhairavānandaliṅgayoḥ | amṛtaṃ tayoḥ 
sāmarasyasambhūtaparamāmṛtamityarthaḥ |

<p. 649> ubhābhyāmamṛtānandaiḥ pūjayedrahasaṃkramāt |

(pādyādyupacārapātrasaṃkhyānirūpaṇam)

pādyapātratrayaṃ kuryādarghyapātratrayaṃ tathā || 42 ||

ṣaḍācamanapātrāṇi madhupātratrayaṃ tataḥ |
ekaṃ subhogapātrantu kārayet ṣoḍaśe dale || 43 ||

(mānasapūjākramaḥ)

sahasradalabhṛṅgāralambikānāla vicyutām |
parāmṛtañca pānīyaṃ bhāvapuṣpaṃ suvāsitam || 44 ||

yathāvidhi kare kṛtvā svarṇapātre prapūrayet |
mānasairupacāraistu dīyate dravyamuttamam || 45 ||

kalpayāmīti manasā upacārān prakalpayet || 46 ||

(tatra pādyādyarpaṇaniyamaḥ)

pādyaṃ pādāmbuje maulāvarghyamācamanaṃ mukhe |
madhuparkaṃ tridhā vaktraṃ madhu pānīyamutsṛjet || 47 ||

punarācamanaṃ dattvā gandhapuṣpādikaṃ budhaḥ || 48 ||

(upacāradānamantre viśeṣaḥ)

hṛdvahnivallabhātoyamantraṃ pādyādiṣu kramāt |
namo vauṣaḍ gandhapuṣpe hṛdantānyān nivedayet || 49 ||


<44 |> bhāveti | bhāvapuṣpāṇyagre vakṣyante |

<49 |> athopacāradānamantre viśeṣamāha (-) hṛditi | hṛt namaḥ  vahnivallabhā svāhā | 
toyamantraṃ svadhā | evañca pādyaṃ namo'ntena arghyaṃ svāhāntena(,) ācamanīyaṃ 
svadhāntena(,) gandhaṃ namo'ntena(,) puṣpaṃ vauṣaḍantena(,) upacārāntarāṇi tu namo'ntena 
mantreṇa dadyāditi phalitārthaḥ |

<p. 550> (atrā'gamāntarasammataḥ kramabhedaḥ)

kuloḍḍīśamatenāpi prakārāntaramucyate || 50 ||

dhūpe dīpe svadhā svāhā naivedyācamane svadhā |
namaḥ sarvopacāreṣu prathamānteṣu yojayet || 51 ||

(atraiva kalpasūtrakṛtāṃ matam)

upacāreṣu sarveṣu kalpasūtramate punaḥ |
kalpayāmi nama iti yojanīyamanurmataḥ || 52 ||

(svayambhūkusumādayo viśiṣṭāḥ pūjopacārāḥ)

svayambhūkusumaiḥ kuṇḍagolotthairapi sādhakaḥ |
bhāvapuṣpaiḥ prayatnena pūjayet parameśvarīm || 53 ||

(tatra pañcadaśa bhāvapuṣpāṇi)

amāyamanahaṅkāramarāgamamadantathā |
amohakamadambhañca adveṣaṃ kṣobhavarjitam || 54 ||

amātsaryamalobhañca daśapuṣpaṃ vidurbudhāḥ |
ahiṃsā paramaṃ puṣpaṃ puṣpamindriyanigrahaḥ || 55 ||

dayāpuṣpaṃ kṣamāpuṣpaṃ jñānapuṣpañca pañcamam |
iti pañcadaśoktāni bhāvapuṣpāṇi pūjane || 56 ||

(anye upacārāḥ)

sudhāmbudhiṃ māṃsaśailaṃ matsyārāśiṃ nivedayet |

(ṣaḍaṅgādipūjā)

ṣaḍaṅgānyatha nityāśca guruṇā ratimarcayet || 57 ||

<p. 551> (snapanāṅgamudvartanam)

svavāme maṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā tatra nītvā sureśvarīm |
udvartanaṃ yathānyāyaṃ vidhāya sarpiṣā budhaḥ || 58 ||

(devyāḥ snapanam)

sugandhidivyatailena devakanyāsahasrakaiḥ |
sahasraiḥ svarṇakumbhaistu sugandhijalapūritaḥ || 59 ||

siñcayed bhaktibhāvena bhavānīṃ bhaktavatsalām |
nānātīrthodakaiḥ śuddhairgajarājasahasrakaiḥ || 60 ||

nāgakanyāsahasraistu kinnarairapsarogaṇaiḥ |
pañcāmṛtaiḥ pañcagavyairdugdhairdadhnā gavāmapi || 61 ||

nārikelodakairikṣujalaiśca śiśirodakaiḥ |
saptamṛttikayā yuktatoyena śītalena ca || 62 ||

śītaloṣṇodakaiḥ śuddhaistathā ratnānvitodakaiḥ |
jalaiḥ sarvauṣadhīnāñca suvāsitajalairapi || 63 ||

sahasraśīrṣamantreṇa pāvamānyā samāhitaḥ |
bhṛṅgārāṣṭakakumbhaiśca devyāḥ snānaṃ samācaret || 64 ||


<63 |> jalaiḥ sarvauṣadhīnāmiti | sarvauṣadhigaṇamāha dīpikāyāṃ tṛtīyādhyāye(-)

surā māṃsī vacā kuṣṭhī śaileyaṃ rajanīdvayam |
śaṭhī campaka(-)mustañca sarvauṣadhigaṇaḥ smṛtaḥ || iti |

<64 |> sahasretyādi | sahasraśīrṣā puruṣa ityādipuruṣasūktamantreṇetyarthaḥ | pāvamānyeti | 
pāvamānīḥ svastayanī sududhā hi ghṛtacyuta ityādi (-) pāvamānī(-)sūkte (-) netyarthaḥ |

<p. 552> (devīśarīrālaṅkaraṇakramaḥ)

śarīraṃ tejasāmṛjya dukūle paridhāpayet |
kaṅkatyā keśasaṃskāraṃ vidhivad bandhanaṃ tathā || 65 ||

lalāṭe tilakaṃ dadyāt sindūraṃ keśamadhyataḥ |
raktavastraṃ tathā mālyaṃ raktālaṅkaraṇaṃ tathā || 66 ||

raktānulepanaṃ kāryaṃ gandhacandana(-)sihlakaiḥ |
sarvālaṅkaraṇaṃ dadyād yatra yena virājate || 67 ||


<65 |> vidhivad bandhanamiti niruktaparipāṭyā saṃskṛtānāṃ keśānāmityarthaḥ |

<67 |> sihlakairiti svārthekaḥ | sihlako gandhadravyaviśeṣaḥ | turaṣkaḥ piṇḍakaḥ sihlo 
yāvano'pītyamaraḥ | sarvālaṅkaraṇamiti | vyaktamāha kaulāvalīnirṇaye tṛtīyollāse (-)

nāgendrahāraracitaṃ śaṅkhaṃ dadyānmanoharam |
haste keyūrakañcaiva kaṅkaṇaṃ kaṭakaṃ tathā |
pādāṅgurīyakaṃ dadyānnānāratnopaśobhitam |
pādayornūpuraṃ dadyāt kaṭyāñca kṣudraghaṇṭikām |
śiroratnaṃ pradadyācca ratnanirmitam |
tāḍaṅkakuṇḍalaṃ karṇabhūṣaṇaṃ supariṣkṛtam |
nayane kajjalaṃ dadyānnāsāgre gajamauktikam |
grīvāpatraṃ kaṇṭhabhūṣāṃ muktāmaṇivibhūṣitam |
ānandahāratṛtayamaṅgurīyakaratnakam |

ityādinā | śāktānandataraṅgiṇī (-) gandharvatantrādiṣvapi alaṅkārabhedāḥ pradarśitāḥ | yatra 
yena virājata iti yeṣu yeṣvaṅgeṣu yad yadalaṅkaraṇaṃ śobhāviśeṣamāvahati tattadalaṅkaraṇaṃ 
tatra tatra deyamityarthaḥ |

<p. 553> (śrīpādukāntopacāradānānantaraṃ namaskāropadeśaḥ)

ratnaśrīpāduke dattvā pravāladaṇḍacihnite |
yantramadhye samānīya namaskuryāt samāhitaḥ || 68 ||

(namaskāramantraḥ)

samāyātāmahaṃ vande śrīmattripurasundarīm |
sarvasaubhāgyajananīṃ sarvadevasvarūpiṇīm || 69 ||

(punaḥ pūjanopadeśastatkramaśca)

punaḥ pādyādikaṃ dattvā pūjayet parameśvarīm |
nāsārandhre tu tattvena gandhaṃ devyai nivedayet || 70 ||

bhāvapuṣpaistu saṃpūjya dhūpaṃ dadyāt samīraṇam |
paraṃ tejaḥ pradīpañca naivedyāni nivedayet || 71 ||

pṛthvītattvāttathā vāyostattvena cāmaraṃ śubham |
ravimaṇḍalamādarśaṃ chatraṃ pūrṇaniśākaram || 72 ||

padmaṃ samekhalāṃ mālāmānandahāramujjvalam |
puṣpaṃ nānāvidhaṃ divyaṃ saptadvīpasamudbhavam || 73 ||


<70-72 |> atha yantrārūḍhāyā devyāḥ punaḥ pūjanamupadiśati (-) punarityādinā | 
pādyādikamityādipadenārghyācamanīye bodhye | gandhādyupacārānāha (-) nāsetyādinā | 
tattvena caturviṃśatitattvena | caturviṃśatitattvena gandhaṃ dadyādvicakṣaṇaḥ iti 
kaulāvalītṛtīyollāsavacanasaṃvādāt | bhāvapuṣpairiti | aṣṭādaśa bhāvapuṣpāṇi 
amāyamanahaṅkāramityādinā prāgasminneva prakāśe pradarśitāni | naivedyānīti | 
pṛthvītattvānnaivedyāni nivedayediti sambandhaḥ |

<73 |> puṣpaṃ nānāvidhamiti śaktipūjāyāṃ vihitamiti bodhyam | viśiṣyā'ha kaulāvalīnirṇaye 
tṛtīyollāse (-)

karavīraṃ javā droṇaṃ campakaṃ nāgakeśaram |

<p. 554> ā mūlād brahmarandhrāntaṃ suṣumṇāmṛtavāyunā |
anāhatadhvanimayīṃ ghaṇṭāmetāṃ nivedayet || 74 ||

pradīpairvandanaṃ kṛtvā dattvā ca pratibodhayet || 75 ||

(darśayitavyāsu mudrāsu sundarīmudrā)

ādhārādutthitaṃ vāyuṃ ṣoḍaśānte suṣumṇayā |
nayane nāsikāgrasthe nimeṣonmeṣavarjite || 76 ||

bhruvormadhye samānīya dantairdantānasaṃspṛśan |
noṣṭhairnoṣṭhaṃ na vā tāluṃ jihvayā jñānakhaḍgakaḥ || 77 ||

śaktau lakṣaṃ bahiḥ kuryānnimeṣonmeṣavarjitam |
eṣā sā sundarī mudrā bhairavīmodakāriṇī || 78 ||

(vismayamudrā)

dakṣiṇā militā muṣṭirnāsikārpitatarjanī |
mudrā vismayasaṃjñā syād vismayāveśakāriṇī || 79 ||


aparāñca kadambañca pārijātādikantathā |
dadyāddevyai prayatnena mālyaṃ gandhasamanvitam || iti |

<74 |> atha ghaṇṭādānaparipāṭīmāha (-) ā mūlādityādinā | mūlādhārād 
brahmarandhraparyantavyāpinī suṣumṇākhyā nāḍī varttate | taduktaṃ gāndharve pañcamapaṭale (-)

merumadhye sthitā yā tu mūlādābrahmarandhragā |
sarvatejomayī sā tu suṣumṇā vahnirūpiṇī || iti |

anayaiva suṣumṇayā mūlādhārād brahmarandhraparyantaṃ vāyuḥ sañcarati | tasyaiva 
vāyorāghātena anāhatākhye śabdabrahmamaye hṛtpuṇḍarīke kaścana śabdo'virāmaḥ pravarttate 
| sa eva śabdo'trānāhatadhvanipadenābhidhīyate | tameva dhvaniṃ ghaṇṭāvādyattvena nivedayet 
iti phalitārthaḥ |

<79 |> militā muṣṭirityatra niviḍā muṣṭiriti tantrasāre pāṭhaḥ |

<p. 555> (nādamudrā)

muṣṭiruddhīkṛtāṅguṣṭhā dakṣiṇā nādamudrikā |

(bindumudrā)

tarjanyaṅguṣṭhasaṃyogād bindvākhyā saiva kīrtitā || 80 ||

(jñānamudrā)

jñānamudrā yadaiva syānnā''bhimukhyena saṃsthitā |

(yogamudrā)

hṛtpradeśe tu sambaddhā yogamudreti kathyate || 81 ||

(bahirantaryonimudre)

yonimudrāṃ tataḥ kuryāt saiva cāntarbhavedapi |
tanmāṃsaśoṇitasvādapramattā muktihetave || 82 ||

eṣā sā paramā muktiḥ śṛṅgārarasabhāvitā |
tasyāḥ svecchā svayaṃ bhūtaṃ paramānandabhairavam || 83 ||

kande sthitā vāyuśaktiḥ suṣumṇādvāragāminī |
nīvāraśūkavattanvī viṣatantutanīyasī || 84 ||

vidyutkoṭipratīkāśā sūryakoṭisamaprabhā |
aśeṣajagadutpattisthitisaṃhārakāriṇī || 85 ||


<80 |> muṣṭīti | muṣṭyā ruddhīkṛto'ṅguṣṭho yasyāstathābhūtā dakṣiṇā nādamudretyarthaḥ | 
atra dakṣiṇakarasyāṅguṣṭhamitareṇāṅgulicatuṣṭayena ruddhaṃ kuryāditi phalitārthaḥ |

<81 |> prāguktā tarjanyaṅguṣṭhasaṃyogātmikā bindumudraiva ābhimukhyena na saṃsthitā cet tadā 
jñānamudreti kathyate ityarthaḥ | tathāca kaulāvalīnirṇaye saptamollāse (-)

jñānākhyamudrayā caiva pūjayet parameśvarīm | 
aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāntu jñānamudreyamīritā || iti |

hṛditi | saiva bindumudrā hṛdi saṃyojitā yogamudretyucyata ityarthaḥ |

<82 |> yonīti | bahirantarbhedena yonimudrā dvividhā bhavati | tatra bahiryonimudrā prasiddhā | 
antaryonimudrāmāha saivetyādinā |

<p. 556> hṛdgranthitālukāgranthikapāṭāsphoṭanākulam |
bindulambikayormadhye trikoṇe śāmbhave nayet || 86 ||

praviśya ramate gāḍhaṃ puruṣeṇa sahāniśam |
sthiracittaḥ sadā dhyāyed yathā syānmānasaṃ sthiram || 87 ||

(svayaṃprajñātāsaṃprajñātabhedena samādherdvaividhyam)

samādhirjāyate tatra saṃjñādvayavirājitaḥ |
svayaṃprajñātanāmaiko hyasaṃprajñātanāmadhṛk || 88 ||

(tatra svayaṃprajñātaḥ)

svayaṃprajñātasaṃjñastu śivādhikyena jāyate |

(asaṃprajñātaḥ)

asaṃprajñātanāmā tu śivatattvena vai bhavet || 86 ||

(svayaṃprajñātabhedau)

svayaṃprajñātabhedastu tīvrastīvrataro bhavet |

(asaṃprajñātabhedau)

asaṃprajñātabhedastu mando mandatarastathā || 90 ||

(tatra prathamasya bhedayoḥ svarūpam)

hāsyarodanaromāñcakampasvedādilakṣaṇaḥ |
tīvrastīvrataraścaiva samādhirupalakṣitaḥ || 91 ||

(dvitīyasya bhedayoḥ svarūpam)

nimeṣavarṇi(rji)te netre vapustallakṣaṇaṃ sthitam |
mando mandataraścaiva samādhirupalakṣitaḥ || 92 ||


<88 |> samādhiriti | saṃprajñātāsaṃprajñātabhedena samādherdvaividhyaṃ dvividhasya ca tasya 
tīvratīvrataratvādibhedena te te bhedāḥ pātañjalasūtravyāsabhāṣye viśiṣya pradarśitāḥ |

<p. 557> śāmbhavena tu yogena sukhī bhūyānnirantaram |
tayoḥ saṃyogamāhūya paramāmṛtagokulam || 93 ||

pānīyaṃ manasā dattvā punarjanma na vidyate |
tadānandamayaṃ jñānaṃ prītā bhavati sundarī || 94 ||

(viśrāmārtha kusumaśayane devyāḥ sthāpanaṃ prītisaṃvādanañca)

puṣpaśayyāṃ tataḥ kṛtvā tatra nītvā sureśvarīm |
manonartakatālaiśca śṛṅgārādirasodbhavaiḥ || 95 ||

nṛtyairgītaiśca vādyaiśca toṣayet parameśvarīm |
tasmāt kāmeśvarī mātā pi(prī)tā kāmeśvaraśca saḥ || 96 ||

(mānasayāgaphalam)

manasaikāṃ mahāpūjāmantarārcanamuttamam |
kṛtvā siddhimavāpnoti na sa bandhena badhyate || 97 ||

(jñānahomanirūpaṇopakramaḥ)

jñānahomaṃ pravakṣyāmi yena brahmamayo bhavet |

(tatra caturasrakuṇḍam)

jñānena caturasrākhyaṃ kuṇḍaṃ sañcintya mantravit || 98 ||


<98 |> evamantarārcanamabhidhāya tadaṅgaṃ jñānahomaṃ vaktumupakramate (-) 
jñānahomamityādinā | jñānahomo mānasahoma eva | jñānamātreṇaiva 
vakṣyamāṇahomaprakriyāsampādanādasya jñānahomatvam | asya phalamāha(-) yenetyādinā | 
jñāneneti | jñānena kevalaṃ manovyāpāreṇa cintanamātreṇetyarthaḥ | caturasrākhyamiti | 
kuṇḍamidaṃ saptamaprakāśoktacaturasrakuṇḍavat kalpanīyam | etadabhiprāyeṇaiva jñānārṇave 
dvāviṃśapaṭale (-)

jñānena caturasrākhyaṃ kuṇḍaṃ sañcintya pūrvavat |

ityuktam |

<p. 558> (ātmanāṃ cāturvidhyam)

ātmāno vedasaṃkhyā hi jñātavyāḥ sādhakottamaiḥ |

(niruktātmajñānaphalam)

eṣāṃ vijñānamātreṇa punarjanma na vidyate || 99 ||

(ātmanaḥ svarūpam)

sādhāraṇena pakṣeṇa varttate sarvajantuṣu |
sa ātmā prāṇarūpī tu hṛdaye paramātmakaḥ || 100 ||

(ātmanaścarācaraśarīravyāpakatvam)

śarīraṃ vyāpya sakalaṃ carasyāpyacarasya ca |
haṃsasvarūpī vijñeyaḥ śvāsocchrāsavilāsavān || 101 ||

(bhramavaśādasyaiva jīvasaṃjñā)

jīvastasyaiva nāma syād bhrāntyā śvāsopalakṣitaḥ |
śvāsocchvāsau dehabhāvau bhrāntireva na saṃśayaḥ || 102 ||


<99 |> ātmāna iti | vedasaṃkhyā ātmāntarātmaparamātmajñānātmabhedena catuḥsaṃkhyākā 
ityarthaḥ | itaḥ prabhṛti prakāśāntaṃ yāvaj jñānārṇavīyadvāviṃśapaṭalena prāyaḥ sarvameva 
saṃvadati | tatrā'tmāna ityādipādadvayāt pūrvam (-)

ātmabhiścaturasraṃ tad vijñeyaṃ vīravandite |

iti pādadvayaṃ dṛśyate | atrā'tmabhirityādipādadvayaṃ lekhakapramādāt patitamiti pratibhāti | 
anyathātmacatuṣṭayanirūpaṇamasaṅgatimāpadyeta | evañca 
niruktajñānārṇavavacanaparyālocanayā niruktātmacatuṣkeṇa caturasrakuṇḍaṃ vidheyamityāpatati(,) 
vakṣyati ca svayameva (-)

ātmāntarātmaparamajñānātmānaḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
etadrūpaṃ hi citkuṇḍaṃ caturasraṃ vibhāvayet || iti |

<100-102> ātmanaścāturvidhyaṃ nirūpya tasya sarvamūrtasaṃyogitvādilakṣaṇaṃ svarūpaṃ 
nirūpayati(-) sādhāraṇenetyādinā bhrāntireva na saṃśaya ityantena | anena jīvātma (-)

<p. 559> kulālacakrabhedena ghaṭākāśaṃ yathā ghaṭe |
ghaṭe bhavati bhinnatvaṃ nā'kāśe bhinnatā bhavet || 103 ||

tathā dehagato jīvo dehanāśe jagatsvayam |
vyāpya tiṣṭhati sarvatra tasmādātmapadaṃ mahat || 104 ||


paramātmanorabhedaḥ pratipāditaḥ | sa sarvaprāṇarūpī carācarākhilaśarīravyāpakaḥ 
haṃsasvarūpī prakṛtipuruṣobhayātmakaśca | tatra śvāsocchvāsādyakhilavilāsavān pratidehaṃ 
vyavasthita ātmaiva bhrānterjīvātmatvena vyapadiśyate | paramārthatastu paramātmetarasya kasyacid 
jīvātmanaḥ sattā nāsti | śvāsapraśvāsādīnāṃ śarīradharmapratītistu bhramavaśādeva | ata 
eva gandharvatantre pañcamapaṭale (-)

nityaḥ sarvagato hyātmā kūṭastho doṣavarjitaḥ |
ekaḥ saṃbhidyate bhrāntyā māyayā na svarūpataḥ |
tasmād dvaitaṃ na me cāsti na prapañco na saṃsṛtiḥ ||

ityādinā nityatvaikatvavyāpakatvādikamātmanaḥ pratipāditam |

<103-104 |> nanu tattaddehāvacchedenā'tmano bhedasyānubhavasiddhatvāt kathaṃ tasyaikatvādikaṃ 
sidhyatītyāśaṅkāṃ dṛṣṭāntapradarśanamukhena pariharati(-) kulāletyādinā | yathā 
ākāśasyaikatve'pi kulālacakrabhedena samutpanneṣu ghaṭeṣu tattadghaṭāvacchinnamākāśaṃ 
bhinnatayā pratibhāti vastutastu ghaṭa eva bhinnatvaṃ bhedo bhavati ākāśe tu bhinnatā na 
bhavet(;) ākāśamekameva(,) upādhibhedādeva tasya bhedavyavahāraḥ | ata eva viśvanāthena ekaḥ 
sannapyupādhita ityuktam | evaṃ dṛṣṭāntamupanyasya dārṣṭāntikaṃ pradarśayati (-) tathetyādinā | 
prāgupadarśitaghaṭādyavacchinnākāśavad dehagato dehāvacchinnaḥ paramātmā jīva ityucyate 
parantu dehanāśe'nupahito'yaṃ svayaṃ jagad vyāpya sarvatra tiṣṭhati(,) sarvatra jagatsu ayaṃ 
vyāpya sarvaṃ vastujātamiti śeṣaḥ(,) iti vā sambandhaḥ | yathā tattadghaṭanāśe 
tattadghaṭāvacchinnākāśo mahākāśa eva tathā tattaddehanāśe tattaddehāvacchinna ātmā 
paramātmaiva(,) na tu jīvatvenā'tmanaḥ kācit svatantrā sattā'stīti phalitārthaḥ | 
etadabhiprāyeṇaiva gandharvatantre pañcamapaṭale (-)

yathākāśo ghaṭākāśo mahākāśa itīritaḥ |
tathā bhrāntirdvidhā proktā hyātmā jīveśvarātmanā || iti |

<p. 560> ātmajñānaṃ śivenoktaṃ śṛṇuṣva ca || 105 ||

(antarātmasvarūpam)

antaḥśabdena sakalaṃ rahasyaṃ sūkṣmarūpakam |
paramātmasvarūpeṇa sarvaṃ vyāpya vijṛmbhate || 106 ||

antaraṅgatayā tena caraṃ vā'pyathavā'caram |
vyāpyate sakalaṃ yasmādantarātmeti gīyate || 107 ||

(paramātmanaḥ svarūpam)

sa eva haṃsa ātmā hi yogigamyo yadā bhavet |
tāvaccañcurbhaveccaiva nigamāgamapakṣavān || 108 ||

śivaśaktipadadvandvo bindutrayavilocanaḥ |
yaśca paramahaṃsastu yasmāt sarvatra caiva hi || 109 ||

tadā bhūtāni jāyante krameṇaiva ca tacchṛṇu |
ākāśaḥ pavano hyagnirjalaṃ pṛthvī krameṇa tu || 110 ||

eteṣāṃ pañcabhūtānāṃ prathamaṃ bījamucyate |
avidyākhyasaromadhye mohapaṅkajapūrite || 111 ||

prapañcakamale bhūtapadmākṣaparijṛmbhite |
vihāro'syaiva mohasya dṛṣṭvā māyāmayo bhavet || 112 ||

ayameva mahākāle niṣprapañco yadā bhavet |
saṃhārarūpī haṃsastu tadātmānaṃ pradarśayet || 113 ||


<108 |> paramātmasvarūpamāha (-) sa evetyādinā | tāvadityādinā rūpaparigrahaḥ sūcitaḥ |

<p. 561> pakṣitvamasya nāstyeva so'hamātmā pratiṣṭhitaḥ |
paramātmeti jānīhi evametadudāhṛtam || 114 ||

(jñānātmanaḥ svarūpam)

yenedaṃ jñāyate sarvaṃ samatvena ca sarvadā || 115 ||

candraḥ sūryo yathā nityaṃ nīrakṣīreṣu dṛśyate |
tadvat kṣīrasya samatā nīrakṣīravibhedataḥ || 116 ||

kardame candane bhinnaṃ na bhavedantyaje dvije |
sākṣī tu sarvabhūtānāṃ jñānātmā parikīrtitaḥ || 117 ||

(ātmacatuṣṭayanirūpaṇopasaṃhāraḥ)

ātmāntarātmaparamajñānātmānaḥ prakīrtitāḥ |

(pratijñātacaturasrakuṇḍasyaitadātmacatuṣṭayātmakatvam)

etadrūpaṃ hi citkuṇḍaṃ caturasraṃ vibhāvayet || 118 ||

(kuṇḍasya svarūpam)

ānandamekhalāramyaṃ bindutrivalayānvitam |
ardhamātrāyonirūpaṃ brahmānandamayaṃ sadā || 119 ||

(tatra kuṇḍe homaḥ)

paradevamaye sarvajñānadīpavijṛmbhite |

juhuyāt sannibhe vahnau prapañcāhutimutkaṭam || 120 ||

śabdākhyamātṛkārūpamakṣavarṇavirājitam |
akṣarāṇi hutānyatra niḥśabdaṃ brahma jāyate || 121 ||


<115 |> yenedaṃ jñāyata iti sa jñānātmā parikīrtita iti vakṣyamāṇena sambandhaḥ |

<120 |> sannibha iti | satī nibhā dīptiryasya tasmin(,) sandīpita ityarthaḥ |

<p. 562> (tatra haviḥkalpanam)

kṛtyākṛtye pāpapuṇye saṅkalpañca vikalpakam |
dharmādharmaiḥ sādhakendro havistena prakalpayet || 122 ||

(tena haviṣā homasyopadeśaḥ)

juhuyāc citsvarūpāgnau manubhistena yājakaḥ |
mūlavidyāṃ brahmarūpāṃ dhyātvā saṃvinmayīṃ parām || 123 ||

(tatra prathamo mantraḥ)

dharmādharmahavirdīpta ātmāgnau manasā śrucā |
suṣumṇā vartmanā nityamakṣavṛttīrjuhomyaham |
agnijāyānvito mantro mūlānte prakaṭīkṛtaḥ || 124 ||

(dvitīyo mantraḥ)

nābhau caitanyarūpāgnau haviṣā manasā śrucā |
jñānapradīpite nityamakṣavṛtīrjuhomyaham |
vahnijāyānvito mantro mūlānte samudāhṛtaḥ || 125 ||

(tṛtīyo mantraḥ)

prakāśākāśahastābhyāmavalambyonmanīśrucā |
dharmādharmakalāsnehapūrṇamagnau juhomyaham |
agnijāyānvito mantro mūlānte ca mahātmanā || 126 ||


<123 |> juhuyāditi | manubhiḥ dharmādharmetyādivakṣyamāṇamantraiḥ | tena prāk prakalpitena 
haviṣetyarthaḥ | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam |

<124 |> jñānahomasya prathamaṃ mantramāha (-) dharmeti | evañcā'dau mūlaṃ tato 
dharmādharmetyādijuhomyahamityantaṃ tataḥ svāhetyuktvā prathamāhutim ātmasvarūpāgnau 
juhuyādityarthaḥ | akṣavṛttīrindriyavṛttīḥ |

<125 |> dvitīyamāha (-) nābhāviti | atrāpi pūrvavanmūlaṃ tato nābhāvityādi juhomyahamityantaṃ 
tataḥ svāheti dvitīyāhutiṃ nābhisthe caitanyarūpāgnau juhuyādityarthaḥ |

<126 |> prakāśeti | atrāpi homakramaḥ pūrvavat |

<p. 563> (caturtho mantraḥ)

antanirantaranirindhanamedhamāne
māyāndhakāraparipanthini saṃvidagnau |
kasmiṃścidadbhutamarīcivikāśabhūmau
viśvaṃ juhomi vasudhādiśivāvasānam || 127 ||

juhuyānmūlamantrānte brahmaprāptyai ca sādhakaḥ || 128 ||

(hoturbrahmarūpatvam)

niṣprapañco yadā kāle jāyate brahmavinnaraḥ |
tadā saṃvinmayaḥ sākṣāt kevalaṃ brahmarūpakaḥ || 129 ||

(upasaṃhāraḥ)

antarhomamanuḥ proktaḥ sarvapāpanikṛntanaḥ || 130 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrītattvacintāmaṇau ṣoḍaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 16 ||


<127 |> antariti | antardehābhyantare nirindhanaṃ dāhyamindhanamantareṇa edhamāne prajvalati tathā 
māyāndhakāraparipanthini māyārūpatamaḥpratibandhake adbhutamarīcivikāśabhūmau 
alaukikaraśmiprakaraprakāśākare kasmiṃścidanirvācyasvarūpe saṃviccaitanyaṃ tadrūpāgnau 
vasudhādiśivāvasānaṃ pṛthvītattvādiśivatattvāntātmakaṃ viśvaṃ juhomītyarthaḥ | 
atredamavadheyam (-) śaivāgame śivādīni kṣityantāni ṣaṭtriṃśattattvāni pratipāditāni | tāni ca 
pañcamaprakāśīya (-) (113-114) (-) śa(-) ślokaṭīkāyāṃ ṣaḍadhvanirūpaṇaprasaṅgena viśiṣya 
pradarśitāni | tatra sṛṣṭikrameṇa śivādikṣityantaṣaṭtriṃśattattvanirṇayaḥ kṛtaḥ | atra tu 
viśvavilayārthaṃ vidheye jñānahome layakrameṇa kṣityādiśivāntaṣaṭtriṃśattattvopadeśaḥ | 
ityabhiprāyeṇaiva vasudhādiśivāvasānamityuktam | homakramastu pūrvavat |



[saptadaśaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(śrīcakrasvarūpam(,) mudrāsvarūpam(,) yantranirmāṇopakaraṇādinirṇayaḥ(,) rātrau 
yantranirmāṇaniṣedhaḥ(,) tatra vyavasthā(,) śrīcakroddhāraḥ(,) tatra viśeṣaḥ(,) navacakrabhedāḥ(,) 
cakrarahasyam(,) pīṭhārcā)

(yantranirūpaṇapratijñā)

yantroddhāraṃ pravakṣyāmi sarvasiddhipradāyakam || 1 ||


<1 |> evaṃ pūrvaprakāśe'ntaryāgamabhidhāya prakāśe'smin śrīmattripurasundarīdevyāḥ 
pūjāyantramabhidhātuṃ pratijānīte (-) yantroddhāramityādinā | atredamavadheyam (-) 
śrīmattripurāyāstrividhaḥ saṅketo bhavati yantrasaṅketo mantrasaṅketaḥ pūjāsaṅketaśceti | 
taduktaṃ yoginīhṛdaye prathamapaṭale (-)

cakrasaṅketako mantra (-) pūjāsaṅketakastathā |
trividhastripurādevyāḥ saṅketaḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||
yāvadetanna jānāti saṅketatrayamuttamam |
na tāvat tripurācakre paramājñādharo bhavet ||

iti | cakrayantraśabdāvabhinnārthakau | tatra ca mantrasaṅketaḥ pūrvamabhihitaḥ | 
pūjāsaṅketaścāṣṭādaśaprakāśe vakṣyate | yantrasaṅketasya 
nirūpaṇārthametatprakāśārambhaḥ | saṅketapadārthaśca vyākhyāto 
yoginīhṛdayaṭīkāyāmamṛtānandanāthena (-) saṅketavat saṅketakaḥ(,) yathā kṛtasamayau 
kāminīkāmukau yatra kvāpi vasata evamasmin śivāviti | evañca bhagavatī kāmakalātmikā 
śrīmattripurādevī bhagavatā kāmeśvareṇātra cakre vasatīti saṅketapadādavagamyate |

<p. 565> (yantrapadavyutpattiḥ)

yamayatyakhilaṃ pāpaṃ trāyate mahato bhayāt |
sādhakaṃ pūjanādghyānāttasmād yantraḥ prakīrttyate || 2 ||

ataḥ śarīraṃ yantrañca mantraṃ jñānamakhaṇḍitam || 3 ||

(śarīrasya traividhyam)

śarīraṃ trividhaṃ prāhurbhautikañca manomayam |
paraṃ jñānamayaṃ nityaṃ yadanāśi nirantaram || 4 ||


<2 |> yantrapadavyutpattimāha (-) yamayatītyādinā | etena pātakaniyantritvād 
bhayatrāṇakartṛtvāccāsya yantrasaṃjñā | tantrasāre tu (-)

kāmakrodhādidoṣottha (-) sarvaduḥkhaniyantraṇāt |
yantramityāhuretasmin devaḥ prīṇāti pūjitaḥ |
tathā (-) duḥkhaniyantraṇād yantramityāhustantravedinaḥ ||

iti yantrapadavyutpattiḥ pradarśitā |

<3 |> yantrasya devīśarīrarūpatvamabhidhatte (-) ata ityādinā | ataḥ 
prāguktākhilapāpaniyantṛtvādiguṇakatvād yantraṃ devyāḥ śarīramityarthaḥ | nanu yantraṃ 
devyāḥ śarīraṃ cet kiṃ tatra jñānamityata āha (-) mantraṃ jñānamiti | 
janyajñānavyāvartanāya akhaṇḍitamiti(,) nityamityarthaḥ | ata eva gandharvatantre caturthapaṭale 
śrīcakranirmāṇaparipāṭīmabhidhāya (-)

evametanmahācakraṃ mahāśrītripurāmayam |
yantraṃ śarīramityāhurmantraṃ jñānamakhaṇḍitam ||

ityanenāyamevārtho vyaktamuktaḥ |

<4 |> devīśarīrasya traividhyaṃ darśayati (-) śarīramityādinā | bhautikaṃ manomayaṃ 
jñānamayañceti trividhaṃ śarīramityarthaḥ | tatra jñānamayaśarīrasya viśeṣamāha (-) paramiti | 
niruktaśarīreṣu jñānamayaṃ śarīraṃ paraṃ śreṣṭhamityarthaḥ | śreṣṭhatve hetumāha (-) 
nityamityādinā | nityam utpattirahitam anāśi vināśarahitañca | nityamityanenaivotpattivināśa (-)

<p. 566> (tatsvarūpam)

mudrā bhautikamityāhuryantraṃ viddhi manomayam |
mantraṃ jñānamayaṃ prāhurevaṃ tridhā vapurbhavet || 5 ||

atrāpi mānasadhvaṃse bhautikaṃ nāsti niścitam |
vināśi syāddvayaṃ tasmādekaṃ satyamiti sthitam || 6 ||

ādyantamadhyaśūnyatvānna kiñcinnānupaśyati |
kenāpi jāyate naitat sūto jñānamayaṃ yataḥ || 7 ||

na dṛṣṭaṃ na śrutaṃ kaścittato bhāvā bhavanti hi |
dṛśyante tatra kāyāniveha nānā pṛthagvidhāḥ || 8 ||

adho'dhaste sthūlarūpāḥ sūkṣmāścaivottarottaram |
nānāvarṇākṛtibhidā nānājātisamāśrayāḥ |
pratiṣṭhitārthāḥ sarveṣāṃ līyante tatra sarvaśaḥ || 9 ||

(pūrvapratijñātamudrāsvarūpam)

atha mudrāśarīrañca vakṣyāmi paramādbhutam || 10 ||

yonirūpā mahāmudrā śarīramiti kīrttyate |
saṃkṣobhaṇyā strikhaṇḍāntā navāṅgāni prakīrtitāḥ || 11 ||


rāhityārthāvagamasambhave'pi avināśīti punarupādānādatra nityapadenotpattirahitatvamātraṃ 
vivakṣitamiti bodhyam | phalitamāha (-) nirantaramiti | kālatrayāvacchedena varttamānamityarthaḥ |

<5 |> krameṇaiteṣāṃ svarūpaṃ nirvakti (-) mudretyādinā | tathā ca mudrā bhautikaṃ śarīram(,) 
yantro manomayaśarīram(,) mantraṃ jñānamayaśarīramiti trividhaṃ śarīramityarthaḥ |

<10 |> pūrvoddiṣṭeṣu mudrāśarīraṃ vaktuṃ pratijānīte (-) athetyādinā |

<11 |> mudrāśarīraṃ nirūpayan mudrāṇāmaṅgāṅgibhāvaṃ darśayati (-) yonirūpetyādinā |

<p. 567> (mudrāpadavyutpattiḥ)

ātmānaṃ modayatyeṣā śāntānandamayaṃ dravam |
janayatyeva sā yasmānmudrā bhūtamayaṃ vapuḥ || 12 ||

(yantranirmāṇādhāropakaraṇādinirṇayaḥ)

gomayena ca saṃlipte bhūpradeśe manorame |
sindūrarajasā vā'pi rajobhiḥ kuṅkumasya vā || 13 ||


tatra yonimudrāyāstrailokyotpattimātṛkārūpatayā prādhānyādaṅgitvam ata eva mahāmudretyuktam 
| śarīramiti aṅgītyarthaḥ | athāṅgabhūtā mudrā uddiśati (-) saṃkṣobhaṇyā ityādinā | tāśca 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇī (-) sarvavidrāviṇī (-)sarvākarṣiṇī (-) sarvavaśyakarī (-) sarvonmādinī (-) mahāṅkuśā 
(-) khecarī (-) bīja (-)trikhaṇḍākhyā nava | evañcāṅgāṅgibhāvenāvasthitaṃ mudrādaśakameva 
mudrāśarīramiti vakturāśayaḥ | mudrāṇāmetāsāṃ svarūpāṇi tu aṣṭādaśapaṭale vakṣyante |

<12 |> ātmānamiti | yasmāt ātmānaṃ modayati śāntānandamayaṃ tamātmānaṃ dravaṃ 
janayati tasmād bhūtamayaṃ vapurmudretyucyata iti sambandhaḥ | tantrasāre tu (-)

modanāt sarvadevānāṃ drāvaṇāt pāpasantateḥ |
tasmānmudreti vikhyātā munibhistantravedibhiḥ ||

ityanyathā vyutpattikrama uktaḥ |

<13 |> atha śrīcakranirmāṇādhāropakaraṇādikamabhidhatte (-) gomayenetyādinā yantrarājaṃ 
samuddharedityantena | anyaccāha gandharvatantre caturthapaṭale (-)

tataḥ prāṅmukha āsīnaścakroddhāraṃ samārabhet |
hemarūpāditāmrāṇāṃ paṭṭe vā'timanohare ||
caturasre same śuddhe madhyocchūnavibhūṣite |
yugmāṅgamilitaṃ devi paṭṭasyeha samīritam ||
athavā parameśāni bhūmau cakraṃ samālikhet |
hastamātramite śuddhe gomayenopalepite ||

<p. 568> yantrarājaṃ likhenmantrī svarṇaratnaśalākayā |
puṣpeṇa vilikhed vā'pi bilvasya kaṇṭakena vā || 14 ||

(tatra kalpāntaram)

athavā hemarajatatāmradarpaṇabhūrjake |
śrīkhaṇḍasambhave pīṭhe raktacandanasambhave || 15 ||

gaṇḍakībhavapāṣāṇe paṭe vā rucipīṭhake |
rocanākuṅkumābhyāntu candanena kulodbhavaiḥ || 16 ||

indukastūrikābhiśca yantrarājaṃ samuddharet |
caturasraṃ samārabhya navacakrāṇyanukramāt || 17 ||


sindūrarajasā tatra kuṅkumenāthavā priye |
ālikheccakrarājañca lekhanyā haimayā tathā ||
athavā kuśamūlena darbhapāṇiḥ samāhitaḥ |
netraramyaṃ yathā cakraṃ tathā kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ ||

iti | jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale'pi (-)

śrīcakrantu varārohe śrīvidyāvarṇasambhavam |
tatra prāṅmukha āsīnaścakrarājaṃ samālikhet |
bhūpradeśe same varye sindūrarajasā'thavā |
kuṅkumasya rajobhistu bhūmau cakraṃ samālikhet |
ṛjurekhaṃ netraramyaṃ sandhibhedasamam ṛju |
athavā hemaraupyābhyāṃ tāmreṇa bahudhātubhiḥ |
paṭṭaṃ viracya śrīkhaṇḍaraktacandanasambhave |
paṭṭe saṃsthāpya vilikhellekhanyā haimayā priye |
rocanākuṅkumābhyāntu kasturīcandanendubhiḥ |

iti | evamanyāni ca pramāṇāni kaulāvalīnirṇayatṛtīyapaṭalādāvanusandheyāni | 
navacakrāṇyanukramāditi | navacakrāṇi trailokyamohanādīni sarvānandamayāntāni | tāni cāgre 
viśiṣya vakṣyante |

<p. 569> (cakrasya krameṇonnatamadhyatve phalabhedāḥ)

unnatādunnataṃ madhyaṃ cakraṃ syānnirdhano dhanī |
tritrikramādunnataṃ tat pūjayitvā śriyaṃ labhet || 18 ||

ekadvitrikramāccaiva śriyai kīrttyai ca kalpate |
navāni samarūpāṇi sarvato'bhīṣṭasiddhaye || 19 ||

(śrīcakranirmāṇasthāpanapūjanapraśastiḥ)

kṛtvā śrīcakranirmāṇaṃ sthāpayet pūjayedapi |
lakṣmīkāntiyaśaḥputradhanārogyādisiddhaye || 20 ||

sīsakāṃsyādiṣu kṛtaṃ pūrvokta viparītakṛt || 21 ||

(yantramantradevatānāmabhedaḥ)

yantraṃ mantramayaṃ proktaṃ mantrātmā devateti ca |
purā bhagavatā proktaṃ tantre sammohanākhyake |
dehātmanoryathā'bhedo'yantradevatayostathā || 22 ||


<18-19 |> unnatādunnatamiti | trailokyamohanacakrataḥ sarvānandamayacakraṃ yāvat krameṇa 
yathonnatiḥ syāttathā cakraṃ racayediti phalitārthaḥ | tat phalamāha(-) nirdhana iti | evaṃ kṛte 
nirdhano'pi sādhako dhanavān bhavedityarthaḥ | tritrīti | prathamāt trailokyamohanacakrād dvitīyaṃ 
sarvāśāparipūrakaṃ cakraṃ triguṇonnatam(,) sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇākhyaṃ tṛtīyaṃ tatastriguṇonnatam(,) 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyakākhyaṃ caturthaṃ tatastriguṇonnatamityevaṃkrameṇa yadi aunnatyaṃ vidadhīta 
tarhi taccakraṃ pūjayitvā śriyaṃ labhedityarthaḥ | ekadvitrīti | prāguktakramonnatiparipāṭyāṃ 
prathamasyaikaguṇatvaṃ dvitīyasya pūrvato dviguṇatvaṃ tatastṛtīyasya pūrvatastriguṇatvaṃ evaṃ 
krameṇa caturthādicakrāṇāṃ krameṇaunnatye śrīkīrtisādhakatvaṃ yantrasyetyarthaḥ | navānīti | 
navānāṃ tulyaunnatye'bhīṣṭasampādakatvaṃ cakrasyetyarthaḥ |

<21 |> pūrveti | pūrvoktaviparītakṛt lakṣmīkāntyādivināśakṛdityarthaḥ |

<p. 570> (yantraṃ vinā pūjane doṣaḥ)

atha pīṭhe mahāyantraṃ likhitvā pūjayed budhaḥ |
vinā yantreṇa cet pūjā devatā na prasīdati || 23 ||

(rātrau yantranirmāṇaniṣedhaḥ)

na rātrāvaṅkayed yantraṃ sādhakastu kadācana |
pramādādaṅkite yantre śāpo bhavati tatkṣaṇāt || 24 ||

(tatra yantrapuṣpe pūjanopadeśaḥ)

bhāvacūḍāmaṇimate tatra puṣpe prapūjayet |

(yantrapuṣpāṇi)

yatrāparājitāpuṣpaṃ javāpuṣpañca bhairava || 25 ||


<23 |> vinā yantreṇeti | spaṣṭam | atraitadavadheyam (-) praśastamapīdaṃ yantranirmāṇaṃ 
devatāyāḥ purato na kartavyam(,) dehātmanoryathā'bhedo yantradevatayostatheti pūrvavacanena 
yantradevatayorabhedokterubhayoreva tulyatayā pūjyatvena devatāpūjayā yantrapūjāyāḥ 
siddherasambhavāt | etadabhiprāyeṇaiva mātṛkābhedatantre dvādaśapaṭale (-)

śālagrāme ca pūjāyāṃ na likhed yantramuttamam |
pratimāyāñca pūjāyāṃ na likhed yantramuttamam ||

ityuktam | pramādataḥ kṛte tu pūjanādikaṃ dviguṇamanuṣṭheyam(,) taduktaṃ tatraiva (-)

mahāyantrantu deveśi yadi kuryācca sādhakaḥ |
tatra mūrtiṃ na kuryācca kadācidapi mohataḥ ||
yadi mūrtiṃ prakuryāttu tatra yantraṃ na kārayet |
yadi kuryāttu mohena yajed vāradvayaṃ priye ||
dviguṇaṃ pūjanaṃ tatra dviguṇaṃ balidānakam |
dviguṇaṃ prajapenmantraṃ dviguṇaṃ homayet sudhīḥ |
anyathā viphalā pūjā viphalaṃ balidānakam |
sarvaṃ hi viphalaṃ yasmāttasmād yantraṃ na kārayet || iti |

<p. 571> karavīre raktaśukle droṇaṃ vā yatra tiṣṭhati |
tatra devī vasennityaṃ tadyantre pūjanaṃ mama || 26 ||

(śrīcakranirmāṇaparipāṭī tatra trikoṇamaṣṭakoṇañca)

trikoṇaṃ vilikhedādau tanmadhyācca trikoṇakam || 27 ||

pūrvaśaktyagrabhāge tu mānayaṣṭivadālikhet || 28 ||

sandhibhedakrameṇaiva tayoḥ śaktyostataḥ param |
rekhe ākṛṣya koṇābhyāṃ tadagre pūrvage guruḥ || 29 ||

etattrayātmakenaiva navakoṇaṃ prajāyate |


<27-30 |> atha śrīcakranirmāṇakramamupadiśati (-) trikoṇamityādinā caturdvāraṃ tathaiva cetyantena | 
tatra trikoṇāntarvartino binducakrasya sarvānandamayākhyasya nirmāṇe viśeṣābhāvāt tadupekṣya 
trikoṇādibhūpurāntānāmaṣṭānāṃ nirmāṇaparipāṭīmabhidadhānaḥ prathamaṃ trikoṇasya 
sarvasiddhipradacakrasya tadbahiraṣṭakoṇasya sarvarogaharacakrasya ca nirmāṇaṃ yugapadāha (-) 
trikoṇamityādinā navakoṇaṃ prajāyate ityantena | ādau pratīcyagramekaṃ trikoṇaṃ likhet | 
tanmadhyāt niruktatrikoṇamadhyapradeśāt trikoṇakaṃ pratīcyagramanyattrikoṇamālikhet | 
etattrikoṇasyāgraṃ pūrvatrikoṇasya madhyadeśe mūlantu tadbahiriti jñeyam | anantarakaraṇīyamāha 
(-) pūrvaśaktyagrabhāga iti | śaktiśabdena trikoṇamucyate | tataśca pūrvaśaktyagrabhāge 
madhyatrikoṇāgre mānayaṣṭivat dakṣiṇottarāyatamānadaṇḍavat dakṣiṇottarāyatāmekāṃ 
saralarekhāmālikhet | sandhīti | tataḥ paraṃ 
niruktatrikoṇadvayamadhyatrikoṇāgrasaralarekhānirmāṇānantaraṃ guruḥ tayoḥ śaktyoḥ koṇābhyāṃ 
rekhe rekhādvayamākṛṣya tadagre tayo rekhayoragre agradvayaṃ pūrvage pūrvadiggāminī kuryāditi 
śeṣaḥ | prāguktasaralarekhāyā dakṣottarābhyām agrābhyāṃ tatsambaddhaṃ 
pūrvatrikoṇadvayasandhibhedi pūrvāgraṃ rekhādvayaṃ vidadhītetyarthaḥ | etena prāgagraṃ 
trikoṇāntaraṃ prāptam | evañca paścimāgraṃ trikoṇadvayaṃ pūrvāgrañcaikaṃ 
trikoṇameteṣāñca prāguktarītyā vinyāse madhye trikoṇamekaṃ sarvasiddhi (-)

<p. 572> (antardaśāram)

pūrvaśaktīśavahnibhyāṃ yonirūpāṃ likhettataḥ || 30 ||

dakṣiṇottarakoṇāttu śrīkaṇṭhasya likhed budhaḥ |
rekhāṃ ṣaṭkoṇarūpāntu pūrvaśaktīśavahnitaḥ || 31 ||

ūrddhvarekhe samākṛṣya śrīkaṇṭhāgravicumbinī |
śrīkaṇṭhasya dakṣavāmakoṇāt pūrvavaduddharet || 32 ||

daśakoṇaṃ bhavettatra

(vahirdaṃśāram)

			tathā'nyaddaśakaṃ likhet |


pradākhyaṃ tadbahiraṣṭakoṇañca sarvarogaharākhyaṃ bhavataḥ | ityabhiprāyeṇaiva mūle 
navakoṇaṃ prajāyata ityuktam | gandharvatantre pañcamapaṭale'pi (-)

pratīcyagraṃ likhedekaṃ trikoṇaṃ taduparyatha |
pūrvatrikoṇamadhyāgraṃ trikoṇāntaramālikhet ||
atha sandhidvayaṃ bhittvā prāgagraṃ vilikhet param |
trikoṇamadhyagaṃ cakramaṣṭakoṇaṃ tathā bhavet ||

	iti vacane aṣṭakoṇapadasya trikoṇamadhyagamiti viśeṣaṇena madhye trikoṇaṃ 
tadbahiraṣṭakoṇamiti sphuṭamavagamyate |

<30-33 |> athāṣṭakoṇād bahirlekhanīyamantardaśāraṃ sarvarakṣākarākhyaṃ cakramāha (-) 
pūrvaśaktītyādinā daśakoṇaṃ bhavettatretyantena | pūrvaśaktyā madhyatrikoṇasya 
īśavahnibhyāṃ īśānāgnikoṇābhyāṃ yonirūpāṃ yonyākārāṃ paścimābhimukhīṃ 
trikoṇarekhāṃ likhet | trikoṇāntaramāha (-) dakṣiṇeti | śrīkaṇṭhasya dakṣiṇottarakoṇābhyāmapi 
pūrvāgrāṃ tathaiva yonyākārāṃ trikoṇarekhāṃ likhet | ime ca rekhe prāguktāsu tisṛṣu 
dakṣiṇottarāyatāsu saralarekhāsu pūrvapaścimarekhe varddhayitvā tataḥ kartavye iti 
vyaktīkariṣyāmaḥ | evaṃkṛte ṣaṭkoṇarūpā rekhā bhavati | tataḥ karaṇīyamāha (-) pūrveti | 
pūrvaśaktīśavahnitaḥ pūrvaśakteḥ pūrvatrikoṇasya īśānāgnikoṇābhyām ūrddhva rekhe 
sandhibhedapūrvakamūrddhva rekhādvaya (-)

<p. 573> (caturdaśāram)

daśāravāmadakṣe tu madhyakoṇacatuṣṭayam || 33 ||

vardhayitvā ca ṣaṭkoṇaṃ sandhibhedena saṃlikhet |
kakṣamadhyagatā rekhā vardhayet koṇarūpataḥ || 34 ||

śeṣaṃ pravardheyenmantrī daśakoṇavidhānataḥ |
yathā caturdaśārantu jāyate cakramuttamam || 35 ||


mākarṣet | śrīkaṇṭhāgravicumbinīti rekhāviśeṣaṇena sandhibhedapūrvakaṃ rekhākarṣaṇamuktam | 
vicumbinyāviti vaktavye vicumbinītyārṣaḥ prayogaḥ | śrīkaṇṭhasyeti pūrvavat 
koṇarekhākarṣaṇakrameṇa śrīkaṇṭhasya dakṣavāmakoṇāt 
pūrvopadarśitadakṣottarāyatapaścimasaralarekhāṃ yāvat prāguktakrameṇa koṇarekhādvayaṃ 
sandhibhedapūrvakamuddharedityarthaḥ | evaṃ kṛte daśakoṇaṃ sarvarakṣākaracakraṃ niṣpadyate | 
vyaktamāha gandharvatantre pañcamapaṭale (-)

tato daśāracakrasya nirmāṇaṃ śṛṇu pārvati |
dakṣiṇottaragā rekhāstisro yāstatra tāsvapi |
madhyarekhāṃ parityajya rekhe dve parivardhayet |
tena ṣaṭkoṇakaṃ kṛtvā sandhibhede catuṣṭayam |
kṛtvā rekhādvayaṃ kuryāddaśakoṇa yathā bhavat || iti |

	atha bahirdaśāraṃ sarvārthasādhakaṃ cakramāha (-) tatheti | tathā 
nirūktadaśārakrameṇaivedaṃ bahirdaśāraṃ kuryāt nātra kaścidapi viśeṣo'sti | vyaktamāha 
gandharvatantre pañcamapaṭale (-)

tathānyadaśakoṇasya nirmāṇaṃ parikīrttyate |
dakṣiṇottaragāsvevaṃ rekhāḥ pañca bhavanti yāḥ ||
tāsāṃ rekhādvayaṃ (trayaṃ) madhye hitvā pūrvāparantataḥ |
bāhyarekhādvayaṃ devi pūrvavat parivardhayet ||
tena ṣaṭkoṇakaṃ kṛtvā sandhibhedacatuṣṭayam |
kṛtvā rekhādvayaṃ kuryāddaśakoṇaṃ yathā bhavet || iti |

<33-35 |> atha caturdaśāraṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyakacakramāha (-) daśāretyādinā 
cakramuttamamityantena | prāguktadaśāracakrasya vāmato dakṣataśca madhyakoṇacatuṣṭayaṃ 
vardhayitvā(,)

<p. 574> (aṣṭārādicakratrayam)

vṛttamaṣṭadalaṃ vṛttaṃ ṣoḍaśāraṃ trivṛttakam |
bhūbimbatritayaṃ kāryaṃ caturdvāraṃ tathaiva ca || 36 ||

tantracūḍāmaṇau devyā matamīdṛśamīritam || 37 ||


prāguktasandhibhedakrameṇa ṣaṭkoṇaṃ saṃlikhet | etaduktaṃ bhavati (-) daśāracakrasya 
paścimatastrikoṇatrayasya pūrvataśca trikoṇatrayasya tyāge daśārasya dakṣataḥ koṇadvayaṃ 
vāmataśca koṇadvayamiti koṇacatuṣṭayamavaśiṣyate | tat koṇacatuṣṭayaṃ koṇaghaṭakasaralarekhā 
ityarthaḥ(,) prāguktakrameṇa vardhayitvā tataḥ prāguktasandhibhedakrameṇa ṣaṭkoṇaṃ saṃlikhet | 
kakṣamadhyagatā rekhāḥ prāguktaṣaṭkoṇavāmadakṣakoṇaghaṭakarekhācatuṣṭayamityarthaḥ(,) 
koṇarūpeṇa vardhayet | evaṃ kṛte koṇāṣṭakaṃ jāyate | śeṣamiti | avaśiṣṭaṃ koṇaṣaṭkaṃ 
prāguktadaśakoṇarītyā vardhayet | pūrvapaścimānta (-)saralarekhādvayaṃ pūrvavad varddhayitvā 
daśārasya paścimataḥ pūrvataścaikaikāṃ dakṣiṇottarāyatāṃ saralarekhāmākṛṣya 
daśārakrameṇa ṣaṭ koṇān vardhayedityevā'ha daśakoṇavidhānata ityanena | yatheti(,) tathā 
pravardhayed yathā uttamaṃ caturdaśāraṃ cakraṃ jāyata iti sambandhaḥ | vyaktamāha 
gandharvatantre pañcamapaṭale (-)

caturdaśāracakrasya nirmāṇaṃ kathyate'dhunā |
dakṣiṇottaragāsvevaṃ rekhāḥ sapta bhavanti yāḥ ||
tāsāṃ rekhādvayaṃ hitvā bāhye pūrvāparantataḥ |
dīrghaṃ rekhādvayaṃ mantrī pūrvavat parivardhayet ||
tena ṣaṭkoṇakaṃ kṛtvā sandhibhedacatuṣṭayam | 
daśārīkṛtya tenaiva sandhibhedacatuṣṭayāt ||
rekhādvayaṃ bahiḥ kuryādrekhāḥ syurnava pañca ca ||
kalpayedatha tasyāgrairanyakoṇacatuṣṭayam ||
evaṃ caturdaśāraṃ syād vilocanamanoharam || iti

<36-37 |> athāṣṭadalaṃ sarvasaṅkṣobhaṇākhyaṃ ṣoḍaśadalaṃ sarvāśāparipūrakākhyaṃ 
caturasraṃ trailokyamohanākhyaṃ cakrañcā'ha (-) vṛttamityādinā | spaṣṭam | 
atrāṣṭadalaṣoḍaśadalayormūle vṛttaṃ sīmārthameva | ṣoḍaśadalād bahirvṛttatrayamapi na 
pūjārtham (-)

vṛttatrayaṃ maheśāni na pūjāyāṃ nigadyate |

<p. 575> (atra viśeṣaḥ)

kuloḍḍīśamate dikṣu mūlaṃ pūrvādito bhavet |

(binducakrasya sarvacakramadhyavarttitvam)

sarvamadhyatrikoṇe tu binducakraṃ likhed budhaḥ || 38 ||


iti gandharvatantrapañcamapaṭalavacanāt | cakramidaṃ saṃkṣipyā'ha tantrasāradhṛtayāmale (-)

bindutrikoṇavasukoṇadaśārayugma (-)
manvasranāgadalasaṅgataṣoḍaśāram |
vṛttatrayañca dharaṇīsadanatrayañca
śrīcakrarājamuditaṃ paradevatāyāḥ ||

iti | etadyantraghaṭakapadme keśarakalpananiṣedhamāha tantrasāradhṛtabhūtabhairave (-)

yo'smin yantre maheśāni keśarāṇi prakalpayet ||
yoginīsahitāstasya hiṃsāṃ kurvanti bhairavāḥ || iti |

<38 |> evaṃ tatracūḍāmaṇisaṃvādena śrīcakranirmāṇaparipāṭīmabhidhāya kuloḍḍīśasaṃvādena 
nava cakrāṇi vibhajate (-) kuletyādinā | nava cakrāṇi teṣāṃ nāmāni ca yoginīhṛdaye 
prathamapaṭale krameṇa pradarśitāni yathā (-)

cakrasya navadhātvañca kathayāmi tava priye |
ādimaṃ bhūtrayeṇa syād dvitīyaṃ ṣoḍaśārakam ||
anyadaṣṭadalaṃ proktaṃ manukoṇamanantaram |
pañcamaṃ daśakoṇaṃ syāt ṣaṣṭhañcāpi daśārakam ||
saptamaṃ vasukoṇaṃ syānmadhyatryasramathāṣṭamam |
navamaṃ tryasramadhyaṃ syāt teṣāṃ nāmānyataḥ śṛṇu ||
trailokyamohanaṃ cakraṃ sarvāśāparipūrakam |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ devi sarvasaubhāgyadāyakam |
sarvārthasādhakaṃ cakraṃ sarvarakṣākaraṃ param ||
sarvarogaharaṃ devi sarvasiddhimayaṃ tathā |
sarvānandamayañcāpi navamaṃ śṛṇu sundari ||

<p. 576> (trailokyamohanacakram)

trailokyamohanaṃ nāma caturasraṃ sukhapradam | 
muktābhaṃ cintayenmantrī mātṛkārṇairvimaṇḍitam || 39 ||

(sarvāśāparipūrakacakram)

śaradindupratīkāśaṃ ṣoḍaśāraṃ manoramam |
sarvāśāpūrakaṃ nāma ṣoḍaśasvarasaṃyutam || 40 ||


iti | evañcātra navamaṃ tryasramadhyaṃ syādityanena yat sarvānandamayaṃ cakramuktaṃ tadeva 
sarvamadhyetyādinā mūle samuddiṣṭam(-)

atra pūjyā mahādevī mahātripurasundarī |

iti yoginīhṛdayaprathamapaṭalavacanenāsya prādhānyāt prathamamabhidhānam(,) viśeṣastvagre 
vakṣyate | binducakraṃ śivātmakamadhyabindumityarthaḥ |

sarvānandamayaṃ madhyabindusthānaṃ śivātmakam | iti tantrarājapañcamapaṭalavacanāt |

<39 |> atha krameṇa trailokyamohanādinavacakrāṇi vivṛṇoti (-) trailokyetyādinā | caturasraṃ bhūpuram(,) 
tacca parito rekhātrayātmakam(;) bhūbimbatritayaṃ kāryamiti prāguktatvāt(,)

bhūbimbatrayametat paśyantyāditrimātṛviśrāntiḥ |

iti kāmakalāvilāsokteśca | madhyatrikoṇādāvirbhūtā paśyantī (-) madhyamā (-)vaikharīśaktayo 
niruktabhūpuratrayaparyantaṃ cakāsatītyarthaḥ | muktābhaṃ śvetavarṇamityarthaḥ |

trailokyamohane cakre buddhañca paripūjayet |
brahmaviṣṇuśivākhyāstāstisro rekhāśca tannibhāḥ ||

iti gandharvatantracaturthapaṭalavacanena tu rekhāṇāṃ krameṇa 
tadadhiṣṭhātṛbrahmaviṣṇuśivavarṇatvamabhihitam | tena kramādetāsāṃ raktakṛṣṇaśvetavarṇatvaṃ 
niruktagandharvavacanādavagamyate | mātṛkārṇeriti akārādikṣakārāntamātṛkāvarṇairityarthaḥ | 
taduktaṃ jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale (-)

caturasraṃ mātṛkārṇermaṇḍitaṃ siddhihetave |
muktāmāṇikyaghaṭitaṃ samasthalavirājitam ||
trailokyamohanaṃ nāma kalpadrumaphalapradam | iti |

<40 |> atha ṣoḍaśadalātmakaṃ sarvāśāparipūrakacakramāha (-) śaradindvityādinā | 
śaradindupratīkāśaṃ śaratkālīnacandrasadṛśavarṇaviśiṣṭam | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave 
daśamapaṭale (-)

<p. 577> (sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇacakram)

javākusumasaṅkāśamaṣṭapatraṃ suśobhanam |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ nāma kādivargāṣṭakairyutam || 41 ||

(niruktatritayātmakaṃ sṛṣṭicakram)

etaccakramayaṃ ramyaṃ sṛṣṭikārakamuttamam || 42 ||

(sarvasaubhāgyadāyakacakram)

caturdaśārakoṇantu navīnārkasamaprabham |
sarvasaubhāgyadaṃ nāma kādiḍhāntairvibhūṣitam || 43 ||


ṣoḍaśāraṃ candrabimbarūpantu sakalālayam |
sarvāśāpūrakaṃ bhadre sravatpīyūṣavarṣaṇam ||

iti | ṣoḍaśāraṃ ṣoḍaśadalam | manomayam | atra manaḥpadaṃ 
bhūtapañcakendriyadaśakamanasāṃ devyāḥ ṣoḍaśavikārāṇāmupalakṣakam | 
niruktaṣoḍaśavikārāḥ kāmākarṣiṇyādiṣoḍaśaśaktyākāreṇa ṣoḍaśadalānyadhyāsata iti 
tātparyam | vyaktamāha kāmakalāvilāse (-)

bhūtānīndriyadaśakaṃ manaśca devyā vikāraṣoḍaśakam |
kāmākarṣiṇyādisvarūpataḥ ṣoḍaśāramadhyāste ||

iti | ṣoḍaśasvarasaṃyutam akārādiṣoḍaśasvaraviśiṣṭam | ṣoḍaśapatreṣu krameṇa ṣoḍaśa 
svarā vartanta ityarthaḥ |

<41 |> athāṣṭadalātmakaṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇacakramāha (-) javetyādinā | javākusumasaṅkāśaṃ 
javākusumavadraktavarṇam | aṣṭapatramaṣṭadalam | kādivargāṣṭakairyutam(,) pañcadaleṣu 
kādipañcavargāḥ | ṣaṣṭhadale yaralavāḥ | saptamadale śaṣasahāḥ | aṣṭamadale lakṣāviti 
vargāṣṭakāvasthitikramaḥ |

<42 |> etattritayasya sṛṣṭicakratvamāha (-) etadityādinā | etaccakramayaṃ niruktatrailokyamohana (-) 
sarvāśāparipūraka (-)sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇākhyacakratrayamayamityarthaḥ | jñānārṇave 
daśamapaṭale'pi (-)

etattrayaṃ maheśāni sṛṣṭicakraṃ sukhapradam |

ityuktam | viśeṣastu kāmakalāvilāsa (-) yoginīhṛdayādiṣu draṣṭavyaḥ |

<43 |> evaṃ sṛṣṭyātmakacakratrayamuktvā sthityātmakacakratraye vaktavye kramaprāptaṃ

<p. 578> (sarvārthasādhakacakram)

taptakāñcanasindūrasadṛśaṃ daśakoṇakam |
sarvārthasādhakaṃ nāma ṇādibhāntairvibhūṣitam || 44 ||

(sarvarakṣākaracakram)

taruṇāruṇasaṅkāśaṃ dvitīyaṃ daśakoṇakam |
sarvarakṣākaraṃ nāma mādikṣāntākṣarairyutam || 45 || 

(niruktatritayātmakaṃ sthiticakram)

sthiticakraṃ trayañcaitanmahājñānapradāyakam || 46 ||


sarvasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ cakramāha (-) caturdaśāretyādinā | caturdaśārakoṇamiti spaṣṭam | 
navīnārkasamaprabhaṃ bhāsvararaktavarṇam | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale (-)

caturdaśāraṃ deveśi dāḍimīkusumaprabham |
anantaphaladaṃ bhadre sarvasaubhāgyasaṃpradam ||

iti | kādīti | caturdaśakoṇeṣu kakārādiḍhakārāntāścaturdaśa varṇā ekaikaśo varttanta ityarthaḥ 
|

<44 |> atha sarvārthasādhakacakraṃ vivṛṇoti (-) taptetyādinā | taptakāñcanasindūrasadṛśaṃ 
raktavarṇam | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale (-)

daśāraṃ taptahemābhaṃ sindūrasadṛśaṃ priye |
sarvārthasādhakaṃ cakraṃ manaścintitadaṃ sadā ||

iti | daśakoṇakaṃ daśakoṇaviśiṣṭam | ṇādīti | ṇakārādibhakārāntā daśa varṇā 
daśāreṣvekaikaśo virājanta ityarthaḥ |

<45 |> dvitīyadaśakoṇātmakaṃ sarvarakṣākaracakramāha (-) taruṇetyādinā | taruṇāruṇasaṅkāśaṃ 
raktavarṇam | mādīti | makārādikṣakārāntā daśa varṇā ekaikaśo daśāreṣu vartanta ityarthaḥ 
|

<46 |> etattritayasya sthiticakratvamāha (-) sthitītyādinā | etattrayaṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyaka (-) 
sarvārthasādhaka (-) sarvarakṣākarākhyaṃ mahājñānapradāyakaṃ sthiticakramiti sambandhaḥ | 
jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale'pi niruktacakratrayamabhidhāya (-)

<p. 579> (sarvarogaharacakram)

padmarāgapratīkāśamaṣṭakoṇañca siddhidam |
sarvarogaharaṃ nāma vargāṣṭakairvimaṇḍitam || 47 ||

(sarvasiddhipradacakram)

dāḍimīpuṣpasaṅkāśaṃ trikoṇaṃ sarvabhūtidam |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ cakramakathāditrirekhagam || 48 ||

(sarvānandamayacakram)

ha(-) kṣavarṇamadhyagataṃ sarveṣāṃ siddhikārakam |
sarvānandamayaṃ nāma binducakraṃ paraṃ padam || 49 ||


etattrayaṃ maheśāni sthiticakraṃ sukhapradam |

ityuktam |

<47 |> evaṃ sthityātmaka (-) cakratrayamabhidhāya saṃhārātmakacakratraye vaktavye kramaprāptaṃ 
sarvarogaharacakramāha (-) padmarāgetyādinā | padmarāgamaṇisavarṇaṃ raktavarṇam | 
vargāṣṭakairvimaṇḍitam | sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇacakroktarītyā kādivargāṣṭakamaṣṭāreṣu vartanta 
ityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale (-)

aṣṭakoṇaṃ varārohe bālārkakiraṇāruṇam |
padmarāgasamaprakhyaṃ sarvarogaharaṃ sadā || iti |

<48 |> sarvasiddhipradacakramāha (-) dāḍimītyādinā | dāḍimīpuṣpasaṅkāśaṃ 
dāḍimīkusumavadraktavarṇam | sarvabhūtidam akhilavibhūtisampādakam | a(-)ka(-)thāditrirekhagam | 
akārādayaḥ ṣoḍaśa svarāḥ(,) kādi (-) tāntāni thādi (-) sāntāni vyañjanāni ca 
krameṇaikaikarekhārūpeṇa vartanta ityarthaḥ | jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale (-)

udyatsūryasahasrābhaṃ bandhūkakusumaprabham |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ cakraṃ sakalālayamīśvari |
trikoṇaṃ sarvasaṃbhūtikāraṇaṃ bhūtidaṃ sadā || iti |

<49 |> athedānīṃ caramaṃ bhagavatyā nivāsasthānaṃ bindvākhyaṃ sarvānandamayacakramāha (-) 
ha(-)kṣeti | paraṃ padaṃ kāmeśvarāṅkanilayāyā deśakālākārādibhiranavacchinnāyāḥ

<p. 580> (niruktatritayātmakaṃ saṃhāracakram)

sadāśivamayañcaitattrayaṃ saṃhārakārakam || 50 ||

(niruktacakre puṣpāñjalidānopadeśaḥ)

yoginīmūlamantreṇa tatra puṣpāñjaliṃ kṣipet |

(cakrasyāśūnyatāsampādanopadeśaḥ)

muktā(-)maṇi(-)pravālairvā vilomamūlavidyayā || 51 ||

aśūnyaṃ sarvadā kāryaṃ śūnye vighnaṃ sadā bhavet |

(navacakropasaṃhāraḥ)

navacakramayaṃ cakraṃ bālādevyā virājitam || 52 ||

(cakreśvarīṇāṃ nāmāni)

prathamā tripurā devī dvitīyā tripureśvarī |
tṛtīyā sundarīnāmnī turyā tripuravāsinī || 53 ||


śrīmattripurasundaryāḥ paraṃ padaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ nivāsasthānamityarthaḥ | ata eva yoginīhṛdaye 
prathamapaṭale sarvānandacakramabhidhāya (-)

atra pūjyā mahādevī mahātripurasundarī |

ityuktam | vyaktamāha kāmakalāvilāse (-)

āsīnā bindumaye cakre sā tripurasundarī devī |
kāmeśvarāṅkanilayā kalayā candrasya kalpitottaṃsā ||
pāśāṅkuśekṣucāpa(-)prasūnaśarapañcakāñcitasvakarā |
bālāruṇāruṇāṅgī śaśibhānukṛśānulocanatritayā ||

iti | atra bālāruṇāruṇāṅgītyabhidhānād bindorapi raktatvamuktaṃ bhavati | 
hakṣavarṇamadhyagatamiti(,) ha(-)kṣau varṇau madhyagatau yasyeti vigrahaḥ |

<51-52 |> mukteti | yantraṃ pūjayitvā tatra vilomamūlamantreṇa muktādyanyatamaṃ sthāpayet 
kadā'pi śūnyaṃ na vidadhītetyarthaḥ | upasaṃharati(-)naveti | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam |

<53-54 |> evaṃtrailokyamohanādīni sarvānandamayāntāni nava cakrāṇyupadiśya teṣu

<p. 581> pañcamī tripurāśrīśca ṣaṣṭhe tripuramālinī |
saptame tripurā siddhā aṣṭame tripurāmbikā || 54 ||

navame śrīmahādevī mahātripurabhairavī |

(cakre svasvasthāne'rcanīyā devatāḥ)

samastāḥ prakaṭā guptāstathā guptatarāśrayāḥ || 55 ||

sampradāyāḥ kulāḥ kaulā nigarbhāśca rahasyagāḥ |
parāpararahasyāha paramātirahasyagāḥ || 56 ||

rājarājeśvarī pūrṇā mahātripurasundarī |
etāścakrasthitāḥ sarvāḥ sthānaṃ jñātvā samarcayet || 57 ||

(niruktacakrasaṅketajñānavaibhavam)

navadhā cakrasaṅketaṃ yo jānāti sa sādhakaḥ |
navadhā yo na jānāti kathaṃ devīṃ prapūjayet || 58 ||

(niruktaśrīcakrajñānapraśastiḥ)

etacchrīcakrarājaṃ sakalalipimayaṃ sarvadevasya vandyaṃ
nityānandasvarūpaṃ bhuvanavaśakaraṃ bhogamokṣaikahetum |


krameṇa pūjanīyānāṃ navacakreśvarīṇāṃ nāmāni nirūpayati (-) prathametyādinā | 
yoginīhṛdaye prathamapaṭale'pi niruktakrameṇa nāmānyabhidhāya (-)

pūjayecca kramādetā navacakre purodite |

ityuktam |

<55-57 |> navama iti | mahātripurabhairavītyatra mahātripurasundarīti yoginīhṛdaye | samastā iti | 
āsāmāvaraṇaśaktīnāṃ svasvasthānanāmārcākramādīni aṣṭādaśe vakṣyante |

<p. 582> śuddho bhūtvā likhitvā yadi paśurahito dhārayet pūjayed vā
sarvā siddhiḥ karasthā bhavati sukṛtinastasya siddhiḥ parā'pi || 59 ||

sarvānandamayaṃ samastajagatāmekādhipaṃ kāmadaṃ
sarvavyādhinirākarañca śubhadaṃ jñānapradaṃ kīrtidam |
sākṣāt kalpataruṃ surāsuragaṇaiḥ saṃveṣṭitaṃ dṛśyate
yenedaṃ sa tu sarvatīrthagamanasnānasya puṇyaṃ labhet || 60 ||

(śrīcakrarahasyanirūpaṇapratijñā)

rahasyaṃ cakrarājasya kathayāmi yathākramam |

(trikoṇāntarbindurahasyam)

madhye binduḥ śivo jñeyaḥ sṛṣṭisaṃhārakārakaḥ || 61 ||

bindumadhye vasennityaṃ śrīmattripurasundarī |
mahākāmakalā tatra bindutritayarūpiṇī || 62 ||

(trikoṇarahasyam)

trikoṇaṃ tripurā caiva bālā tripurasundarī |
trikoṇarūpī rudraḥ syāttrikoṇatvāt parā śivā || 63 ||

triṣu pañcadaśī nityā samayā ca caturdaśī |
ṣaḍaṅgayuvatī devī tatra pūrvāditaḥ sthitā || 64 ||


<61-62 |> atha śrīcakrarahasyaṃ vaktumupakramate (-) rahasyamityādinā | madhye sarvasiddhipradākhya 
(-) trikoṇamadhye | binduḥ śivātmakaḥ śvetabinduḥ | bindumadhye śivātmakasitabindumadhye 
śoṇavindvātmikā mahākāmakalā śrīmattripurasundarī vilasatītyarthaḥ | tāṃ viśinaṣṭi (-) 
bindvityādinā | bindutritayarūpiṇī śivaśaktirūpaṃ niruktabindudvayam(,) tayoḥ samarasībhūtastṛtīyo 
miśrabinduḥ tattritayarūpiṇītyarthaḥ | viśeṣastu bhūmikāyāṃ draṣṭavyaḥ |

<p. 583> (aṣṭārarahasyam)

aṣṭakoṇeṣvaṣṭasiddhirbhūtayo'ṣṭau bhavanti hi |
jṛmbhamohavaśastambhapāśāṅkuśadhanuḥśarāḥ || 65 ||

nivasanti tatra nityaṃ vaśinyādyaṣṭadevatāḥ || 66 ||

(antardaśāra(-)rahasyam)

daśendriyāṇi deheṣu saṃsthitāni vasanti ca |
sarvajñādimahādevāḥ saṃsthitā daśa devatāḥ || 67 ||

evaṃ dikkoṇasandhyagraprāṇā daśakalā daśa || 68 ||

(bahirdaśāra(-)rahasyam)

aparaṃ daśakoṇantu daśadikpāladaivatam |
digvātārkapraceto'śvi(-)vahnīndropendramitra(-)kāḥ || 69 ||

vaikārikāttu te jātā daśasaṃkhyāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
sarvasiddhyādayastatra sadā tiṣṭhanti pūjitāḥ || 70 ||

(caturdaśārarahasyam)

anantarūpacakrasya tathā koṇacaturdaśa |
caturdaśāṅgaśāstrāṇi bhuvanāni caturdaśa || 71 ||

caturdaśāracakreṣu saṃkṣobhaṇyādidevatāḥ |
eko dharmo guṇān sūte adharmastu tathā mataḥ || 72 ||

(aṣṭadala(-)rahasyam)

aṣṭarūpāṣṭapatreṣu dharmādīni vasanti ca |
anaṅgakusumādīni bodhyāni satataṃ budhaiḥ || 73 ||


<69 |> mitrakā iti | mitrastṛtīyaḥ sūryaḥ iti rāghavabhaṭṭaḥ | kaḥ prajāpatiḥ | kaḥ 
prajāpatiruddiṣṭa ityekākṣarakoṣaḥ |

<p. 584> (ṣoḍaśadala(-)rahasyam)

ṣoḍaśacchadacakreṣu tithayaḥ ṣoḍaśa smṛtāḥ |
sarvasaubhāgyadā nityaṃ kāmākarṣaṇapūrvikāḥ || 74 ||

trivṛtte candrasūryāgnitrirekhākāravartinaḥ || 75 ||

śivarekhā pūrvasandhyā brahmāṇī brahmarekhagā |
aṇimādyā brahmarekhāḥ krameṇa parikīrtitāḥ || 76 ||

catuḥṣaṣṭistathā koṭiḥ koṭikoṭivibhūtayaḥ |
yoginyo devadevyaśca cakramāśritya saṃsthitāḥ || 77 ||

asya prabhedāḥ koṇānāṃ dalānāntu prakīrtitāḥ |

(yantrasya parimāṇabhedāḥ)

trikoṇa(?)ñcaikatolaṃ vā caturaṅgulimānakam || 78 ||

tatraiva lekhayeccakraṃ caturasraṃ suśobhanam |
navahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā tathaikahastameva vā || 79 ||


<74-77 |> trivṛtta ityādinā cakramāśritya saṃsthitā ityantenoktā āvaraṇaśaktayo'ṣṭādaśe 
pūjākrame granthakṛdbhirviśiṣya vakṣyante |

<78-80 |> atha yantrasya mānabhedānāha(-)trikoṇa(?)mityādinā yāmalasammatamityantena | atra 
trikoṇamiti pāṭhaḥ prāmādika iti pratibhāti | caturasramiti vakṣyamāṇena virodhādekatolaṃ veti 
vāśabdavaiyarthyāt svacchandabhairava(-)tantrarājādivirodhācca | tathāca tantrasāradhṛta(-)
svacchandabhairave (-)

kuryācca sthaṇḍile yantraṃ hastamātraṃ susundaram | 
ratnādiṣu tu nirmāṇe mānamicchāvaśād bhavet |

<p. 585> likhed yantraṃ bhūpradeśe ratnādau tu nijecchayā |
mūlamuccārayan svastha iti yāmalasammatam || 80 ||

(binducakre mahākāmakalāyā avasthitiḥ)

trikoṇacakramadhye tu mahākāmakalāṃ likhet |
kathitaṃ paramaṃ cakraṃ triṣu lokeṣu durlabham || 81 ||

prārthayed yadi mokṣantu mokṣadvāramidaṃ mahat |
śrīkrame paramaṃ vastu kīrtitaṃ paramātmanā || 82 ||

(śrīcakroddhāre diṅniyamaḥ)

udaṅmukho yadā mantrī cakrarājaṃ prapūjayet |
udīcī dik tadā caiva pūrvāśaiva nigadyate |
īśānantu tathāgneyaṃ bhavedevaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 83 ||


ekatolaṃ dvitolaṃ vā tritolaṃ vedatolakam |
ito'dhikaṃ naraḥ kṛtvā prāyaścittī bhaved dhruvam |
raktena rajasāpūrya śrīcakraṃ bhuvi pūjayet |
naśyanti sarvavighnāni prāpyate vāñchitaṃ phalam |

iti | tantrarāje trayastriṃśapaṭale'pi (-)

navahastaṃ trihastaṃ vā śrīcakramabhiṣecane |
kuryāt sthaṇḍilapūjāyāṃ hastamātre'tisundaram |
ratnādiṣu tu nirmāṇe mānamicchāvaśād bhavet | 
sadā suvihite pūjā śubhānyasmiṃstathā'nyathā |

iti | evañcaiteṣu vacaneṣu tritolaparimāṇadarśanādatrāpi tritolamityeva sādhīyān pāṭha iti 
mantavyam | mūlamiti mūlamantramuccārayan yantraṃ likhediti sambandhaḥ |

<81 |> trikoṇacakramadhya iti | madhyatrikoṇacakrasya madhye bindāvityarthaḥ

<83 |> athedānīṃ śrīcakroddhāre diṅniyamaḥ pratipādyate | tatra ca (-)

tatra prāṅmukha āsīnaścakrarājaṃ samālikhet |

iti jñānārṇavadaśamapaṭalavacanena(,)

<p. 586> tataḥ prāṅmukha āsīnaścakroddhāraṃ samārabhet |

iti gandharvatantra(-)caturthapaṭalavacanena ca śrīcakranirmāṇe sādhakasya 
pūrvadiṅmukhatvamupadiṣṭam | tadidānīṃ pūrvāṃ diśameva niyamayati(-) udaṅmukha ityādinā | 
sādhaka udaṅmukhaḥ san cakranirmāṇāya pravṛttaścettarhi uttaradiśa eva pūrvadiktvam(,) 
īśānasyāgnikoṇatvam | anayā rītyā sarvatra diṅniyama ityuttaravacanebhyo'vagantavyam | etāni 
diṅniyamapratipādakavacanāni kvacicchrīcakroddhāraviṣaye kvacana vā 
śrīmattripurāpūjanaviṣaye'bhihitāni dṛśyante | yathā jñānārṇave daśamapaṭale (-)

uttarāśāmukho mantrī yadā cakraṃ samuddharet |
uttarāśā tadā devi pūrvāśaiva nigadyate ||

ityādi | evameva kaulāvalīnirṇaye'pi | vacanamidaṃ cakroddhāre diṅniyamapratipādakam | tathā 
gandharvatantre saptamapaṭale (-)

uttarābhimukho bhūtvā yadā devīṃ prapūjayet |
uttarāśā tadā devi pūrvāśaiva na saṃśayaḥ |
īśānamagnikoṇaṃ syādvāyukoṇaṃ tatheśakam | 
dakṣiṇāśā tadā jñeyā paścimāśā maheśvari |
rākṣasaṃ vāyukoṇaṃ syādāgneyaṃ rākṣasaṃ bhavet |

ityādivacanaiḥ pūjāyāṃ diṅniyamaḥ pratipāditaḥ | evañca niruktajñānārṇava(-)
gandharvatantrādivacanaparyālocanayā śrīcakroddhārapūjanayorubhayorapi niruktakrameṇa diṅniyamaḥ 
kartavya iti paryavasyati | parantu (-)
	tatra prāṅmukha āsīnaścakroddhāraṃ samārabhet iti prāgupadarśita(-)gandharvavacanena 
cakroddhāre prāṅmukhatvaniyamāt (-)

digvibhāgeṣu kauberī dik śivāprītidāyinī |
tasmāttanmukha āsīnaḥ pūjayettripurāṃ sadā ||

iti gandharvatantrasaptamapaṭalavacanena pūjane uttarāsyatvaniyamācca cakroddhāre 
pūrvadiṅmukhatvasya pūjane cottarāsyatvasya praśastataratvamiti bodhyam | naca 
digvibhāgeṣvityādivacanena pūjane pūrvāsyatvamātraṃ kalpyatāmiti vācyam(,)

yadāśābhimukho mantrī tripurāṃ paripūjayet |
devīpaścāttadā prācī pratīcī tripurāpuraḥ |

iti guptārṇavatantravacane yadāśābhimukha ityanena yatkiñciddiṅmātrābhidhānāt(,)

<p. 587> paścimāśā yadā mantrī cakrarājaṃ prapūjayet |
pratīcī dik tadā caiva pūrvāśaiva na saṃśayaḥ |
vāyukoṇaṃ tadāgneyamīśānaṃ rākṣasaṃ bhavet || 84 ||

dakṣiṇāśāmukho mantrī yadā cakraṃ prapūjayet |
pūrvāśaiva tadā sā dig rakṣaḥkoṇantu vahnivat || 85 ||

āgneyantu tadeśānaṃ vāyustu nir(-)ṛtirbhavet |
bṛhacchrīkramatantrasya matametat prakīrtitam || 86 ||

purandaramukho mantrī pūjayettripurāṃ yadā |
devīpaścāttadā prācī pratīcī tripurāpuraḥ |
guptārṇavamatenāpi digvibhāgaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 87 ||

(śrīcakrasthāpanādhāraḥ)

atha siṃhāsane mantrī śrīcakraṃ purato nyaset || 88 ||

(sīsakādiṣu cakrasthāpananiṣedhaḥ)

sīsake kāṃsyapātre vā raṅge vā sādhakottamaḥ |
phalakāyāṃ paṭe bhittau sathāpayenna kadācana || 89 ||

sthāpitaṃ yadi lobhena mohādajñānato'pi vā |
kulaṃ vittamapatyañca nirmūlayati sarvadā || 90 ||


udaṅmukho yadā mantrī cakrarājaṃ prapūjayet |

ityādimūloktavacaneṣu pūjane uttarāsyatvādervyaktamabhidhānācca virodhāpatteḥ | tasmāt 
cakroddhāre prāṅmukhatvasya pūjane cottarāsyatvasya praśastataratvaṃ diśāmanyāsāṃ 
praśastatvamiti niṣkarṣaḥ |

<p. 588> (pīṭhapūjā)

pīṭhapūjāṃ tataḥ kuryāduparyuparibhāvataḥ |
maṇḍūkaṃ pūjayedādau rudraṃ kālāgnirūpakam || 91 ||

ādhāraśaktiṃ kūrmañca tathā'nantaṃ varāhakam |
pṛthvīṃ sudhāsamudrañca ratnadvīpamataḥ param || 92 ||

svarṇaśailaṃ ratnabhūmiṃ nandanodyānameva ca |
nānāvṛkṣamahodyānaṃ tathaiva kalpavāṭikām || 93 ||

santānavāṭikāñcaiva haricandanavāṭikām |
mandāravāṭikāṃ pārijātavāṭīṃ samarcayet || 94 ||

kadambavanavāṭīñca ratnaprākārakān yathā |
puṣparāgaṃ padmarāgaṃ gomedaṃ vajramapyatha || 95 ||

vaidūryamindranīlañca muktāṃ marakataṃ tathā |
vidrumañceti navakān ratnaprākārasaṃyutān || 96 ||

māṇikyamaṇḍapañcaiva sahasrastambhamaṇḍapam |
amṛtavāpikāmevamānandavāpikāṃ tataḥ || 97 ||

vimarṣavāpikāṃ bālātapodgāramataḥ param |
candrikodgārakaṃ mahāśṛṅgāraparikhāmapi || 98 ||

mahāpadmāṭavīṃ kalpavṛkṣaṃ saṃpūjayennaraḥ |
tataścintāmaṇigṛhaṃ ratnanirmitavedikām || 99 ||


<91 |> pīṭhapūjāmāha (-) pīṭhapūjāmityādinā samarcayediti prakāśāntena |

<p. 589>  pūrvāmnāyamayaṃ pūrvaṃ dvāraṃ pūrve samarcayet |
dakṣiṇe paścime saumye tattadāmnāyamapyatha || 100 ||

ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ śvetacchatramūrddhve prapūjayet |
dharmaṃ jñānañca vairāgyamaiśvaryaṃ cāgnito yajet || 101 ||

a(-) pūrvān pūjayedetān dikṣu pūrvāditaḥ kramāt |
ātmāntarātmaparamajñānātmānaḥ krameṇa tu || 102 ||

cakramadhyasthapadmañca kandaṃ vasudalaṃ tataḥ |
nālamūrddhvacchadādhaśca tattvarūpāntu karṇikām || 103 ||

maṇḍalaṃ vahnisūryendo rajaḥ sattvaṃ tamo'pi ca |
jñānamāyākalāvidyātattvānyatra prapūjayet || 104 ||

gaṇeśaṃ vaṭukaṃ mantrī savye dakṣe prapūjayet |
nāmādivarṇabījāni caturasrāntare punaḥ || 105 ||

īśāgnyantañca mitrīśanāthamuḍḍīśanāthakam |
jālandharāhvayaṃ pīṭhaṃ pīṭhaṃ pūrṇagiriṃ tataḥ || 106 ||

tryasre saṃpūjayenmantrī krameṇānena tatparam |
pūrvādikramayogeṇa phalake āsanasya tu || 107 ||


<100 |> pūrveti | pūrvadvāre pūrvāmnāyam(,) evaṃ dakṣiṇapaścimottareṣu 
dakṣiṇapaścimottarāmnāyān krameṇa pūjayedityarthaḥ | etena pūrvāmnāyamayapūrvadvārāya 
namaḥ dakṣiṇāmnāyamayadakṣiṇadvārāya nama ityādirūpaḥ prayoga ityāpatati | tantrasāre tu 
pūrvāmnāyapūrvadvārāya nama ityādirūpaḥ prayoga uktaḥ |

<102 |> apūrvāniti | adharmamajñānamavairāgyamanaiśvaryañcetyarthaḥ |

<105 |> caturasreti | śrīcakracaturasrāntare īśānādyagnikoṇāntaṃ krameṇa 
jālandharādipīṭhacatuṣṭayaṃ pūjayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 590> pṛthivyāśca patiñcaiva brahmāṇamamṛteśvaram |
viṣṇutejo'dhipaṃ rudraṃ vāryadhīśaṃ tatheśvaram || 108 ||

madhye prāsādamuccārya viyatpadamudīrayet |
tato'dhipataye procya pañcavaktrāya yojayet || 109 ||

sadāśivāya ca mahāpretapadmāsanāya hṛt |
yajedāsanamantreṇa sarvāsanamathāpi vā || 110 ||

pretabījaṃ samuccārya sadāśivamahāpadam |
pretapadmāsanāyeti hṛnmanurmanurīritaḥ || 111 ||

pūrvoktenaiva mantreṇa tasyopari ṣaḍāsanam || 112 ||

tasyopari yajenmantrī prasūnatulikāmapi |
kāmeśvaraṃ tathā kāmeśvarīmūrtiṃ samarcayet || 113 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrītattvacintāmaṇau saptadaśaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 17 ||


<109-110 |> prāsādeti | hauṃ viyadadhipataye sadāśivāya mahāpretapadmāsanāya nama iti 
prayogaḥ |

<111 |> preteti | pretabījaṃ hasauriti | tathā ca hasauḥ sadāśivamahāpretapadmāsanāya nama iti 
prayogaḥ |



[aṣṭādaśaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(sāmānyārghyasthāpanādivisarjanāntasaparyākramaḥ)

(sāmānyārghyasthāpanam (tatra maṇḍalam))

vidhāya vāmabhāge tu trikoṇavṛttabhūpuram |
athavā caturasrantu jalena parikalpayet || 1 ||

caturasrantu tat kuryāttrikoṇadvayasaṃyutam |

(śaṅkhādhārasthāpanam)

ādhāraṃ tatra saṃsthāpya pūjayed vahnimaṇḍalam || 2 ||

ādhāreṇa vinā pūjā niṣphalā parikīrtitā |

(ādhārabhedāḥ)

ādhāraṃ vividhañcaiva ṣaṭpadaṃ vā catuṣpadam || 3 ||


<1 |> evaṃ pūrvaprakāśe cakrasaṅketamabhidhāya pūjāsaṅketamabhidadhānaḥ prathamaṃ 
sāmānyārghyasthāpanaparipāṭīmāha(-)vidhāyetyādinā | trikoṇeti | ādau trikoṇaṃ tadbahirvṛttaṃ 
tadbahirbhapuraṃ caturasramityarthaḥ | atra trikoṇamadhomukhaṃ kāryaṃ śaktiviṣayatvāt | taduktaṃ 
tārārahasyadhṛtarudrayāmale (-)

yatra yatra mahāvidyā śaktividyā upāsitā |
tatra tatra trikoṇañca adhomukhamudīritam |
devatrikoṇe kartavye ūrddhvaṃ tat parikīrtitam |

iti | kalpāntaramāha (-) athaveti | jalena caturasraṃ parikalpya tadantastrikoṇadvayaṃ kuryādityarthaḥ |

<p. 592> athavā vartulākāraṃ trikoṇaṃ vā samācaret |
suvarṇarūpyaracitaṃ tripadaṃ vā'pi pūjayet || 4 ||

(mantropadeśaḥ)

bījoktau tadanuktau vā māyāśrīpūrvamarcanam |
mantrānuktau nāmamantraṃ sarvatraivopayojayet || 5 ||

(pādukāmantraprayogaḥ)

śrīpādukākhyamantrantu dadyādante yathākramam || 6 ||

(vahnerdaśakalāḥ)

dhūmrā ca nīlavarṇā ca kapilā visphuliṅginī |
jvālā haimavatī kavyavāhinī havyavāhinī |
raudrī saṅkarṣiṇī vahneretāḥ kalāḥ parā yathā || 7 ||


<5 |> tripadaṃ vā'pi pūjayedityuktaṃ tatpūjāmantraṃ nirdiśati (-) bījoktāviti | māyābījaṃ hrīṃ(,) 
śrībījaṃ śrīṃ | tathā ca hrīṃ śrīṃ maṃ vahnimaṇḍalāya daśakalātmane 
arghyapātrādhārāya nama iti prayogaḥ | tantrasārakārastu niruktamāyābījāt pūrvaṃ 
vāgbhavabījasyāpi yojanayā tritārīprayogamupadideśa | tripurārcanarahasye tu mūlamantrānantaraṃ 
śrīmahātripurasundarīsāmānyārghyādhāramaṇḍalāya nama iti maṇḍalaṃ saṃpūjya oṃ 
daśakalātmane'gnimaṇḍalāya śrīmahātripurasundarīsāmānyārghyādhārāya nama 
ityarghyādhārapūjākrama uktaḥ(,) tatra māyā(-)śrībījayorullekho na dṛśyate | mantrānuktāviti | 
nāmamantraṃ tattaddevatānāmarūpaṃ mantramityarthaḥ | atra viśiṣyānuktāvapi nāmnaḥ 
praṇavapūrvakatvamavagantavyam | vyaktamāha durgāpūjātattvadhṛtayogiyājñavalkya(-)
brahmapurāṇayoḥ (-)

dhyātvā praṇavapūrvantu daivatantu samāhitaḥ |
namaskāreṇa puṣpādi vinyasettu pṛthak pṛthak ||

tathā(-)

oṃkārādisamāyuktaṃ namaskārāntakīrtitam |
svanāma sarvadevānāṃ mantra ityabhidhīyate || iti |

<6 |> śrīpāduketi | prathamaṃ devatānāma tataḥ śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti 
pādukāmantraḥ |

<7 |> evamādhāraṃ tatretyādinā vahnimaṇḍalapūjāmupadiśya tatraiva vahnikalārcāmupadiśati (-) 
dhūmrā cetyādinā | yoginīhṛdayaṭīkādhṛtasvacchandasaṃgrahe'pi (-)

<p. 593> (tatra kalpāntaram)

dhūmrārciruṣmā jvalinī jvālinī visphuliṅginī |
suśrīḥ surūpā kapilā havyakavyavahe tathā |
ābhirvā pūjayed vahniṃ yādikṣāntādibhiḥ kramāt || 8 ||


ṣaṭkoṇāntastrikoṇe tu vahnibimbaṃ kalāyutam |
āvāhyā''dhārato devi pūjayenmantravittamaḥ ||

ityuktam | yadyapyatra vacane ṣaṭkoṇāntastrikoṇa ityanena viśeṣārghyasthāpana eva 
vahnyādikalānāmarcanamupadiṣṭaṃ na tu sāmānyārghyasthāpanāvasare(,) tripurārcanarahasya(-)
kaulāvalīnirṇaya(-)tantrasārādiṣvapi tathaiva dṛśyate(,) tathā'pi mūle tadvaiparītyena 
sāmānyārghyasthāpana eva vahnyādikalāpūjanopadeśād viśeṣārghye 
tadanabhidhānāccā'gamāntarasammato'yaṃ kramo mūlakṛdbhiḥ paramahaṃsapādaiḥ parigṛhīta iti 
pratibhāti | dhūmreti | dhūmrādisaṅkarṣiṇyantā vahnerdaśa kalā ityarthaḥ |

<8 |> kalpāntaramāha(-)dhūmrārciriti | tathācaitatkalpe dhūmrārcirādyāḥ kavyavahāntā daśa kalā 
ityarthaḥ | atra tantrasārādiṣu nāmnāṃ kramabhedaḥ svarūpabhedaśca dṛśyete | ābhirveti | 
vāśabdaḥ kalpāntarabodhakaḥ | ābhirdhūmrādibhiḥ dhūmrārcirādibhirveti sambandhaḥ | ābhiriti 
viśeṣayati(-)yādikṣāntādibhiriti | yakārādikṣakārāntadaśavarṇānāmekaikamādau niyojya 
namo'ntena pūjayedityarthaḥ | atra yakārādivarṇāḥ sabindukā grāhyāḥ | tathā ca 
kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhollāse dhūmrārcirityādyabhidhāya (-)

yādisendukṣakārāntā abjādyāḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
ṅe(-)yutā vai namo'ntāśca kalā vahneritīritāḥ ||

ityanenānusvārayuktatvaṃ yakārādīnāmuktam(,) abjādyā ityanena śrībījapūrvakatvamapyuktam(,) 
etenaitanmate śrīṃ yaṃ dhūmrāyai nama iti prayogakramaḥ paryavasyati | mūlakṛnmate tu bījoktau 
tadanuktau vā māyāśrīpūrvamarcanam iti prāguktavacanānusāreṇa hrīṃ śrīṃ yaṃ dhūmrāyai 
nama ityādirūpaḥ prayoga iti pratibhāti | tantrasārakṛtā tu yādīnāṃ pūrvaṃ tritārīprayoga 
uktaḥ | yoginīhṛdayaṭīkādhṛtasvacchandasaṃgrahe'pi (-)

<p. 594> (kalānāmāsāṃ svarūpam)

taruṇāruṇasaṅkāśā varābhayakarā imāḥ |

(tatra sakala(-)vahnimaṇḍalārcākramaḥ)

udarārṇa vāgbhavaṃ vā dattvā tanmaṇḍalaṃ yajet || 9 ||


yādikṣāntātmavarṇāni kalā vahnermaheśvari |
etāḥ kalāḥ samabhyarcya svasvavarṇairyathāvidhi || 
svabījādyāścaturthyantā nāmamadhyā namo'ntikāḥ |
proktā vahnikalā mantranāmāni śṛṇu sāmpratam ||
dhūmrārcirnīlaraktā ca kapilā visphuliṅginī |
jvālāmālinyarciṣmatī tadūrdhvaṃ havyavāhinī |
aṣṭamī kavyavāhā ca raudrī saṃvāhinī tathā || 

iti vacane svabījādyā ityanena śrībījādyaṃ vā māyāśrībījādyaṃ vā vāgbhava(-)
māyāśrībījarūpatritārīpūrvakatvaṃ vā'bhipretamiti saṃkṣepaḥ |

<9 |> niruktānāṃ vahnikalānāṃ svarūpamāha (-) taruṇeti | navoditasūryasavarṇāḥ | 
varābhayakarāḥ ekena kareṇa varamapareṇa cābhayaṃ dadhatya ityarthaḥ | pūrvaṃ pūjayed 
vahnimaṇḍalam ityuktam(,) tadvahnimaṇḍalapūjākramamupadiśati(-)udarārṇamityādinā | udarārṇaṃ 
maṃ vāgbhavaṃ aiṃ iti bījaṃ vā dattvā tanmaṇḍalaṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ yajedityarthaḥ | evañca 
niruktayorbījayoranyataraduccārya vahnimaṇḍalāya daśakalātmane arghyapātrādhārāya namaḥ 
ityanena pūjayediti bodhyam | vyaktamāha kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

pūrvavanmaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā saṃpūjya tena vartmanā |
ādau senduṃ mahākālaṃ vahnimaṇḍalaṃ ṅeyutam |
hṛdantaṃ mantramuccārya ādhāre pūjayettataḥ |

iti | mahākālaṃ makāram | tatrāpi jñānārṇave caturdaśapaṭale (-)

vahniṃ tatra vicintyātha pūjayed yantrikāmayam |

	ityabhidhānād arghyapātrādhārāya nama ityādhārapātrapadollekhaḥ kāryaḥ | 
tripurārcanarahasyādiprāmāṇikapūjāprayogeṣvapi tathaiva dṛśyate |

<p. 595> (sakala-sūryamaṇḍalārcā)

pātraṃ nidhāya tatraiva kalābhiḥ sūryamarcayet |

(dvādaśa saurakalāḥ)

tapinī tāpinī cānyā vibudhā bodhinī tathā || 10 ||

kalinī ṣoḍaśī caiva vāruṇyākarṣiṇī tathā |
māyā viśvāvatī hema(a)*prabhā etāḥ kalā raveḥ || 11 ||

(tatra prakārāntaram)

tapinī tāpinī dhūmrā marīcirjvālinī ruciḥ |
suṣumṇā bhogadā viśvā bodhinī dhāriṇī kṣamā |
yajedābhiḥ kalābhirvā tattanmantreṇa sādhakaḥ || 12 ||


<10-11 |> atha sakala(-)sūryamaṇḍalapūjanamupadiśati(-)pātramityādinā | tatraiveti 
prāguktaṣaṭpadādyanyatamādhāre ityarthaḥ | vyaktamāha kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhollāse (-)

eṣāmanyatamaṃ pātraṃ sthāpayettripadopari |

iti | atrāpi pūrvavanmaṇḍalamālikhya saṃpūjya ca sūryamaṇḍalamarcayediti jñeyam | 
tathācoktaṃ tatraiva viśeṣārghyaprakaraṇe (-)

pūrvavanmaṇḍalaṃ kṛtvā pūjayet pūrvavartmanā |
sūryasya maṇḍalaṃ tatra cintayitvā'tha pūjayet ||

iti | dvādaśa sūryakalā nirūpayati(-)tapinītyādinā | tāpinyādyāḥ prabhāntā raverdvādaśa 
kalāḥ |

<12 |> kalpāntaramāha(-)tapinītyādinā | kalpe'smiṃstapinyādyāḥ kṣamāntā dvādaśa

<p. 596> (kalārcākramaḥ)

kādi(-)ṭhāntān binduyutān bhādi(-)ḍāntān sabindukān |
anyo'nyakramayogeṇa kalādau yojayet kramāt || 13 ||

(kalānāṃ svarūpam)

varābhayakarāḥ sarvā atasīpuṣpasodarāḥ | 

(sauramaṇḍalārcākramaḥ)

lalāṭaṃ kāmabījaṃ vā saṃyojya maṇḍalaṃ raveḥ || 14 ||


sūryakalāḥ | kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhaprakāśe'yameva kramaḥ parigṛhīto dṛśyate | yajediti 
tapinyādiprābhāntābhiḥ tapinyādikṣamāntābhirvā yajedityarthaḥ | tattanmantreṇeti 
pūrvavanmāyā(-)śrībījādipūrvakamantreṇetyarthaḥ |

<13 |> tatrā'dau varṇayojanamāha(-)kādītyādinā | kādi(-)ṭhāntān kakārādiṭhakārāntān tathā 
bhādi(-)ḍāntān bhakārādi(-)ḍakārāntān vilomaparipaṭhitān binduyuktān niruktānāṃ 
dvādaśakalānāmādau yojayedityarthaḥ | evañca prāguktakrameṇa bījamuccārya kaṃ bhaṃ 
tapinyai namaḥ(,) khaṃ maṃ tāpinyai nama ityādirūpaḥ prayogakramaḥ paryavasyati | vyaktamāha 
yoginīhṛdayaṭīkādhṛtasvacchandasaṃgrahe (-)

astraprakṣālitaṃ śaṅkhaṃ sthāpayitvā tathopari |
hṛdayāt sūryabimbañca samāvāhya svamantrataḥ ||
kādi(-)ṭhāntaṃ bhādi(-)ḍāntaṃ varṇajātaṃ kramotkramāt | 
dvayaṃ dvayaṃ prayoktavyaṃ kalāśca tadanantaram ||

iti | atrāpi kaulāvalīnirṇaya(-)yoginīhṛdayādiṣu pūrvavat kalānāṃ nāmabhedaḥ svarūpabhedaśca 
dṛśyete |

<14 |> kalānāmāsāṃ svarūpamāha(-)varābhayeti | sarvā eva ekena hastena varamapareṇa 
cābhayaṃ dadhatyaḥ | atasīpuṣpasodarāḥ atasīpuṣpasavarṇāḥ | pūrvaṃ kalābhiḥ 
sūryamarcayedityuktam(,) tatkramamupadiśati(-)lālāṭamiti | lālāṭam aṃ(,) kāmabījaṃ klīṃ | 
bījayoretayoranyataramādau saṃyojya ravermaṇḍalaṃ pūjayedityarthaḥ | pūjākramamāha 
kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

<p. 597> (arghyapātrāpūraṇam)

tīrthodakena śuddhena pūrayenmūlamuccaran |

(somakalārcopadeśaḥ)

praṇavena gandhapuṣpe dattvā somakalārcanam || 15 ||

(ṣoḍaśa somakalāḥ)

amṛtā mānasī tuṣṭiḥ puṣṭiḥ prītī ratistathā |
śrīśca hrīśca svadhā rātrirjyotsnā haimavatī tathā || 16 ||

chāyā'nyā pūrṇimā vidyā amāvāsyā ca ṣoḍaśī | 
ābhirvā pūjayet somaṃ parābhirvā yathākramāt || 17 ||


maṇḍalaṃ pūrvavat kṛtvā pūjayet pūrvavartmanā | 
sūryasya maṇḍalaṃ tatra cintayitvā'tha pūjayet |
svarādyaṃ bindusahitamarkamaṇḍalaṃ ṅeyutam | 
namo'ntaṃ mantramuccārya pūjayitvā'rghyapātrakam | 
kalāḥ saṃpūjayettatra bhānordvādaśasaṃjñakāḥ |

iti | evañca lalāṭakāmabījayoranyataramuccārya aṃ arkamaṇḍalāya dvādaśakalātmane 
arghyapātrāya nama iti prayogaḥ |

<15 |> athārghyapātrasyā'pūraṇādikamāha(-)tīrthetyādinā | pūrayet arghyapātramiti śeṣaḥ | 
mūlamuccarannityantarbhūtaṇyarthaḥ uccārayannityarthaḥ | tatastatra praṇavena gandhapuṣpādikaṃ 
nikṣipya somakalārcanaṃ somamaṇḍalārcanaṃ kuryādityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ svacchandasaṃgrahe (-)

elālavaṅgakakkolajātīphalasusaṃyutān |
sugandhikusumairdravyaiḥ saha tasmiñ jale kṣipet | 
navayoniṃ samālikhya pūrvavajjalamadhyataḥ |
niśuddhitaḥ samāvāhya candramaṇḍalamarcayet | iti |

<16-17 |> atha ṣoḍaśa somakalāstatpūjanañcopadiśati(-)amṛtetyādinā | amṛtādyā amāvāsyāntāḥ 
ṣoḍaśa kalāḥ | ābhirniruktābhiḥ kalābhiḥ | kalpāntaramavatārayati(-)parābhirveti(,) 
vakṣyamāṇābhirvetyarthaḥ |

<p. 598> (tatra prakārāntaram)

amṛtā mānadā pūṣā tuṣṭiḥ puṣṭī ratidhṛtiḥ |
śaśinī candrikā kāntirjyotsnā śrīḥ prītiraṅgadā || 18 ||

pūrṇā pūrṇāmṛtā kāmadāyinyaḥ svaragāḥ kalāḥ |

(somakalānāṃ svarūpam)

taruṇāruṇasaṅkāśā varābhayakarāḥ smṛtāḥ || 19 ||

(kalārcākramaḥ)

paścimādikrameṇāpi kalāḥ sarvāḥ prapūjayet |

(somamaṇḍalārcā)

śaktyarṇaṃ dakṣakarṇaṃ vā niyojya maṇḍalaṃ vidhoḥ || 20 ||

(ānandabhairavayoḥ pūjanam)

ānandabhairavaṃ devamānandabhairavīmapi |


<18-20 |> tā evā'ha(-)amṛteti | kalpe'smin amṛtādyāḥ pūrṇāmṛtāntāḥ kāmadāyinyaḥ 
vāñchitārthapradāḥ ṣoḍaśa kalāḥ(,) etāḥ pūjayedityarthaḥ | ayameva kalpaḥ 
samānānupūrvīkavacanena pratipāditaḥ kaulāvalīnirṇaye | svaragāḥ akārādi(-)ṣoḍaśa(-)svaragatāḥ 
kalā ityarthaḥ | atra svarajāḥ kalā ityuktaṃ kaulāvalīnirṇaye | 
evañcākārādiṣoḍaśasvarāṇāmekaikamādau niyojya ekaikamarcayediti bodhyam | vyaktamāha 
yoginīhṛdayaṭīkādhṛtasvacchandasaṃgrahe (-)

ādikādyantikāḥ saumyāḥ kalāḥ ṣoḍaśa kīrtitāḥ |

iti | bījayogaśca pūrvavat | evañca pūrvavad bījamuccārya aṃ amṛtāyai namaḥ | āṃ 
mānadāyai nama ityādirūpaḥ prayogakramaḥ paryavasyati | kalānāmāsāṃ svarūpamāha (-) 
taruṇeti | spaṣṭam | paścimādikrameṇa vṛttākāreṇa pūjayet | tantrasāre'pyevameva |

	atha candramaṇḍalapūjākramamāha(-)śaktyarṇamiti | śaktyarṇaṃ sauḥ iti(,) dakṣakarṇam uṃ 
| bījayogaḥ pūrvavat | evañca niruktabījamuccārya uṃ somamaṇḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane 
arghyapātrāmṛtāya nama iti prayogaḥ |

<21-22 |> athā'nandabhairavānandabhairavyostatra pūjāmupadiśati (-) ānandetyādinā |

<p. 599> (ānandabhairavamantraḥ)

śivasomau mātṛkāntaṃ kālabhūvaruṇānalam || 21 ||

vāmakarṇasamāyuktaṃ vāyumardhendumaṇḍitam |
ānandabhairavāyeti śikhāmantraṃ tato vadet || 22 ||

ānandabhairavaḥ soma(?) ānandabhairavīṃ śṛṇu |

(ānandabhairavīmantraḥ)

pūrvavad varṇamālikhya candraṃ hitvādimaṃ nayet || 23 ||

karṇe vāmākṣi saṃyojya sudhādevyai manuṃ dṛśoḥ |

(arghye japakramaḥ)

asyopari japenmūlaṃ tāraṃ vā saptadhā budhaḥ || 24 ||


ādāvānandabhairavaṃ tata ānandabhairavīṃ(,) prapūjayediti pūrveṇa sambandhaḥ | 
tatrā'nandabhairavamantramāha(-)śivetyādinā | śivo hakāraḥ(,) somaścandrabījaṃ sakāraḥ(,) 
mātṛkāntaṃ kṣakāraḥ(,) kālo makāraḥ(,) bhūḥ pṛthvībījaṃ lakāraḥ(,) varuṇabījaṃ vakāraḥ(,) 
analaṃ vahnibījaṃ rakāraḥ(,) vāyubījaṃ yakāraḥ(,) tacca vāyubījaṃ vāmakarṇena ṣaṣṭhasvareṇa 
samāyuktaṃ tathā ardhendunā anusvāreṇa maṇḍitam | evañca ha sa kṣa ma la va ra yūṃ iti 
prāptam | tata ānandabhairavāyeti | tataśca śikhāmantraṃ vaṣaṭ iti | eva~ca ha sa kṣa ma la 
va ra yūṃ ānandabhairavāya vaṣaḍityānandabhairavamantraḥ paryavasyati |

<23-25 |> ānandabhairavamantramupasaṃharati(-)ānandeti | atra soma iti prāmādikaḥ pāṭhaḥ(,) prokta 
ityeva samīcīna iti pratibhāti | athā'nandabhairavīmantramāha(-)ānandabhairavīmityādinā | 
pūrvavadānandabhairavakrameṇa hakārādivarṇāṣṭakamālikhyetyarthaḥ | candraṃ hitvā 
dvitīyavarṇaṃ sakāraṃ ullaṅghya ādimaṃ hakāraṃ nayet dvitīyākṣarāt sakārāt parataḥ 
prayuñjītetyarthaḥ(,) anena ha sa ityatra sa ha iti prāptam | tathā karṇe niruktamantrastha 
vāmakarṇasthāne vāmākṣi caturthasvaraṃ saṃyojya | anena yūṃ ityatra yīṃ iti prāptam | 
tataḥ sudhādevyai iti | tataśca dṛśormanuṃ vauṣaḍiti padaṃ yojayediti śeṣaḥ | evañca ha sa 
kṣa ma la va ra yīṃ

<p. 600> (upasaṃhāraḥ)

sāmānyārghyamidaṃ proktaṃ

(viśeṣārghyanirūpaṇapratijñā)

				viśeṣārghyamathocyate || 25 ||

(śrīpātrakalpanā)

gṛhītvājñāṃ mahādevyāḥ śrīpātraṃ parikalpayet |

(maṇḍalanirmāṇam)

ātmaśrīcakrayormadhye maṇḍalaṃ racayed yathā || 26 ||

īkāreṇānvitaṃ tryasraṃ ṣaḍasraṃ vṛttabhūpure |
tryasrabāhye'thavā vṛttaṃ tadabhyukṣettadambunā || 27 ||


sudhādevyai vauṣaḍityānandabhairavīmantraḥ paryavasyati | asyeti | asya sāmānyārghyasyopari 
mūlamantraṃ tāraṃ praṇavaṃ vā saptadhā japedityarthaḥ | sāmānyārghyamupasaṃharati(-)
sāmānyeti |
	evaṃ sāmānyārghyaparipāṭīmabhidhāya viśeṣārghyasthāpanaprakriyāmabhidhatte (-) 
viśeṣārghyamityādinā |

<26-27 |> atha pātrasthāpanayogyamaṇḍalanirmāṇasthānamupadiśati(-)ātmeti | ātmaśrīcakrayormadhye 
ātmanaḥ śrīcakrarūpāyā devatāyāśca madhyavartinyāṃ bhūmau maṇḍalaṃ 
vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa racayedityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

ātmadevīdvayormadhye bhūmau cakraṃ likhettataḥ |

iti | maṇḍalaracanāparipāṭīmāha (-) īkāreṇeti | īkāreṇānvitamīkāragarbhaṃ trikoṇam | 
kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale'pi (-)

madhye māyāṃ samālikhya prokṣayettadanantaram |

iti | tatrāpi māyāpadena caturthasvara eva bodhyaḥ | evañca caturthasvaragarbhaṃ trikoṇaṃ 
tadbahiḥ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tadbahirvṛttaṃ tadbahiścaturasrarūpaṃ bhūpuram ityeko maṇḍalaracanākalpaḥ | 
kalpāntaramāha(-)tryasreti | athavā prāguktatryasrabāhye vṛttaṃ vidadhīta | evañcātra kalpe 
ādāvīkāragarbhaṃ trikoṇaṃ tadbahirvṛttaṃ tadbahiḥṣaṭkoṇaṃ tadbahiścaturasramiti viśeṣaḥ | 
evaṃ maṇḍalaracanāyāṃ kalpadvayamanyatrāpi dṛśyate | yathā kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale(-)

<p. 601> (tatra pīṭhacatuṣṭayādyarcā)

caturasre pūrṇaśailamuḍḍīyānābhidhaṃ param |
jālandharaṃ kāmarūpaṃ ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍāsanam || 28 ||

(ṣaṭkoṇārcāyāṃ vikalpaḥ)

ṣaḍaṅgaṃ pūjayed vā'pi tattanmantramudīrayan |

(trikoṇādyarcā)

trikoṇañca tribhiḥ kūṭairmadhya ādhāraśaktikām || 29 ||


ātmadevīdvayormadhye bhūmau cakraṃ likhettataḥ |
trikoṇañcaiva ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vṛttaṃ bhūgṛhasaṃyutam ||

iti | vacanamidaṃ pūrvakalpapratipādakam | tathā jñānārṇave caturdaśapaṭale(-)

trikoṇavṛttaṣaṭkoṇaṃ caturasrantu maṇḍalam |

iti | vacanamidamuttarakalpapratipādakam | evañca tantrabhedena kalpabhedadarśanāt 
svasvagurusaṃpradāyānusāreṇaikataraḥ pakṣaḥ samāśrayaṇīya iti dik | taditi | tanmaṇḍalaṃ 
tadambunā sāmānyārghyajalenābhyukṣedityarthaḥ | vyaktamuktaṃ kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale(-)

madhye māyāṃ samālikhya prokṣayettadanantaram |
astrāntamūlamantreṇa sāmānyārghyajalena ca || 

iti |

<28 |> atha prāguktamaṇḍale caturasrādikrameṇa pūjanamupadiśati(-)caturasra ityādinā | caturasre 
pūrṇaśailādipīṭhacatuṣṭayamarcayet | pūjanañca pūrvādikrameṇa(,) taduktaṃ kaulāvalīnirṇaye 
ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

caturasre pūrṇaśailamuḍḍīyānaṃ jalandharam | 
pūjayet kāmarūpañca pūrvādikramayogataḥ |

iti | atha niruktacaturasrāntaḥṣaṭkoṇe pūjanamāha (-)ṣaḍiti | ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍāsanaṃ pūjayediti 
pareṇa sambandhaḥ | ṣaḍāsanāni ca amṛtārṇavāsana(-)
potāmbujāsanātmāsanacakrāsanasarvamantrāsanasādhyasiddhāsanāni tripurārcanarahasye 
vyaktamuktāni veditavyāni | prayogastu hrīṃ śrīmiti dvitārīṃ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīmiti tritārīṃ voccārya 
amṛtārṇavāsanāya namaḥ ityādirūpaḥ |

<29 |> kalpāntaramāha (-) ṣaḍaṅgamiti | vyaktamāha jñānārṇave caturdaśapaṭale (-)

<p. 602> trikoṇavṛttaṣaṭkoṇamādhāraṃ pūrvameva vā |

(maṇḍale'rghyādhārasthāpanakramaḥ)

hṛdā prokṣitamādhāraṃ sthāpayenmaṇḍalopari || 30 ||

(ādhārārcā)

bālātribījaṃ tripurasundaryarghyāsanaṃ vadet |
sādhayāmi namo'ntena manunādhāramarcayet || 31 ||

prapūjya pūrvavad vahneḥ kalāntamantramuccaran | 
syād vahnimaṇḍalāyeti rūpaṃ daśakalātmane || 32 ||

arghyapātrāsanāyeti hṛdādhāre samarcayet | 
ṣaṭkoṇeṣu ṣaḍaṅgāni vyastairmadhye śivāṃ manoḥ || 33 ||


dvirāvṛttyā ṣaḍaṅgāni ṣaṭkoṇeṣu prapūjayet |

iti | evañcāgnyādikrameṇa prathamaṃ vāgbhavakūṭaṃ tataḥ kāmarājakūṭaṃ tataḥ 
śaktikūṭaṃ punarapi niruktavāgbhavādikūṭatrayamuccārya pūjayedityarthaḥ | tantrasārakārairapi 
agnyādikrameṇa ṣaṭkoṇe mūlavidyayā dvirāvṛttyā ṣaḍaṅgāni pūjayedityuktam | 
tripurārcanarahasye'pyevameva | tattanmantramudīrayannityasyāpyayamevābhiprāyo 
jñānārṇavatantrasārādisaṃvādenāvagamyate | antastrikoṇapūjanamāha(-)trikoṇeti | tribhiḥ 
kūṭairvyastakūṭatrayeṇetyarthaḥ | jñānārṇave caturdaśapaṭale'pi (-)

vyastakūṭairyajettatra trikoṇe parameśvari |

ityuktam | madhya iti | trikoṇamadhye ādhāraśaktiṃ pūjayedityarthaḥ |

<30 |> hṛdā nama ityanena |

<31 |> athārghyapātrādhārārcāmantramāha (-) bāleti | tathāca aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ 
tripurasundaryarghyāsanaṃ sādhayāmi nama iti mantraḥ paryavasyati |

<32-33 |> pūrvavaditi | sāmānyārghyoktakrameṇa vahnerdaśakalāḥ saṃpūjya vahnimaṇḍalāya 
daśakalātmane arghyapātrāsanāya nama ityādhāre samarcayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 603> (arghyapātranirṇayaḥ)

pātraṃ kāñcanakācarūpyajanitaṃ muktākapālodbhavaṃ
viśvāmitramayañca kāmadamidaṃ haimaṃ priyaṃ sphāṭikaṃ |
tāmraṃ prītidamaṣṭasiddhijanakaṃ śrīnārikelodbhavaṃ
kāpālaṃ sphuṭamantrasiddhijanakaṃ muktipradaṃ mauktikam || 34 ||

śaṅkham alāvupātrañca tathā puṇyatarūdbhavam | 
mṛnmayaṃ tāmrajaṃ vā'pi tathā lohasamudbhavam || 35 ||

purā vai nirmitaṃ pātraṃ viśvāmitreṇa dhīmatā | 
viśvāmitrakapālañca sarvapātrottamottamam || 36 ||

brahmahatyādipāpāni tathā viśvāsaghātakam |
dṛṣṭvā pātraṃ nārikelaṃ sarvapāpaṃ praṇaśyati || 37 ||

kalpakoṭipradānāni tathā hemaśatāni ca | 
yo dadāti munīndrāya rāhugraste niśākare || 38 ||

tatphalāt koṭiguṇitaṃ nārikelārghyapātrataḥ |
abhāve tasya pātrasya pātramanyat prakalpayet || 39 ||

dṛṣṭvārghyapātraṃ paramaṃ brahmādyā devatāḥ sadā |
nṛtyanti sarvayoginyaḥ prītyā siddhiṃ dadātyalam || 40 ||

(kāmanābhedena pātrabhedāḥ)

vaśyākarṣaṇakārye tu hemapātraṃ praśasyate | 
śāntike pauṣṭike caiva rājataṃ kārayed budhaḥ || 41 ||


<41 |> pātrabhedena phalabhedamāha haratattvadīdhitidhṛtaśivarahasye (-)

hemapātrāṇi sarvāṇi gṛhītāni bhavantu me |
arghyaṃ dattvā tu raupyeṇa loke pūjyasutā(/)llabhet ||

<p. 604> lauhapātraṃ vijānīyānmāraṇoccāṭane tathā |
stambhakāryeṣu pāṣāṇaṃ vidveṣe lauhamṛnmayam || 42 ||

kulotsādanakāryeṣu kācapātraṃ praśasyate |
kāṣṭhapātraṃ vijānīyānmantrārādhanakarmaṇi || 43 ||

(sarvatra viśvāmitrapātrasya prāśastyam)

sarvakāryeṣu kartavyaṃ viśvāmitra manuttamam | 

(pātrabhedena phalabhedāḥ)

śaṅkhaṃ jñānapradaṃ proktamalāvu sarvasiddhidam || 44 ||

uktaṃ mahārājatantramataṃ paramadurlabham |

(arghyapātraparimāṇam)

ṣoḍaśāṅgulamānaṃ tat pātraṃ sarvasamṛddhidam || 45 ||


tāmrapātreṇa saubhāgyaṃ dharmaṃ manmayasambhave |
sarvālābhe tu māheyaṃ svahastaghaṭitaṃ yadi ||

ā(mala ? sana)ñcārghyapātrañca bhagnamāsādayenna tu |
sarvatra svarṇavattāmramarghyapātre tato'dhikam ||

pātrāṇāmādaraḥ kāryaḥ pātrāṇyevottamāni tu |
bahirhomakriyāyāntu vinā pātraṃ na sidhyati || iti |

adhikāribhedena pātrabhedamāha gandharvatantre dvādaśapaṭale (-)

śaṅkhaśuktirajatasvarṇairdivyānāṃ pātramiṣyate |
mahāśaṅkhaistu vīrāṇāṃ phalajaṃ vanavāsinām || iti |

arghyādau tāmrapātrasya prāśastyamāha (-)

pūjārghyapātraṃ naivedyādyādhārapānapātrakam |
sarvaṃ tāmramayaṃ kuryād yatkiñcidiha pūjane ||
tāmre devāḥ pramodante tāmre devāḥ sthitāḥ sadā |
devīprītikaraṃ tāmraṃ tasmāttāmraṃ prayojayet ||

<p. 605> dvādaśāṅgulamānaṃ vā vasvaṅgulamathāpi vā |
etannyūnañca yat pātraṃ tat pātramadhamaṃ smṛtam || 46 ||

(varjanīyapātranirūpaṇam)

atyantasthūlapātrantu sūkṣmapātrantu varjayet |
eteṣāmācaredekaṃ pāthasā sādhakottamaḥ || 47 ||

(pātrasthāpanakramaḥ)

astramantreṇa prakṣālya sthāpayed yantrikopari |


<45-47 |> arghyapātrasya parimāṇamāha (-) ṣoḍaśetyādinā |

viśiṣyā'ha kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

ukteṣveteṣu pātreṣu pātramekaṃ prakalpayet |
ṣoḍaśāṅgulavistāraṃ ṣaḍaṅgulasamucchrayam ||
athavā'pi tadardhaṃ syāttadardhaṃ vā'pi kārayet | 
ekāṅgulaṃ tathā sārdhaṃ ṣaṭkañcaiva pramāṇataḥ ||
atisūkṣmamatisthalaṃ sacchidraṃ parivarjayet |
na yojayed bhagnapātraṃ svapnādeśaṃ praśasyate ||

iti | śivārcanacandrikādhṛtaśivarahasye'pi (-)

ṣaṭtriṃśadaṅgulaṃ pātramuttamaṃ parikīrtitam |
madhyamantu tribhāgonaṃ kaniṣṭhaṃ dvādaśāṅgulam ||
vasvaṅgulavihīnantu na pātraṃ kārayet kvacit ||
nābhīvivarayuktāni puṇḍarīkākṛtīni ca |
drākṣānīlotpalādīni pātrāṇi parikalpayet ||

iti | tathā haratattvadīdhitidhṛtaśyāmārcanacandrikāyām (-)

bhagnaṃ vasvaṅgulinyūnaṃ kṣīṇaṃ sacchidrameva ca |
vijātīyañca deveśi varjayet sarvathā priye || iti |

<p. 606> (pātrapratiṣṭhāpanamantraḥ)

bālābījatrayasyānte tatastripurasundarī || 48 ||

viśeṣārghyapadāt pātraṃ pratiśabdādanantaram |
sthāpayāmīti manunā pratiṣṭhāpya kalā raveḥ || 49 ||

(tatra sūryakalāmaṇḍalārcā)

prapūjya vidhivad vidvān syāt sūryamaṇḍalāya ca |
dvādaśeti kalātmane cārghyapātrāya hṛnmanuḥ || 50 ||

(maṇḍalavidhiḥ)

trikoṇaṃ vṛttaṣaṭkoṇaṃ pātramadhye likhettataḥ |


<48-50 |> ādhāre'rghyapātrasthāpanamāha(-) astreti | astramantreṇa phaḍityanena | prakṣālya 
sāmānyārghyodakeneti śeṣaḥ | yantrikopari tripadikādiprāguktādhāre | tathāca gandharvatantre 
dvādaśapaṭale (-)

tathaivāstreṇa yutayā sāmānyārghyodakena tu |
prakṣālya parameśāni maṇḍale sthāpayettataḥ ||

ityanena maṇḍale'rghyapātrādhārasthāpanasya kramamupadiśya (-)

pūrvavat parameśāni pātraṃ prakṣālya sādhakaḥ |

ityādinā ādhārasthāpanakrameṇaivārghyapātrasyāpi sthāpanamuktam | 
arghyapātrapratiṣṭhāmantramāha(-)bāleti | tathāca aiṃ klīṃ sauḥ tripurasundarīviśeṣārghyapātraṃ 
pratiṣṭhāpayāmīti pratiṣṭhāpanamantraḥ pūrvavat | dvitārīprayogastritārīprayogo vā sarvatra 
pūrvavat | kalā raveriti | prāguktasāmānyārghyakrameṇa dvādaśa tapinyādisūryakalāḥ 
prapūjyetyarthaḥ | sūryamaṇḍaleti | (aṃ) sūryamaṇḍalāya dvādaśakalātmane arghyapātrāya 
nama iti mantreṇārghyapātraṃ pūjayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 607> (maṇḍalapūjā)

samastavyastakūṭena pūjayet tu trikoṇake || 51 ||

(pātrāpūraṇakramaḥ)

bālātribījaṃ tripurasundaryarghyapadopari |
pātraṃ saṃpūrayāmīti saṅkalpya manunā'munā || 52 ||

anulomavilomābhyāṃ mātṛkārṇaṃ samuccaran |
amṛtāmṛtabuddhyā tu śrīpātraṃ paripūrayet || 53 ||

(pātrāpūraṇadravyāṇi)

jalācchataguṇaṃ proktaṃ dugdhodakamanuttamam |
dugdhāddadhi śataguṇaṃ dadhnaḥ śataguṇaṃ ghṛtam || 54 ||

ghṛtācchataguṇo hetu(?) devīdakṣiṇasādhane |


<51 |> trikoṇamiti | niruktārghyapātramadhye ādau trikoṇaṃ tadbahirvṛttaṃ tadbahiḥ ṣaṭkoṇaṃ 
likhedityarthaḥ | atra kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

maṇḍalaṃ pūrvavat kṛtvā pūjayet pūrvavartmanā |

ityabhidhānāt(,) tantrasāre'pi pūrvavad yantramālikhyetyukterjñānārṇavādāvapi tathā darśanāt 
atrāpi ṣaṭkoṇād bahirbhūpuraṃ likhediti hṛdayam | samasteti trikūṭātmakamantreṇa(;) vyastakūṭena 
pṛthak pṛthak vāgbhava (-) kāmarāja (-) śaktikūṭenetyarthaḥ |

<52-53 |> atha pātrāpūraṇakramamāha (-) bāleti | tathāca ai(/) klī(/) sau(/) ḥ tripurasundaryarghyapātraṃ 
saṃpūrayāmīti mantreṇa saṃkalpyetyarthaḥ | anulometi | akārāt kṣakārāntaṃ punaḥ 
kṣakārādakārāntaṃ mātṛkāvarṇaṃ samuccaran | amṛtāmṛtabuddhyā paramāmṛtatvena 
vibhāvyetyarthaḥ | śrīpātramarghyapātram |

<54 |> atha pātrāpūraṇadravyāṇi dravyabhedena phalabhedāṃścā'ha (-) jalāditi | jalād 
dugdhodakasya śataguṇaphalajanakatvaṃ tato dadhnaḥ śataguṇaphalajanakatvamityevaṃ 
krameṇoktānāṃ phalajanakatvamavagantavyamityarthaḥ | dakṣiṇasādhana iti | dakṣiṇārakrameṇa 
sādhana ityarthaḥ | viśiṣyā'ha gandharvatantre dvādaśapaṭale (-)

<p. 608> (arghyadravyāṇi)

dūrvākṣataṃ raktapuṣpaṃ bilvapatrañca candanam || 55 ||

nānāsugandhikadravyaṃ navaratnāṣṭagandhakam |

(sakalasomamaṇḍalārcā)

dattvā yajet somakalāḥ pūrvavat paścimakramāt || 56 ||

syāt somamaṇḍalāyānte ṣoḍaśeti kalātmane |
arghyāmṛtāya nama ityaghya dadyād vāmakrameṇa tu || 57 ||

(gandhāṣṭakam)

candanāgurukastūrīcorakuṅkumarocanāḥ |
jaṭāmāṃsī kapiyutā śaktergandhāṣṭakaṃ viduḥ || 58 ||


mātṛkāṃ pratilomena mūlamantrābhimantritaiḥ |
ādimaiḥ pūrayed vā'pi tathā puṣpāsavairapi ||

kapilāyāstathā kṣīrairnārikelāmṛtairapi |
ikṣurasaiḥ sugandhaiśca madhuratritayena vā ||

pūrayettanmāhāpātraṃ nānādravyaiḥ kadācana |
adhikāriprabhedena dravyabhedā bhavanti hi ||
svayambhūkusumantatra karpūrāgurucandanaiḥ |
rocanākuṅkumairmiśraṃ kastūrīparibhāvitam |
nikṣipet parameśāni śarkarāṃ madhusaṃyutām || iti |

<55-56 |> atha tatrārghyadravyārpaṇamāha (-) dūrveti | spaṣṭam | naveti | navaratnaṃ 
gandhāṣṭakañca dattvā yajed vakṣyamāṇakrameṇeti śeṣaḥ | navaratnāni pañcamaprakāśe 
(5/93 ślo.) pradarśitāni |

	gandhāṣṭakantu svayamevāgre vakṣyati | yajediti | pūrvavat sāmānyārghyakrameṇa 
amṛtādiṣoḍaśacandrakalā yajedityarthaḥ | someti | (uṃ) somamaṇḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane 
arghyāmṛtāya nama iti prayogaḥ |

<58 |> pūrvamaṣṭagandhakamityuktam(,) tad gandhāṣṭakaṃ nirūpayati (-)candanetyādinā | coraḥ 
kṛṣṇaśaṭhī(,) kapiḥ gāṭhiyālā iti tantrasāraḥ | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam |

<p. 609> (arghyāmṛte yantralekhanādikramaḥ)

puṣpeṇa yantramālikhya pūrvasomāmṛtāntare |
akathādīṃstrirekhāsu haṃ laṃ kṣaṃ madhyato likhet || 59 ||

(tatrārcāvāhane)

trikoṇaṃ pūjayenmantrī trikūṭena yathākramāt |
hastābhyāṃ pātramācchādya tīrthāvāhanamācaret || 60 ||

(pañcaratnārcākramaḥ)

pūrvādito dikṣu madhye pañcaratnaṃ prapūjayet || 61 ||

(pañcaratnamantraḥ)

kāntāntaṃ somatapanaṃ bhāntaṃ dhāntaṃ mahīyutam |
dakṣakarṇendusaṃyuktaṃ pañcaratnamanukramāt || 62 ||

(pañcaratnāni)

gaganaṃ svargapātālaṃ marttyaṃ nāgamanantaram |
pañcaratnamidaṃ proktaṃ devyānandakaraṃ mahat || 63 ||


<59 |> puṣpeṇeti | pūrvasomāmṛtāntare somakalātmakārghyasthāmṛtābhyantare | yantraṃ 
trikoṇavṛttaṣaṭkoṇacaturasrātmakayantramityarthaḥ | akatheti | antastrikoṇaghaṭakarekhātraye krameṇa 
akārādiṣoḍaśasvarān(,) kakārāditakārāntān thakārādisakārāntāṃśca vyañjanavarṇān(,) tathā 
madhyato niruktatrikoṇābhyantare haṃ laṃ kṣamiti varṇatrayaṃ likhediti phalitārthaḥ | 
atrākārādikakārādithakārādivarṇaniyāmako'kathaśabda iti jñeyam |

<60 |> trikoṇamiti | niruktatrikoṇaṃ trikūṭena vāgbhava(-)kāmarāja(-)śaktikūṭairvyastaiḥ krameṇa 
pūjayedityarthaḥ | tīrthāvāhanamiti oṃ gaṅge cetyādinetyarthaḥ |

<61 |> pūrvādita iti | pūrvādidikcatuṣṭaye catvāri madhye caikamityevaṃkrameṇa pañcaratnaṃ 
prapūjayedityarthaḥ |

<62-63 |> pañcaratnānyāha(-)kāntāntamityādinā | kāntānto gakāraḥ(,) somaḥ sakāraḥ(,) tapanaḥ 
pakāraḥ(,) bhānto makāraḥ(,) dhānto nakāraḥ(,) etadvarṇapañcakaṃ mahīyutaṃ mahyā pṛthvībījena 
lakāreṇa yuktaṃ tathā dakṣakarṇena pañcamasvareṇa indunā'nusvāreṇa ca saṃyuktam |

<p. 610> (ānandabhairavārcā)

ānandabhairavaṃ devaṃ pūrvavat paripūjayet |

(pañcabhirmantrairarcanasyopadeśaḥ)

kuladravyāṇi niḥkṣipya pañcamantraiḥ samarcayet || 64 ||


etena gluṃ sluṃ pluṃ mluṃ nluṃ iti bījapañcakaṃ prāptam | etat pañcaratnaṃ krameṇa 
gaganādīnāṃ pūrvaṃ yojayedityarthaḥ | upasaṃharati(-)pañcaratnamityādinā | evañca gluṃ 
gaganaratnāya namaḥ(,) sluṃ svargaratnāya namaḥ(,) pluṃ pātālaratnāya namaḥ(,) mluṃ 
marttyaratnāya namaḥ nluṃ nāgaratnāya namaḥ iti prayogakramaḥ | evameva 
tripurārcanarahasye'pi | kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale tu gaganaratnebhyo namaḥ 
ityādibahuvacanāntaḥ prayogo dṛśyate | yathā (-)

saṃpūjayettataḥ paścāt pañcaratnaṃ susādhakaḥ |
pañcāntakaṃ binduyutaṃ dakṣakarṇasamanvitam ||
gaganānte ca ratnebhyo namo'ntamanumuddharet |
śītalaṃ śakrasaṃyuktamagrabinduvibhūṣitam ||
svargapadaṃ samuccārya ratnebhyo nama ityapi |
pañcamaṃ devarājañca dakṣaśrotrasamanvitam ||
pātālapadaratnebhyo namo'ntaścāparo manuḥ |
mahākālaṃ kṣitiyutaṃ dakṣakarṇasamanvitam ||
marttyaratne tataḥ paścād bhyo namo'tra samuddharet |
vāmapādaṃ kṣitiyutaṃ dakṣaśravaṇabhūṣitam | 
nāgapadaṃ samuccārya ratnebhyo nama ityapi ||

iti | asmābhistu mūle gaganamityādyekavacanāntapadadarśanād granthakṛdguru(-)
śrīmadbrahmānandakṛtatripurārcanarahasye 
gaganaratnāyetyādyekavacanāntaprayogadarśanāccaikavacanānta eva prayogaṣṭākāyāṃ 
pradarśitaḥ | parantu tatra pātālaratnāt pūrvaṃ marttyaratnasya samāveśo dṛśyata iti viśeṣaḥ |

<64 |> ānandeti | pūrvavat prākpradarśitasāmānyārghyoktakrameṇa | atrā'nandabhairavyā api 
pūrvavat pūjanaṃ vidheyaṃ tripurārcanarahasya(-)tantrasārādau tathā darśanāt |

<p. 611> (tatra prathamo mantraḥ)

akhaṇḍaikarasānandakare parasudhātmani |
svacchandasphuraṇāmatra nidhehyakularūpiṇi || 65 ||

(dvitīyaḥ)

akulasthāmṛtākāre śuddhajñānakare pare |
amṛtatvaṃ nidhehyasmin vastuni klinnarūpiṇi || 66 ||

(tṛtīyaḥ)

tadrūpeṇaikavaśyañca kṛtvā'syai tatsvarūpiṇi |
bhūtvā parāmṛtākāraṃ mayi visphuraṇaṃ kuru || 67 ||

(caturthaḥ)

vāgbhavaṃ (plu?plū)mātmañca jhrau(/) hrū(/) sastataḥ paṭhet |
amṛte'mṛtodbhave procya athāmṛteśvarīti ca || 68 ||

amṛtavarṣi(ṇī ? ṇi) padamamṛtaṃ srāvayadvayam |
vahnijāyāṃ samuddhṛtya mantramanyaṃ samuddharet || 69 ||


<65 |> mantrapañcakamāha(-)akhaṇḍaiketyādinā | spaṣṭam |

<68-69 |> caturthaṃ mantramāha(-)vāgbhavamityādinā | vāgbhavaṃ ai(/)(,) tataḥ plaṃ (?) (plūṃ) tataḥ 
jhrau(/) hrū(/) sa iti | adhodhṛtapāṭhāntarānusāreṇa tu jhrau(/) hrū(/) saḥ ityatra hasau haṃsa iti 
labhyate | kaulāvalīnirṇayaṣaṣṭhapaṭaloktakrameṇa tu kṣau(/) jūṃ saṃ iti labhyate | 
gandharvatantradvādaśapaṭalānusāreṇa tu klīṃ sauriti bījadvayam | evañca bahudhā 
pāṭhabhedadarśanāt saṃśayaviṣadigdhahṛdayairmūloktameva pāṭhamanurudhya mantroddhāraḥ 
kriyate'smābhiriti kṣamatāṃ bhūtabhāvano bhagavān bhavānīpatiḥ | tathāca 
niruktapramāṇānusāreṇa(,) ai(/) plaṃ (?) (plūṃ) jhrau(/) hrū(/) saḥ amṛte'mṛtodbhave amṛteśvari 
amṛtavarṣiṇi amṛtaṃ srāvaya srāvaya svāheti mantraḥ paryavasyati | kaulāvalīnirṇaye 
ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

<p. 612> (pañcamaḥ)

vāgbhavaṃ vadavadasyānte vāgvādini ca vāgbhavam |
klinne(-)kledini(-)śabdāttu kledayeti samuddharet || 70 ||

mahākṣobhaṃ kurudvandvaṃ kāmaṃ śaktiṃ samuddharet |
mokṣaṃ kuruyugaṃ procya hasauḥ sthaustu samuddharet || 71 ||


vāgbhavaṃ pañcamaṃ kṣauṇīṃ vāmaśrotrasamanvitam |
kṣauṃ jūṃ saṃ amṛte'mṛtodbhave'mṛteśvari ||
amṛtavarṣiṇi procya amṛtaṃ srāvayadvayam |
vahnijāyāntamuccārya coddharedaparantataḥ ||

iti | atra plūmiti ṣaṣṭhasvarasaṃyogadarśanāt tadapi darśitam |

<70-71 |> pañcamaṃ mantramāha(-)vāgbhavamityādinā | tathā ca aiṃ vadavada vāgvādini e(/) klinne 
kledini kledaya mahākṣobhaṃ kuru kuru klīṃ hrīṃ mokṣaṃ kuru kuru hasauḥ sthauḥ iti mantraḥ 
paryavasyati | atra kaulāvalīnirṇayagandharvatantrayostu viśeṣo dṛśyate (-) yathā kaulāvalyāṃ 
ṣaṣṭhapaṭale (-)

vāgbhavaṃ vadayugmañca vāgvādini tataḥ param |
vāṅmanaḥpadamābhāṣya klinne kledini tatparam ||
kledayadvitayaṃ mahāmokṣaṃ kurudvayaṃ vadet |
kāmabījaṃ śaktibījaṃ mokṣaṃ kurudvayaṃ vadet |
pretabījaṃ samuccārya hasaurnamastataḥ param ||

iti | atra vāgvādinītyataḥ paraṃ vāṅmanaḥpadaṃ kledayetyasya dvirāvṛttiḥ(,) mahākṣobham ityatra 
mahāmokṣam(,) hasaurityataḥ pūrvaṃ pretabījaṃ sthaurityatra nama iti viśeṣaḥ | tathā 
gandharvatantre dvādaśapaṭale (-)

vāgbhavaṃ vadayugmañca vāgvādini ca vāgbhavam |
kāmabījaṃ klinnetyuktvā kledini kledayeti ca ||
mahākṣobhaṃ kuruyugmaṃ kāmabījamataḥ param | 
tārttiyaṃ mokṣamityuktvā kuruyugmaṃ vadettataḥ ||
śaktibījaṃ punaścānte sandīpanamanuḥ priye |

<p. 613> (āvāhanādikramaḥ)

āvāhayedarghyamadhye dhyātvā tripurasundarīm |
tālatrayaṃ tato dattvā tathā'vaguṇṭhanaṃ caret || 72 ||

dhenvākhyayā'mṛtīkṛtya digbandhanaṃ śareṇa tu |

(navamudrāpradarśanam)

mudrāḥ sandarśayenmantrī sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇādikāḥ || 73 ||

(trikoṇe bījayogārcāprakriyā)

trikoṇe haṃsamantrañca likhet kāmakalākṣaram |
tārttīyaṃ śrīgurorbījaṃ namo'ntaṃ tatra pūjayet || 74 ||

(śaṅkhamudrāpradarśanopadeśaḥ)

śaṅkhamudrāṃ pradarśyātha sakalīkaraṇaṃ caret |

(śaṅkhamudrāsvarūpam)

vāmāṅguṣṭhāntare'ṅguṣṭhaṃ niyojya sakalāṅgulīḥ || 75 ||

dakṣiṇasya karasyaiva vāmāṅguṣṭhena saṃspṛśet |
śaṅkhamudreyamākhyātā mudrāśāstraviśāradaiḥ || 76 ||


iti | atra kledayetyasya dvirāvṛttirnāstīti mūlena saṃvadati(,) klinne ityataḥ pūrvaṃ vāgbhavācca 
paraṃ kāmabījaprayoga ityevamādayo viśeṣāśca dṛśyante | tadevaṃ 
mantrasvarūpabhedadarśanāt svasvagurusampradāyānusāreṇaikatamaḥ pakṣaḥ samāśrayaṇīya iti 
dik |

<72 |> avaguṇṭhanamiti(,) avaguṇṭhanamudrāmiti śeṣaḥ | avaguṇṭhanamudrā ca pañcadaśaprakāśe 
(67 ślo.) ṭīkāyāṃ pradarśitā |

<73 |> dhenvākhyeti | dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya arghyodakamamṛtatvaṃ prāpayyetyarthaḥ | 
dhenumudrā'pi pañcadaśaprakāśe (67 ślo.) ṭīkāyāṃ pradarśitā | digiti | śareṇa 
phaḍityastramantreṇa digbandhanaṃ kṛtvā(,) choṭikābhiriti śeṣaḥ | mudrā iti | 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇādikā asminneva prakāśe vakṣyamāṇā nava mudrāḥ sandarśayediti 
sambandhaḥ |

<75-76 | > śaṅkheti | śaṅkhamudrāṃ vakṣyamāṇalakṣaṇām | sakalīkaraṇamapi 
vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa | tatra śaṅkhamudrālakṣaṇamāha(-)vāmāṅaṣṭhāntara iti | sakaleti |

<p. 614> (sakalīkaraṇamudrā)

devatāṅge ṣaḍaṅgañca sakalīkaraṇantvidam |

(tatra japasya saṃkhyābhedaḥ)

mīnākhyamudrayācchādya saptāṣṭadaśadhā japet || 77 ||

iṣṭadevadhiyā'rghyantu dhūpadīpaiśca vandayet |

(tarpaṇam)

kaulikyā tarpayenmantrī tattanmantreṇa vai tridhā || 78 ||

ānandabhairavaṃ mūrdhni gurūṃśca hṛdi devatām |

(tatra kaulikī mudrā)

madhyamāṅguṣṭhayogena mudrā tu kaulikī smṛtā || 79 ||


dakṣiṇasya karasya sakalāṅgulīḥ vāmāṅguṣṭhena saṃspṛśediti sambandhaḥ | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam 
| vyaktamāha tantrasāre (-)

vāmāṅguṣṭhantu saṃgṛhya dakṣiṇena tu muṣṭinā |
kṛtvottānaṃ tato muṣṭimaṅguṣṭhantu prasārayet ||
vāmāṅgulyastathā śliṣṭāḥ saṃyuktāḥ syuḥ prasāritāḥ |
dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭhasaṃspṛṣṭā jñeyaiṣā śaṅkhamudrikā || iti |

<77 |> sakalīkaraṇamudrāmāha (-) devatāṅga iti | spaṣṭam | tantrasāre'pi devatāṅge 
ṣaḍaṅgānāṃ nyāsaḥ syāt sakalīkṛtirityuktam | gandharvatantre trayodaśapaṭale (-)

saṃpūrṇāvasthiteryācñā sakalīkaraṇaṃ priye |

iti | sakalīkaraṇantu ṣaḍaṅgamantrairvidheyam | taduktaṃ gandharvatantre dvādaśapaṭale (-) 
sakalīkaraṇaṃ kuryāt ṣaḍaṅgena ca pūrvavat iti | mīneti | mīnākhyamudrayā 
matsyamudrayetyarthaḥ | matsyamudrāmāha tantrasāre (-)

dakṣapāṇipṛṣṭhadeśe vāmapāṇitalaṃ nyaset |
aṅguṣṭhau cālayet samyaṅ mudreyaṃ matsyarūpiṇī ||

iti | sapteti | saptadhā'ṣṭadhā daśadhā vā japedityarthaḥ |

<78-79 |> kaulikyā tadākhyayā mudrayetyarthaḥ | ānandabhairavam(,) gurūn(,) hṛdi (-)

<p. 615> (kaulikamudrayā tarpaṇasyopayogitvam)

aṅguṣṭhe bhairavī devī madhyame caṇḍikā smṛtā |
ataḥ prayatnato mantrī tarpayedanayā sadā || 80 ||


sthitāṃ devatāñca tattanmantreṇa ānandabhairavādimantreṇa pratyekaṃ tridhā tarpayediti 
sambandhaḥ | kaulikīṃ mudrāmāha(-)madhyameti | spaṣṭam |

<80 |> kaulikyā tarpaṇe yuktimāha (-) aṅguṣṭha iti | aṅguṣṭhe bhairavī devī madhyame 
madhyamāyāṃ caṇḍikā smṛtā | ato bhairavī (-) caṇḍikāsambandhāt 
tarpaṇadravyasyāmṛtatvasampādanāya anayā kaulikyā tarpayediti sambandhaḥ | tarpaṇakramo'yaṃ 
kulārṇavasammata iti svayameva vakṣyati | parantu kulārṇave ṣaṣṭhollāse tarpaṇaprakaraṇe kaulikī 
mudrā nopalabhyate(,) tatra tu (-)

aṅguṣṭho bhairavo devo anāmā caṇḍikā priye |
anāmāṅguṣṭhayogena (.. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. ..) ||

iti vacanamupalabhyate | etena tu tattvamudrayaiva tarpaṇamuktaṃ bhavati | 
tantrasāradhṛtasvatantratantre'pi (-)

aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogād vāmahastasya pārvati |
tarpayet sundarīṃ devīṃ samudrāñca savāhanām | 
tarpayāmi mukhe devyāstrivāraṃ mūlavidyayā |
aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogānnakhairnirdiṣṭamuddhṛtam | 
śrīpātrasyodakaṃ binduṃ tarpayet kulanāyikām |
aṅguṣṭho bhairavo devi anāmā caṇḍikā priye |
savyena hastayogena tarpayed vā kuleśvarīm | 

iti | atrāpi aṅguṣṭhe bhairavasyānāmāyāṃ caṇḍikāyāḥ 
sthitiraṅguṣṭhānāmāsaṃyogarūpatattvamudrayā tarpaṇañcopadiṣṭe iti mūlena visaṃvādaḥ | tat 
ataḥ prayatnato mantrī tarpayedanayā sadā ityantaṃ 
madhyamāṅguṣṭhasaṃyogātmakakaulikamudrākaraṇakatarpaṇa(-)pratipādakavacanaṃ tantrāntarīyaṃ 
kramāntarapratipādakañca | anāmāṅguṣṭhayogenetyādivacanāni tu kulārṇavoktāni iti 
sambhāvayāmaḥ | evañcāvisaṃvādaḥ sutarāmupapadyate |

<p. 616> (kāmanābhedena tarpaṇe mudrābhedāḥ)

anāmāṅguṣṭhayogena vaśyakarmaṇi tarpayet |
aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāntu tarpayedabhicārake || 81 ||

kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhayogena tarpayet stambhane sudhīḥ |
kulārṇavākhyatantrasya mataṃ tarpaṇamīritam || 82 ||

(tatrā'gamāntarasammataḥ kramaḥ)

śuddhaṃ dravyaṃ samādāya tarpayettattvamudrayā |
aṅguṣṭhānāmikā madhye śuddhiṃ saṃgṛhya yatnataḥ || 83 ||

vāmena dakṣiṇenaiva devīṃ santarpayed budhaḥ |
evaṃ santarpaṇaṃ proktaṃ samayācārasammatam || 84 ||

(ātmopakaraṇādiprokṣaṇakramaḥ)

sāmānyārghye paraṃ binduṃ niḥkṣipet sādhakottamaḥ |
prokṣayettena cā'tmānaṃ pūjopakaraṇāni ca || 85 ||

(prokṣaṇaphalam)

evaṃ prokṣaṇamātreṇa sarvaṃ brahmamayaṃ bhavet | 

(devyaṅgadevatātarpaṇavidhiḥ)

sāmānyārghyasya toyena tarpayedaṅgadevatāḥ || 86 ||



<81-82 |> atha kāmanābhedena tarpaṇe'ṅguliniyamamāha(-)anāmetyādinā | tantrasāre'pyevameva | 
kaulāvalīnirṇaye saptamollāse tu (-)

aṅguṣṭhamadhyamābhyāñca vaśyakarmaṇi tarpayet |
kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhayogena stambhane tarpayettataḥ |
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena tarpayedabhicārake | 

iti kramabhedo dṛśyate | 

<86 |> evamiti prāguktakrameṇa | prokṣaṇamidaṃ tridhā arghyodakenaiva kartavyam(,) udakāntareṇa 
tatkaraṇe doṣaśravaṇāt | taduktaṃ gandharvatantre dvādaśapaṭale (-)

<p. 617> (vaṭukādipūjopadeśaḥ)

idānīṃ vaṭukādīnāṃ balidānaṃ samācaret |

(kṣetrapālādibalimadattvā devatāntarapūjananiṣedhaḥ)

adattvā kṣetranāthebhyaḥ kathaṃ kṣetreṣu pūjayet || 87 ||

yāvanna vaṭuke dadyāttāvat pūjā kathaṃ bhavet |
gaṇeśayoginībhyāntu na dattvā pūjayet katham || 88 ||


prokṣayettena cā'tmānaṃ mūlena vāruṇena vā |
pūjopakaraṇañcāpi trirabhyukṣya tathaiva hi | 
amṛtaiḥ prokṣitaṃ yattu sarvaṃ brahmamayaṃ bhavet |
yadanyaddīyate dravyamalaṅkārādikañca yat |
varuṇasyaiva bījena teṣāṃ prokṣaṇamācaret | iti |

tathā (-)

anyatoyaistu saṃsṛṣṭamarghyapātrasthitetaraiḥ |
tanna gṛhṇātīṣṭadevī dattaṃ vidhiśatairapi | iti |

haratattvadīdhitidhṛtakālikāpurāṇe (-)

yaddeyamarghyapātrasthajalaireva nivedayet |
anyatoyairyadutsṛṣṭamarghyapātrasthitetaraiḥ ||
tanna gṛhṇāti vai devī dattaṃ vidhiśatairapi |

arghyaṃ sāmānyārghyamiti sampradāyavida iti haratattvadīdhitiḥ | mūle'pi sāmānyārghyasya 
toyenetyasyobhayatra sambandhāt tena prokṣaṇamaṅgadevatātarpaṇañcetyubhayameva prāptamiti 
nirvivādametat | prokṣaṇantūttānahastena kartavyam (-)

uttānena tu hastena prokṣaṇaṃ samudāhṛtam |

ityekādaśītattvadhṛtavacanāt | sāmānyeti | atra tarpayedityanenāṅgadevatānāṃ 
vakṣyamāṇānāṃ pūjanamapi atraiva kartavyamiti jñeyam | ata eva tantrasārakāraiḥ 
sundarīdevatāyā aṅgadevatāpūjanantvarghyasthāpanānantaram ityuktam | 
parivārapūjanantvarghyasthāpanānantaraṃ gṛhītvājñāṃ mahādevyāḥ parivārāṃstato'rcayediti 
tarpaṇopadeśānantaraṃ mūle vakṣyamāṇatvāt |

<p. 618> (balidānākaraṇe doṣaśrutiḥ)

balidānaṃ vinākṛtya tripurāṃ pūjayed yadi |
pūjā tu viphalā proktā vighnaścaiva pade pade || 89 ||

(upasaṃhāraḥ)

iti jñātvā prayatnena balidānaṃ samācaret |

(atra pramāṇikatantrasammatiḥ)

śaktiyāmalatantre tu śiveneti prakīrtitam || 90 ||

(vaṭukapūjāmakṛtvā sundarīpūjāniṣedhaḥ)

yāvanna vaṭuke dadyāttāvannaiva kuleśvarīm |
sundaryai prathame datte pūjā tu viphalā bhavet || 91 ||

(atrā'gamāntarasammatiḥ)

bṛhacchrīkramatantre tu śiveneti prakīrtitam || 92 ||

(vaṭukādipūjākramaḥ(,) tatrā'dau maṇḍalanirmāṇam)

īśānād vāyukoṇāntaṃ dikṣu pūrvādito'thavā |
maṇḍalaṃ racayenmantrī trikoṇaṃ vṛttasaṃyutam || 93 ||

bhūpureṇa yutaṃ kṛtvā sādhako bhūmijānukaḥ |
trikoṇañcaiva ṣaṭkoṇaṃ caturasraṃ svavāmataḥ || 94 ||


<93-94 |> atha vaṭukādipūjāyā maṇḍalamāha(-)īśānādityādinā | īśānād vāyukoṇāntaṃ 
pūrvādidikcatuṣṭaye vā śrīcakrasyeti śeṣaḥ(,) vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa maṇḍalacatuṣṭayaṃ 
racayedityarthaḥ | vyaktamāha jñānārṇave pañcamapaṭale (-)

īśāne ca tathāgneye naiṛtye ca tathā priye |
vāyavye kramato devi maṇḍalānāṃ catuṣṭayam ||
śrīcakramabhito devi trikoṇaṃ vyoma cā'likhet |

<p. 619> (maṇḍalārcāmantraḥ)

vāgbhavañca māhāmāyāṃ kavacaṃ maṇḍalāya ca |
hṛdanto'yaṃ manuḥ proktaḥ pūjayenmaṇḍale budhaḥ || 95 ||

(vaṭukārcopadeśaḥ)

vaṭukaṃ pūjayedādau dhyātvā pādyādibhiḥ sadā || 96 ||

(vaṭukadhyānam)

pīyūṣabhāṇḍamasikhaṇḍakapālakhaṇḍa(-)
caṇḍāticaṇḍabhujadaṇḍamatipracaṇḍam | 
śrīkuṇḍaladvayavimaṇḍitagaṇḍamīḍe
nīlaṃ vaṭuṃ vaṭukanāthamahīndrahāram || 97 ||

(vaṭukabalimantraḥ)

dhyātvaivaṃ pūjayenmantrī vāṃkārabījapūrvakam | 
ehyehi devīputrānte vaṭukānte ca nāthataḥ || 98 ||

kapilānte jaṭābhāra bhāsurānte trinetrataḥ |
jvālāmukheti sarvānte vighnānnāśaya nāśaya || 99 ||


iti | maṇḍalasvarūpamāha (-) trikoṇamityādinā | ādau trikoṇaṃ tadbahirvṛttaṃ tadbahirbhūpuramiti 
maṇḍakramaḥ | pañcamaṃ maṇḍalamāha(-)trikoṇamiti | svavāmabhāge ādau trikoṇaṃ tadbahiḥ 
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ tadbahiścaturasraṃ racayediti sambandhaḥ |

<95 |> maṇḍalapūjāmantramāha(-)vāgbhavamityādinā | vāgbhavaṃ ai(/)(,) mahāmāyā hrīṃ(,) kavacaṃ 
huṃ(,) hṛdantaḥ namo'ntaḥ | evañca ai(/) hrīṃ huṃ maṇḍalāya nama iti maṇḍalapūjāmantraḥ 
paryavasyati | 

<98-100 |> dhyānānantaraṃ vaṭukasya pūjanamāha(-)vāmiti | evañca vāṃ vaṭukāya nama iti 
pūjāmantraḥ | taduktaṃ tantrasāre (-)

<p. 620> sarvopacārasahitaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhā padam |
vahnijāyāntamantreṇa vaṭukasya baliṃ haret || 100 ||

(vaṭukabalikramaḥ)

ardhānnapūrṇasalilaṃ ratnapuṣpādisaṃyutam | 
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhato'pi vā || 101 ||

vāmānāmāṅguṣṭhato vā sādhako balimutsṛjet | 

(yoginīpūjopadeśaḥ)

tataśca yoginīṃ dhyātvā yajeddakṣādibhiḥ kramāt || 102 ||

(yoginīdhyānam)

yoginyaḥ kāmarūpāḥ sakalaguṇabhṛtastaptakārttasvarābhā
mattāḥ kaṅkālamālākalitagalataṭā raktavastrottarīyāḥ |


vāmādivaṭukaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ namo'nto manurīritaḥ |

iti | balimantramāha(-)ehyehītyādinā baliṃ haredityantena | tathāca ehyehi devīputra vaṭukanātha 
kapilajaṭābhārabhāsura trinetra jvālāmukha sarvavighnānnāśaya nāśaya sarvopacārasahitaṃ 
baliṃ hṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāhā iti baṭukabalimantraḥ paryavasyati | anena mantreṇa baliṃ haredityarthaḥ 
| kaulāvalīnirṇaye ṣaṣṭhapaṭale tu (-)

viṣaṃ māyā ramā devīputravaṭukanāthataḥ |
piṅgalapadato jaṭābhāsvara procya piṅgala | 
trinetra ca imaṃ baliṃ pūjāṃ gṛhṇayugaṃ tataḥ | 
vahnijāyāntamuccārya vaṭukasya mahātmanaḥ | 
anena balimutsṛjya yoginīścintayettataḥ |

ityanena teṣu teṣu sthāneṣu balimantre bhedo daśitaḥ | 

<101-102 |> vaṭukabalerupacāraṃ dānakramañcā'ha(-)ardhetyādinā | spaṣṭam |

<103 |> yoginīnāṃ dhyānamāha(-)yoginya iti | taptakārtasvarābhāḥ taptasuvarṇaraktavarṇāḥ |

<p. 621> śūlaṃ pāśaṃ kapālaṃ śṛṇimapi vidhṛtāḥ sasmitāḥ suprasannā
bhaktānāṃ sādhakānāmabhilaṣitaphalaṃ dīyamānāḥ suveśāḥ || 103 ||

(yoginīpūjāmantraḥ)

yāṃkāraṃ bījamuccārya yoginīṃ pūjayettataḥ || 104 ||

(yoginībaliḥ)

ūrddhvaṃ brahmāṇḍato vā divi gaganatale bhūtale niṣkale vā
pātāle vā vane vā salilapavanayoryatra kutra sthitā vā | 
kṣetre pīṭhopapīṭhādiṣu ca kṛtapādā dhūpadīpādikena
prītā devyaḥ sadā naḥ śubhabalividhinā pāntu vīrendravandyāḥ || 105 ||

etadante vāyubījaṃ mukhavṛttena saṃyutam |
yoginībhyaḥ padaṃ vahnijāyāñca sarvayoginīm || 106 ||

kavacāstrāgnijāyānte balidānaṃ samācaret |

(tatrāṅguliniyamaḥ)

dakṣāṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhato'pi vā || 107 ||


kapālaṃ naraśiro'sthi | śṛṇimaṅkuśam | vidhṛtā dhārayantyaḥ | śūlaṃ pāśamityādinā 
caturbhujatvamapyāsāmarthādāyāti | dīyamānā dadatya ityarthaḥ |

<104 |> yoginīpūjāmantramāha(-)yāmiti | atra yoginīmityekavacane satyapi yoginyaḥ kāmarūpā iti 
bahuvacanadarśanāt(,)

yoginīpūjāmantramāha(-)yāmiti | atra yoginīmityekavacane satyapi yoginyaḥ kāmarūpā iti 
bahuvacanadarśanāt(,)

etadante maheśāni yāṃ bījaṃ yoginī tataḥ |
bhyaḥ svāhā sarvavarṇānte yoginīpadamālikhet ||

iti jñānārṇavapañcamapaṭalavacanadarśanācca yāṃ yoginībhyo nama ityeva prayogaḥ | etena 
yoginīnāṃ yugapadvākyābhedenārcopadiṣṭā |

<105-107 |> yoginīnāṃ balimantramāha(-)ūrddhvamityādinā | spaṣṭam | etadanta

<p. 622> (kṣetrapālārcā)

kṣāṃkāraṃ bījamuccārya dhyātvā kṣetre samarcayet || 108 ||

(kṣetrapāladhyānam)

cañcatkapālasukṛpāṇakamū(śū)ladaṇḍa(-)
mudyat (sadā ?) ḍamarumaṇḍitapāṇidaṇḍam |
nīlāñjanapracayapuñjamiva prasannaṃ
śrīkṣetranāyakamahaṃ śaraṇaṃ śrayāmi || 109 ||

(kṣetrapālabalidānopadeśaḥ)

evaṃ dhyātvā tu saṃpūjya balidānaṃ samācaret || 110 ||

(balidānakramaḥ)

ṣaḍdīrghasvarasaṃbhinnaṃ kṣakāraṃ sthānaśabdataḥ || 111 ||

kṣetrapālapadaṃ dhūpadīpādisahitaṃ balim | 
gṛhṇa gṛhṇa vahnijāyāṃ samuddhṛtya baliṃ haret || 112 ||

(tatrāṅgulīniyamaḥ)

vāmamuṣṭiṃ vidhāyātha tarjanīṃ saralāñcaret |
aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāṃ vā kṣetrapālabalirmataḥ || 113 ||


iti | ādāvūrddhvamityādi vīrendravandyā ityantamuktvā tadante yamiti vāyubījaṃ tacca 
mukhavṛttena dvitīyasvareṇa saṃyutaṃ vadedityarthaḥ | etena yāmiti prāptam | tathāca 
ūrddhvamityādi tataśca yāṃ yoginībhyaḥ svāhā sarvayoginī huṃ phaṭ svāheti yoginībalimantraḥ 
paryavasyati | niruktabalidāne'ṅguliniyamamāha(-)dakṣeti | spaṣṭam |

<108 |> atha kṣetrapālapūjanamāha(-)kṣāmityādinā | tathā ca kṣāṃ kṣetrapālāya nama iti 
pūjāmantraḥ |

<110-113 |> dhyānamupadiśya balidānamāha(-)evamityādinā | ṣaḍiti |

<p. 623> (gaṇeśapūjanopadeśaḥ)

saṃpūjayed gaṇeśañca dhyātvā pādyādibhiḥ sudhīḥ || 114 ||

(gaṇeśadhyānam)

pāśāṅkuśāmṛtakapālakaśūlahastaṃ
hastyānanaṃ vividhabhūṣaṇanīladeham |
nityotsavaṃ sakalavighnavināśahetuṃ
śrīmadgajānanamahaṃ praṇamāmi nityam || 115 ||

(gaṇeśapūjākramaḥ)

gaṃkārabījamuccārya gaṇeśaṃ pūjayed budhaḥ | 

(gaṇeśabalimantraḥ)

gaṃkāratrayamuccārya dīrghayuktaṃ samuddharet || 116 ||

ṅe'ntaṃ gaṇapatiṃ procya varaṃ varadaśabdataḥ |
sarvajanaṃ samālikhya me vaśamānayeti ca || 117 ||


ākārādivisargāntaṣaḍdīrghasvarasaṃyuktaṃ kṣakāram | evañca kṣāṃ kṣīṃ kṣūṃ kṣaiṃ 
kṣauṃ kṣaḥ sthānakṣetrapāla dhūpadīpādisahitaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa svāheti 
kṣetrapālabalimantraḥ | tatra balidānakramamāha (-) vāmamuṣṭimiti | jñānārṇave pañcamapaṭale 
(-)

vāmamuṣṭiṃ vidhāyā'dau tarjanīṃ saralāṃ kuru |
anayā mudrayā devi kṣetrapālabalirbhavet || ityuktam |

<114 |> atha gaṇeśasya pūjanamupadiśati (-) saṃpūjayediti | dhyātvā saṃpūjayed 
vakṣyamāṇakrameṇeti śeṣaḥ |

<116-118 |> gamiti | gaṃ gaṇeśāya nama ityanena pūjayedityarthaḥ | balimantramāha (-) gaṃkāramiti 
| dīrghayuktaṃ dvitīya(-)caturtha(-)ṣaṣṭhasvarayuktaṃ gaṃkāratrayamuccāryetyarthaḥ | atra

<p. 624> baliṃ gṛhṇayugaṃ procya vahnijāyāṃ samuccaret |
anena manunā mantrī gaṇeśasya baliṃ haret || 118 ||

(gajatuṇḍāmudrā)

saṃkocitāṅgulīḥ kṛtvā daṇḍavat kārayed budhaḥ |
gajatuṇḍākhyamudreyaṃ gaṇeśasya prakīrtitā || 119 ||


dīrghayuktamiti viśiṣyānuktāvapi prathamaprāptaparityāge pramāṇābhāvād dvitīya (-) caturtha (-) 
ṣaṣṭhasvarāṇāṃ grahaṇamarthādāyātam | etena gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ iti prāptam | vyaktamāha 
jñānārṇave pañcamapaṭale (-)

gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ trayamālikhya ṅe'ntaṃ gaṇapatiṃ tataḥ |

iti | evañca gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ gaṇapataye varavarada sarvajanaṃ me vaśamānaya baliṃ gṛhṇa 
gṛhṇa svāheti gaṇeśabalimantraḥ paryavasyati | jñānārṇavapañcamapaṭale tu (-)

gāṃ gīṃ gūṃ trayamālikhya ṅe'ntaṃ gaṇapatiṃ tataḥ |
varānte varadānte ca sarvānte janamālikhet | 
me vaśaṃ cā'naya procya sarvopa (-) padamālikhet |
cārānte sahitaṃ coktvā baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhā padam | 
vahnijāyānvito mantro gāṇapatyabaliṃ haret | 

ityanena niruktamantre vaśamānayetyanantaraṃ sarvopacārasahitamiti baliviśeṣaṇamuktamiti viśeṣo 
dṛśyate |

<119 |> atha gaṇeśabalidāne vihitāṃ gajatuṇḍāmudrāmāha (-) saṃkociteti | aṅgulīrvāmahastasya 
saṅkocitāḥ kṛtvetyarthaḥ | daṇḍavaditi madhyamāmaṅguliṃ daṇḍavat kārayet | iyameva 
gaṇeśapriyā gajatuṇḍāmudretyarthaḥ | tathāca jñānārṇave pañcamapaṭale (-) vāmamuṣṭiṃ 
vidhāyā'dāviti kṣetrapālabalimudrāmabhidhāya (-)

tathā muṣṭestu madhyasthāmaṅgulīṃ daṇḍavat kuru |
gajatuṇḍā mahāmudrā gaṇapasya balirbhavet ||

ityanena vāmahaste muṣṭiṃ badhvā madhyamāṅgulerdīrghīkaraṇameva gajatuṇḍāmudreti 
vyaktamuktam |

<p. 625> (maṇḍalapūjā)

svavāmamaṇḍalaṃ mantrī sādhāraṃ paripūjayet |
vyāpakānte maṇḍalāya ai(/) parānte namaḥpadam || 120 ||

(sarvabhūtabaliḥ)

baliṃ tatraiva saṃsthāpya trirmūlenābhimantrayet |
pūjayet sarvabhūtañca dhūpadīpādinā sudhīḥ || 121 ||

(balimantraḥ)

tārañca bhuvaneśānīṃ sarvavighnapadantataḥ |
hṛdbhyaśca sarvabhūtebhyaḥ śabdabījañca ṭhadvayam || 122 ||

imaṃ kalārṇamuccārya tritārānte baliṃ haret |

(balimudrā)

aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāñca mudrayā tattvasaṃjñayā || 123 ||

(niruktabalau kalpāntaram)

ekatra vā pañca balīn dadyād vyāpakamaṇḍale |
vāmabhāge sthite mantrī sarvavighnaharo bhavet || 124 ||


<120 |> evaṃ maṇḍalacatuṣṭaye krameṇa vaṭukādīnāṃ pūjanaṃ baliñcopadiśya 
prāguktasvavāmāvasthitamaṇḍalasya pūjāmāha | ai(/) parānte vyāpakamaṇḍalāya tato 
namaḥpadamiti sambandhaḥ | evañca ai(/) hrīṃ vyāpakamaṇḍalāya nama iti maṇḍalapūjāmantraḥ 
|

<121 |> balimiti | tatraiva prāguktatrikoṇa(-)ṣaṭkoṇa(-)caturasramaṇḍala eva | pūjayediti(,) sarvabhūtebhyo 
nama ityanenetyarthaḥ |

<112-123 |> balimantramāha(-)tāramityādinā | tāraḥ praṇavaḥ(,) bhuvaneśānī hrīṃ | evañca oṃ hrīṃ 
sarvavighnahṛdbhyaḥ sarvabhūtebhyaḥ ai(/) svāhā | iti sarvabhūtabalimantraḥ | aṅguṣṭheti | 
aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogātmakatattvamudrayā sarvabhūtebhyo baliṃ harediti sambandhaḥ |

<124 |> pūrvaṃ śrīcakrasya caturdikṣu kṛte maṇḍalacatuṣṭaye balicatuṣṭayaṃ svavāmabhāge kṛte 
maṇḍale balimekaṃ dadyādityuktam | tatra kalpāntaramāha(-) ekatra veti | maṇḍala(-)

<p. 626> (punaḥ kalpāntaram)

athavā sarvabhūtāya balimekaṃ samācaret |

(punaḥ ṣaḍaṅgapūjā)

ṣaḍaṅgañca tataḥ kuryāt pūrvoktenaiva vartmanā || 125 ||

(hṛdaye mūrtikalpanā)

mayābījaṃ samuccārya kāmabījaṃ tataḥ param |
balimātmakamāropya hṛdi mūrtiṃ prakalpayet || 126 ||

(dhyāne vihitaṃ mudrādvayam)

trikhaṇḍāmudrayā dhyāyed baddhvā vā pāṇikacchapām |
yathā dhyātvā sādhakasya mano nānyatra sajjate || 127 ||


catuṣṭayamakṛtvā kevalaṃ svavāmakṛtavyāpakamaṇḍale vaṭukādisarvabhūtāntabalipañcakaṃ 
vidadhītetyarthaḥ | vyaktamāha jñānārṇave pañcamapaṭale (-)

athavā vāmabhāge tu maṇḍalaṃ caikamālikhet |
tatraiva balidānantu kuryāt sarvārthasiddhaye ||

iti | vāmabhāge vihitasya baleḥ phalamāha (-) vāmetyādinā | 

<125 |> tatrāpi kalpāntaramāha (-) athaveti | kalpe'smin aśaktau pūrvavad balipañcakamakṛtvā 
kevalena sarvabhūtabalinaiva baliphalaṃ labhyeta |

<127 |> atha tripurāyā dhyāne vihitaṃ mudrādvayaṃ niruktamudrādvayena kṛtasya dhyānasya 
praśastiñcā'ha (-) trikhaṇḍeti | tatra trikhaṇḍāmudrāmāha tantrasāre (-)

parivarttya karau spṛṣṭāvaṅguṣṭhau kārayet samau |
anāmāntargate kṛtvā tarjanyau kuṭilākṛtī ||
kaniṣṭhike niyuñjīta nijasthāne maheśvari |
trikhaṇḍeyaṃ samākhyātā tripurādhyānakarmaṇi ||

iti | anayā mudrayā tripurāṃ dhyāyedityarthaḥ | kalpāntaramāha (-) baddhvā veti | 
pāṇikacchapāṃ kūrmamudrāṃ vetyarthaḥ | kūrmamudrālakṣaṇamāha tantrasāre (-)

vāmahastasya tarjanyāṃ dakṣiṇasya kaniṣṭhikām |
tathā dakṣiṇatarjanyāṃ vāmāṅguṣṭhaṃ niyojayet ||

<p. 627> (dhyānayogaḥ)

dhyānayogaṃ samāsthāya pūrakeṇāpi karmaṇā |
mano mūle tu saṃyojya kuñcya prāṇānirūkataḥ(?) || 128 ||

mūlādhāre sphuraddīpaśikhākāraṃ śivāṃ smaret |
saṃyojya paramānande brahmarandhrāntarasthite || 129 ||

sāmarasyaṃ tayoḥ kṛtvā viśrāmya ca punaḥ punaḥ |
śivānandāmṛtālolībhūtāṃ caitanyarūpiṇīm |
tāmātmasthānamānīya cidrūpāṃ paricintayet || 130 ||


unnataṃ dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭhaṃ vāmasya madhyamādikāḥ |
aṅgulīryojayet pṛṣṭhe dakṣiṇasya karasya ca ||
vāmasya pitṛtīrthena madhyamānāmike tathā |
adhomukhe ca te kuryāddakṣiṇasya karasya ca ||
kūrmapṛṣṭhasamaṃ kuryāddakṣapāṇiñca sarvataḥ |
kūrmamudreyamākhyātā devatādhyānakarmaṇi ||

iti | evameva gandharvatantre ekādaśapaṭale'pi | yatheti(-)niruktānyataramudrayā dhyāyataḥ 
sādhakasya manaḥ anyatra na sajjate dhyeyaviṣaya eva samāhitaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ |

<128 |> mūla iti | mūlādhāre manaḥ saṃyojyetyarthaḥ | imamevārthamāha tantrasāre 
yogaprakriyāprakaraṇe (-)

ādau pūrakayogena svādhāre yojayenmanaḥ |
gudamedrāntare śaktiṃ tāmākuñcya prabodhayet ||

gudamedrāntare tāṃ śaktimākuñcya nirupamasūkṣmatākāṃ sañcintya pravardhayet (iti cāsya 
vyākhyā) |

<129 |> mūlādhāra iti | niruktalakṣaṇāṃ śivāṃ kuṇḍalinīṃ mūlādhāracaturdalābhyantare 
smaredityarthaḥ | saṃyojyeti | brahmarandhrābhyantarīṇe paramānandasvarūpe paramaśive tāṃ 
kuṇḍalinīṃ saṃyojyetyarthaḥ |

<130 |> sāmarasyamiti | sāmarasyañca (-)

strīpuṃyoge tu yat saukhyaṃ sāmarasyaṃ taducyate |

ityuktalakṣaṇam | tayoḥ kuṇḍalinīparamaśivayorniruktasāmarasyaṃ sampādyetyarthaḥ |

<p. 628> cintayet karṇikāmadhye ratnasiṃhāsanaṃ mahat |
siddhiṣoḍaśakoṇaṃ tat sūryakoṭisamaprabham || 131 ||

tanmadhye cintayenmantrī cakrarājaṃ suśobhanam |
cakramadhye tataḥ śaktiṃ trikoṇāṃ paricintayet || 132 ||

tanmadhye cintayettejaḥ suprakāśaṃ nirañjanam |
pralayānalasaṅkāśaṃ sarvadevamayaṃ śivam || 133 ||

brahmatejomayaṃ nityaṃ munisiddhitapomayam |
sarvavrataphalamayaṃ sarvayajñaphalātmakam || 134 ||

sarvaśaktimayañcaiva sarvavidyātmakaṃ punaḥ |
sarvātmabhāvarūpañca sarvānandamayaṃ tathā || 135 ||

sarvajñānamayañcaiva sarvabhūtātmakaṃ punaḥ |
cintayecca mahādevīṃ tejaḥ pariṇataṃ hi tat || 136 ||

(devyā dhyānam)

tataḥ padmanibhāṃ devīṃ bālārkakiraṇāruṇām |
javākusumasaṅkāśāṃ dāḍimīkusumaprabhām || 137 ||


śiveti | paramaśivasambhogasrutānandāmṛtacañcalībhūtāmityarthaḥ ātmasthānaṃ hṛdayamityarthaḥ 
|

<131 |> cintayediti | karṇikāmadhye anāhatapadmasyeti śeṣaḥ | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam |

<132-136 |> tanmadhye niruktaratnasiṃhāsanamadhyapradeśe cakrarājaṃ śrīcakram(,) tanmadhye 
trikoṇarūpāṃ śaktim(,) tanmadhye ca vakṣyamāṇarūpaṃ tejaḥ(;) tattejaḥpariṇatirūpāṃ 
mahādevīṃ śrīmattripurasundarīṃ vakṣyamāṇadhyānakrameṇa cintayediti phalitārthaḥ |

<137 |> atha śrīmattripurasundaryā dhyānadvayamabhidhāsyan prathamaṃ dhyānamāha (-) tataḥ 
padmanibhāmityādinā paramānandananditāmityantena | spaṣṭārthamidamiti na vyākhyāyate |

<p. 629> padmarāgapratīkāśāṃ kuṅkumodakasannibhām |
sphuranmukuṭamāṇikya (-) kiṅkiṇījālamaṇḍitām || 138 ||

kālālikulasaṅkāśakuṭilālakapallavām |
pratyagrāruṇasaṅkāśavadanāmbhojamaṇḍalām || 139 ||

kiñcidardhendukuṭilalalāṭamṛdupaṭṭikām |
pinākidhanurākārasubhruvaṃ parameśvarīm || 140 ||

ānandamuditollolalīlāndolitalocanām |
sphuranmayūkhasaṅghātavilasaddhemakuṇḍalām || 141 ||

sugaṇḍamaṇḍalābhogajitendvamṛtamaṇḍalām |
viśvakarmādinirmāṇasūtravispaṣṭanāsikām || 142 ||

tāmravidrumabimbābharaktoṣṭhīmamṛtopamām |
smitamādhuryavijitamādhuryarasasāgarām || 143 ||

bījapurasphuradbījadantapaṅktiyugānvitām |
ratnadvīpasphuradratnajihvāmamalabhāṣiṇīm || 144 ||

anaupamyaguṇopetacibukoddeśaśobhitām | 
kambugrīvāṃ mahādevīṃ mṛṇālalalitairbhujaiḥ || 145 ||

raktotpaladalākārasukumārakarāmbujām |
karāmbujanakhajyotirvidyotitanabhastalām || 146 ||

muktāhāralatopetasamunnatapayodharām |
trivalīvalayāmuktamadhyadeśasuśobhitām || 147 ||

<p. 630> lāvaṇyasaridāvartākāranābhivibhūṣitām |
anargharatnaghaṭitakāñcīyuktanitambinīm || 148 ||

nitambabimbadviradaromarājivarāṅkuśām |
kadalīlalitastambhasukumārorumīśvarīm || 149 ||

lāvaṇyakadalītulyajaṅghāyugalamaṇḍitām |
gūḍhagulphapadadvandvaprapadājitakacchapām || 150 ||

brahmaviṣṇuśiroratnanighṛṣṭacaraṇāmbujām |
tanudīrghāṅgulisvacchanakhacandravibhūṣitām || 151 ||

śītāṃśuśatasaṅkāśakāntisantānahāsinīm |
lauhityajitasindūrajavādāḍimarāgiṇīm || 152 ||

raktavastraparīdhānāṃ pāśāṅkuśakarodyatām |
raktapadmaniviṣṭāntu raktābharaṇabhūṣitām || 153 ||

caturbhujāṃ trinetrāñca pañcavāṇadhanurdharām | 
karpūraśakalonmiśratāmbūlapūritānanām || 154 ||

mahāmṛgamadoddāmakuṅkumāruṇavigrahām |
sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 155 ||

jagadāhlādajananīṃ jagadrañjanakāriṇīm |
jagadākarṣaṇakarīṃ jagatkāraṇarūpiṇīm || 156 ||

<p. 631> sarvamantramayīṃ devīṃ sarvasaubhāgyasundarīm |
sarvalakṣmīmayīṃ nityāṃ paramānandananditām || 157 ||

(dhyānāntaram)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa dhyāyeddevīṃ sulakṣaṇām |
javākusumasaṅkāśāṃ dāḍimīkusumāruṇām || 158 ||

sindūrapūrarucirāṃ bālārkakiraṇopamām |
taptakāñcanasaṅkāśāṃ padmarāgamaṇiprabhām || 159 ||

nānāsadratnasaṃyuktakirīṭavarabhūṣaṇām |
arddhendumastakākrāntakuṭilālakapallavām || 160 ||

camarībālakuṭilanirmalaśyāmakeśinīm |
mallikāmālatīmālākavarīpariveṣṭitām || 161 ||

nānāsadratnasaṃyuktapaṭṭagucchapralambitām |
śaradardhendukuṭilalalāṭamṛdupaṭṭikām || 162 ||

keśamadhye mahābhāsvatsindūralaharīyutām |
candanāgurukastūrīkuṅkumaistilakojjvalām || 163 ||

kāmakodaṇḍasadṛśasubhruvaṃ padmalocanām |
ānandamuditollāsalocanatritayānvitām || 164 ||

śaratpūrṇendusadṛśasūtravispaṣṭanāsikām |
nāsāgre gajarājotthamahāmuktāvirājitām || 165 ||


<158-193 |> atha dhyānāntaramāha (-) athavetyādinā sādhakottama ityantena |

<p. 632> sucāruvṛttagaṇḍena vijitāmṛtamaṇḍalām |
śaratpūrṇendusadṛśamukhamaṇḍalamaṇḍitām || 166 ||

īṣatsahāsyavadanajitamādhuryasāgarām |
karṇoparisphuradratnapatrikāvararājitām || 167 ||

ānandaratnaghaṭitakarṇabhūṣaṇabhūṣitām |
sphuradratnasamūhena vilasaddhemakuṇḍalām || 168 ||

karṇabhūṣaṇatejobhiḥ kapolasthalamañjarīm |
bandhūkāruṇasindūrabimboṣṭhīmamṛtopamām || 169 ||

bījapūrasphuradbījadantapaṅktiyugānvitām |
anaupamyaguṇopetacibukasthalarājitām || 170 ||

nānāratnasamāyuktagrīvābhūṣaṇabhūṣitām |
muktāmaṇipravālasya nikaraiḥ kaṇṭhabhūṣitām || 171 ||

pravālavallīsādṛśyabāhuvallīcatuṣṭayām |
kuṅkumāruṇasaṅkāśasukomalakarāmbujām || 172 ||

pāṇipadmanakhajyotsnāvitānitanabhasthalām |
sadratnagaṇasaṃyuktakeyūravarabhūṣitām || 173 ||

navaratnasamāyuktapaṭṭasūtrapralambitām |
nāgendradantaśaṅkhena maṇibandhavirājitām || 174 ||

anarghyaratnaghaṭitakaṅkaṇaiḥ parimaṇḍitām |
aṅgulīyakaratnena virājitadigantarām || 175 ||

<p. 633> sattvarajastamobhūtapāśaṃ vāmakare dhṛtām |
bhṛṅgapaṅktiguṇākrāntamikṣucāpavidhāriṇīm || 176 ||

aṣṭadhātusamāyuktamaṅkuśaṃ dakṣiṇe kare |
raktotpalābjakumudakundāmrāṅkurasambhavān || 177 ||

tadadhaḥ pañcabāṇāṃśca dadhatīṃ tripureśvarīm |
āyudhasya pratīkāśairnabhastalavirājitām || 178 ||

ānandahārasandohavirājitapayodharām |
pṛṣṭhadeśe sphuradratnapaṭṭagucchapralambitām || 179 ||

suvṛttaniviḍottuṅgapīvarastanamaṇḍalām |
payodharabharānamrasucārukṣīṇamadhyamām || 180 ||

nābhipadmādromarājilatākucasamīpagām |
gandhacandanakastūrīvilepitakalevarām || 181 ||

kāñcanāñcitakāñcolīparipūritabhūṣitām |
sucārutrivalīyuktamadhyadeśasuśobhitām || 182 ||

kvaṇatkāñcīsamāyuktanitambabimbamaṇḍalām |
suvarṇasūtraracitaraktapaṭṭapaṭānvitām || 183 ||

paṭāñcalasamāyuktasadratnavarabhūṣitām |
anekaratnaracitacārumekhalayā'nvitām || 184 ||

karīndrakarasādṛśyasukumāroruyugmakām |
kadalīlalitastambhacārujaṅghāyugānvitām || 185 ||

<p. 634> taruṇāruṇapādābjaraṇannūpurarājitām |
muktāmaṇipravālaiśca pādapadmavibhūṣitām || 186 ||

pravālāṅkurasādṛśyapādāṅguliprakāśitām |
pādāṅgulinakhajyotiḥśaradindutiraskṛtām || 187 ||

sukomalalasanmālāpādapadmapralambitām | 
brahmaviṣṇuśiroratnaiḥ prakāśitapadāñcalām || 188 ||

kāmarājāṅgamārūḍhāṃ śivasiṃhāsanasthitām | 
sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 189 ||

śaradindusahasrasya kāntisantānahāriṇīm |
karpūrādisamāyuktatāmbūlapūritānanām || 190 ||

mukhaprasādavacanairjitamādhuryasāgarām |
karṇacumbisphurannīlalolākṣakṣepasundarīm || 191 ||

jagadāhlādajananīṃ jagatkāraṇarūpiṇīm |
sarvamantramayīṃ devīṃ jagadrañjanakāriṇīm || 192 ||

nānāsadratnasaṃyuktaśvetacchatravirājitām |
koṭikoṭidhūpadīpaiḥ pariveṣṭitamaṇḍalām |
śabdabrahmamayīṃ nityāṃ bhāvayet sādhakottamaḥ || 193 ||

(niruktadhyānapraśastiḥ)

evaṃ pariṇatāṃ devīmātmānaṃ cintayet sadā |
tadāviṣṭaḥ sadā sa syāttathāveśaḥ sadā bhavet || 194 ||

<p. 635> tathābhinayaśīlaśca tathācārastathā śuciḥ |
sadā kāmeśvaro bhūtvā kāmabhogān samācaret || 195 ||

evaṃ hi dhyānayogena bhavennānyamanā yadi |
tadā tanmayatāmetya jīvanmukto bhavet sadā || 196 ||

nirvikalpaḥ sadā dhyānānniḥsaṅgo jāyate sadā |
jarāmaraṇamuktaśca mahābhogī mahāsukhī || 197 ||

avyāhatājñaḥ sarvatra vicared bhuvanatrayam |
nāsti pāpaṃ nāsti puṇyaṃ sākṣāddevaḥ śivo bhavet || 198 ||

evaṃ siddho dṛḍhābhyāsānnānārūpāṇi dhārayet |
sthūlasūkṣmavibhedena dṛśyādṛśyaśca jāyate || 199 ||

pañcabhūtātmakaṃ rūpaṃ sūryācandramasorapi |
brahmādīnāṃ tathā rūpaṃ devagandharvarakṣasām || 200 ||

patattriṇāṃ pannagānāmicchayaiva hi jāyate |
kalpanādeva naśyanti siddhayo vā jagattraye || 201 ||

sarvabhūtāni saṃvetti sarvatrāvyāhatā gatiḥ |
māraṇoccāṭanaṃ caiva stambhanaṃ mohanaṃ tathā || 202 ||

dṛṣṭvaiva kurute sarvaṃ kalpanādeva sādhakaḥ |
dāsavattrijagat sarvaṃ tasmai balimupāharet || 203 ||


<203 |> baliṃ pūjām |

<p. 636> kartā hartā tathā pātā śivatulyo bhavet sadā |

(niruktasvarūpāyā devyā hṛdayādāvāhanam)

evaṃ tāṃ hṛdayāmbhojānmudrayāvāhayettataḥ || 204 ||

(trikhaṇḍā mudrā)

parivarttyakarau kṛtvā aṅguṣṭhau kārayet samau |
dhārayettarjanībhyāñca kaniṣṭhādyadvayaṃ tataḥ || 205 ||

madhyamāyugalaṃ madhye sthāpayitvā kaniṣṭhake |
nijasthāne samāyojya sthāpayet sādhakottamaḥ || 206 ||

trikhaṇḍeyaṃ samākhyātā tripurāhvānakarmaṇi |

(trikhaṇḍayā devyā āvāhanam)

anayāvāhayeddevīṃ śrīmattripurasundarīm || 207 ||

(puṣpāñjalau samānayanam)

vahannāsāpuṭenaiva bahantīṃ paramāṃ kalām |
puṣpāñjalau samānīya pūrvoktāṃ bhairavīṃ japan || 208 ||


<205-206 |> trikhaṇḍāmudrāmāha tantrasāre (-)

parivartya karau spṛṣṭāvaṅguṣṭhau kārayet samau |
anāmāntargate kṛtvā tarjanyau kuṭilākṛtī ||
kaniṣṭhake niyuñjīta nijasthāne maheśvari |
trikhaṇḍeyaṃ samākhyātā tripurādhyānakarmaṇi ||

<208 |> vahannāsāpuṭeneti | nāsāpuṭapravāhitavāyunā vahantīṃ viniḥsarantīm | evañca 
hṛtpaṅkaje devīṃ dhyātvā nāsārandhrapravāhivāyunā tāṃ viniḥsārya puṣpāñjalau 
samānīya mahāpadmetyādinā tasmādañjalerdevīṃ mahāyantre sthāpayediti kramaḥ | 
añjaliviyojanantu sthāpanāt pūrvaṃ na kartavyam | sphuṭamāha gandharvatantre trayodaśapaṭale (-)

prāṇāyāmaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā gṛhṇīyāt kusumāñjalim |
puṣpāñjaliṃ vinā devīṃ nā'vāhayet kadācana |
tato dhyāyenmahādevīṃ yathoktāṃ parameśvarīm |

<p. 637> (prārthanāmantraḥ)

mahāpadmavanāntaḥsthe kāraṇānandavigrahe |
sarvabhūtahite mātarehyehi parameśvari || 209 ||

(yantre devyāḥ sthāpanam)

ityuccārya mahāyantre sthāpayet paradevatām || 210 ||

(āvāhanī mudrā)

ūrddhvāñjalimadhaḥ kuryādiyamāvāhanī bhavet |

(sthāpanī mudrā)

iyantu viparītā syāttadā vai sthāpanī bhavet || 211 ||

(sannidhāpanī mudrā)

ūrddhvāṅguṣṭhau muṣṭiyugaṃ tadeyaṃ sannidhāpanī |

(sannirodhinī mudrā)

antarāṅguṣṭhamuṣṭibhyāṃ tadeyaṃ sannirodhinī || 212 ||


pratyakṣīkṛtya hṛdaye jitaprāṇo'tha sādhakaḥ |
aikyaṃ sañcintayeddevyā bāhyāntarmūrtiyugmayoḥ |
tatastu āyubījena vahannāsāpuṭena tu |
taccaitanyaṃ viniḥsārya puṣpāñjalau niveśayet |
nāsikāvāyuniḥsārāt puṣpasthā devatā bhavet |
yāvat saṃsthāpayeddevīṃ svahastaṃ na viyojayet |
kṛte viyoga hastasya puṣpāttasmānmaheśvari |
gandharvaiḥ pūjyate devī pūjakairnā'pyate phalam || iti |

<211 |> ūrddheti | ūrddhve sthitamañjalimadhaḥkuryādavanamayedityarthaḥ | na tu 
ūrddhvamukhamañjalimadhomukhaṃ kuryādityarthaḥ kalpanīyaḥ(,) vakṣyamāṇasthāpanīmudrayā 
virodhāt |

hastābhyāmañjaliṃ baddhvā'nāmikāmūlaparvaṇoḥ |
aṅguṣṭhau nikṣipet seyaṃ mudrā tvāvāhanī smṛtā ||

iti tantrasāradhṛtavacane spaṣṭamabhidhānācca | iyantviti viparītā adhomukhī | taduktaṃ tantrasāre 
(-) 

adhomukhī tviyaṃ cet syāt sthāpanīmudrikā smṛtā | iti |

<p. 638> (āvāhanasvarūpam)

svata evābhipūrṇāyā devatāyāḥ prapūjane |
sādaraṃ saṃmukhībhāva āvāhanamihocyate || 213 ||

(sthāpanasvarūpam)

vibhorniveśanaṃ yantre sthāpanaṃ kathitaṃ budhaiḥ || 214 ||

pūjāṃ prapūjyamānstu gṛhītvā'nugrahādikam |

(sannidhāpanasvarūpam)

kartuṃ sannidhyamasyāstu tatsānnidhyaṃ pracakṣate || 215 ||

(sannirodhasvarūpam)

ākarmakāṇḍaparyantaṃ sānnidhyaṃ hi vibhośca yat |
sa sannirodha uddiṣṭo bhaktito mantravinnaraiḥ || 216 ||

(avaguṇṭhanam)

ānandāyataṃ tattvaṃ saccidānandalakṣaṇam |
tadatra sakale vyāptaṃ dhyeyaṃ syādavaguṇṭhanam || 217 ||

(sakalīkaraṇam)

sakalīkaraṇaṃ kṛtvā mantraiḥ ṣaḍbhirathaikatām |

(amṛtīkaraṇam)

aṅganāmaṅgalā(?)sārddhaṃ vidadhyādamṛtākṛtam || 218 ||

(paramīkaraṇam)

kṣamā tasyāparādhānāṃ vijñeyā paramīkṛtiḥ || 219 ||

(jīvanyāsaḥ)

jīvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kuryāt pūrvoktamantramuccaran ||
kuśasya viṣṭareṇāpi lelihānena vā budhaḥ || 220 ||

<p. 639> (lelihāmudrā)

tarjanīmadhyamānāmāḥ samaṃ kuryādadhomukham(?) |
anāmāyāṃ kṣiped vṛddhāmṛjuṃ kṛtvā kaniṣṭhikām |
lelihā nāma mudreyaṃ jīvanyāse prakīrtitā || 221 ||

(sakalīkaraṇasvarūpam)

vahnyādidikṣu vā devyāstattadaṅgeṣu vā sudhīḥ |
ṣaḍaṅgaṃ kalpayedetat sakalīkaraṇaṃ bhavet || 222 ||

(tritālādiparamīkaraṇāntaṃ karma)

tritālaṃ daśadigbandhamavaguṇṭhanamācaret |
dhenvākhyayā'mṛtīkṛtya paramīkaraṇañcaret || 223 ||

(parivāradevatāsvarūpam)

evaṃ kṛtvā taccharīrānmayūkhanikarān bahiḥ |
viniḥsṛtya sthirībhūtaṃ parivāraṃ vicintayet || 224 ||


<222 |> vahnyāditi | tattadaṅgeṣu hṛdayādiṣaḍaṅgeṣu | ṣaḍaṅgaṃ kalpayediti 
ṣaḍaṅgamantrairityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ gandharvatantre trayodaśapaṭale (-)

aṅgamantrān nyaseddevi devyaṅge sādhakottamaḥ |
sakalīkaraṇaṃ nāma mudreyaṃ vyāptirūpiṇī || iti |

<223 |> tritālādikramaḥ pūrvameva viśadīkṛtaḥ | paramīkaraṇañcarediti paramīkaraṇamudrayetyarthaḥ 
| paramīkaraṇamudrāmāha tantrasāre (-)

anyonyagrathitāṅguṣṭhā prasāritaparāṅgulī |
mahāmudreyamuditā paramīkaraṇe budhaiḥ ||

iti | paramīkaraṇasvarūpamāha gandharvatantre trayodaśapaṭale (-)

sarvāparādhajātānāṃ sahiṣṇutvaprakāśakam |
paramīkaraṇaṃ nāma saṃprārthanamihocyate || iti |

<224 |> evamiti | devī śarīrānmayasvarūpeṇa bahirāvirbhūtā devatā eva parivārā ityarthaḥ |


<p. 640> (mudrānavakadarśanopadeśaḥ) 
 
vakṣyamāṇoktavidhinā nava mudrāḥ pradarśayet |

(tatra sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇī mudrā)

madhyamāmadhyame kṛtvā kaniṣṭhe'ṅguṣṭharodhite || 225 ||

tarjanyau daṇḍavat kṛtvā madhyamoparyanāmike |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīnāmnī mudreyaṃ kṣobhayejjagat || 226 ||

(sarvavidrāvaṇī mudrā)

etasyā eva mudrāyā madhyame sarale yadā |
sarvavidrāvaṇīnāmnī mudreyaṃ drāvayet kṣaṇāt || 227 ||

(sarvākarṣiṇī mudrā)

madhyamā tarjanī yugme vakre kuryād yathāvidhi |
etasyā eva mudrāyāstadākarṣaṇakarmaṇi || 228 ||


<225-226 |> atha tripurārcane darśayitavyā nava mudrāḥ krameṇa nirūpayati (-)vakṣyamāṇetyādinā | 
tatra prathamāṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīmudrāmāha (-)madhyametyādinā | atra kaniṣṭe'ṅguṣṭharodhita 
iti sandhirārṣaḥ | hastayormadhyamāṅgulermadhyame parvaṇi sthāpite kaniṣṭe aṅguṣṭhābhyāṃ 
rodhite kṛtvā tarjanīdvayaṃ daṇḍavat saralaṃ kṛtvā anāmikādvayaṃ madhyamādvayopari 
sthāpayediti phalitārthaḥ | sarvajagatsaṃkṣobhaṇakāritvādasyā mudrāyāḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīti 
saṃjñā |

taduktaṃ tantrasāre (-)

madhyamāmadhyame kṛtvā kaniṣṭe'ṅguṣṭharodhite |
tarjanyau daṇḍavat kṛtvā madhyamoparyanāmike |
eṣā ca prathamā mudrā sarvasaṃkṣobhakāriṇī | iti |

<227 |> dvitīyāmāha (-) etasyā iti | etasyāḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyā mudrāyā madhyamāṅgulyau 
sarale avakre cet sarvavidrāvaṇī mudrā bhavati | tantrasāre'pyāha (-)

etasyā eva mudrāyā madhyame sarale yadā |
kriyete parameśāni sarvavidrāviṇī tadā || iti |

<228 |> tṛtīyāmāha(-)madhyameti | niruktamudrayā madhyamātarjanyorubhayorvakratve sarvākarṣiṇī 
mudrā bhavati | mudrā caiṣā sādhakajagadākarṣaṇaśaktimāvirbhāvayati |

madhyamātarjanībhyāñca kaniṣṭhānāmike same |
aṅkuśākārarūpābhyāṃ madhyame parameśvari |

<p. 641> (sarvavaśyakarī mudrā)

parivartanamārgeṇa svāṅgulīḥ sammukhā yajet |
aṅguṣṭhayorvaktradeśe tarjanyāvaṅkuśākṛtī |
sarvavaśyakarīnāmnī mudreyaṃ vaśakāriṇī || 229 ||

(sarvonmādinī mudrā)

sammukhau tu karau kṛtvā madhyamāmadhyage'ntyaje |
anāmike tu sarale tadbahistarjanīdvayam || 230 ||

daṇḍākārau tato'ṅguṣṭhau madhyamānakhadeśagau |
mudraiṣonmādinīnāmnī kledinī sarvayoṣitām || 231 ||


aṅguṣṭhantu niyuñjīta kaniṣṭhānāmikopari |
iyamākarṣiṇī mudrā trailokyākarṣiṇī parā |

iti tantrasāradhṛtavacanānusāreṇa tu kaniṣṭhānāmikayoravakratvaṃ 
kaniṣṭhānāmikayoruparyaṅguṣṭhasthāpanañceti viśeṣo dṛśyate |

<229 |> caturthīmāha (-) parivartanetyādinā | atra pūrvato madhyamātarjanīyugma ityādyadhyāhāryam 
| evañcā'bhimukhyena vakrayostarjanyoradho madhyame tadadhaḥ parivartanakrameṇānāmike 
tatastenaiva krameṇa kaniṣṭhe aṅguṣṭhayorvaktradeśe agre niviḍaṃ saṅgatāḥ kuryāt ityevā'ha(-)
svāṅgulīḥ sammukhā yajedityanena | yajet parasparaṃ saṅgamayedityarthaḥ | tarjanyau aṅkuśākṛtī 
aṅkuśavad vakre kuryāt | na tu aṅkuśākṛtī tarjanyau aṅguṣṭhayorvaktradeśe niveśayediti 
sambandhaḥ(,) tantrasāre sarvāsāmaṅgulīnāmupari aṅguṣṭhaniveśanasya vyaktamuktatvāt | tathāca 
tantrasāre (-)

puṭākārau karau kṛtvā tarjanyāvaṅkuśākṛtī |
parivartakrameṇaiva madhyame tadadhogate | 
krameṇa devi tenaiva kaniṣṭhānāmike tathā |
saṃyojya niviḍāḥ sarvā aṅguṣṭhāvagradeśataḥ |
mudreyaṃ parameśāni sarvavaśyakarī matā || iti |

<230-231 |> atha pañcamīmāha (-) sammukhāviti | karau parasparaṃ sammukhau kṛtvā antyaje 
kaniṣṭhike madhyamayormadhyage madhyaparvasaṃsthe kuryāt | anāmike sarale avakre

<p. 642> (mahāṅkuśā mudrā)

etasyā eva mudrāyā anāmātarjanīkramāt |
aṅkuśākārarūpeṇa yojayet sādhakottamaḥ |
iyaṃ mahāṅkuśānāmnī sarvakāryārthasādhikā || 232 ||

(khecarī mudrā)

savyaṃ dakṣiṇahaste tu dakṣiṇaṃ vāmahastake |
pariveṣṭanamārgeṇa kaniṣṭhānāmike tataḥ || 233 ||

tarjanībhyāñca saṃrudhya madhyame sarale tataḥ | 
yonyākārasvarūpeṇa yojayet sādhakottamaḥ || 234 ||

iyantu khecarīnāmnī mudrā sarvottamottamā || 235 ||


kṛtvā tadbahistarjanīdvayaṃ sthāpayet | tato daṇḍākārau saralāvaṅguṣṭhau 
madhyamānakhadeśagau kuryāt madhyamayornakhadeśe saralāvaṅguṣṭhau yojayedityarthaḥ | 
sarvayoṣitāṃ kledinī ārdratāsampādinīyamunmādinī mudrā | 

prāyaḥ samānupūrvīkavacanenokteyaṃ mudrā tantrasāre'pi (-)

sammukhau tu karau kṛtvā madhyamāmadhyage'ntyaje |
anāmike tu sarale tadvahistarjanīdvayam ||
daṇḍākārau tato'ṅguṣṭhau madhyamānakhadeśagau |
mudraiṣonmādinī nāmnā karṣiṇī sarvayoṣitām || iti |

<232 |> ṣaṣṭhīmāha (-) etasyā iti | etasyā unmādinīmudrāyāḥ krameṇānāmikādvayaṃ 
tarjanīdvayañca aṅkuśākārarūpeṇa yadi yojayet tadā mahāṅkuśākhyā mudrā bhavati | 
vyaktamāha tantrasāre (-)

asyāstvanāmikāyugmamadhaḥkṛtvā'ṅkuśākṛtī |
tarjanyāvapi tenaiva krameṇa viniyojayet ||
iyaṃ mahāṅkuśā mudrā sarvakāryārthasādhinī |

iti | asyā iti unmādinīmudrāyāḥ |

<233-235 |> atha saptamīmāha (-) savyamityādinā | savyaṃ vāmahastaṃ dakṣiṇahaste

<p. 643> (khecarīmudrāpraśastiḥ)

prayato'prayato vā'pi śucirvā'pyathavā'śuciḥ |
gacchaṃstiṣṭhan svapan vā'pi bhuñjāno maithune rataḥ || 236 ||

mudrāyā madhyamāṅgulyau parivartakrameṇa tu |
pārthivasthānasaṃyuktāḥ sadyaḥ khecaratāṃ vrajet || 237 ||

etayā jñātayā caiva yoginīnāṃ bhavet priyaḥ || 238 ||

(bījamudrā)

parivarttya karau spṛṣṭāvardhacandrākṛtī bhavet |
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayugalaṃ yugapat kārayed budhaḥ || 239 ||

adhaḥ kaniṣṭhāvaṣṭabdhe madhyame viniyojayet |
tathaiva kuṭile yojya sarvādhastādanāmike || 240 ||


dakṣiṇañca vāmahaste yojayet(,) tataḥ pariveṣṭanamārgeṇa kaniṣṭhānāmike yojayet vāmahastasya 
kaniṣṭhayā dakṣahastasya anāmikāṃ dakṣahastasya kaniṣṭhayā vāmahastasyānāmikāñca 
pariveṣṭayedityarthaḥ | tarjanībhyāmiti | tathā sarale avakre madhyame prāguktarītyā 
tarjanībhyāñca saṃrudhya yonyākāreṇa sthāpayediti khecarī mudrā |

savyaṃ dakṣiṇadeśe tu savyadeśe tu dakṣiṇam | 
bāhuṃ kṛtvā mahādevi hastau saṃparivartya ca ||
kaniṣṭhānāmike devi yuktvā tena krameṇa tu |
tarjanībhyāṃ samākrānte sarvorddhvamapi madhyame || 
aṅguṣṭhau tu maheśāni saralāvapi kārayet | 
iyaṃ sā khecarī nāmnā pārthivasthānayojitā ||

iti tantrasāradhṛtavacane tu aṅguṣṭhayoḥ sāralyena avasthānamiti viśeṣo dṛśyate |

<239-241 |> aṣṭamīmāha (-) parivartyeti |

parivartya karau spaṣṭāvardhacandrākṛtī priye |
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayugalaṃ yugapat kārayet tataḥ ||

<p. 644> bījamudreyamākhyātā sarvasiddhipravartinī || 241 ||

(yonimudrā)

madhyame kuṭilākāre tarjanyuparisaṃsthite |
anāmikāmadhyagate tathaiva ca kaniṣṭhike || 242 ||

sarvā ekatra saṃyojya aṅguṣṭhaparipīḍitāḥ |
yonimudreyamākhyātā trailokyotpattimātṛkā || 243 ||

(niruktamudrābījanirūpaṇapratijñā)

bījāni kramato vakṣye mudrāṇāṃ tantravartmanā | 

(mudrānavake prayojyāni bījāni)

pañcabāṇaṃ samuddhṛtya śūlabījaṃ likhettataḥ || 244 ||


adhaḥ kaniṣṭhāvaṣṭabdhe madhyame viniyojayet |
tathaiva kuṭile yojye sarvādhastādanāmike || 
bījamudreyamacirāt sarvasiddhivivardhinī | iti tantrasāre | 

<242-243 |> atha navamīṃ yonimudrāmāha (-) madhyama iti | kuṭilākāre madhyame 
tarjanyuparisaṃsthite kuryāt(,) tathā kaniṣṭhike anāmikāmadhyagate vidadhīta | tataśca sarvā 
aṅgulīrekatra saṃyojya aṅguṣṭhābhyāmavaṣṭabdhāḥ kuryāditi yonimudrābandhanakramaḥ | 
trailokyotpattimātṛketi sarvotpattibhūmitvād yonerityarthaḥ |

madhyame kuṭile kṛtvā tarjanyuparisaṃsthite |
anāmike madhyagate tathaiva hi kaniṣṭhike ||
sarvā ekatra saṃyojya aṅguṣṭhaparipīḍitāḥ |
eṣā tu paramā mudrā yonimudreyamīritā || iti tantrasāre | 

etāsāṃ mudrāṇāṃ pūjākāle prayogamāha tatraiva (-)

etā mudrā maheśāni tripurāyā mayoditāḥ |
pūjākāle prayoktavyāḥ sandhyānukramayogataḥ || iti |

<p. 645> śivaḥ śaktiḥ kāntapāntaṃ bhagarephendumaṇḍitam |
sadāśivasya bījantu vāgbhavaṃ navamaṃ smṛtam || 245 ||

(tarpaṇopadeśaḥ)

tarpaṇañca tataḥ kuryāttrivāraṃ tattvamudrayā |

(ṣoḍaśopacāraiḥ pūjanasyopadeśaḥ)

upacāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhiḥ pūjayet parameśvarīm || 246 ||


<244-245 |> atha krameṇa niruktasarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyādimudrāsu prayojyāni bījāni nirūpayati (-) 
pañcabāṇamityādinā | pañcabāṇabījāni tu pañcadaśe thāntadvayamityādinā (343 ślo.) mūle 
ṭīkāyāñca pradarśitāni | pañcabāṇaṃ samuddhṛtya drāṃ drīṃ klīṃ blūṃ saḥ iti 
bījapañcakamuddhṛtyetyarthaḥ | evañca sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyādisarvonmādinyantamudrāpañcake 
niruktabījapañcakaṃ prayuñjīteti bodhyam | tataśca drāmityuktvā sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīṃ mudrāṃ 
pradarśayet | evaṃ drīṃ sarvavidrāvaṇīm | klīṃ sarvākarṣiṇīm | blūṃ sarvavaśyakarīm | saḥ 
sarvonmādinīm | śūlabījaṃ kroṃ | evañca kromityuktvā mahāṅkuśāṃ mudrāṃ pradarśayet | 
atha saptamyāṃ khecarīmudrāyāṃ bījayojanamupadiśati (-) śiva ityādinā | śivo hakāraḥ(,) śaktiḥ 
sakāraḥ(,) kāntaḥ khakāraḥ(,) pāntaḥ phakāraḥ(,) sa ca phakāro bhagenaikādaśasvareṇa repheṇa 
indunā'nusvāreṇa ca maṇḍitaḥ | etena ha sa kha phreṃ ityuktvā khecarīmudrāṃ pradarśayediti 
bodhyam | aṣṭamyāṃ bījamudrāyāṃ bījayogamāha (-) sadeti | sadāśivasya bījaṃ hsauriti | 
evañca hsaurityuktvā bījamudrāṃ pradarśayedityarthaḥ | vāgbhavamiti ai(/) iti 
vāgbhavabījapūrvikāṃ navamīṃ yonimudrāṃ pradarśayedityarthaḥ | gandharvatantre trayodaśapaṭale 
(-)

sandarśayet svasvabījapūrvaṃ mudrāstato nava |
saṃkṣobhadrāvaṇākarṣavaśyonmadamahāṅkuśāḥ |
khecarībījayonyākhyā navamudrāstataḥ kramāt |
etā mudrā maheśāni bandhūkakusumaprabhāḥ ||
svasvamudrākarāḥ sarvāḥ śrīvidyāsammukhī smaret || iti |

<246 |> tarpaṇañceti | tattvamudrālakṣaṇamāha gandharvatantre trayodaśapaṭale (-)

aṅguṣṭhānāmikāyogaṃ (ḥ) tattvamudreyamīritā |

<p. 646> tritattvairvahnijāyāntaistridhā'rghyaṃ parikalpayet || 247 ||

mūlasya ca triṣu trīṇi bījāni viniyojya ca |
bālāmantreṇa mantrajña upacārānnivedayet || 248 ||

(ṣoḍaśopacārāḥ)

āsanaṃ svāgataṃ pādyamarghyamācamanīyakam |
madhuparkācamanasnānavasanābharaṇāni ca || 249 ||

sugandhasumanodīpadhūpanaivedyavandanāḥ |
prayojayedarcanāyāmupacārāṃstu ṣoḍaśa || 250 ||

(tatra kalpāntaram)

athavā kalpayenmantrī pādyārghyācamanīyakam |
snānaṃ vastraṃ tathā bhūṣāṃ gandhaprasūnadhūpakam || 251 ||

pradīpakañca naivedyamācāntārthaṃ jalaṃ punaḥ |
tāmbūlamarcanā stotraṃ tarpaṇañca namaskriyā |
prayojayedarcanāyāmupacārāṃstu ṣoḍaśa || 252 ||


aṅguṣṭhaṃ śivamityāhuranāmā śaktirucyate ||
tarpaṇantu tayoryogādamṛtairvāmapāṇinā || iti |

upacārairiti | upacārapadavyutpattimāha tatraiva (-)

bhaktyaivaite kṛtā deve sādhakaṃ devasannidhim |
cārayanti yatastasmāducyante copacārakāḥ ||

samīpe caraṇād vā'pi kalākānte tathoditāḥ || iti |

<249-254 |> atha krameṇopacārān vibhajate (-) āsanamityādinā pañcopacārikā ityantena | spaṣṭam 
| tatrā'sane viśeṣamāha gandharvatantre caturdaśapaṭale (-)

sauvarṇaṃ rājataṃ vāstraṃ tathā ratnavinirmitam |
āsanaṃ prathamaṃ dadyāt pauṣpaṃ dāravameva vā ||

<p. 647> (daśopacārāḥ)

arghyaṃ pādyaṃ nivedyātha jalamācamanīyakam |
madhuparkañcā'camanaṃ gandhaprasūnake tataḥ |
dhūpadīpau ca naivedyaṃ daśopacārakaṃ smṛtam || 253 ||

(pañcopacārāḥ)

gandhādayo naivedyāntāḥ pūjāḥ pañcopacārikāḥ |

(krameṇaiteṣāmuttamamadhyamādhamatvam)

uttamā madhyamā caiva budhairuktā'dhamā kramāt || 254 ||

(upacāreṣu kasyacidalābhe vyavasthā)

upacāreṣu sarveṣu yatkiñciddurlabhaṃ bhavet |
tat sarvaṃ manasāṃ dhyātvā puṣpakṣepeṇa kalpayet || 255 ||


na patramāsanaṃ dadyāt kadācidiha pūjane |
yathoktavidhinā devyai raktakambalameva vā ||
svamerupādapīṭhānte padmakalpitamāsanam |
bhogamokṣaprade mātastiṣṭhasva parameśvari ||
anenaivā'sanaṃ devyai yo dadyādvihitaṃ śive |
bhuktimuktī kare tasya sarvatra sthānavān bhavet ||

iti | anyeṣāmapyupacārāṇāṃ svarūpamatraiva pradaśitaṃ vistarabhayāt | pañcopacārānāha (-) 
gandhādaya iti | vyaktamāha nibandhatantre pañcapañcāśattamapaṭale (-)

gandhapuṣpadhūpadīpanaivedyamiti pañcakam |
nivedayet sadā'rcāyāṃ pūjāḥ pañcopacārikāḥ ||

iti | uttameti | ṣoḍaśopacārikā uttamā(,) daśopacārikā madhyamā(,) pañcopacārikā adhamā 
pūjetyarthaḥ |

<255 |> upacāreṣviti | kasyacidupacārasyābhāve puṣpameva tadupacāratvena kalpayitvā devyai 
nivedayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 648> (pratyupacārānantaraṃ jaladānam)

tatra tatra jalaṃ dadyādupacārāntarāntarā |

(devīśirasi puṣpadānam)

devatāyāḥ śiraḥ kuryāt kusumopahitaṃ sadā || 256 ||

(devyā ūrdhve karabhrāmaṇaniṣedhaḥ)

pūjākāle devatāyā nopari bhrāmayet karam |

(puṣpādyabhāve vyavasthā)

pūjayet parameśānīṃ puṣpābhāve tu patrakaiḥ || 257 ||

patrāṇāmapya bhāve tu tṛṇagulmauṣadhādibhiḥ |
oṣadhīnāmabhāve tu tatphalairapi pūjayet || 258 ||

akṣatairvā jalairvā'pi tadabhāve tu sarṣapaiḥ | 
sitaistathā'pyalābhe tu mānasīṃ bhaktimācaret || 256 ||


<257 |> pūjayediti puṣpābhāve patrādibhirarcayet(,) paraṃ tu kadā'pi pūjālopaṃ na vidadhīta(,) 
niruktānāmekatamasyāpyalābhe mānasīṃ pūjāṃ vidadhīta(;) tayaiva pūjāsiddhirbhavatīti bhāvaḥ 
| vyaktamāha gandharvatantre caturdaśapaṭale (-)

puṣpābhāve yajet patraiḥ patrālābhe ca tatphalaiḥ |
akṣatairvā jalairvā'pi na pūjāṃ vyatilaṅghayet ||
eteṣāmapyalābhe tu mānasīṃ bhaktimāśrayet |

iti | atra puṣpābhāve yajet patrairiti sāmānyataḥ patravidhāne satyapi (-)

patreṣu bilvapatrañca tathā madanapallavam |
dūrvāṅkuraṃ tathā proktaṃ nānyat patraṃ prayojayet ||

iti gandharvatantracaturdaśapaṭalavacanasaṃvādāt na patrairarcayecchivāmityanena sāmānyataḥ 
patrakaraṇakārcāniṣedhācca puṣpābhāve niruktabilvādipatraireva pūjanaṃ vidheyaṃ na tu 
patrāntarairiti jñeyam |

<p. 649> (puṣpādyupacārāṇāṃ paratvāparatvādi)

parāparottamañcaiva madhyamañca tathā'dhamam |
sauvarṇaṃ paramaṃ proktamaparaṃ citravastujam || 260 ||

vṛkṣagulmodbhavaṃ puṣpamuttamaṃ parikīrtitam |
adhamaṃ patratoyādi madhyamantu phalātmakam || 261 ||

(puṣpanivedanakramaḥ)

jñānākhyamudrayā mantrī cakre puṣpaṃ nivedayet |

(jñānamudrā)

aṅguṣṭhatarjanībhyāntu jñānamudrā prakīrtitā || 262 ||

(puṣpādidāne viśeṣaḥ)

yathotpannaṃ tathā puṣpaṃ tathā dadyācca patrakam |
puṣpāñjalipradāne tu na bhavenniyamastvayam || 263 ||

nādhomukhaṃ phalaṃ dadyāditi śāstrasya nirṇayaḥ | 

(tarpaṇam)

tarpayenmūlamantreṇa trivāraṃ pūrvavat sudhīḥ || 264 ||

(devyā udvartanādyalaṅkāradānāntaṃ karma)

svavāmamaṇḍale nītvā devimudvartanādikam |
manaḥpūjākramaiḥ snānaṃ vāsasā tanumārjanam || 265 ||

sarvālaṅkaraṇaṃ dattvā maṇḍale tāṃ samānayet |

(pādyādyarpaṇam)

pūrvavad vandanaṃ kṛtvā pādyādīni nivedayet || 266 ||


<265 |> manaḥpūjākramairiti | saptadaśapaṭaloktamānasārcanavihitasnānakramaiḥ devyāḥ snānaṃ 
nivartayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 650> (gandhādyarpaṇam)

gandhacandanadhūpaistu dīpairnānāphalairapi |
śarkarāmiśrapayasā ghṛtena madhunā phalaiḥ |
dadhnā ca paramānnena bhavānīṃ paritoṣayet || 267 ||

(naivedyanivedanakramaḥ)

mūlaṃ devyāḥ svanāmānte naivedyamiti coccaran |
gṛhāṇa vahnijāyānte naivedyamutsṛjediti || 268 ||

(balidāne viśeṣaḥ)

na rājā meṣamahiṣabalidānaṃ samācaret |
siṃhavyāghranarāṃścaiva na dadyād brāhmaṇottamaḥ || 269 ||

(vyajanādyupacārairdevyāḥ paritoṣavidhānam)

vyajanaiḥ śuddhasindūrairghaṇṭācāmaradarpaṇaiḥ |
vitānacchatratāmbūlaiḥ kastūrīkuṅkumādibhiḥ || 270 ||

rocanāgurukarpūraistathā lākṣārasena ca |
nṛtyairgītaiśca vādyaiśca toṣayet parameśvarīm || 271 ||


<268 |> naivedyanivedanakramamāha (-) mūlamityādinā | ādau mūlaṃ tato devyāḥ svanāma tato 
naivedyamiti gṛhāṇeti ca padadvayaṃ vahnijāyā svāheti | evañca mūlaṃ tataḥ 
śrīmattripurasundari naivedyaṃ gṛhāṇa svāheti mantraḥ paryavasyati |

<269 |> balidāne viśeṣamāha (-) na rājeti | sāmānyato balidāne vihiteṣvapi paśuṣu rājā 
meṣamahiṣabaliṃ tathā brāhmaṇottamaḥ siṃhādibaliṃ na vidadhītetyarthaḥ |

<p. 651> (tarpaṇam)

dattvā nānāvidhaṃ dravyaṃ hetubhistarpayet parām |

(parivāradevatārcopadeśaḥ)

gṛhītvājñāṃ mahādevyāḥ parivārāṃstato'rcayet || 272 ||

(tatra ṣaṇṇāmaṅgadevatānāṃ pūjā)

yathā sarvajñatā tṛptiranādibodhasaṃjñikā |
svatantrā nityatṛptā'nyā tathā'nantakramādimāḥ || 273 ||


<272 |> dattveti | hetubhiḥ kāraṇaiḥ | tatrāpi viśeṣamāha gandharvatantre pañcadaśapaṭale (-)

nirvikalpasya deveśi suraiva vihitāgame |
amṛtañca tadeva syānmadyañcāpi tadeva hi ||
nā'padyapi dvijo madyaṃ dadyād devyai kadācana |
mohād yadi dadenmadyaṃ brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate ||
brahmaghātī sa eva syāt tasmānmadyaṃ vivarjayet |
(.. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. .. ..)  
nirvikalpo yadā madyaṃ mahādevyai nivedayet |
aśvamedhasahasrasya .. .. .. .. .. ..
savikalpo yadā devi pāpabhāṅ nātrasaṃśayaḥ || iti |

atha parivārārcanamavatārayati (-) gṛhītveti | ājñāprārthanakramamāha tripurārcanarahasye ādau 
mūlam(,) tataḥ (-)

saṃvinmaye pare devi parāmṛtarasapriye |
anujñāṃ tripure dehi parivārārcanāya me ||

iti | gandharvatantre ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

raśmivṛndāni te devi pūjayāmi vidhānataḥ |
ājñāpaya jaganmātaryatastameva tāniva (?) ||
kṛtāñjalirmaheśāni devyājñāṃ sādhakottamaḥ |
gṛhītvā pūjayet tuṣṭaḥ prāguktakramayogataḥ || iti |

<273-275 |> tatrā'dau ṣaḍaṅgadevatārcākramamabhidhatte (-) yathetyādinā | tathāca

<p. 652> ṣaḍaṅgadevatāḥ pūjyāstattanmantraṃ samuccaran |

(tāsāṃ dhyānam)

tuṣārasphaṭikaśyāmanīlakṛṣṇāruṇārciṣaḥ || 274 ||

varadābhayadhāriṇyaḥ pradhānatanavaḥ striyaḥ |

(pūjāsthānam)

agnīśāsuravāyavye madhye dikṣu yathākramāt || 275 ||

(punastarpaṇaṃ puṣpāñjalidānañca)

tarpaṇañca punaḥ kṛtvā mūlamuccārya sarvataḥ || 276 ||

śirovakṣaḥpadadvandvakaradvandveṣu ca kramāt |
sarvāṅgeṣu punaḥ kuryāt pañcapañcāñjalīn hṛdā || 277 ||

(parivārapūjāyāmādau bījayojanakramaḥ)

sarvāvaraṇanāmādau māyāṃ lakṣmīṃ niyojayet |
vāṅmāyāṃ kamalāṃ vā'pi tribhiḥ saṃpuṭitañca vā || 278 ||


sarvajñatāśaktiśrīmahātripurasundarīhṛdayāya namaḥ(,) tṛptiśaktiśrīmahātripurasundarīśirase 
svāhetyādikrameṇa ṣaḍaṅgadevatāḥ pūjayedityāpatati | tantrasārakṛtā tu sarvajñatetyatra 
sarvajñā śaktiriti bālābījasya dvirāvṛttyā ai(/) klīṃ saurityādyekaikabījapūrvakatvañcoktam |

	etāsāmaṅgadevatānāṃ krameṇa svarūpamāha (-) tuṣāreti | 
sarvajñatāśaktistuṣāravarṇā(,) tṛptiśaktiḥ sphaṭikavarṇā(,) anādibodhaśaktiḥ śyāmavarṇā(,) 
svatantrā śaktirnīlavarṇā(,) nityatṛptiśaktiḥ kṛṣṇavarṇā(,) anantaśaktiraruṇavarṇetyuktaṃ bhavati | 
varadetyādi sādhāraṇam | krameṇaitāsāṃ sthānamāha (-) agnīti(,) agnyādikrameṇaitāḥ 
pūjayedityarthaḥ |

<276 |> pañcapuṣpāñjalidānamāha (-) mūletyādinā | tathāca ādau mūlaṃ tataḥ śira (-) 
ādisarvāṅgānteṣu krameṇa puṣpāñjalipañcakamarpayedityarthaḥ |

<278 |> athā'varaṇapūjāyāmādau bījayojane prasthānatrayamāha (-)māyāmityādinā | tathāca 
māyāṃ lakṣmīṃ hrīṃ śrīmiti māyābījaṃ śrībījañca niyojayediti dvitārīprayoga (-)

<p. 653> (pādukāmantraḥ)

pādukāṃ pūjayāmīti śrīpūrvaṃ pādukāmanuḥ |
namo'nte yojayitvā tu namo'ntaṃ sarvamarcayet || 279 ||

(nyāse'pi pādukāmanoḥ prayojyatvam)

nyāse'pi yojayenmantrī pādukā sarvasiddhidā |

(atra prāmāṇikāgamasammatiḥ)

rahasyaṃ paramaṃ proktamiti yāmalasammatam || 280 ||


kramaḥ | vāṅmāyāṃ kamalāmiti ai(/) hrī(/) śrīmiti bījatrayaṃ yojayediti tritārīprayogakramaḥ | 
tribhiḥ saṃpuṭitaṃ veti tṛtīyaḥ kalpaḥ | tribhiḥ vāṅmāyākamalābījaiḥ saṃpuṭitam | 
saṃpuṭalakṣaṇamāha tantrasāre (-)

mantramādau vadet sarvaṃ sādhyasaṃjñāmanantaram |
viparītaṃ punaścānte bījaṃ tat saṃpuṭaṃ smṛtam ||

evañcātra kalpe prathamaṃ aiṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ tataḥ pūjyadevatānāma tataḥ śrīṃ hrīṃ aiṃ iti 
viparītamuccārayediti phalitam | tantrasārakṛtā'pi sarvatrā'dau dvitāryā tritāryā vā prayoga 
ityuktam | jñānārṇave'pi (-)

māyālakṣmīmayaṃ bījayugmaṃ pūrvakrameṇa hi |
kathitaṃ yojayeddevi trayaṃ vā parameśvari ||

iti | kalpasūtre'pi sarvatrā'dau tritārīprayoga iti tantrasārakāraḥ | tritārī ca (-)

vāṅmāyā kamalā ceti tritārī samudāhṛtā | iti |

<279 |> atha sarvatra parivārārcane prayojyaṃ pādukāmantramāha (-) pādukāmiti | tathāca aiṃ 
hrīṃ śrīṃ śrīmahātripurasundarīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama ityevaṃkrameṇa 
sarvamarcayedityarthaḥ |

<280 |> nyāse'pīti | nyāsakāle'pi niruktapādukāmantraṃ prayuñjītetyarthaḥ | tatra pādukāyai 
nama iti viśeṣaḥ | asminnarthe pramāṇabhūtamāgamamudāharati (-) rahasyamiti |

<p. 654> (tarpaṇasaṃkhyā)

tarpaṇañca tridhā kāryaṃ sakṛdvā'pi nijecchayā |

(homādau vākyabhedāḥ)

svāhā home tarpaṇe ca tarpayāmīti saṃsmaret || 281 ||

(ṣoḍaśatithinityārcāyāṃ svaravinyāsaḥ)

madhyatrikoṇarekhāsu svāgre dakṣottarakramaiḥ |
pañca pañca krameṇāpi svarān vibhāgato likhet ||
aḥsvarañca likhenmadhye tithinityāstathā'rcayet || 282 ||

(kāmeśvaryādipūjanopadeśaḥ)

kāmeśvaryādikāḥ sarvā dhyātvā tattanmanuṃ caret |
pratipadādipūrṇāntaṃ vāmāvartakrameṇa tu || 283 ||

(kāmeśvaryā dhyānam (1) )

kāmeśvarīṃ raktavarṇāṃ raktavastravibhūṣitām |
pāśāṅkuśaśarāṃścāpaṃ dhārayantīṃ vicintayet || 284 ||


<281 |> parivāradevatānāṃ tarpaṇasaṃkhyāmāha (-) tarpaṇañceti | spaṣṭam | prakṛte tu 
tarpayāmītyantena tarpaṇaṃ kuryāditi bodhyam |

<282-283 |> atha kāmeśvaryādiṣoḍaśatithinityārcanamabhidhāsyan prathamaṃ śrīcakramadhyatrikoṇe 
akārādivisargāntaṣoḍaśasvaravinyāsamāha(-)madhyetyādinā | svāgre dakṣottarakramaiḥ 
dakṣādikrameṇa pañcaśaḥ svarān anusvārāntān rekhātraye trikoṇamadhye ca visargaṃ likhediti 
phalitārthaḥ | tatra kāmeśvaryādikā vakṣyamāṇāstithinityā vakṣyamāṇakrameṇa dhyātvā 
tattaddevatāmantreṇārcayedityarthaḥ | tatra kramamāha (-) pratipadādīti |

<284 | >atha krameṇa kāmeśvaryādīnāṃ vicitrāntānāṃ pratipadādipañcadaśyanteṣu 
pañcadaśatithiṣu krameṇārcanīyānāṃ pañcadaśatithinityānāṃ sādhāraṇyena pañcadaśatithiṣu

<p. 655> (bhagamālāyāḥ (2) )

bhagamālāṃ śuklavarṇāṃ bhagamālāvibhūṣitām |
pāśāṅkuśa(ñca) sūtrañca pustakaṃ bibhratīṃ karaiḥ || 285 ||

(nityaklinnāyāḥ (3) )

nityaklinnāṃ śuklavarṇāṃ varābhayakarāmbujām || 286 ||

(bheruṇḍhāyāḥ (4) )

bheruṇḍāṃ raktavarṇāñca raktābharaṇabhūṣitām |
muṇḍavedadharāṃ devīṃ dvibhujāṃ paricintayet || 287 ||

(vahnivāsinyāḥ (5) )

piṅgalābhāṃ tathāhastāṃ bhāvayed vahnivāsinīm |

(mahānityeśvaryāḥ (6) )

mahānityeśvarīṃ khaḍgacarmākṣasragdharāṃ varām || 288 ||


samarcanīyāyāḥ śrīmattripurasundaryāśca dhyānānyāha(-)kāmeśvarīmityādinā sādhakottama 
ityantena | spaṣṭam |

<288 |> mahānityeśvarīmiti | vajreśvarīti jñānārṇave mahāvajreśvarīti ca tantrarāje pāṭhaḥ | atra 
mahānityeśvarīdhyānānantaram evaṃ sukṛṣṇāṃ tvaritāmiti tvaritāyā dhyānamuktam | parantu (-)

prathamā sundarī nityā mahātripurasundarī |
kāmeśvarī samākhyātā tathaiva bhagamālinī ||
nityaklinnā ca bheruṇḍā tathaiva vahnivāsinī |
vajreśvarī ca dūtī ca tvaritā kulasundarī ||
nityā nīlapatākā ca vijayā sarvamaṅgalā |
jvālāmālāvicitrāntāḥ pañcadaśa prakīrtitāḥ ||

iti tantrasāradhṛtakulārṇavavacane tvaritāyāḥ pūrvaṃ śivadūtyā nirūpaṇaṃ dṛśyate | evameva 
tantrarājatantre'pi | tripurārcanarahasye'pyevameva | mūle'pi pañcadaśaprakāśe 
ṣoḍaśanityānyāsāvasare saptamyāṃ vinyasedenāṃ śivadūtīṃ svayaṃ hṛdi ityanena 
śivadūtīnyāsa (-)

<p. 656> (śivadūtī (7) )

(x            x              x              x            x               x |)

(tvaritā-kulasundaryoḥ (8, 9) )

evaṃ sukṛṣṇāṃ tvaritāṃ gaurāṅgīṃ kulasundarīm |

(nityāyāḥ (10) )

aṣṭasiddhidharāṃ devīmaṣṭakoṇāntarasthitām || 289 ||

(nīlapatākāyāḥ (11) )

nityāṃ nīlapatākāñca pāśāṅkuśadharāṃ smaret |

(vijayāyāḥ (12) )

vijayāṃ caṇḍarūpāñca tathā strāṃ yoginīvṛtām || 290 ||

(sarvamaṅgalāyāḥ (13) )

padmadvayakarāṃ raktāṃ dhyāyed vai sarvamaṅgalām |

(jvālāṃśumālinyāḥ (14) )

jvālāṃśumālinīṃ dhūmrāṃ trinetrāṃ śvetarūpiṇīm || 291 ||

(vicitrāyāḥ (15) )

vicitrāṃ śvetarūpāñca śvetapadmadharāṃ śubhām |
citrahastāṃ mahādevīṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām || 292 ||

(śrīmattripurasundaryāḥ (16) )

tataḥ śrīsundarīṃ dhyātvā pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ |

(pratipadādiṣvekaikanityārcāyāḥ phalam)

ekaikāṃ pūjayed yo hi sa saubhāgyaphalaṃ labhet || 293 ||


mabhidhāya aṣṭamyāṃ vinyaset kaṇṭhe tvaritāṃ dvādaśākṣarīmityanena śivadūtyanantaraṃ 
tvaritāyā nirdeśaḥ kṛtaḥ | etena gaṇanayā nityānāṃ ṣoḍaśatvamapyupapadyate(,) śivadūtyā 
agrahaṇe tu nyūnataiva syāt | tad yadatra mūle ṣoḍaśanityāpūjāprakaraṇe śivadūtyā 
dhyānaṃ na dṛśyate(,) tallekhakapramādakṛtamiti pratibhāti |

<193 |> evaṃ kāmeśvaryādīnāṃ vicitrāntānāṃ pañcadaśanityānāṃ dhyānānyabhidhāya

<p. 657> (sundaryāḥ sarvāsu tithiṣu pūjyatvam)

aḥsvare ṣoḍaśīṃ nityāṃ tripañcatithigāminīm |

(pakṣabhedenārcāyāṃ kramabhedaḥ)

kṛṣṇapakṣe vicitrādyāḥ kāmeśvaryantikā yajet || 294 ||


ṣoḍaśyāḥ śrīmattripurasundaryāṃ dhyānamupadiśati(-)tata ityādinā | dhyānantu pūrvameva 
daśitam | ekaikāṃ niruktāsu nityāsvityarthaḥ |

<294 | > ṣoḍaśyāḥ sundaryāḥ pūjāsthānamāha(-)aḥsvara iti | aḥsvare aḥsvarañca likhenmadhye iti 
prāguktyā madhyatrikoṇamadhyalikhite aḥ iti ṣoḍaśasvare ityarthaḥ | ṣoḍaśīṃ viśinaṣṭi (-) 
tripañceti | evañca pratipadādipañcadaśatithiṣu ekaikāṃ nityāṃ pūjayet(;) ṣoḍaśīntu sarvāsveva 
tithiṣu pūjayedityuktaṃ bhavati | yadetat kāmeśvaryādīnāṃ pratipadādiṣvekaikaṃ pūjanamuktaṃ 
tacchuklapakṣaviṣayam | kṛṣṇapakṣe viśeṣamāha (-) kṛṣṇetyādinā | atra pratipadi vicitrāṃ 
dvitīyāyāṃ jvālāṃśumālinīmityevaṃkrameṇa kāmeśvaryantā nityāḥ pūjayedityarthaḥ | 
vyaktamāha jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

pratipattithimārabhya paurṇamāsyantamadrije |
ekaikāṃ pūjayennityāṃ mahāsaubhāgyamāpnuyāt ||
kṛṣṇapakṣe maheśāni pūjayettithimaṇḍalam |
vicitrādyā varārohe yāvat kāmeśvarī bhavet || iti | 

	tantrasārakṛtā'pi mahātryasre vāmāvartena ākārādipañca ūkārādipañca 
ekārādipañca vibhāvya madhye visargaṃ teṣu vāmāvartena śuklapakṣe 
kāmeśvaryādivicitrāntaṃ kṛṣṇapakṣe vicitrādikāmeśvaryantaṃ pūjayediti vyaktamuktam | evameva 
tripurārcanarahasye'pi | yajediti(,) niruktakrameṇa dhyātvā 
pañcadaśaprakāśīyatithinityānyāsoktarītyā tattanmantramuccārya śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama 
ityantena pūjayedityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ tantrasāradhṛtatantrāntare (-)

śrīpadaṃ pūrvamuccārya pādukāpadamuccaret |
pūjayāmi namaḥ paścāt pūjayedaṅgadevatāḥ ||

iti | atrāpi dvitāryāstritāryā vā prayogaḥ kartavyaḥ sādhāraṇyenāṅgadevatārcāyāṃ 
vihitatvāt | tathā ca ai(/) hrīṃ (ai(/) hrīṃ śrīṃ) aṃ ai(/) krīṃ sauḥ oṃ namaḥ kāmeśvari

<p. 658> (nityānāṃ tarpaṇadravyam)

tarpayecca madhudravyaiḥ paramānandacetasā |

(pūjanam)

varṇānukramayogeṇa sādhayettripureśvarīm || 295 ||

svaśaktyā pūjanaṃ kuryānmūlavidyāñca pūjayet |

(devyanujñāgrahaṇam)

devyājñāṃ mastake kṛtvā karomi bāhyapūjanam || 296 ||

(gurupūjanopadeśaḥ)

trivṛtte divyasiddhaughamānavaughān prapūjayet |

(asya prāmāṇikāgamasaṃvāditvam)

bṛhacchrīkramatantre tu śiveneti prakīrtitam || 297 ||

(tatra kalpāntaram)

tithinityārcanād bāhye trirekhāsvathavā sudhīḥ |
pradakṣiṇakrameṇaiva tripaṅktyā pūjayed gurūn |


icchākāmaphalaprade sarvasattvavaśaṅkari sarvajagatkṣobhakari huṃ huṃ huṃ huṃ drāṃ drīṃ 
klīṃ blūṃ saḥ sauḥ klīṃ ai(/) kāmeśvarīnityākalāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ ityādirūpaḥ 
prayogaḥ kartavyaḥ | evaṃ bhagamālinyādīnāmapi mantrā unneyāḥ | ṣoḍaśyāḥ sundaryāḥ 
pūjane tu ādau dvitārī tritārī vā tataḥ ṣoḍaśasvarastato mūlaṃ tataḥ śrīmahātripurasundarī 
(mahā) nityākalā śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ iti prayogaḥ |

<295-296 |> tarpayediti tithinityā iti śeṣaḥ | varṇānukramayogeṇeti 
ādito'kārādivisargāntaṣoḍaśasvarayogeṇetyarthaḥ | mūlavidyāṃ tripurasundarīm | pūjanakramastu 
pūrvameva pradarśitaḥ | 

<297 |> atha gurumaṇḍalapūjāmabhidhāsyan prathamaṃ gurvarcanasthānamāha(-)trivṛtta iti | trivṛtte 
ṣoḍaśārabahistrivṛtte krameṇa divyaughān siddhaughān mānavaughāṃśca pūjayet | iti 
bṛhacchrīkramatantrasiddhāntaḥ |

<298 |> tatra kalpāntaramāha (-) tithītyādinā | tithinityārcanāsthānaṃ prathamaṃ

<p. 659> (tatra prayogakramaḥ)

ānandanāthaśabdāntānambāntāṃ mātaraṃ kramāt || 298 ||

(gurukramanirūpaṇapratijñā)

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi ṣoṣaśīnāṃ gurukramam || 299 ||

(tatra sapta divyaughāḥ)

paraprakāśako nāma paraśivo dvitīyakaḥ |
tṛtīyā paraśaktiśca kauleśvarastataḥ param || 300 ||

śuklādevī pareśānaḥ kāmeśvaryambikā tataḥ |
divyaughā guravaḥ proktāḥ parākhyāḥ saptamā iti || 301 ||


prathamatrikoṇaṃ sarvasiddhipradaṃ nāma tadbāhyarekhātraye prādakṣiṇyena tripaṅktyā 
rekhātrayeṇetyarthaḥ(,) krameṇa divyaughān siddhaughān mānavaughāṃśca gurūn pūjayediti 
phalitārthaḥ | pūjanakramamāha (-) ānandeti | tathāca amukānandanāthaśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
iti puṃgurupūjāyām(,) amukāmbāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmīti strīgurupūjāyāṃ prayogaḥ | 
vyaktamāha tantrasāre (-)

ānandanāthaśabdāntā vijñeyāḥ parameśvari | 
ambāntā guravaḥ proktāḥ strīliṅgā vīravandite ||

iti | śrīpādukādipadavyavahārabījantu śrīpadaṃ pūrvamuccāryetyādinā pūrvamupadarśitam |

<299-301 |> atha ṣoḍaśīnāṃ gurupaṅktimabhidhāsyan prathamaṃ kāmarājavidyāyāstadghaṭitānāṃ 
vidyānāñca gurukramamāha (-)paraprakāśaka ityādinā | anena 1 paraprakāśaḥ(,) 2 paraśivaḥ(,) 3 
paraśaktiḥ(,) 4 kauleśvaraḥ(,) 5 śuklādevī(,) 6 pareśānaḥ(,) 7 kāmeśvaryambikā iti sapta parākhyā 
divyaughāḥ | taduktaṃ jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

paraprakāśo deveśi tataḥ paraśivo mataḥ |
parā śaktistathā devi kauleśvara iti priye | 
śuklā devi(vī) kuleśānakāmeśvaryambikāḥ kramāt | 
munisaṃkhyāstu guravaḥ parākhyā divyarūpiṇaḥ |

iti | atra jñānārṇavavacane pareśāna ityatra kuleśāna iti viśeṣaḥ | kauleśvara ityatra 
kauleśvarīti ca tantrasāre |

<p. 660> (siddhaughāḥ pañca)

bhogakrīḍau ca samayaḥ sahajo devasaṃjñakaḥ | 
parāparākhyāḥ siddhaughāḥ

(mānavaughāḥ sapta)

mānavaughān bravīmyatha || 302 ||

gagano viśvavimalau madano bhuvanastathā |
nīlamātmapriyaścaiva saptasaṃkhyāstu mānavāḥ |

(nigamanam)

kāmarājākhyavidyāyā gurupaṅktiriyaṃ bhavet || 303 ||


<302 |> atha kramaprāptān parāparākhyān siddhaughānāha(-)bhogetyādinā | tathāca (-)(1) bhogaḥ(,) (2) 
krīḍaḥ(,) (3) samayaḥ(,) (4) sahajaḥ(,) (5) devaḥ iti pañca parāparākhyāḥ siddhaughāḥ | taduktaṃ 
tatraiva (-)

bhogaklinnastu samayo vedākhyaḥ sahajastathā |
parāparākhyasiddhaughe mānavaughe śṛṇu priye ||

iti | evañca kroḍa ityatra klinna iti jñānārṇave viśeṣaḥ | samayaḥ sahajo veda iti mūlataḥ 
kramabhedaḥ(,) deva ityatra veda iti pāṭhabhedaśca jñānārṇava(-)tantrasārayoḥ | 
niruktabhogetyādijñānārṇavavacanasya(-)samayaḥ sahajo vedasaṃkhyakāḥ iti kvacit pāṭhabhedo 
dṛśyate | tatra ca bhogaḥ klinnaḥ samayaḥ sahaja iti vedasaṃkhyakāścatuḥsaṃkhyakāḥ 
siddhaughā ityartho labhyate | tripurārcanarahasye'pi bhogādyāścatvāra eva siddhaughatvena 
parigṛhītāḥ | deva ityatra jñānārṇavatantrasārādiṣu veda iti darśanād veda iti pāṭhasya 
samīcīnatvaṃ sambhāvayatā'pi prabalatarapramāṇābhāvānmūloktapāṭho na parihṛtaḥ |

<303 |> atha kramaprāptān siddhaughānāha(-)gagana ityādinā | evañca (1) gaganaḥ(,) (2) viśvaḥ(,) (3) 
vimalaḥ(,) (4) madanaḥ(,) (5) bhuvanaḥ(,) (6) nīlam(,) (7) ātmapriyaḥ iti saptāparākhyā manavaughāḥ | atra 
jñānārṇave (-)

gagano viśvavimalau madano bhuvanastathā |

<p. 661> (svagurvādiyāgaḥ)

mānavaughāntike mantrī svagurutritayaṃ yajet |
parameṣṭhī ca paramaḥ svaguruśca trayo bhavet || 304 ||

(guruvaṃśaprakarṣaḥ)

svavaṃśādadhiko jñeyo guruvaṃśo mahāśubhaḥ | 

(mantradātuḥ prakarṣaḥ)

piturapyadhiko jñeyo mantradaḥ paramo guruḥ || 305 ||

(niruktagurunāmājñāne kartavyam)

na jānāti gurornāma tadā'nena prapūjayet |
gurubhyo nama uccārya pādukābhyo namo vadet || 306 ||

gurvante paramānte ca gurubhyo nama ityapi | 
eteṣāṃ pādukāstadvadācāryebhyo namo vadet || 307 ||

(nigamanam)

sāmānyaguruśiṣyāṇāṃ gurupaṅktiriyaṃ bhavet | 

(gurupaṅktipūjāpraśastiḥ)

gurupaṅkti prapūjyātha svayaṃ śrītripurā bhavet || 308 ||


līlā svātmā priyaḥ paścānnāgasaṃkhyāstu mānavāḥ |
aparāḥ parameśāni niyatā akṣarā ime |

iti vacane gurūṇāṃ keṣāñcinnāmabhedā aṣṭasaṃkhyatvañca dṛśyante | 
tripurārcanarahasyatantrasārayorapi niruktakrameṇāṣṭasaṃkhyatvamevoktamiti saptasaṃkhyāstu 
mānavā iti mūloktyā mahān virodhaḥ | kāmarājeti | nirukto gurukramaḥ 
kāmarājākhyavidyāyāstadghaṭitānāṃ vidyāntarāṇāñceti bodhyamityarthaḥ |

<304 |> mānaveti | mānavaughānāṃ niruktānāmantike guruṃ paramaguruṃ parāparaguruṃ 
parameṣṭhiguruñca yajedityarthaḥ |

<p. 662> (lopāmudrāyā gurukramaḥ)

lopāmudrākhyavidyāyāḥ pravakṣyāmi gurukramam |

(tatra divyaughāḥ)

paramādyaḥ śivāntaśca kāmeśvaryambikā tataḥ || 309 ||

divyaughaśca mahaughaśca sarvānandastataḥ param |
prajñādevī prakāśaśca divyaughe saptamo bhavet || 310 ||

(siddhaughāḥ)

divyacitraśca kaivalyadevyambā ca mahodayaḥ |
siddhaughe ca catuṣkaḥ syān (-)

(mānavaughāḥ)

			mānavaughamathocyate || 311 ||

cidviśvaśaktīśvarakāścaturtha(ḥ) kamalo bhavet |
manoharaḥ paraḥ svātmā alobhaścāṣṭamo mataḥ || 312 ||


<309-310 |> evaṃ kāmarājavidyāyā gurukramaṃ nirūpya lopāmudrāyāstadghaṭitānāṃ 
vidyāntarāṇāñca gurukramamāha(-)paramādya ityādinā | paramādyaḥ śivaḥ paramaśivaḥ | 
evañca (1) paramaśivaḥ(,) (2) kāmeśvaryambikā(,) (3) divyaughaḥ(,) (4) mahaughaḥ(,) (5) sarvānandaḥ(,) (6) 
prajñādevī(,) (7) prakāśaśceti sapta divyaughā iti paryavasyati |

