catvāraḥ siddhaughāḥ | mānavaughānāha (-) mānavetyādinā | tathāca (-) (1) cid(,) (2) viśvaḥ(,) (3) 
īśvaraḥ(,) (4) kamalaḥ(,) (5) manoharaḥ(,) (6) paraḥ(,) (7) svātmā(,) (8) alobhaḥ(,) ityaṣṭau mānavaughāḥ | 
tantrasārakṛtā tu cidviśvaśaktīśvara (-) kamalaparamānandamanoharasukhānandapratibhān | ete 
mānavaughā ityanena manoharādicatuṣṭaye nāmabhedāḥ pradarśitāḥ | jñānārṇave 
ṣoḍaśapaṭale lopāmudrāyā gurukrama itthamupadarśitaḥ (-)

<p. 663> (vidyāntarāṇām gurukramaḥ)

anyāsāṃ sarvavidyānāṃ samānā guravaḥ kramāt || 313 ||

athāparaḥ prakāraśca parādiviśva ityapi | 
kāmeśvarī tṛtīyā syāccaturthī syādathāmbikā || 314 ||


lopāmudrākhyavidyāyā gurūñ śṛṇu varānane |
paramādyaśivaścā'dyā kāmeśvaryambikā tathā ||
divyaughaśca mahaughaśca sarvānandastataḥ param |
prajñādevyambikā paścāt prakāśaḥ saptamo bhavet ||
divyāḥ parākhyaguravo lopāmudrāprabhāmayāḥ |
divyaścitraśca kaivalyadevyambā ca mahodayaḥ ||
siddhāḥ parāparā jñeyā mānavaughaṃ śṛṇu priye |
vidyā śaktiśca viśvaśca caturthaḥ komalo(?)bhavet ||
pañcamastu parānando manohara iti priye |
svātmānandaḥ saptamastu pratibho'ṣṭama ucyate ||
aparākhyā ime devi guravaḥ parikīrtitāḥ |
pūrvavad yojayet paścādaṣṭānantarameva ca ||
trayaṃ vā svaguruṃ vā'pi navāntaṃ vā'bjalocane |
dakṣiṇāmūrtiśiṣyāṇāṃ gurukrama udāhṛtaḥ ||

iti | niruktajñānārṇavavacane kaivalyadevyambeti tṛtīyagurunirdeśāt siddhaughe ca catuṣkaḥ syāditi 
mūloktacatuḥasṃkhyākatvaṃ samyagupapadyate | yattu tantrasāre divyaṃ citraṃ kaivalyaṃ 
divyāmbāṃ mahodayam ete siddhaughāḥ pañca ityanena siddhaughānāṃ pañcatvaṃ 
pratipāditam(,) taj jñānārṇavaśrītattvacintāmaṇivirodhāllekhakapramādakṛtamiti pratīmaḥ | 
mānavaugheṣvapi gurūṇāṃ parasparaṃ saṃjñābhedo dṛśyate |

<313 |> anyāsāmiti lopāmudrāghaṭitānām | samānāḥ mānavaughāntike 
mantrītyādikāmarājavidyāgurukrame pradarśitaiḥ svagurvādibhistulyā ityarthaḥ | etena 
kāmarājavidyāgurukrame ye sāmānyā guruvastatpādukāśca pūjyatayā nirdiṣṭā atrāpi krameṇa 
ta eva prayojyā ityarthaḥ | ata eva jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

sādhāraṇāstu guravaḥ sarvabhedeṣu vai samāḥ | ityuktam |

<p. 664> mokṣaścāmṛtasaṃjñaśca prakāśo ghora eva ca |
atha nāma sadguruśca siddhaughaścottaraḥ kramāt || 315 ||

udbhavaḥ paramaścaiva sarvajñastattva eva ca |
siddhastathā ca govindaḥ śaṅkaro mānavo bhavet || 316 ||

gurupaṅktivihīnastu puruṣaḥ paṅktivarjitaḥ | 
sampradāyavihīnasya na dadyāt paṅktimuttamām || 317 ||

guruṃ vinā kramaṃ yastu kurute yadi sādhakaḥ | 
mahāniṣṭaṃ bhavettasya satyaṃ satyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 318 ||

dakṣiṇāmūrtitantrasya matametadudīritam |

(āmnāyadevatāpūjanopadeśaḥ)

gurukramaṃ prapūjyātha yajedāmnāyadevatāḥ || 319 ||

(tatra pūrvāmnāyārcā)

trailokyamohane cakre sarvāśāparipūrake |
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇe cakre pūrvāmnāyaṃ samarcayet || 320 ||

(dakṣiṇāmnāyārcā)

sarvasaubhāgyade cakre tathā sarvārthasādhake |
sarvarakṣākare cakre dakṣiṇāmnāyamarcayet || 321 ||


<320 |> evaṃ gurukramārcāmabhidhāyā'mnāyadevatārcāmabhidadhānaḥ prathamaṃ 
pūrvāmnāyasamarcanakramamāha (-) trailokyetyādinā | prāgukte trailokyamohanādicakratraye 
caturasraṣoḍaśadalāṣṭadalātmake sṛṣṭicakre pūrvāmnāyaṃ samarcayedityarthaḥ | evaṃ 
dakṣiṇāmnāyādīnāmapi vakṣyamāṇarītyā cakre yathāsthānamarcanā jñeyā |

<321 |> sarvasaubhāgyade caturdaśāre(,) sarvārthasādhake vahirdaśāre(,) sarvarakṣākare'ntardaśāre | 
etattritaye dakṣiṇāmnāyamarcayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 665> (paścimāmnāyārcā)

madhyacakre yajeddevīṃ paścimāmnāyanāyikām | 

(uttarāmnāyārcā)

aṣṭacakre yajeddevīmuttarāmnāyanāyikām || 322 ||

(adha-āmnāyārcā)

sarvasiddhiprade cakre adha(-)āmnāyamarcayet |

(ūrdhvāmnāyārcā)

sarvāmnāyamaye cakra ūrdhvāmnāyaṃ prapūjayet || 323 ||

(tarpaṇam)

pūrvoktamantrayogeṇa tataḥ santarpayet kramāt || 324 ||

(pañcapañcikāḥ, tatra pañcalakṣmyaḥ)

śrīvidyā ca tathā lakṣmīrmahālakṣmīstathaiva ca |
triśaktiḥ sarvasāmrājyalakṣmīḥ pañca prakīrtitāḥ || 325 || 


<322 |> madhyacakra iti | madhyacakratraye (-)

madhyacakratraye devi paścimāmnāyamarcayet |

iti jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale vyaktamabhidhānāt | madhyacakratrayañca sarvarogaharacakram 
aṣṭakoṇātmakam(,) sarvasiddhipradacakraṃ trikoṇātmakam(,) sarvānandamayacakraṃ 
madhyabindvātmakam | aṣṭacakra iti | atra (-)

navacakreṣu deveśi kauberāmnāyamarcayet |

iti jñānārṇave pāṭhaḥ |

<323 |> sarvasiddhiprada iti | niruktamadhyatrikoṇa ityarthaḥ | sarveti | sarvāmnāyamaye cakre 
madhyabindvātmakasarvānandamayacakra ityarthaḥ | tantrasārakārairapi vaindavacakre 
ūrdhvāmnāyārcā'bhihitā | jñānārṇavatantrasārayoradha(-)āmnāyārcākramo na dṛśyate(,) 
āmnāyārcākramastu tantrasārādāvanusandheyaḥ |

<325 | > atha pañcapañcikārcāmabhidhāsyan prathamapañcalakṣmīrnirūpayati(-)śrīvidyeti |

<p. 666> (pañca kośāḥ)

śrīvidyā ca paraṃjyotiḥ parā niṣkalaśāmbhavī |
ajapā mātṛkā ceti pañca kośāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 326 ||

(pañca kalpalatāḥ)

śrīvidyā tvaritā ceti pārijāteśvarī tathā | 
tripuṭā pañcakāmeśī pañca kalpalatāḥ smṛtāḥ || 327 ||

(pañca kāmadughāḥ)

śrīvidyā mṛtapīṭheśī sudhāśrīramṛteśvarī |
annapūrṇeti vikhyātāḥ pañca kāmadughāḥ smṛtāḥ || 328 ||

(pañcaratnāḥ)

śrīvidyā siddhalakṣmīśca mātaṅgī bhuvaneśvarī |
vārāhīti ca saṃproktāḥ pañcaratnāḥ prakīrtitāḥ || 329 ||


śrīvidyā lakṣmīrmahālakṣmīstriśaktiḥ sarvasāmrājyeti pañca lakṣmyaḥ | atra jñānārṇave 
ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

śrīvidyā ca tathā lakṣmīrmahālakṣmīstathaiva ca | 
triśaktiḥ sarvasāmrājyā pañca lakṣmyaḥ prakīrtitāḥ || iti pāṭhaḥ |

<326 |> śrīvidyeti | jñānārṇave tu pañcalakṣmīnirūpaṇāt pūrvaṃ pañcakośanirūpaṇaṃ 
dṛśyate | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam |

<328 |> kāmadughāḥ kāmadhenavaḥ | tathāca jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale(-)
śrīvidyetyādisamānānupūrvīkavacane pañca kāmadughāḥ smṛtā ityatra pañcaitāḥ 
kāmadhenava iti pāṭho dṛśyate | tripurārcanarahasye tu kāmadughetyeva pāṭho vākye viniyuktaḥ 
|

<p. 667> (pañcapañcikārcāsthānam)

śrīvidyāpūjanasthāne cakrarāje mahodaye |
mahākoṣeśvarīvṛndamaṇḍitāsanasaṃsthitā || 330 ||

(pañcapañcikārcākramaḥ)

sarvasaubhāgyajananīṃ pādukāṃ pūjayāmi ca |
ityuccārya paraṃjyotiḥkośāḍhyāṃ(?) paripūjayet || 331 ||

anenaiva vidhānena pūjayet pañcapañcikām | 

(nigamanam)

evaṃ saṃpūjya sakalaṃ śrīvidyāṃ parito yajet || 332 ||

(tarpaṇam)

tarpaṇāni punaḥ kuryāt triḥ sakṛdvā yathecchayā | 

(aṇimādiprakaṭayoginīdhyānam)

aṇimādyā raktavarṇāstrinetrāḥ śaśiśekharāḥ || 333 || 

savyadakṣiṇahastābhyāṃ vidhṛtābhayapustikāḥ |
trailokyamohane cakre dhyāyet prakaṭayoginīm(?)(ḥ) || 334 ||


<330 |> śrīvidyeti | śrīvidyāpūjanasthāne baindavacakre ityarthaḥ(,)

śrīvidyāpūjanasthāne baindave pañcapañcikāḥ |

iti tripurārcanarahasye vyaktamabhidhānāt |

<331 |> niruktapañcapañcikāpūjanakramamāha (-) sarveti | viśeṣastu jñānārṇave 
ṣoḍaśapaṭale'nusandheyaḥ | paraṃjyotiḥkośāḍhyāmiti lakṣmīviśeṣaṇam(,) parajyotirmayīmityarthaḥ | 
kośādyāmiti jñānārṇavapāṭhe tu pañcakośādipañcapañcikāmityarthaḥ(,) tatra 
pañcakośānāmeva prathamaṃ nirūpaṇam |

<333-334 |> athāṇimādiprakaṭayoginīdhyānamāha (-) aṇimetyādinā | trailokyamohane ṣoḍaśadalād 
bahirvṛttatrayātmake cakre ityarthaḥ | spaṣṭamidaṃ prakaraṇam |

<p. 668> (aṇimādyarcāsthānam)

aṇimāṃ paścimadvāri dakṣabhāge prapūjayet |
laghimāmuttaradvāri paścime paripūjayet || 335 ||

pūrvadvāre ca mahimāmuttare tu samarcayet |
dakṣiṇadvāradeśe ca īśitvākhyāñca pūrvataḥ || 336 ||

vaśitvākhyāñca vāyavye prākāmyasiddhimīśake |
muktisiddhiṃ tathā'gneyyāmicchāsiddhiñca nair(-)ṛte || 337 ||

adhastāt prāptisiddhiñca sarvakāmaṃ tadūrdhvataḥ |

(asitāṅgādyaṣṭabhairavadhyānopadeśaḥ)

madhyadvāre tato dhyāyet paścimādikrameṇa tu || 338 ||

(asitāṅgādyaṣṭabhairavanirūpaṇam)

asitāṅgaṃ ruruṃ caṇḍaṃ krodhamunmattabhairavam |
kapālinaṃ bhīṣaṇañca saṃhārañcāṣṭabhairavam || 339 ||

(bhairavāṇāṃ dhyānam)

ete śyāmāstrinayanā bhṛkuṭībhīṣaṇānanāḥ |
śūlaṃ daṇḍañca vetālaṃ kapālaṃ kṣudraghaṇṭikām |
vidhṛtā vedahastena gajacarmottarāṃśukāḥ || 340 ||


<338 |> madhyeti | atra prakaṭayoginīdhyānāvasare'sitāṅgādibhairavadhyānopadeśo 
bhrāhmyādyaṣṭaśaktipūjārthaḥ | vakṣyati ca (-) bhairavāṅkasthitā etā pūjyā vai bhairavaiḥ 
saheti (349 ślo.) | madhyadvāre madhyacaturasrasya dvāracatuṣṭaye paścimādikrameṇa dhyāyediti 
sambandhaḥ |

<p. 669> (aṣṭaśaktīnāṃ dhyānam, tatra brahmāṇyāḥ)

brahmāṇī pītavarṇā ca caturbhiḥ śobhitā mukhaiḥ |
varadābhayahastā ca kuṇḍikākṣalasatkarāḥ || 341 ||

(māheśvaryāḥ)

māheśvarī śvetavarṇā trinetrā śūladhāriṇī |
kapālamālāṃ paraśuṃ dadhānā siddhidāyinī || 342 ||

(kaumāryāḥ)

kaumārī pītavarṇā ca śaktitomaradhāriṇī |
varadābhayahastā ca dhyātavyā sādhakottamaiḥ || 343 ||

(vaiṣṇavyāḥ)

vaiṣṇavī śyāmalacchāyā śaṅkhacakragadākarā |
bibhratī karapadmañca divyabhūṣaṇabhūṣitā || 344 ||

(vārāhyāḥ)

vārāhī śyāmalacchāyā varāhavadanā śubhā |
halañca mūṣalaṃ khaḍgaṃ kheṭakaṃ dadhatī bhujaiḥ || 345 ||

(indrāṇyāḥ)

indrāṇī śyāmalacchāyā raktotpalalasatkarā || 346 ||

(cāmuṇḍāyāḥ)

cāmuṇḍā kṛṣṇavarṇā ca śūlaṃ ḍamarumeva ca |
khaḍgaṃ vetālakañcaiva vidhṛtā dakṣiṇairbhujaiḥ |
nagakheṭakaghaṇṭāñca dadhānoccaiḥ kapālakam || 347 ||

(mahālakṣmyāḥ)

mahālakṣmīstu pītābhā padmaṃ darpaṇameva ca |
mātuluṅgaphalañcaiva dadhānā parameśvarī || 348 ||

<p. 670> (niruktāṣṭaśaktīnāṃ pūjāyāṃ viśeṣaḥ)

bhairavāṅkasthitā etāḥ pūjyā vai bhairavaiḥ saha || 349 ||

(pūjāsthānam)

mahendrādīśaparyantaṃ pūjayet kramato'thavā |
paścimottaramāhendradakṣadvāre krameṇa tu || 350 ||

vāyvīśavahnirakṣaḥsthayugmāyugmasvaraiḥ saha |

(mantre viśeṣaḥ)

hrasvārṇā bhairavā mantrā mātṝṇāṃ dīrgharūpakāḥ || 351 ||

(mudrārcā)

antardvāre pratīcyādyāḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇādikāḥ |
raktāḥ pāśāṅkuśadharā dhyātvā tattanmanuṃ smaran || 352 ||


<349 |> atha niruktānāṃ brāhmyādyaṣṭaśaktīnāṃ pūjāyāṃ viśeṣamāha(-)bhairaveti | 
bhairavāṅkasthitāḥ prāguktāsitāṅgādyaṣṭabhairavakroḍasthitā etā brāhmyādyaṣṭaśaktayaḥ 
bhairavairasitāṅgādibhiḥ saha pūjyā ityarthaḥ |

<350-351 |> athāṣṭaśaktīnāṃ pūjāsthānaṃ viśiṣya nirūpayati (-) mahendrāditi | evañca pūrvataḥ 
prādakṣiṇyeneśānakoṇāntaṃ krameṇa pūjayedityarthaḥ | kramāntaramāha (-) athaveti | evañca 
paścimādidakṣiṇāntadvāracatuṣṭaye vāyavyādinair(-)ṛtāntakoṇacatuṣṭaye ca pūjayedityarthaḥ | 
yugmeti | ayugmasvaraiḥ prathamatṛtīyādibhiḥ(,) yugmasvaraiḥ dvitīyacaturthādibhiśca saha pūjayediti 
sambandhaḥ | imameva svaravibhāgaṃ viśinaṣṭi (-) hrasvārṇā iti | evañca bhairavamantrādau 
akārādihrasvasvarān aṣṭaśaktimantrādāvākārādidīrghasvarān yojayedityarthaḥ | 
yadyapyekādaśādisvareṣu hrasvārṇatvaṃ vyabhicarati tathā'pi hrasvārṇā ityasya dvayordvayoḥ 
pūrvapūrvasvaropalakṣakatvādadoṣaḥ |

<352-353 |> antardvāre abhyantaracaturasradvāracatuṣṭaye pratīcyādyāḥ paścimādi (-)

<p. 671> prapūjayettrikhaṇḍāntu vāgbhavaṃ bījamuccaran |

(mudrārcāyāṃ diṅniyamaḥ)

paścimādikrameṇaiva pūrvavaddigvidikṣu ca || 353 ||

(tatra viśeṣaḥ)

ūrdhvādhaḥkramayogeṇa khecarīṃ yonimarcayet |

(nigamanam)

etāḥ prakaṭayoginyaḥ pāntu tricaturasragāḥ || 354 ||

(cakrārcā)

trailokyamohanaṃ nāma cakraṃ saṃpūjayettataḥ | 

(tripurāyāḥ svarūpaṃ pūjanañca)

prathamāvaraṇe devīṃ tripurāṃ cakranāyikām || 355 ||

pāśāṅkuśakarāṃ raktāṃ trinetrāṃ paricintayet | 

(aṇimāsiddhyādyarcā)

aṇimāsiddhipurataḥ pūjayettanmanuṃ smaran |
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīṃ kṛtvā buddhañca paripūjayet || 356 ||


sthitāḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇādikāḥ prāgupadarśitā mudrāḥ prapūjayet ityarthaḥ | tattanmanuṃ 
smaranniti prāguktakrameṇa bījamuccārya sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīmudrāśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmītyādirūpaḥ prayogaḥ kartavya ityarthaḥ | paścimādīti | pūrvavat 
prāguktāṣṭaśaktipūjanakrameṇetyarthaḥ |

<354 |> khecarīyonimudrayorviśeṣamāha(-)ūrdhvādha iti | ūrdhvadvāre khecarīmudrāmadhaśca 
yonimudrāmarcayedityarthaḥ | tricaturasragā iti prāguktacaturasratrayasthitāḥ |

<355-356 |> trailokyeti | trailokyamohanacakrāya nama iti pūjayet | evameva tripurārcanarahasye'pi | 
tantrasāre tu trailokyamohanacaturasracakrāya nama iti prayoga uktaḥ | prathamāvaraṇa iti | (aṃ 
āṃ sauḥ) tripureśvarīcakranāyikāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti prayogaḥ | aṇimeti | pūrvaṃ 
yadaṇimāsiddheḥ sthānaṃ darśitaṃ tatraiva paścimadvāre sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīmudrāṃ 
pūjayedityarthaḥ | vyaktamāha jñānārṇave (-)

<p. 672> (bauddhamantraḥ)

praṇavañca tatastāre caṇḍāre bhairavadvayam |
vahnijāyānigadito bauddhamantro manīṣibhiḥ || 357 ||

(buddhataddarśanayorarcā)

buddhāya bauddhapūrvāya darśanāya namaḥ param || 358 ||

(devyai pūjārpaṇam)

etāḥ prakaṭayoginya iti trailokyamohane |
cakre samudrā iti ca sasiddhayastu sāyudhāḥ || 359 ||

savāhanāḥ savarṇādyāḥ parivārāḥ sapūrvikāḥ | 
tataḥ sarvopacāraiśca pūjitāḥ santu coccaran || 360 ||

(pūjāsamarpaṇadravyam)

arghyodakākṣataiḥ puṣpairdevyai pūjāṃ samarpayet |

(guptayoginīnāṃ svarūpamarcākramaśca)

javākusumasaṅkāśāḥ kāmākarṣaṇikādikāḥ || 361 ||


aṇimāsiddhipurataḥ sarvakāryārthasādhikām |
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīṃ mudrāṃ darśayet kamalānane || iti |

tatraivāṇimāsiddhiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti prayogaḥ | tathā 
sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīmudrāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti prayogaḥ |

<357 |> buddhañca paripūjayedityuktam(,) tadbuddhamantramāha(-)praṇavañcetyādinā |

<359-360 |> atha devyai prakaṭayoginīpūjāsamarpaṇamupadiśati (-) etā ityādinā | tathāca etāḥ 
prakaṭayoginyastrailokyamohane cakre samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ 
sarvopacāraiḥ pūjitāḥ santu iti prayogaḥ | tatrasāre tu pūjitāstarpitāḥ santu iti prayogo dṛśyate 
| sa tu niruktapramāṇavirodhitayā nātra pradarśitaḥ |

<361-362 |> atha ṣoḍaśadale sarvāśāparipūrakacakre vakṣyamāṇānāṃ guptayoginīnāṃ

<p. 673> pāśaśūladharāḥ pūjyā vāmāvartena ṣoḍaśa |
paścimādikrameṇāpi binduyuktaiḥ svaraiḥ saha || 362 ||

(kāmākarṣiṇyādiṣoḍaśaguptayoginyaḥ)

kāmākarṣaṇarūpāñca buddhyākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm |
ahaṅkārākarṣaṇīñca śabdākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm || 363 ||


pūjanamabhidhāsyan tāsāṃ svarūpamāha (-) javetyādinā | vāmāvarteneti | paścimādikrameṇa 
sabindukaiḥ svaraiḥ krameṇādita ekaikaśo niveśitaiḥ svaraiḥ saha pūjayediti sambandhaḥ(;) taduktaṃ 
jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

paścimādivilomena ṣoḍaśāre svarānvitāḥ |
etā nityāḥ kalāḥ pūjyāḥ sravatpīyūṣamaṇḍalāḥ ||

iti | evañca aṃ kāmākarṣiṇīnityākalāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | āṃ 
buddhyākarṣiṇīnityākalāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ ityādirūpaḥ prayogaḥ kartavya iti 
jñeyaḥ | dvitāryādiprayogastu pūrvavadeva |

<363-365 |> atha kāmākarṣiṇyādiṣoḍaśaguptayoginīrnirūpayati (-) kāmākarṣaṇa (-)

<p. 674> sparśākarṣaṇarūpāñca rūpākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm |
smṛtyākarṣaṇarūpāñca nāmākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm || 364 ||

bījākarṣaṇarūpāñca ātmākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm |
amṛtākarṣiṇīṃ devīṃ śarīrākarṣiṇīṃ tathā || 365 ||

(tāsāmarcāsthānam)

etāstu guptayoginyaḥ sarvāśāparipūrake |

(cakrapūjā)

sarvāśāpūrakaṃ nāma cakraṃ saṃpūjayettataḥ || 366 ||

(cakranāyikārcā)

kāmākarṣaṇarūpāyāḥ puratastripureśvarīm |
dvitīyāvaraṇe mantrī trinetrāṃ cakranāyikām || 367 ||


rūpāñcetyādinā | atra mūloktaḥ pāṭhaḥ prāmādika iti jñānārṇavatantrānusāreṇa 
guptayoginīnāṃ nāmāni nirdiśyante | yathā jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

kāmākarṣiṇikāṃ devi buddhyākarṣiṇīkāṃ tathā |
ahaṅkārākarṣiṇīñca śabdākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm ||
sparśākarṣiṇī(?)rūpāñca rūpākarṣiṇi(?)rūpiṇīm |
rasākarṣakarīñcaiva gandhākarṣaṇakāriṇīm ||
cittākarṣiṇikāṃ tadvad dhairyākarṣiṇikāṃ priye |
nāmākarṣiṇikāñcaiva bījākarṣiṇikāntathā ||
amṛtākarṣiṇīñcaiva smṛtyākarṣiṇikāṃ priye |
śarīrākarṣiṇīñcaiva ātmākarṣaṇarūpiṇīm ||
paścimādivilomena ṣoḍaśāre svarānvitāḥ |
etā nityāḥ kalāḥ pūjyāḥ sravatpīyūṣamaṇḍalāḥ ||

iti | amṛtānandanāthakṛtāyāṃ yoginīhṛdayaṭīkāyāṃ tantrasāre ca yoginīnāmāsāṃ pūjane 
paurvāparyakramabhedo dṛśyate |

<366 |> sarvāśeti | sarvāśāparipūrakacakrāya namaḥ iti prayogaḥ |

<367 |> atha niruktacakranāyikārcāmāha (-) kāmeti | kāmākarṣaṇarūpāyāḥ

<p. 675> pāśaśūladharāṃ devīṃ tasya mantreṇa pūjayet |

(mudrādarśanam brahmaṇaḥ pūjanañca)

sarvavidrāvaṇīṃ kṛtvā brahmāṇaṃ paripūjayet || 368 ||

(pūjāmantraḥ)

patṛtīyaṃ vahniyutaṃ śeṣākhyendusamanvitam |

(darśanārcā)

brahmaṇe vaidiketyuktvā darśanāya namaḥ smaran || 369 ||

(pūjāsamarpaṇam)

athaitā guptayoginyaḥ sarvāśāparipūrake |
cakre samudrā ityādipūrvavanmanunā'munā |
samarpya mūladevyaitāṃ pūjāmarghyodakādibhiḥ || 370 ||


prathamayoginyāḥ puratastripureśvarīṃ cakranāyikāṃ pūjayediti sambandhaḥ | tathāca 
jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

cakreśvarīṃ yajed devīṃ tripureśīṃ samṛddhidām |
kāmākarṣaṇarūpāyāḥ purataḥ pūjayet priye |

iti | prayogastu dvitāryādyanyatamānantaraṃ tripureśvarīcakranāyikāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi 
namaḥ iti | tantrasāre tu pūrvataḥ aiṃ klīṃ sauriti bījatrayayoga uktaḥ |

<368-369 |> sarvavidrāvaṇīmiti | pūrvopadarśitāṃ sarvāvidrāvaṇīmudrāṃ pradarśyetyarthaḥ | 
brahmaṇo mantramāha (-) patṛtīyamiti | pakārasya tṛtīyo varṇo vakāraḥ sa ca vahninā rakāreṇa 
yuktaḥ | śeṣākhyeṇa dvitīyasvareṇa indunā bindunā ca samanvitaḥ | etena brāṃ iti prāptam | 
evañca brāṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ iti brahmāṇaṃ paripūjayet iti phalitārthaḥ | vaidiketi | 
vaidikadarśanāya namaḥ iti prayogaḥ |

<370 |> atha devyai pūjāsamarpaṇamāha (-) athaitā ityādinā | evañca (-) etā guptayoginyaḥ 
sarvāśāparipūrake cakre samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ pūjitāḥ 
santu iti prayogaḥ |

<p. 676> (guptatarayoginīnāmarcā svarūpañca)

aṣṭapatre yajenmantrī kādivargāṣṭakena ca || 371 ||

anaṅgakusumāraktā raktavastrāstrilocanāḥ |
akṣasrakpustakābhītivaradāḍhyakarāmbujāḥ || 372 ||

anaṅgakusumāṃ pūrve dakṣiṇe'naṅgamekhalām |
paścime'naṅgamadanāmuttare madanāturām || 373 ||

anaṅgarekhāñcā'gneyyāṃ nair(-)ṛte'naṅgaveginīm | 
anaṅgāṅkuśāntu vāyavye śambhau cānaṅgamālinīm || 374 ||

(āsāṃ tṛtīyāvaraṇavṛttitvam)

etā guptatarāḥ sarvāstṛtīyāvaraṇe sthitāḥ |

(cakrārcā)

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇaṃ cakramaṣṭārañca prapūjayet || 375 ||


<371-372 |> evaṃ ṣoḍaśadale sarvāśāparipūrakacakre kāmākarṣiṇyādīnāṃ pūjanamabhidhāya 
tadantaraṣṭadale sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇacakre'naṅgakusumādīnāṃ guptatarayoginīnāṃ pūjanamāha (-) 
aṣṭapatra ityādinā | kādīti | kādivargāṇāmekaikaṃ sabindukamādau yojayitvā pūjayedityuttaratra 
darśayiṣyāmaḥ | anaṅgakusumārakteti spaṣṭam | atra anaṅgakusumāraktetyādinā 
prāthamyādanaṅgakusumāyāḥ svarūpaṃ pradarśitam(,) anyāsāmapi svarūpamidameva bodhyam | 
yoginīhṛdaye tṛtīyapaṭale (-)

anaṅgakusumādyāstu raktakañcukaśobhitāḥ |
veṇīkṛtalasatkeśāścāpabāṇadharāḥ śubhāḥ ||

ityabhinnarūpatādarśanāt |

<373-374 |> pūjāsthānamāha (-) anaṅgetyādinā | pūrve pūrvapatre yajediti sambandhaḥ | 
evamanyatrāpi | evañca kaṃ khaṃ gaṃ ghaṃ ṅaṃ anaṅgakusumādevīśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmītyādirūpaḥ prayogaḥ | tritāryādiprayogastu pūrvavadeva | kādivargāṣṭakapūrvakatvaṃ 
vyaktamāha jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

<p. 677> (cakranāyikārcā)

anaṅgakusumāgre tu cakreśīṃ sundarīṃ yajet || 376 ||

(mudrāpradarśanam, śivārcā)

tata ākarṣiṇīṃ kṛtvā prāsādena śivaṃ yajet |

(darśanārcā)

śivāya śaivarūpāya darśanāya namaḥ smaran || 377 ||


sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇe cakre yajed guptatarābhidhāḥ |
anaṅgakusumāṃ prācyāṃ ka(-)vargeṇa prapūjayet ||
dakṣiṇe ca ca(-)vargeṇa tathā cānaṅgamekhalām |
anaṅgamadanāṃ paścāṭṭa(-)vargeṇa prapūjayet ||
ta(-)vargeṇottare paścādanaṅgamadanāturām |
anaṅgarekhāmāgneye pa(-)vargeṇa prapūjayet ||
rākṣase'naṅgavegāntu ya(-)vargeṇa prapūjayet ||
vāyavye tu śa(-)vargeṇa tathā'naṅgāṅkuśāṃ yajet |
īśānye la(-)kṣa(-)vargeṇa pūjyā'naṅgādimālinī ||

iti | atrānaṅgādimālinī anaṅgamālinītyarthaḥ | sarveti | tathāca sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇāṣṭāracakrāya 
nama iti prayogaḥ |

<376 |> cakreśvarīpūjanamāha (-) anaṅgeti | anaṅgakusumāyāḥ prathamayoginyā agre cakreśvarīṃ 
tripurasundarīṃ pūjayedityarthaḥ | tathāca jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

cakreśvarīṃ yajeddevīṃ tatastripurasundarīm |
anaṅgakusumāgre ca sarvasāmrājyadāyinīm ||

iti | atra tantrasārakṛtā tritārīprayogānantaram ai(/) klīṃ sauḥ 
tripurasundarīcakranāyikāśripādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ iti prayogo darśitaḥ |

<377 |> tata iti | tataścakreśvarīpūjanānantaram ākarṣiṇīṃ kṛtvā sarvākarṣiṇīmudrāṃ 
pradarśyetyarthaḥ sarvākarṣaṇamudrāñca darśayet suravandite iti jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale

<p. 678> (pūjāsamarpaṇam)

etā guptataretyuktvā yoginya iti śabdataḥ |
sarvasaṃkṣobhavarṇānte kārake cakra ityapi || 378 ||

samudretyādisarvañca pūrvavat parikalpayet |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ nāma sṛṣṭicakratrayātmakam || 379 ||

(satsampradāyayoginīnāmarcā)

caturdaśāracakre tu pūjayet paścimakramāt |
vāmāvartena mantrajñaḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇādikāḥ ||

(tāsāṃ svarūpam)

sūryakāntapratīkāśā dhanurbāṇakarāmbujāḥ || 380 ||

(caturdaśa satsampradāyayoginyaḥ)

sarvasaṃkṣobhiṇīṃ śaktiṃ sarvavidrāvaṇīṃ tathā |
sarvākarṣaṇaśaktiñca sarvāhlādanakāriṇīm || 381 ||


vyaktamabhidhānāt | anena sarvākarṣiṇīmudrāyāḥ pradarśanameva pratīyate natu pūjanam | atra 
tantrasārakṛtā sarvākarṣiṇīmudrāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ iti yat pūjanamuktaṃ 
tatrānukūlaṃ pramāṇaṃ kimapi nopalabhyate | prasādena hauṃ iti prasādabījena | hauṃ 
śivāya namaḥ | śaivadarśanāya namaḥ iti | tantrasāre tu jitendradarśanāya namaḥ iti dṛśyate |

<378-379 |> etā iti | tathāca etā guptatarayoginyaḥ sarvasaṃkṣobhakārake cakre samudrāḥ 
sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ sarvopacāraiḥ pūjitāḥ santu iti mūladevyai 
prāguktakrameṇa pūjāṃ samarpayet |

<380 |> atha caturdaśāre sarvasaubhāgyadāyakacakre sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyādiśaktīnāṃ 
satsampradāyayoginīnāṃ pūjanamāha (-) caturdaśāretyādinā | etāsāṃ dhyānamāha (-) sūryeti 
|

<381-383 |> sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīśaktyādicaturdaśasatsampradāyayoginīrāha (-) sarva (-)

<p. 679> sarvasammohanīṃ śaktiḥ sarvastambhanarūpiṇīm |
sarvajṛmbhaṇaśaktiṃ ca sarvatovaśakāriṇīm |
sarvarañjanaśaktiñca sarvonmādasvarūpiṇīm || 382 || 

sarvārthasādhinīṃ śaktiṃ sarvasampattipūraṇīm | 
sarvamantramayīṃ śaktiṃ sarvadvandvakṣayaṅkarīm || 383 ||

(etāsāṃ prathamāvaraṇavṛttitvam)

satsampradāyayoginyaḥ prathamāvaraṇe sthitāḥ | 

(arcākramaścakrapūjanañca)

kādiḍhāntākṣarairiṣṭvā sarvasaubhāgyadaṃ yajet || 384 ||

(etaccakranāyikāyāḥ pūjanaṃ svarūpañca)

sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīṃ śaktiṃ purataḥ puravāsinīm |


saṃkṣobhaṇīmityādinā sarvadvandvakṣayaṅkarīmityantena | sarvatra pūjayediti pūrveṇa sambandhaḥ 
|

<384 |> pūjane yoginīnāṃ purato varṇayojanamāha (-) kādīti | kakārādi(-)ḍhakārāntāni 
caturdaśākṣarāṇi sabindukāni krameṇaikaikaśaḥ pūrvato yojayitvā'rcayediti bodhyam(,) tathā ca 
dvitāryādyanyatamaprayogānantaraṃ kaṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīśaktiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | 
khaṃ sarvavidrāvaṇīśaktiśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ ityādirūpāḥ prayogā jñeyāḥ | 
pūjanantu vāmāvartena kartavyam(,)

sarvasaubhāgyade cakre paścimādivilomataḥ |
vāmamārgeṇa deveśi saṃpūjyāḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ ||

iti jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale viśiṣyābhidhānāt | sarveti | tathāca 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyakacaturdaśāracakrāya nama iti prayogaḥ |

<385 |> sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīmiti | niruktāsu caturdaśayoninīṣu prathamāyāḥ 
sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇīśaktyāḥ purataḥ puravāsinīṃ tripuravāsinīṃ pūjayet | tathāca 
tripuravāsinīcakranāyikā (-)

<p. 680> himakundendudhavalāṃ śrīcakranāyikāṃ parām |
pāśāṅkuśavarābhītikarāṃ pīnapayodharām || 385 ||

(mudrāpradarśanaṃ sūryapūjanañca)

vaśyamudrāṃ darśayitvā sūryaṃ tanmanunā yajet |

(darśanārcā)

sūryāya saurapūrvāya darśanāya namaḥ smaran || 386 ||

(pūjāsamarpaṇam)

etāḥ sampradāyayoginyaḥ sarvasaubhāgyadāyake |
cakre samudrā ityādi pūrvavat parikalpayet || 387 ||

(kulakaulikayoginīnāṃ svarūpaṃ sthāpanañca)

varābhayakarāḥ śvetāḥ sarvasiddhipradāyikāḥ |
sarvārthasādhake cakre pañcamāvaraṇe sthitāḥ || 388 ||


śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti prayogaḥ | tantrasāre tu pūrvataḥ haiṃ haḥ klīṃ hasauḥ iti 
bījacatuṣṭayayogo dṛśyate |

<386 |> vaśyeti | prāgupadarśitāṃ sarvavaśyakarīṃ mudrāṃ pradarśyetyarthaḥ | sūryamiti | 
sūryaṃ saṃpūjya sauradarśanāya nama iti pūjayet ityarthaḥ | tantrasāre tu atra sāṃkhya(-)
mīmāṃsānyāyadarśanebhyo nama iti dṛśyate |

<387 |> etā iti | tathāca etāḥ saṃpradāyayoginyaḥ sarvasaubhāgyadāyake cakre samudrāḥ 
sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ sarvopacāraiḥ pūjitāḥ santu iti 
pūrvavanmūladevyai pūjāṃ samarpayet |

<388 |> atha bahirdaśāre sarvārthasādhakacakre kulakaulikayoginīnāṃ pūjanamabhidhāsyan tāsāṃ 
svarūpamāha (-) vareti | sarveti | evaṃlakṣaṇā vakṣyamāṇāḥ 
sarvasiddhipradādikulakaulikayoginyaḥ pañcamāvaraṇe bahirdaśāre sthitā ityarthaḥ | taduktaṃ 
jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

<p. 681> (pūjāparipāṭī)

ṇādibhāntākṣaraṃ dattvā paścimādikramād yajet || 389 ||

(daśa kulakaulikayoginyaḥ)

sarvasiddhipradāṃ devīṃ sarvasampatpradāṃ tathā | 
sarvapriyaṅkarīñcaiva sarvamaṅgalakāriṇīm || 390 ||

sarvakāmapradāṃ devīṃ sarvaduḥkhapramocinīm |
sarvamṛtyupraśamanīṃ sarvavighnavināśinīm || 391 ||

sarvāṅgasundarīṃ devīṃ sarvasaubhāgyadāyinīm |

(etāsāṃ pūjanopadeśaḥ)

kulakaulikayoginya etāstu paripūjayet || 392 ||

(cakrārcā)

sarvārthasādhakaṃ cakraṃ tataḥ pūrvoktalakṣaṇam |

(cakranāyikārcā)

sarvasiddhipradāgre tu nāyikāṃ tripurāśriyam || 393 ||


sarvārthasādhake cakre daśāre kulayoginīḥ |
pūjayet sarvakāryārthasiddhidāḥ pañcame kramāt || iti |

<389 |> athaitāsāṃ pūjāparipāṭīmāha (-)ṇādīti | ṇakārādibhakārāntadaśākṣarāṇi sabindukāni 
ekaikaśaḥ krameṇā'dau niyojya paścimato vāmāvartena pūjayet |

paścimādivilomena daśāre pūjayedimāḥ |

iti jñānārṇave ṣoḍaśapaṭale viśiṣyābhidhānāt | tathāca dvitāryādyanyatamānantaraṃ ṇaṃ 
sarvasiddhipradādevīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | taṃ sarvasampatpradādevīśrīpādukāṃ 
pūjayāmi nama ityādirūpaḥ prayogaḥ |

	atha daśa kulakaulikayoginīrāha (-) sarvasiddhipradāmityādinā 
sarvasaubhāgyadāyinīmityantena | sarveti sarvāthasādhakabahirdaśāracakrāya namaḥ iti prayogaḥ |

<393-394 |> cakreśvarīpūjanamāha (-) sarvasiddhīti | sarvasiddhipradāyāḥ prathamayoginyāḥ 
purataścakranāyikāṃ tripurāśriyaṃ pūjayet | tathāca tripurāśrīcakranāyikā (-)

<p. 682> (mudrāpradarśanādi)

sandarśyonmādinīṃ mudrāṃ nārāyaṇaṃ prapūjayet |
namo nārāyaṇaṃ ṅe'ntaṃ praṇavādyamathāpi vā |
viṣṇave vaiṣṇavānte ca darśanāya natiṃ smaran || 394 ||

etāḥ padaṃ samuddhṛtya kulakaulikapadaṃ tataḥ |
yoginya iti sarvārthasādhake cakra ityapi |
tataḥ samudrā ityādipūrvavat parikalpayet || 395 ||

(nigarbhayoginīnāṃ svarūpaṃ sthānañca)

pustābhayajñānamudrā akṣasūtrakarāḥ sitāḥ |
sarvarakṣākare cakre nigarbhayoginīgaṇāḥ || 396 ||

(pūjāparipāṭī)

paścimādikramādetā mādikṣāntākṣarairyajet |

(daśa nigarbhayoginyaḥ)

sarvajñāṃ sarvaśaktiñca sarvaiśvaryapradāyinīm || 397 ||


śrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti prayogaḥ | tantrasāre tu tritāryanantaram ādau hasaiṃ hasaklīṃ 
hasauriti bījayogo dṛśyate | sandarśyeti | unmādinīṃ sarvonmādinīṃ prāguktalakṣaṇām | 
nārāyaṇamiti(,) oṃ namo nārāyaṇāyetyaṣṭākṣaramantreṇa viṣṇave nama ityanena vā 
pūjayedityarthaḥ | vaiṣṇava iti | vaiṣṇavadarśanāya nama iti darśanaṃ pūjayet | 

<395 |> etā iti | tathāca etāḥ kulakaulikayoginyaḥ sarvārthasādhake cakre samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ 
sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ sarvopacāraiḥ pūjitāḥ santu iti prayogaḥ |

<396-397 |> athāntardaśāre sarvarakṣākaracakre sarvajñādīnāṃ nigarbhayoginīnāṃ 
pūjanamabhidadhānastāsāṃ svarūpamāha (-) pusteti | paścimeti | paścimato vāmāvartenaitāḥ 
pūjayet | 

paścimādivilomena pūjayet paṅktiyonike |

iti | mādikṣāntākṣarairiti | pūrvavanmakārādikṣakārāntadaśākṣarāṇyekaikaśaḥ krameṇa

<p. 683> sarvajñānamayīṃ devīṃ sarvavyādhivināśinīm |
sarvādhārasvarūpāñca sarvapāpaharāṃ tathā || 398 ||

sarvānandamayīṃ devīṃ sarvarakṣāsvarūpiṇīm | 
gandhādyairupacāraistu sarvepsitaphalapradām || 399 ||

(cakrārcā cakranāyikārcā)

sarvarakṣākaraṃ cakraṃ dhyāyechrīcakranāyikām |
sarvajñāpurato mantrī tripurāmālinīṃ parām || 400 ||

pāśāṅkuśadhanurbāṇadharāṃ śvetāmbujaśriyam |

(mudrāpradarśanādi)

mahāṅkuśākhyaṃ sandarśya jineśaṃ viṣṇumarcayet || 401 ||

(pūjāsamarpaṇam)

etā nigarbhayoginyaḥ sarvarakṣākare padāt |
cakre samudrā ityādi pūrvavat parikalpayet || 402 ||


ādito niyojya yajedityarthaḥ | tathāca maṃ sarvajñādevīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ | yaṃ 
sarvaśaktidevīśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama ityādirūpaḥ prayogaḥ | sarvatra 
dvitāryādyanyatamaprayogaḥ pūrvavat |

<397-399 |> atha daśa nigarbhayoginīrāha (-) sarvajñāmityādinā sarvepsitaphalapradāmityantena | 
gandhādyairupacārairyajediti sarvatra sambadhyate |

<400-401 |> sarvarakṣeti | cakraṃ yajediti sambandhaḥ | tathāca sarvarakṣākarāntardaśāracakrāya 
nama iti prayogaḥ | dhyāyediti | tripurāmālinīcakranāyikāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi nama iti 
prayogaḥ | tantrasāre tu tritāryanantaramādau hrīṃ klīṃ blumiti bījayogo dṛśyate | maheti | 
sarvamahāṅkuśamudrāṃ prāguktalakṣaṇām | 

<402 |> atha mūladevyai pūjāsamarpaṇasya kramamāha (-) etā iti | tathāca etā

<p. 684> (sthiticakropasaṃhāraḥ saṃhāracakranirūpaṇapratijñā ca)

sthiticakraṃ samākhyātaṃ saṃhāraṃ kathayāmyatha || 403 ||

(vaśinyādyaṣṭarahasyayoginyaḥ)

paścimāmnāyamārgeṇa vaśinyādyaṣṭadevatāḥ |

(tāsāṃ svarūpam)

navīnārkasamābhāsāḥ sarvālaṅkārabhūṣitāḥ || 404 ||

dhanurbāṇākṣamālāñca pustakaṃ bibhratīḥ karaiḥ |

(pūjākramaḥ)

nyāsoktamanunā mantrī yajed vargāṣṭakena tu |

(etāsāmaṣṭāravṛttitvam)

etā rahasyayoginyaḥ prathamāvaraṇe sthitāḥ || 405 ||


nigarbhayoginyaḥ sarvarakṣākare cakre samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ 
saparivārāḥ sarvopacāraiḥ pūjitāḥ santu iti prayogaḥ |

<403 |> sthitīti | sarvasaubhāgyadāyakaṃ sarvārthasādhakaṃ sarvarakṣākarañcetyetattritayātmakaṃ 
sthiticakramityarthaḥ | vakṣyamāṇatritayātmakaṃ saṃhāracakraṃ nirūpayituṃ pratijānīte (-)
saṃhāramityādinā |

<404-405 |> tatra prathamamaṣṭāre sarvarogahare cakre vaśinyādīnāṃ rahasyayoginīnāṃ 
pūjanamabhidadhānastāsāṃ svarūpamāha (-) navīnārketi | vaśinyādyāstu 
vaśinyādyaṣṭavāgdevīreṣu sthāneṣu vinyasedityādinā pañcadaśe nyāsaprakaraṇe 
samuddiṣṭāstāśca taṭṭīkāyāṃ vaśinī (-) kāmeśvarī (-) modinī (-) vimalāruṇā (-) jayinī (-) 
sarveśvarī (-) kaulinyākhyā aṣṭāviti viśiṣya pradarśitāḥ | nyāsokteti | 
pūrvapradarśitanyāsoktamantreṇaivaitāḥ pūjayet | vargāṣṭakeneti vaśinyādīnāmaṣṭānāṃ 
purataḥ krameṇa vargāṣṭakaṃ prayojya pūjayedityarthaḥ(;)  evañca akārādiṣoḍaśasvarāṇyuccarya 
varalūṃ vaśinīvāgdevatāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ ityādirūpaḥ prayogaḥ(,) 
tritāryādiprayogastu pūrvavadeva |

<p. 685> (cakrapūjā)

sarvarogaharaṃ nāma cakraṃ saṃpūjayettataḥ |

(cakranāyikārcā)

dhyāyecchrītripurāsiddhāṃ vaśinīpurataḥ sudhīḥ || 406 ||

(cakranāyikāyāḥ svarūpam)

javākusumasaṅkāśāṃ pāśāṅkuśadhanuḥśarām |

(mudrāpradarśanādi)

sandarśya khecarīmudrāṃ yajecchaktiñca māyayā || 407 ||

(pūjāsamarpaṇam)

etā rahasyayoginyaḥ sarvarogahare padāt |
cakre samudrā ityādi pūrvavat parikalpayet || 408 ||

(bāṇārcā)

aṣṭakoṇāntarāle ca trikoṇasya bahiḥsthitaḥ |
paścimādicaturdikṣu bāṇān saṃpūjayed budhaḥ || 409 ||

(bāṇānāṃ svarūpam)

taruṇāruṇasaṅkāśān raktavastravibhūṣitān | 
raktamālyaviśobhāḍhyān yauvanonmattavigrahān || 410 ||

pāśāṅkuśadhanuḥpañcapuṣpabāṇavibhūṣitān |
bāṇadhanuḥpāśaśṛṇiyugmāni ca kramādanu || 411 ||


<406-407 |> sarvarogeti | sarvarogaharāṣṭāracakrāya namaḥ iti prayogaḥ | dhyāyediti | 
śrītripurāsiddhācakranāyikāśrīpādukāṃ pūjayāmi namaḥ iti prayogaḥ | atra mūle 
cakranāyikāpadamanupāttamapi sarvatra cakranāyikāpadaprayogadarśanānniveśitam |

<p. 686> (bāṇānāṃ saṃjñāḥ pūjākramaśca)

jṛmbhaṇaṃ mohanañcaiva vaśaṃ stambhanameva ca |
nyāsoktakramayogeṇa pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ || 412 ||

(aṅgadevatārcā)

astratrikoṇayormadhye pūjayedaṅgadevatāḥ || 413 ||

trikoṇamadhyacakre tu pūjayenmūlavidyayā |
akṣarākṣarabhedena samastavyastayā yajet || 414 ||

bālābījatrayeṇāpi bhairavyāḥ kūṭakaistribhiḥ |
sundaryāśca tribhiḥ kūṭaistrikoṇaṃ paripūjayet || 415 ||

kāmeśvarīṃ rudraśaktimagnicakre prapūjayet |
vajreśvarīṃ viṣṇuśaktiṃ sūryacakre prapūjayet || 416 ||

bhagamālāṃ brahmaśaktiṃ somacakre prapūjayet |
binducakre yajeddevīṃ paraṃbrahmasvarūpiṇīm || 417 ||

kāme mitrīśanāthaḥ syājjāle ṣaṣṭhīśanāthakaḥ |
pūrṇe coḍḍīśanāthaśca caryānāthastu oḍrake || 418 ||

kāmeśvarīṃ vāgbhavena yajed dhyātvā tu pūrvavat |
evaṃ cakreśvarīṃ dhyātvā kāmarājena pūjayet || 419 ||

bhageśīṃ śaktikūṭena yajed dhyātvā tu pūrvavat |
sarvasiddhiprade cakre dvitīyāvaraṇe nayet || 420 ||

<p. 687> rahasyayoginīstatra sarvasiddhipradāyikām |
pāśāṅkuśadhanurbāṇadharāṃ raktāṃ suśobhanām || 421 ||

bījamudrāñca sandarśya parāṃ śaktiṃ prapūjayet || 422 ||

etā atirahasyeti padād yoginya ityapi |
sarvasiddhimaye cakre samudretyādi pūrvavat || 423 ||

(binducakre śrīmattripurasundarīsaparyā)

sarvānandamaye cakre baindave parameśvarīm |
paraṃbrahmasvarūpāñca paramāmṛtarūpiṇīm || 424 ||

sarvacakreśvarīṃ devīṃ sarvamantreśvarīṃ tathā |
sarvamudreśvarīñcāpi sarvavidyeśvarīṃ tathā || 425 ||

sarvapīṭheśvarīñcāpi sarvavīreśvarīṃ punaḥ |
sarvayogeśvarīñcāpi sarvasiddhīśvarīmapi || 426 ||

utpattisthitisaṃhārakāriṇīṃ mātṛkāṃ parām | 
samudrāṃ sāyudhāñcāpi sacakrāñca savāhanām || 427 ||

parivārasametāñca sasiddhiñca sadevatām |
parāparāṃ mahādevīṃ bhuktimuktipradāyinīm || 428 ||


<423 |> etā iti | tathāca etā atirahasyayoginyaḥ sarvasiddhimaye cakre samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ 
sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ sarvopacāraiḥ pūjitāḥ santu iti prayogaḥ |

<p. 688> brahmaviṣṇuśivādyaśca munīndrairapi sevitām |
manasaivaṃ samālokya śrīmattripurasundarīm || 429 ||

paraṃbrahmātmaśaktiśrīpādukāmarcayed budhaḥ |

(vaindavacakrārcā)

sarvānandamayaṃ cakraṃ baindavaṃ paripūjayet || 430 ||

(cakranāyikārcā)

āvāhanena mantreṇa bhairavīcakranāyikām |
devyagre pūjayenmantrī gandhapuṣpākṣatādibhiḥ || 431 ||

(mudrādarśanādi)

yonimudrāñca sandarśya parāṃ śaktiṃ prapūjayet |
śaivaṃ vā pūjayettatra tattvavimarṣiṇīmate || 432 ||

madhyatryasraṃ sāntarālaṃ śaivaṃ darśanamīritam |
hau(/) oṃ(/) namaḥ śivāya hau(/) bhūyo namo'munā śivam |
pūjayed gandhapuṣpādyaiḥ ṣoḍhā'yaṃ darśanakramaḥ || 433 ||

(mūladevyai pūjāsamarpaṇam)

etāḥ parāparetyuktvā rahasyeti padopari |
yoginya iti coddhṛtya sarvānandamaye padāt || 434 ||

mahācakre baindave ca parabrahmasvarūpiṇī |
parāmṛtapadācchakti sarvacakreśvarīpadam || 435 ||

sarvamantreśvarīśabdāt sarvavidyeśvarīpadam |
sarvavīreśvarī sarvapīṭheśvarī padaṃ tataḥ || 436 ||


<434-438 |> atha pūjāsamarpaṇamantramāha (-) etā ityādinā | tathāca etāḥ 
parāpararahasyayoginyaḥ sarvānandamaye mahācakre baindave cakre parabrahmasvarūpiṇī (-)

<p. 689> sarvayogeśvarīśabdāt sarvavāgīśvarīpadam |
sarvasiddheśvarī sarvajagadutpattimātṛkāḥ || 437 ||

sacakrā ca samudrā ca sasiddhi sāyudhāstathā |
savāhanāḥ saparivārāśca sarvopacārakairmahā |
tripurānte sundarīti parayāparayāpadāt || 438 ||

parāparā tṛtīyānte saparyā ca tathāvidhā |
pūjitāḥ santu ityuktvā devyai pūjāṃ samarpayet || 439 ||


parāmṛtaśakti (-) sarvacakreśvarī (-) sarvamantreśvarī (-) sarvavidyeśvarī (-) sarvavīreśvarī (-) 
sarvapīṭheśvarī sarvayogeśvarī (-) sarvavāgīśvarī (-) sarvasiddheśvarī (-) sarvajagadutpattimātṛkāḥ 
sacakrāḥ samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ 
sarvopacārakairmahātripurasundarīparayā parayā parāparayā saparyayā pūjitāḥ santu iti prayogaḥ 
|

	tantrasāre tu (-) atra sarvānandamaye baindavacakre parabrahmasvarūpiṇī (-) parāparaśakti (-) 
śrīmahātripurasundarī (-) samastacakranāyikā (-) sambittirūpacakranāyikādhiṣṭhite 
trailokyamohanasarvāśāparipūraka (-) sarvasaṃkṣobhakāraka (-) sarvasaubhāgyadāyaka (-) 
sarvārthasādhaka (-) sarvarakṣākara (-) sarvarogahara (-) sarvasiddhiprada (-) 
śrīcakrasamunmīlitasamastaprakaṭaguptaguptatarasampradāyakula (-) kaulinīnigarbharahasyātirahasya (-) 
parāpararahasya (-) samastayoginīparivṛta (-) śrītripurātripureśī (-) tripurasundarī (-) tripuravāsinī (-) 
tripurāśrī (-) tripuramālinī (-) tripurāsiddhā (-) 
tripurāmbātattaccakranāyikāvanditacaraṇakamalaśrīmahātripura (-) sundarī (-) nityādevī (-) 
sarvacakreśvarī (-) sarvamantreśvarī (-) sarvavidyeśvarī (-) sarvapīṭheśvarī (-) sarvakāmeśvarī (-) 
sarvatattveśvarī (-) sarvavīreśvarī (-) traikokyamohinī jagadutpattimātṛkā (-) sarvacakramayī (-) 
taccakranāyikāsahitāḥ samudrāḥ sasiddhayaḥ sāyudhāḥ savāhanāḥ saparivārāḥ 
sarvopacāraiḥ śrīmahātripurasundarī parāparayā saparyayā pūjitāstarpitāḥ santu iti 
viśeṣārghyodakākṣatakusumaiḥ pradhānadevyā vāmahaste samarpayed ityuktam |

<p. 690> kuṇḍagolodbhavairdravyaiḥ svayambhukusumairyutaiḥ |
sundarīṃ pūjayenmantrī śatamakṣatataṇḍulaiḥ || 440 ||

(punaḥ saparyopadeśaḥ)

punaḥ pādyādikaṃ dattvā śrīvidyāṃ pūjayed yathā |

(punararghyatrayadānam)

punastritattvamuccārya dadyādarghyaṃ tridhā punaḥ || 441 ||

(vividhopacāraiḥ pūjanam)

gandhacandanakastūrīrocanāgurukuṅkumaiḥ |
raktacandanasindūrairdravyairnānāvidhairyajet || 442 ||

(upacāradāne prārthanāmantrāḥ | tatra pādyasya prāthanāmantraḥ)

gandhapuṣpasāmāyuktaṃ sugandhijalasaṃyutam |
pādyaṃ gṛhāṇa deveśi sarvakāmārthasiddhaye || 443 ||

(arghyasya)

dūrvākṣatasamāyuktaṃ gandhacandanacarcitam |
caturvargaphalāvāptyai gṛhāṇārghyaṃ sureśvari || 444 ||

(ācamanīyasya)

suvāsitaṃ jalaṃ śuddhaṃ dukūlaiḥ pariśodhitam |
gṛhāṇā'camanīyaṃ tvaṃ śrīmattripurasundari || 445 ||

(madhuparkasya)

dadhyājyamadhusaṃyuktaṃ suvahaṃ sumanoharam |
madhuparkaṃ gṛhāṇa tvaṃ dharmakāmārthasiddhaye || 446 ||


<442 |> atha devīpūjāyāṃ praśastānupacārān sāmānyata āha (-) gandheti |

<p. 691> (gandhasya)

candracandanakastūrīrocanāgurukuṅkumaiḥ |
sambhṛtaṃ saralairārdraṃ gandhamākalpayāmyaham || 447 ||

(puṣpasya)

vicitramamalaṃ ramyaṃ vāsitaṃ gandhavāribhiḥ |
sugandhi vikasat puṣpamādarāt kalpayāmyaham || 448 ||


<448 |> puṣpadānamāha (-) vicitramiti | vāsitamiti gandhavāribhiścandanajalairvāsitaṃ 
surabhīkṛtamityarthaḥ | atredamavadheyam (-) gandhapuṣpadhūpādaya upacārāḥ 
parakīyatvaghrātatvādidoṣaduṣṭāḥ pūjāyāṃ varjanīyāḥ | taduktaṃ gandharvatantre 
caturdaśapaṭale (-)

parakīyāṃstathā ghrātāṃsteṣāṃ kṛtyābhimarditān |
puṣpaṃ dhūpañca gandhañca nopacārāṃstathā'parān |
ghrātānnivedya deveśi naro narakamāpnuyāt |
naiva paryusitaiḥ puṣpaiḥ patraiścāpi maheśvarīm |
pūjayet parameśāni mahātripurasundarīm ||
sarvaṃ paryuṣitaṃ varjyaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ tathā |
padmāni sitaraktāni kumudānyutpalāni ca ||
eṣāṃ paryuṣitāśaṅkā kāryā pañcadinordhvataḥ |
anyeṣāṃ kusumānāñca yāvad gandhaviparyayaḥ ||

iti | evañca padmakumudotpalānāṃ dinapañcakaṃ yāvat(,) itareṣāntu yāvad gandhāvasthiti (-) 
stāvat paryuṣitatvaṃ nāstītyuktaṃ bhavati | tripurārcāyāṃ praśastāni patrapuṣpāṇyāha tatraiva 
(-)

vakulaṃ keśaraṃ vajraṃ mālyaṃ kundañca śālmalam | 
karavīrañcārkapuṣpaṃ bandhūkakamale tathā ||
mālatī mallikā jātī yūthikā mādhavī tathā |
tagaraḥ karṇikāraśca droṇaścotpalacampakau ||

<p. 692> (ṣoḍaśāṅgadhūpapramāṇam)

guggulaṃ saralaṃ dāru patraṃ malayasambhavam |
hrīberamaguruṃ kuṣṭhaṃ guḍaṃ sarjarasaṃ ghanam || 449 ||


aśokaḥ kumudaścaiva śephālikā (-) kadambakau
ketakī vanamālā ca kusumbhakiṃśukau tathā ||
kahlāravakule caiva lavaṅga (-) nāgakeśarau |
sarveṣu puṣpajāteṣu tripurāyāḥ sadaiva hi ||
etānyeva priyāṇi syurna patrairarcayecchivām | 
patreṣu bilvapatrañca tathā madanapallavam ||
dūrvāṅkurantathā proktaṃ nānyat patraṃ prayojayet |
mallikā mālatī kundo droṇaścātha sitāmbujaḥ ||
śuklapakṣe mahādevi tripurāyai nivedayet |
sarveṣāṃ puṣpajātīnāṃ raktapadmaṃ tathā javā ||
devīprītikaraṃ prājñe sarvakāmaphalapradam |
ratnapuṣpañca deveśi tathā svarṇādinirmitam |
raktapadmena vajreṇa tulāṃ nā'yāti karhicit ||

iti | tathā vihitānāmapi puṣpāṇām ugragandhatvāśuddhapātragatatvādidoṣaduṣṭatve 
teṣāmarpaṇaṃ niṣiddham(,) yathā tatraiva (-)

ugragandhamagandhañca krimikeśādidūṣitam |
aśuddhapātrapāṇisthaṃ vāsobhiḥ kutsitātmabhiḥ ||
ānītaṃ nārpayeddevyai pramādādapi doṣakṛt |
snātvānītaiḥ paryuṣitairyācitaiḥ kṛṣṇavarṇakaiḥ ||
svayaṃ vikaśitairmuktaiḥ svayañca patitairbhuvi |
nārcayet kalikābhiśca vinā campakapaṅkajaiḥ ||

ityādi | evamanyānyapi vihitāvihitapuṣpapratipādakapramāṇāni muṇḍamālāyoginītantra(-)
kaulāvalīnirṇayādiṣu jñātavyāni |

<p. 693> harītakīṃ nakhaṃ lākṣāṃ jaṭāmāṃsīñca śailajam |
ṣoḍaśāṅgaṃ vidurdhūpaṃ daive pitrye ca karmaṇi || 450 ||

(anyādṛśadhūpapramāṇam)

madhusarpiḥ śarkarā ca candanāgurugugguluḥ |
uśīraḥ sapta evaite dhūpo'yaṃ caṇḍikāpriyaḥ || 451 ||


449-450 | ṣoḍaśāṅgadhūpapramāṇamāha (-) guggulamityādinā | saralo vṛkṣaviśeṣaḥ | pītadruḥ 
saralaḥ pūtikāṣṭhamityamaraḥ | dāru devadāru(,) śakrapādapaḥ paribhadrakaḥ | 
bhadradārudrukilimam(,) pītadāru ca dāru ca | pūtikāṣṭhañca sapta syurdevadāruṇītyamaraḥ | atra 
dāruśabdena devadārurevocyate(,)

harītakī mustamatho nakhī ca māṃsī jatuḥ śailaja(-)devadāruḥ |
kuṣṭhaṃ guḍaḥ sarjarasastathaiva daśāṅgadhūpaḥ kathito munīndraiḥ ||

iti kaulāvalīnirṇayasaptamollāsīyadaśāṅgadhūpapramāṇe tathā darśanāt | patraṃ tejapatram | 
malayasambhavaṃ candanam | hrīberaṃ netravāleti khyāto gandhadravyaviśeṣaḥ | bālaṃ 
hrībarabarhiṣṭhodīcyaṃ keśāmbunāma cetyamaraḥ | sarjarasaḥ sālaniryāsaḥ | yakṣadhūpaḥ 
sarjaraso'rālasarvarasāvapītyamaraḥ | ghano mustā mutheti prasiddhā | ghanaḥ sāndre dṛḍhe 
dārḍhye vistāre mudgare'mbude | saṃghe muste ghanaṃ madhyanṛtyavādyaprakārayoriti haimaḥ | 
nakhaṃ gandhadravyaviśeṣaḥ(,) nakhaṃ punargandhadravye nakhaḥ karajaṣaṇḍayoriti haimaḥ | 
śailajaṃ śilājatu iti khyāto gandhadravyaviśeṣaḥ | kālānusāryavṛddhāśmapuṣpaśītaśivāni tu 
śaileyamityamaraḥ | śaileyaṃ galaparṇyāñca saindhave | śailaje nā tu madhupe 
śilātulye'nyaliṅgakam | iti ca medinī | śiṣṭaṃ spaṣṭam | gandharvatantre caturdaśapaṭale (-)

patraṃ mustaṃ nakhaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ jaṭāmāṃsīñca śailajam |
saralaṃ devakāṣṭhañca jatusarjasacandanam ||
kapilāghṛtakarpūraśarkarāpūramiśritam |
ṣoḍaśāṅgo mahādhūpaḥ ṣoḍaśīprītidāyakaḥ ||

iti |

<451 |> madhviti | uśīro vīraṇamūlam |

<p. 694> (anyādṛśadhūpapramāṇam)

athavā'gurukarpūracandanaiḥ saha gugguluḥ |
madhusarpirjaṭāmāṃsī śaileyaṃ kuṅkumaṃ tathā |
ebhirvimiśritaḥ kāryo dhūpo'yaṃ pārvatīpriyaḥ || 452 ||

(dhūpadānakramaḥ)

dhūpabhājanamastreṇa prokṣyārbhyarcya hṛdā'nunā |
jayadhvani tato mantramātaḥ svāheti pūjitām |
vāmena vādayan ghaṇṭāṃ dhūpadīpau nivedayet || 453 ||

(dhūpasya prārthanāmantraḥ)

vanaspatirasotpanno gandhāḍhyo gandha uttamaḥ |
āghreyaḥ sarvadevānāṃ dhūpo'yaṃ pratigṛhyatām || 454 ||

athavā dhūpayeddhūpairmūlamantrapuraḥsaram |
surabhīghṛtasaṃyogād vahnerutpannamuttamam |
dhvastadurvāsanaṃ divyaṃ dhūpamunmīlayāmyaham || 455 ||

(dīpasya)

suprakāśo mahādīpaḥ sarvatastimirāpahaḥ |
sabāhyābhyantaraṃ jyotirdīpo'yaṃ pratigṛhyatām || 456 ||


<453> dhūpeti | astreṇa phaṭ ityanena | hṛdā'nunā(,) nama iti hṛnmantreṇetyarthaḥ | tathāca phaṭ 
ityanena dhūpabhājanamabhyukṣya dhūpāya nama ityabhyarcyetyarthaḥ | dhūpeti | dhūpadīpau 
nivedayedityanena vakṣyamāṇadīpadāne'pi niruktakrameṇa oṃ jayadhvanimantramātaḥ svāheti 
prayojayediti bodhyam |

<p. 695> (tatra kalpāntaram)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa dīpaṃ dadyād vicakṣaṇaḥ || 457 ||

(prārthanāmantrāntaram)

ghṛtasaṃyuktavarttyagre prajvalantaṃ nirantaram |
divyadarśanadātāraṃ dīpaṃ sandarśayāmyaham || 458 ||

(dhūpadāne diṅniyamaḥ)

dhūpantu vāmato dadyāt saṃmukhe vā vicakṣaṇaḥ |

(bhūmyādau dhūpasthāpananiṣedhaḥ)

na bhūmau sthāpayeddhūpamāsane vā ghaṭe ca vā || 459 ||

(dīpadāne diṅniyamaḥ)

ghṛtadīpaṃ dakṣiṇe ca svavāme tailadīpakam |
abhito darśayenmantrī dīpamālāṃ suśobhanām || 460 ||

(saptavidhāḥ pradīpāḥ)

ghṛtapradīpaḥ prathamaṃ tilatailasamudbhavaḥ | 
sārṣapaḥ phalaniryāsajāto vā vārijodbhavaḥ |
dadhijaścānnajaścaiva dīpāḥ sapta prakīrtitāḥ || 461 ||

(pañcavidhā vartikāḥ)

paṭṭasūtrabhavā darbhagarbhasūtrabhavā'thavā |
śālajā bādarī vā'pi phalakoṣodbhavā'thavā |
vartikā dīpakṛtyebhyaḥ sadā pañcavidhāḥ smṛtāḥ || 462 ||

(praśastāni dīpapātrāṇi)

taijasaṃ bādaraṃ lauhaṃ mārtikyaṃ nārikelajam | 
tṛṇarājodbhavaṃ vā'pi dīpapātraṃ praśasyate || 463 ||

<p. 696> evaṃ dīpaṃ prakurvīta netrarañjanakārakam |

(dīpadānakramaḥ)

dīpantu padmaparyantamadho dhūpaṃ prakāśayet || 464 ||

(mālyadāne prārthanāmantraḥ)

kamalotpalakahlārakaravīrādiyogataḥ |
surabhīṇi sugandhīni mālyānyāvedayāmyaham || 465 ||

(madhuradravyadānam)

pradadyānmadhuraṃ dravyaṃ paramānandamānasaḥ || 466 ||

(tarpaṇam)

tarpayenmadhurairdravyairamṛtairmadhumiśritaiḥ |
amṛtaścāmṛtadravyaistarpayet paradevatām || 467 ||

(carupākopadeśaḥ)

tataśca saṃskṛte vahnau gokṣīracarukaṃ pacet |

(carupākakramaḥ)

astreṇa kṣālite pātre nave tāmramayādike || 468 ||


<464-465 |> dīpantviti | padmaparyantamiti dṛṣṭiparyantamityarthaḥ | dīpe viśeṣamāha gandharvatantre 
caturdaśapaṭale (-)

dīpamālā prakartavyā naikadīpaḥ kadācana |
trayo dīpāḥ pradātavyāḥ pañca vā parameśvari |
ito nyūnaṃ na dātavyaṃ tripurāyai kadācana | iti |

kamaleti | mālyadānaphalamāha gandharvatantre caturdaśapaṭale (-)

eteṣāṃ puṣpajātānāṃ yena kena vinirmitām |
mālāṃ kṛtvā mahādevyai yat phalaṃ labhate naraḥ |
api vaktusahasraistu vaktuṃ nālaṃ tataḥ prabhuḥ |

iti atraiteṣāmityanena pūrvopadarśitāni vihitapuṣpāṇyabhihitāni | 

<468-472 |> tataśceti | saṃskṛta iti aṣṭamaprakāśoktakrameṇeti śeṣaḥ |

<p. 697> taṇḍulāñ śālisambhūtān mūlamantrābhimantritān |
prasṛtīḥ pañcadaśabhirnikṣipyāstramanuṃ smaran || 469 ||

pidhāya pātravadanaṃ prakṣālya kavacānunā |
prāṅmukho mūlamantreṇa sādhakendraścaruṃ pacet || 470 ||

śruveṇā'jyena saṃsvinne dadyāttatrābhighāraṇam |

(caroravatāraṇam)

mūlamantreṇa tat pātraṃ kavacenāvatārayet || 471 ||

astrajapte kuśāstīrṇe maṇḍape vidhivad guruḥ |

(caruvibhāgaḥ)

taṃ vibhajyaikabhāgantu devatāyai prakalpayet || 472 ||

anyadagnau prajuhuyādaparaṃ balimuttamam |
ekantu carukaṃ proktamārātrikavidhāvapi || 473 ||

(ārātrikam(,) tatrāṣṭadalapadmanirmāṇam)

tatastu kāñcane sthāne raupye vā kāṃsyanirmite |
vasupatrasamāyuktaṃ kuṅkumena tu nīrajam || 474 ||


carupākaparipāṭīmāha(-)astreṇetyādinā | astreṇa phaḍityanena | śālisambhūtān 
haimantikadhānyabhavān(,) pañcadaśamuṣṭiparimitān tāmranirmitacarusthālyāṃ nikṣipedityarthaḥ | 
astramanumiti | tathā ca phaṭ iti carusthālīmukhamācchādya kavacānunā hu(/) iti mantreṇa 
prakṣālya caruṃ pacediti sambandhaḥ | kavaceneti(,) hu(/) ityavatārayedityarthaḥ |

<472-473 |> evaṃkrameṇa caroḥ pākamabhidhāya tasya caturdhā vibhajanamāha(-) tamityādinā | taṃ 
caruṃ caturdhā vibhajya ekaṃ devatāyai samarpya dvitīyamagnau juhuyāt(,) apareṇa baliṃ dadyāt(,) 
carumanyamārātrikavidhau prayuñjītetyarthaḥ |

<p. 698> (tatraudanasya navabhāgakalpanam)

śuddhaudanaṃ pariṣkṛtya navabhāgaṃ prakalpayet |
navakoṇakarūpañca cakrarūpaṃ vicintayet || 475 ||

(aṣṭadaleṣu śuddhaudanasthāpanam)

śarkarāyavagodhūmacaṇakaiḥ parimaṇḍitam |
taṇḍulājyatilaiyuktaṃ vasupatre vinikṣipet || 476 ||

(navamabhāgasya karṇikāyāṃ sthāpanam(,) navamudrāpradarśanañca)

ekaṃ madhye tu saṃsthāpya nava mudrāḥ pradarśayet |

(padme dīpanavakanyāsaḥ pūjanañca)

sthāpayettatra mantrajño nava dīpān ghṛtaplutān || 477 ||

pañcaratnaṃ pretabījaṃ samuccārya prapūjayet |
mūlamantreṇa saṃpūjya pāṇibhyāṃ dhārayed yathā || 478 ||


<474-475 |> athā'rātrikavidhimāha (-) tatastvityādinā | kāñcanādyanyatamanirmite sthāne ādhāre 
kuṅkumenāṣṭadalaṃ nīrajaṃ padmaṃ vidadhītetyarthaḥ | tataḥ śuddhaudanaṃ navabhāgaṃ 
kuryāt | naveti | aṣṭau dalāni karṇikāñcā'dāya navasaṃkhyākatvaṃ bodhyam |

<476-477 |> niruktāṣṭadale prāguktaśuddhaudanasthāpanamāha (-) śarkareti | śarkarādibhiryuktaṃ tat 
śuddhaudanaṃ vasupatre niruktapadmasya patrāṣṭake niveśayet | ekamiti | bhāgamekaṃ madhye 
karṇikāyāṃ sthāpayet | praguktaśuddhaudanasya navabhāgānāmaṣṭau bhāgānaṣṭasu daleṣu(,) 
avaśiṣṭaṃ navamaṃ bhāgaṃ karṇikāyāṃ sthāpayedityarthaḥ | nava mudrā iti prāguktāḥ 
sarvākarṣiṇyādikāḥ |

<477-478 |> tatra dīpasthāpanamāha (-) sthāpayedityādinā | nava dīpān 
śuddhaudanakrameṇāṣṭadaleṣu karṇikāyāñcetyarthaḥ | atha sadīpasya pātrasya pūjanamāha (-) 
pañcaratnamiti | ādau pañcaratnaṃ tato hsāviti pretabījam | pañcaratnaṃ glūṃ slūṃ mlūṃ 
plūṃ llūṃ iti bījapañcakam | bījānāmeteṣāmādau śrīṃ hrīmiti bījadvayamante ca tadvilomena 
hrīṃ śrīmiti bījadvayaṃ samaṣṭyā navākṣaro ratneśīmantro bhavati | atra pañcaratnamityuktāvapi 
jñānārṇa (-)

<p. 699> (dīpapātrasya bhrāmaṇam)

mastakāntaṃ samānīya navadhā bhrāmayed budhaḥ |
mūlamantrāntamantreṇa tato nīrājanaṃ caret || 479 ||

(ārātrikamantraḥ)

samastacakracakreśīyute devi navātmike |
ārātrikamimaṃ devi gṛhāṇa mama siddhaye || 480 ||


vādau ratneśīmantreṇa dīpapātrārcopadeśadarśanādatrāpi tadabhiprāyeṇaiva 
pañcaratnamityuktamiti pratibhāti | vyaktamāha tantrasāradhṛtajñānārṇave (-)

ārātrikamataḥ kuryāt sarvakāmārthasiddhaye |
sauvarṇe rājate kāṃsye sthānake parameśvari ||
kuṅkumena likhed yantraṃ navakoṇaṃ manoharam |
candrarūpaṃ caruṃ kṛtvā tanmadhye mastake śive ||
dīpamekaṃ vinikṣipya vasukoṇe'ṣṭadīpakān |
yavagodhūmamudgādiracitāñ śarkarāyutān |
caṇakāhitaśobhābhiḥ śobhitān ghṛtapūritān ||
abhimantrya maheśāni ratneśvaryāstataḥ param ||
śrībījañca parābījaṃ saṃlikhya varavarṇini | 
gasau ca mapalāḥ paścādindrasthāḥ kramataḥ priye |
vāmakarṇasamāyuktā nādabinduvibhūṣitāḥ |
bījapañcakametattu pañcaratnāni sundari |
pūrvabījavilomena ratneśīyaṃ navākṣarī ||

iti | evañcā'dau śrīṃ hrīmiti śrīparābījayorante ca hrīṃ śrīmiti vilomena paṭhitayostayorniveśena 
śrīṃ hrīṃ glūṃ slūṃ mlūṃ plūṃ llūṃ hrīṃ śrīṃ iti navākṣaro ratneśīmantro bhavati | 
mūlamantreṇeti | pañcaratnena pretabījena mūlena cābhyarcyetyarthaḥ | ata eva tantrasārakārairapi 
ratneśīmantramabhidhāya iti mantreṇa mūlena cārbhyarcyetyuktam |

<479 |> mastakāntamiti | spaṣṭam | mūlamantrāntamantreṇa ādau mūlamuccārya 
vakṣyamāṇamantreṇetyarthaḥ |

<p. 700> (mudrādarśanam)

yathoktasthāne saṃsthāpya cakramudrāñca darśayet || 481 ||

(cakramudrā)

dakṣiṇetarahastasya vṛddhāgarbhakaniṣṭhikām |
dakṣiṇe yojayitvā tu kaniṣṭhāgarbhake tataḥ || 482 ||

vāme ca dakṣiṇāṅguṣṭhaṃ sādhako viniyojayet |
anyonyayogataścaiva cakramudrā samīritā || 483 ||

(naivedyārpaṇam)

tata ārātrikaṃ vīkṣya naivedyāni prakalpayet || 484 ||

(naivedyapātrāṇi)

taijaseṣu ca pātreṣu prastare vā drupatrake |
yajñadārumaye vā'pi naivedyaṃ kalpayed budhaḥ || 485 ||

sarvālābhe tu māheye svahastaghaṭite yadi || 486 ||

(arghyetarapātroyatoyairnaivedyotsarganiṣedhaḥ)

anyatoyairyadutsṛṣṭamarghyapātrasthitetaraiḥ | 
na gṛhṇāti mahādevī dattaṃ vidhiśatairapi || 487 ||

(naivedyam)

naivedyaṃ saghṛtaṃ śubhraṃ ghṛtavyañjanasaṃyutam |
matsyamāṃsaṃ mudgasūpaṃ marīcādisusaṃskṛtam || 488 ||


<481 |> cakramudrāmiti | taduktaṃ tantrasāre (-)

ārātrike maheśāni cakramudrāṃ pradarśayet | iti |

<485-486 |> taijaseṣviti | māheye mṛtpātre | tripurāpūjāyāṃ praśastāni 
naivedyapātrāntarāṇyāha gandharvatantre pañcadaśapaṭale

sauvarṇe rājate vā'pi tāmre vā prastare'pi ca |
padmapatre'thavā dadyānnaivedyaṃ tripurāpriyam || iti |

<p. 701> śarkarāpūpabharitaṃ madhudugdhaguḍānvitam |
ṣaḍrasena samāyuktaṃ pāyasaṃ madhusaṃyutam || 486 ||

nānāvidhāni dravyāṇi phalāni vividhāni ca |
manaḥpriyāṇi dravyāṇi kṛtvā sādhakasattamaḥ || 490 ||

(tatsthāpanārhaṃ maṇḍalam(,) tatrā'dhāraśaktyarcanañca)

dakṣiṇe vā purobhāge vāme vā maṇḍalaṃ likhet |
trikoṇavṛttabhūbimbamādhāraśaktimarcitam || 491 ||


<491 |> atra naivedyasthāpanamāha (-) dakṣiṇa iti |

naivedyaṃ dakṣiṇe vāme purato vā na pṛṣṭhataḥ |

iti gandharvatantracaturdaśapaṭalavacanena devyā dakṣiṇe vāme'grato vā naivedyasthāpanopadeśāt 
| atra maṇḍalanirmāṇamapi tatra tatroktam | etena naivedyasthāpanasthānamapyarthādāyātam | na 
ca dakṣiṇe vā purobhāga ityatra kasyeti viśeṣānatideśād ātmano dakṣiṇādiṣu 
naivedyasthāpanamanenopadiṣṭamiti vācyam (-)

dīpaṃ dakṣiṇato devyāḥ purato vā na vāmataḥ |
vāmatastu tathā dhūpamagre vā na tu dakṣiṇe |
nivedayet purobhāge gandhaṃ puṣpañca bhūṣaṇam |

ityanantaraṃ naivedya dakṣiṇe vāma ityādi prāgupadarśitagandharvavacanadarśanād devyā eva 
dakṣiṇādiṣu naivedyasthāpanaṃ na tvātmana iti bodhyam | ata eva tantrasārakārairapi 
vāmadakṣiṇabhāgastu devatāyā eva(,) na tu sādhakasya (-)

dhūpadīpau subhojyañca devatāgre nivedayet |

iti darśanādityuktam | tathā (-)

dadyādayogyaṃ purato naivedyaṃ bhojanādikam |

iti gandharvavacanadarśanād dravyaprācuryādivaśāt sthānābhāvena vāmadakṣiṇayoḥ 
sthāpayitumayogyameva naivedyādikaṃ purataḥ sthāpyam | sthānasadbhāve tu 
vāmadakṣiṇayorevetyuktaṃ bhavati | pakvāmānnayorviśeṣamāha tantrasāre (-)

pakvañca devatāvāme āmānnañcaiva dakṣiṇe |

iti | purataḥ sthāpanantu niyamaviruddham |

<p. 702> (naivedyasthāpanaṃ prokṣaṇādisaṃskārāśca)

naivedyaṃ tatra saṃsthāpya prokṣayedastramantrataḥ |
kavacākhyena saṃrakṣya vāyubījena śodhayet || 492 ||

vahnibījena saṃdahya vāruṇenāmṛtaṃ caret |

(naivedyārcanā)

puṣpaṃ dattvā tatra mantraṃ saptadhā prajapennijam || 493 ||


purato niyamo nāsti dīpanaivedyayoḥ kvacit |

iti tantrasāradhṛtayāmalavacanāt |

yattu haratattvadīdhitikāraiḥ (-)

dakṣiṇe ca sitāvartirvāmato raktavartikām |
pakvāpakvavibhāgena naivedyasyāpi tatsthitiḥ |

iti tantrasāradhṛtayāmalavacanena pakvānnasya dakṣiṇata āmānnasya vāmataśca sthāpanaṃ 
pratipāditam(,) tat pakvañca devatāvāma iti pūrvopadarśitavacanavirodhāt kuvyākhyānavijṛmbhitam | 
pakvāpakvavibhāgenetyatra apakvañca pakvañceti dvandve'lpasvaratvāt pakvapadasya pūrvanipātena 
apakvasya dakṣiṇataḥ pakvasya vāmataḥ sthitirityarthe na virodha iti sarvaṃ nirvivādam | evañca (-)

dakṣiṇantu parityajya vāme caiva nidhāpayet | 
abhojyaṃ tad bhavedannaṃ pānīyantu suropamam ||

ityapi na pakvānnaviṣayam | dakṣiṇantu parityajyetyanena ekanaivedyasthale dakṣiṇatyāgapūrvakaṃ 
vāmataḥ sthāpanaṃ pratiṣidhyate(,) bahunaivedyasthale tu dakṣiṇataḥ sthānālābhe vāmataḥ 
sthāpane'pi na doṣaḥ | na tu dakṣiṇantu parityajyeti vacanasya pakvānnaviṣayatve kimapi 
mānamasti(,) tantrasārakārairapi nāsya vacanasya pakvānnaviṣayatvamuktam | 
puraścaraṇacandrikāyāṃ vacanamidaṃ sāmpradāyikatvena vyākhyātam |

<492-493 |> naivedyanivedanakramamāha (-) naivedyamityādinā | astramantrataḥ phaḍiti mantreṇa | 
kavacākhyena hūṃ iti mantreṇa | vāyubījena yamityanena | vahnibījena ramityanena | vāruṇena 
vamiti varuṇabījena | puṣpaṃ dattveti | puṣpeṇa naivedyamabhyarcyetyarthaḥ | mantraṃ 
mūlamantram | gandharvatantre tu (-)

<p. 703> (nivedanaprakāraḥ)

hemapātragataṃ divyaṃ paramānnaṃ susaṃskṛtam |
pañcadhā ṣaḍrasopetaṃ gṛhāṇa parameśvari || 494 ||

sarvopakaraṇādīni mūlāntena nivedayet |

(naivedyālābhe vyavasthā)

aśaktau manasā dadyādetat karma na lopayet || 495 ||

(devyai cullukadānaṃ mudrāpradarśanopadeśaśca)

cullukaṃ manasā dattvā pañca mudrāḥ pradarśayet || 496 ||

(prāṇādipañcamudrāmantrāḥ)

prāṇāpānau tathā vyāna udānākhyaḥ samānakaḥ |
caturthyanto'gnijāyānto mudrāmantro dhruvādikaḥ || 497 || 


nirācchādaṃ samālokya bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ |
vāyubījena saṃśodhya sandahed vahninā tathā ||
vāruṇena svadhāvṛttyā plāvayeddhenumudrayā |
astramantreṇa saṃrakṣya mūlenaivābhiṣicya tu ||
mūladevyāḥ svanāmānte naivedyamiti coccaret |
gṛhāṇa vahnijāyānto naivedyamanurīritaḥ ||
annaṃ caturvidhaṃ devi rasaiḥ ṣaḍbhiḥ samanvitam |
mayā niveditaṃ bhaktyā tadidaṃ pratigṛhyatām ||
lehyacoṣyānupānādibhakṣyabhojyāni yāni ca |
mayāhṛtāni yatnena kṛpayā devi bhujyatām ||

		ityevaṃ naivedyapradānakrama uktaḥ |

<496-500 |> cullukamityādi spaṣṭam | atra viśeṣamāha gandharvatantre pañcadaśapaṭale (-)

jātīlavaṅgakakvolavāsitaṃ svardhunījalam |
mukhavāsakaraṃ puṇyaṃ gṛhītvācama sundari ||

<p. 704> (tatra prāṇamudrā)

vṛddhānāmākaniṣṭhābhiḥ prāṇamudrā samīritā |

(apānamudrā)

vṛddhāmadhyātarjanībhirapānasya prakīrtitā || 498 ||

(vyānamudrā)

vṛddhānāmāmadhyamābhirvyānamudrā samīritā |

(udānamudrā)

kaniṣṭhāvarjaṃ sarvābhirudānasya prakīrtitā || 499 ||

(samānamudrā)

samānamudrā sarvābhiraṅgulībhirudīritā |

(grāsamudrā)

vāmahaste grāsamudrā vikacotpalasannibhā || 500 ||

(pānīyadānam)

suvāsitajalaṃ dadyāt svarṇaraupyādibhājane |

(punargaṇḍūṣadānaṃ tāmbūladānañca)

punaśca cullukaṃ dattvā dadyāttāmbūlamuttamam || 501 ||

(tāmbūladāne mantraḥ)

elālavaṅgakarpūrajātīphalasamanvitam |
tamāladalakarpūrapūgabhāgataraṅgitam |
saṃśodhitaṃ sugandhañca tāmbūlamanusaṃdade || 502 ||


mūlamantreṇa deveśi hunet pañcā'hutīḥ kramāt |
prāṇāpāṇau tathā vyānamudānañca samānakam ||
etatsvarūpaṃ jānīyādāhutīnāñca pañcakam |
pañcāṅgulībhireva syāt kramāt pañcā'hutīḥ priye || iti |

<501-502 |> punaśceti | atra gandharvatantroktaḥ prakāraḥ (-)

punarācamanaṃ dattvā mukhavāsaṃ nivedayet |

<p. 705> (mālyādidānam)

mālyaṃ jalañca vimalaṃ śītalañca suvāsitam |
vyajanaṃ tālavṛntañca svarṇadaṇḍañca cāmaram |
darpaṇañca tato dadyāt purataścandravāniśaṃ (?) || 503 ||

(nṛtyagītādi)

nṛtyaṃ gītaṃ śītalañca kuryād vibhavapūrvakam || 504 ||

(puṣpāñjalidānaṃ tarpaṇañca)

suprasannāṃ tato dhyātvā sarvābharaṇasaṃyutām |
puṣpāñjalitrayaṃ dattvā tarpayet paradevatām || 505 ||

(saparyātraividhyam)

saparyā trividhā proktā parākhyā aparābhidhā |
parāpareti vikhyātā jñātavyā sādhakottamaiḥ || 506 ||

(parādīnāṃ lakṣaṇam)

parā tu bindupūjā syādaparā bāhyataḥ kramāt |
parāparā vyāpikā ca jñātavyā guruvaktrataḥ || 507 ||


tāmbūlaṃ gandhasaṃyuktaṃ karpūrādisuvāsitam |
saṃskṛtya vividhairdravyairgandhavadbhirnivedayet || iti |

<507-508 |> atra pūjāyāstraividhyaṃ parādīnāṃ lakṣaṇañcoktaṃ saparyetyādinā ślokadvayena | 
tatrāpi gurumukhādeva jñātavyamityuktam iti nātra parādīnāṃ vyākhyānamāvaśyakam | 
tantrasāre tu pūjāyāḥ pañcavidhatvamuktam (-) gautamīye (-)

pūjā ca pañcadhā proktā tāsāṃ bhedāñ śṛṇuṣva me |
abhigamanamupādānaṃ yogaḥ svādhyāya eva ca |
ijyā pañcaprakārā'rcā krameṇa kathayāmi te ||
tatrābhigamanaṃ nāma devatāsthānamārjanam |
upalepananirmālyadūrīkaraṇameva ca ||

<p. 706> (punaḥ prāṇāyāmaḥ kāmakalāsmaraṇañca)

prāṇāyāmaṃ punaḥ kṛtvā smaret kāmakalāṃ budhaḥ |
mukhaṃ binduvadākāraṃ tadadhaḥ kucayugmakam || 508 ||

tadadhaḥ saparārdhantu cintayettadadho mukham |
mukhabindurbhavet sūryo dahanendū stanāvubhau || 509 ||

yonirhārdakalā jñeyā mukhabindoḥ samutthitā |
nāsādyaṅgastanadvandvād bāhuyoneḥ padadvayam || 510 ||

(ātmanaḥ kāmakalābhedacintā)

evaṃ kāmakalārūpamātmānaṃ cintayet sadā || 511 ||

meḍhrasthāne śikhākāramādhāre kanakaprabham |
nābhisthaṃ sūryabimbābhaṃ taruṇādityavarcasam || 512 ||

hṛdi vahniśikhākāraṃ tadūrdhve bhāskaradyutim |
kaṇṭhe dīpaśikhākāraṃ ghaṇṭāvaidūryasannibham || 513 ||

lambike candra bimbābhaṃ bhrūmadhye ratnavadruciḥ |
navame viśvatejaśca cintayedeṣu sādhakaḥ || 514 ||


upādānaṃ nāmagandhapuṣpādicayanaṃ tathā |
yogo nāma svadevasya svātmatvenaiva bhāvanā ||
svādhyāyo nāma mantrārthasandhānapūrvako japaḥ |
sūktastotrādipāṭhaśca hareḥ saṃkīrtanaṃ tathā ||
tattvādiśāstrābhyāsaśca svādhyāyaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |
ijyā nāma svadevasya pūjanantu yathārthataḥ ||
iti pañcaprakārā'rcā kathitā tava suvrata |
sārṣṭisāmīpyasālokyasāyujyasārūpyadā kramāt || iti |

<p. 707> (śrīgurupādukādhyānam)

tataḥ padme sahasrāre dhyāyecchrīgurupādukām |

(saiva kulakuṇḍalinīśaktiḥ)

mūlakande tu sā śaktirbhujākārarūpiṇī |

(prāṇasya svarūpam)

tadbhramāvartavāto'yaṃ prāṇa ityucyate budhaiḥ || 515 ||

(śakteśceṣṭāviśeṣaḥ)

jhiñjīvāvyaktamadhurā sphurantī śataśo'pi vā |
gacchantī brahmamārgeṇa praviśantī svaketane || 516 ||

(tatra manolayanam)

yātāyātakrameṇāpi tatra kuryānmanolayam |

(mantraśikhotpattiḥ)

tena mantraśikhā jātā sarvasiddhipradīpikā || 517 ||

(śikhāhīnamantrasya niṣphalatvam)

tamaḥpūrṇagṛhe yadvad yatkiñcinna hi bhāsate |
śikhāhīnāstathā mantrā na sidhyanti kadācana || 518 ||

(śikhāyā guptatvam)

śikhopadeśaḥ sarvatra vidvidbhiḥ parigopitaḥ || 519 ||

(tadvaiparītye siddhyabhāvaḥ)

vinā'nena na siddhiḥ syādarghyakoṭiśatarapi |

(svāpakāle mantrajapasyā'narthakyam)

svāpakāle tu mantrasya japo'narthaphalapradaḥ || 520 ||


<514 |> lambike iti | lambike tālardhvasūkṣmajihvāyāmityarthaḥ | navame navamacakre sahasrāre 
ityarthaḥ | navacakravivekastu saubhāgyalakṣmyupaniṣadi draṣṭavyaḥ |

515-520 | mūlakande iti mūlādhāre ityarthaḥ | 
mūlādhārasthakulakuṇḍalinīśakterbhramāvartavātaḥ prāṇa ityākhyāyate | tatra manaso melanaṃ 
kuryāt(,) tata eva

<p. 708> (svāpasya jāgarasya ca lakṣaṇam)

svāpakālo vāmavaho jāgaro dakṣiṇavahaḥ |

(mantraviśeṣe svāpajāgarayorviśeṣaḥ)

āgneyasya manoḥ saumya mantrasyaitadviparyayaḥ || 521 ||

(prabodhakālaḥ)

pabodhakālaṃ jānīyādubhayorubhayorapi |

(śivaśaktisaṅgamakālaḥ)

prāṇāpānasamāyogācchivaśaktyostu saṅgamaḥ |
prabodhakālo vijñeyaḥ svāpakālastato'thavā || 522 ||

(tripurāgāyatrīpraśaṃsāyāṃ hariharasaṃvādaḥ)

atha vakṣyāmyahaṃ guhyaṃ saṃvādaṃ hariharātmakam |
devadāruvane pūrvaṃ brāhmaṇānatidurdhiyaḥ || 523 ||

vilokya bhagavān viṣṇuḥ śivaṃ gatvā'bhyabhāṣata |
devadeva jagannātha mahādeva jagatpate || 524 ||

ime durmatayaḥ sarve vedācārabahiṣkṛtāḥ |
svacchandacaritāḥ sarve devadāruvane dvijāḥ || 525 ||


mantraśikhā utpadyate | evañca evaṃrūpeṇa prāṇe manolayanaṃ vinā mantraśikhānutpādaḥ(,) 
tadanutpāde ca na mantrasiddhiḥ syāditi phalito'rthaḥ |

<521-522 |> svāpakāla iti | yadā vāmanāsikayā śvāso vahati tadā svāpakālaḥ(,) yadā tu 
dakṣiṇanāsāpuṭena śvāsaścalati tadā jāgarakālaḥ(,) iti sarvasādhāraṇamantrajape | evañca 
japārambhakāle dakṣiṇanāsāpuṭena vāyorvahanamāvaśyakam(,) anyathā japasya niṣphalatvamiti | 
āgneyamantrasya tu vāmanāsāpuṭena yadā śvāso vahati tadaiva japārambha iti 
viparyayapadenopadiśati granthakāraḥ | evañca 
ubhayorāgneyamantretaradevatākamantrayorvāmanāsāvaho dakṣiṇanāsāvahaśca śvāso 
yathākramaṃ jāgaraṇakāla ityāśayaḥ |

<p. 709> anyastrīmaithunāsaktāḥ surāpānaparāyaṇāḥ |
ātmajñānavihīnānāṃ yogābhyāsāvahelinām || 526 ||

kathameṣāṃ bhavenmuktistadupāyaṃ vada prabho |
kathaṃ vā brahmavidyāyāṃ dīkṣāyāmadhikāritā || 527 ||

ityuktvaivābhavattūṣṇīṃ tato nikhilavedinā |
tasmai uktā brahmabhūtā gāyatrī tripurāmayī || 528 ||

yayā vijñātayā caiva dīkṣito brāhmaṇo bhavet |
api kṛtvā kadācārān patito vedavarjitaḥ |
nārī śūdro'thavā vrātyo jñātvaiva brāhmaṇo bhavet || 529 ||

(gāyatrīkathanam)

atha vakṣyāmi tāṃ vidyāṃ gāyatrīṃ tripurātanīm || 530 ||

devīpraṇavamuddhṛtya tatastripurasundarī |
ṅe'ntā'tha vidmahe kāmeśvaryai dhīmahi yojayet |
tannaḥ klinne pracodayādeṣā japyā japāditaḥ || 531 ||

(gāyatrījapānantaramanyajapasyādhikāritā)

aṣṭāviṃśatisaṃkhyābhirjaptṝṇāmadhikāritā |
brahmavidyāṃ japet paścāt sarveṣāmeva niścitam || 532 ||

(tripurāgāyatrījapaphalāni)

japtvaināmagamanmuktiṃ devadāruvane dvijāḥ |
jīvanmukto jāmadagnyaḥ śiṣyo me ghorapātakaiḥ || 533 ||


<530-532 |> atha vakṣyāmīti | tripurāsundarīgāyatrīkathanam(,) sā ca gāyatrī hrīṃ tripura (-) sundaryai 
vidmahe(,) kāmeśvaryai dhīmahi(,) tannaḥ klinne pracodayāt | iti |

<p. 710> vimukto mātṛputrebhyo mīnanāthastathā paraḥ |
jaigīṣavyaśca candraśca vāsavaśca vimocitaḥ || 534 ||

gurudārākarṣaṇādyaistathā'gastyo vimocitaḥ |
abhakṣyaṃ bhakṣayitvā tu vātāpiñca mahāsuram || 535 ||

cāṇḍālīgamanāccaiva vaśiṣṭho'pi vimocitaḥ |
dattātreyaḥ surāpānājjvalanaḥ sarvabhakṣaṇāt || 536 ||

kuloḍḍīśābhidhe tantre śambhuneti prakīrtitam || 537 ||

(gāyatrījapasya niyamaḥ)

atha prajapyā gāyatrī dhyāyañ śrītripureśvarīm |
vilambaṃ tvaritaṃ tyaktvā japenmantramananyadhīḥ || 538 ||

aṣṭottarasahasraṃ vā gajāntakaśatañca vā |
triṃśannyūnaṃ naiva japennityaṃ japa iti smṛtaḥ || 539 ||


<539 |> gajāntakaśatamiti aṣṭottaraśatamityarthaḥ | viśeṣamāha gandharvatantre saptadaśapaṭale (-)

uttamo daśasāhasraḥ sahasro madhyamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
adhamantu nijānīyādaṣṭottaraśataṃ śive ||
ito nyūnaṃ maheśāni na śastaṃ japakarmaṇi |
yathāśakti japaṃ kuryāt saṃkhyayaiva prayatnataḥ ||
asaṃkhyātañca yajjaptaṃ tat sarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet |
gṛhṇanti rākṣasā yena gaṇayet sarvathā budhaḥ ||
naikavāsā japenmantraṃ bahuvastrākulo'pi vā |
aprāvṛtakaro vā'pi śirasā prāvṛto'pi vā ||
cintāvyākulacitto vā kruddho vā'pi tvarānvitaḥ |
nirbodhaḥ prīticitto na na rugṇo na kṣudhā'nvitaḥ ||
tathā cānyamanā bhūtvā pralapanna japenmanum |
anāsīnaḥ śayāno vā gacchan bhuñjāna eva ca || iti |

<p. 711> mantranirṇayatantrasya matametadudīritam |

(nigadādinā japaḥ)

nigadenopāṃśunā vā mānasenāpi vā japet || 540 ||

(nigadalakṣaṇam)

jihvādharoṣṭhacalanaṃ nigadaḥ parikīrtitaḥ |

(upāṃśulakṣaṇam)

rasanāmātracalanamupāṃśu parikīrtitam || 541 ||

(mānasalakṣaṇam)

manasā mantravarṇasya cintanaṃ mānasaḥ smṛtaḥ |

(japānāmadhamamadhyamottamatvanirūpaṇam)

nigade lakṣajaptaḥ syādupāṃśu smaraṇopamaḥ || 542 ||

upāṃśurvā lakṣajapaḥ sadṛśo mānasaikakaḥ |
adhamo madhyamaḥ prokta uttamo mantravinnaraiḥ || 543 ||

(japakāle atihrasvātidīrghoccāraṇayorniṣedhaḥ)

atihrasvo vyādhiheturatidīrghastapaḥkṣayaḥ |

(japarītiḥ)

akṣarākṣarasañcāraṃ japenmauktikahāravat || 544 ||


<540-545 |> nigadenetyādi | viṣayamimamadhikṛtya sphuṭamuktaṃ gandharvatantre saptadaśapaṭale (-)

nigadenopāṃśunā vā mānasenāthavā priye |
japārambhaṃ sudhīḥ kuryād devatābhāvatatparaḥ ||
niḥśaṅkaḥ parameśāni spaṣṭavācā nigadyate |
avyaktaḥ prasphuradvaktra upāṃśuḥ parikīrtitaḥ ||

<p. 712> (daśāviśeṣe (-) stavajapayorniṣphalatā)

manasā yaḥ smaret stotraṃ vacasā ca manuṃjapet |
ubhayaṃ niṣphalaṃ tasya bhinnabhāṇḍodakaṃ yathā || 545 ||

(jape aṅguliniyamaḥ)

anāmāyā dvayaṃ parva parivartena vai kramāt |
madhyamāyāstrayaṃ parva tarjanīmūlaparvaṇi |
nityajāpe samākhyātā na kāmye karamālikā || 546 ||


dhiyā yadakṣaraśreṇīṃ varṇasvarapadātmikām |
uccaredanu saṃsmṛtya sa ukto mānaso japaḥ ||
sauṣumṇādhvanyuccaritaṃ dhvanimātraṃ vibhāvayet |
mantrākṣarāṇi cicchaktau protāni ca vibhāvayan ||
tāmeva parame vyomni paramāmṛtabṛṃhitaḥ |
darśayatyātmasadbhāvaṃ pūjāhomādibhirvinā ||
manaḥ saṃhṛtya viṣayānmantrārthagatamānasaḥ |
na drutaṃ na vilambañca japenmauktikapaṅktivat ||
nigadena tu yajjaptaṃ lakṣamātraṃ varānane |
upāṃśūccāraṇenaiva tulyaṃ bhavati śailaje ||
upāṃśu lakṣamātraṃ tu yajjaptaṃ kamalekṣaṇe |
mānasoccāraṇāttulyamekena varavarṇini ||
viśeṣāt tripurātantre praśasto mānaso japaḥ |
manasā ca smaret stotraṃ vacasā vā japenmanum ||
ubhayaṃ niṣphalaṃ tasya bhinnabhāṇḍodakaṃ yathā |

<546-548 |> anāmāyā iti | karajape niyamamāha gandharvatantre saptadaśapaṭale (-)

mālābhāve tataḥ svāsu aṅgulīṣu japed budhaḥ |
nityaṃ japaṃ kare kuryānna tu kāmyaṃ kadācana ||

<p. 713> (jape aṅguliviyoganiṣedhaḥ)

aṅgulīrna viyuñjīta kiñcit saṅkocayet talam |
aṅgulīnāṃ viyoge tu cchidreṣu sravate japaḥ || 547 ||

(aṅgulyagre japasya niṣphalatvam)

aṅgulyagre ca yajjaptaṃ yajjaptaṃ merulaṅghane |
parvasandhiṣu yajjaptaṃ tat sarvaṃ niṣphalaṃ bhavet || 548 ||



ārabhyānāmikāmadhyāt prādakṣiṇyena vai kramāt |
tarjanīmūlaparyantaṃ japennavasu parvasu ||
tarjanyagre tathā madhye yo japet tantravān naraḥ |
catvāri tasya naśyanti āyurvidyā yaśo balam ||
anāmāmadhyaparvantu meruṃ kṛtvā na laṅghayet |
meruṃ pradakṣiṇaṃ kurvannanāmāmūlaparvataḥ ||
aṅgulīparvabhirmantraṃ japan rekhāṃ na saṃspṛśet |
aṅgulīrnāpayuñjīta kiñcidākuñcite tale |
aṅgulīnāṃ viyoge tu cchidreṇa sravate japaḥ || iti |

mālayā jape viśeṣamāha tatraiva(-)

yathā siddhistathā mālā mālā'ṅgaṃ japakarmaṇi | 
mālayā japato nityaṃ siddhireva na saṃśayaḥ ||
āśu siddhikarī mālā varṇamayī samīritā |
anulomavilomārṇairmātṛkāyāḥ sabindukaiḥ ||
sumerukaiḥ sadā kāryā mālā sarvasamṛddhidā |
aṣṭādhike'ṣṭavargaistu punareva samāpayet ||
varṇenāntaritaṃ mantraṃ kṛtvā japyeta sādhakaḥ |
sphāṭikādibhirapyatra mālā japasamṛddhidā ||
nidhāya purato mālāṃ savyahastagatāñca vā |
japādau pūjayenmālāṃ toyairabhyukṣya yatnataḥ ||

<p. 714> iṣṭa(-)mantreṇa mālāyāḥ prokṣaṇaṃ parikīrtitam |
ai(/) māṃ māle mahāmāle sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi |
caturvargastvayi nyastastasmānme siddhidā bhava ||
candra(-)candana(-)kastūrī(-)rocanāguru(-)kuṅkumaiḥ |
pūjayitvā tato mālāṃ hṛhṇīyād dakṣapāṇinā ||
bījaṃ gaṇapateḥ pūrvamuccārya tadanantaram |
avighnaṃ kuru māle tvaṃ gṛhṇīyādityanena tu ||
yathā hastānna cyavate japataḥ srak tathācaret |
hastacyutāyāṃ vighnaḥ syācchinnāyāṃ maraṇaṃ bhavet ||
yatnāt saṃgopayedenāṃ bhrāmayenna vidhūnayet |
guruṃ prakāśayennaiva yantraṃ mantraṃ kadācana ||
akṣamālāñca mudrāñca gurave'pi na darśayet |
bhūta(-)rākṣasa vetālāḥ siddha(-)gandharva(-)cāraṇāḥ ||
haranti prakaṭaṃ yasmāt tasmād guptaṃ japet sadā |
mālāṃ svahṛdayāsannāṃ dakṣiṇasya karasya ca ||
madhyamāyā madhyabhāge varjayitvā tu tarjanīm |
anāmikākaniṣṭhābhyāṃ yutayā namrabhāgataḥ || 
sthāpayitvā tatra mālāmaṅguṣṭhagreṇa tadgatam |
pratyekaṃ bījamādāya kuryād vāmena na spṛśet ||
prativāraṃ paṭhenmantraṃ śanairoṣṭhaṃ na cālayet |
tarjanyā na spṛśenamālāṃ muktito gaṇanākramaḥ ||
aṅaṣṭhaparvamadhyasthāṃ parivartaṃ samācaret |
aṅguṣṭhena vinā karma kṛtaṃ bhavati niṣphalam ||
aṅguṣṭhaṃ mokṣadaṃ devi tarjanī śatrunāśinī |
madhyamā dhanasiddhau syācchāntikarmaṇyanāmikā ||
kaniṣṭhākarṣaṇe jñeyā japakarmaṇi siddhidā | 
mālābījantu japtavyaṃ spṛśenna hi parasparam ||
pūrvabījaṃ japan yastu parabījantu saṃspṛśet |
aṅguṣṭhena bhavettasya niṣphalastasya tajjapaḥ ||

<p. 715> (japārambhe visarge ca prāṇāyāmaḥ)

prāṇāyāmaṃ samācarya japaṃ kṛtvā samāhitaḥ |
punaḥ prāṇān samāyamya japañcaiva samarpayet || 549 ||

(japasamarpaṇam)

arghyasya jalapuṣpābhyāṃ devyā dakṣiṇahastataḥ || 550 ||

(samarpaṇamantraḥ)

guhyātiguhyagoptrī tvaṃ gṛhāṇāsmatkṛtaṃ japam | 
siddhirbhavatu me devi tvatprasādānmaheśvari || 551 ||


kiṭi śabdānvitā mālā chinnā bhinnā'pi vā bhavet |
vāmorau dakṣapādañca vinyasya parameśvari ||
baddhavīrāsano mantrī diśaścānavalokayan |
guru(-)daivata(-)mantrāṇāmaikyaṃ sambhāvayan dhiyā || iti |

<550-551 |> ardhyasyeti | atra viśeṣo gandharvatantre saptadaśapaṭale(-)

yathāvidhi japaṃ kṛtvā mantreṇārdhyodakena ca |
japaṃ tañca mahādevyā vāmahaste samarpayet ||
tejorūpaṃ japaphalaṃ śivayā svīkṛtaṃ smaret |
śrībījenaiva pāṇibhyāmavatārārṇaśīrṣataḥ |
sārasvatena bījena hastābhyāṃ sthāpayet tataḥ ||
japakarmaṇi mālāyāḥ pratipattiriyaṃ priye |
evaṃ yaḥ kurute mālāṃ jāpyañca sādhakaḥ priye |
sa prāpnotīpsitaṃ devi hīnasyā''yurviparyayaḥ ||
niḥsetuñca yathā toyaṃ kṣaṇānnimnaṃ prasarpati |
mantrastathaiva niḥsetuḥ kṣaṇāt kṣarati mantriṇām ||
tasmāt sarveṣu mantreṣu sarve varṇā dvijātayaḥ |
pārśvayoḥ setumādadhyājjapakarmaṇi sādhakaḥ ||
akārañcāpyukārañca makārañca prajāpatiḥ | 
vedatrayāt samuddhṛtya praṇavaṃ nirmame purā ||

<p. 716> (devyai rudhiradānam)

gṛhītvā śiṇitaṃ pātraṃ svakīyahṛdayodbhavam |
toyasaindhavasaṃyuktaṃ śarkarāmadhusaṃyutam || 552 ||

abhyukṣya rudhiraṃ dadyād vāgbhavena tu sādhakaḥ |
yathāśakti naro dadyānnābherūrdhvamadho na ca || 553 ||

(stavapāṭhānantaraṃ pradakṣiṇasya kartavyatā)

stutvā pradakṣiṇaṃ kāryaṃ tri(-)sapta(-)navadhā'pi vā |

(aṣṭāṅgapraṇāmasya kartavyatā)

aṣṭāṅgaṃ praṇamenmantrī bhaktibhāvena sādhakaḥ || 554 ||


japādau japakarmānte praṇavaṃ seturūpakam |
niyojayenmaheśāni sarvakāryārthasiddhaye || iti | 

<554 |> stavapāṭhānantaraṃ pradakṣiṇamāha(-)stutvetyādinā | atroktaṃ gandharvatantre 
pañcadaśapaṭale(-)

stuvannānāvidhaiḥ stotrairbhaktibhāvasamanvitaḥ |
praṇamet parameśāni vidhinā sādhakottamaḥ ||

stave viśeṣamāha tatraiva(-)

yat svayaṃ gadyapadyābhyāṃ ghaṭitābhyāṃ namaskriyā |
kriyate bhaktiyuktena vācikastūttamaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
paurāṇikairvaidikairvā tāntrikaiḥ kriyate natiḥ |
sa madhyamo namaskāro bhavedvācanikaḥ sadā ||
pareṣāṃ gadyapadyābhyāṃ namaskāro yadā bhavet |
sa vāciko'dhamo jñeyo namaskāreṣu sarvataḥ || iti |

pradakṣiṇapramāṇañcoktaṃ tatraiva(-)

pradakṣiṇapramāṇañca kuryāddharmārthasādhanam | 
prasārya dakṣiṇaṃ hastaṃ svayaṃ namraśirāḥ punaḥ ||
dakṣiṇaṃ darśayan pārśvaṃ bhaktiśraddhāsamanvitaḥ |
sakṛt pradakṣiṇaṃ kṛtvā vartulākṛtisādhakaḥ ||

<p. 717> (aṣṭāṅgapraṇāmalakṣaṇam)

padbhyāṃ karābhyāṃ jānubhyāmurasā śirasā dṛśā |
vacasā manasā caiva praṇāmo'ṣṭāṅga īritaḥ || 555 ||

(prakārāntareṇāṣṭāṅgapraṇāmaḥ)

sāṣṭāṅgo daṇḍavadbhūmau nipatya hṛdayena tu |
civukena mukhenātha nāsayā mastakena ca |
karṇābhyāṃ brahmarandhreṇa bhūmisparśanameva vā || 556 ||


sa ca pradakṣiṇo jñeyaḥ sarvadevaughatuṣṭidaḥ |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ yastu devyāḥ kuryāt pradakṣiṇam ||
sa sarvakāmamāsādya paścānmokṣamavāpnuyāt ||

saptadhā praṇāmalakṣaṇamuktaṃ tatraiva(-)

trikoṇamatha ṣaṭkoṇamardhacandraṃ pradakṣiṇam |
daṇḍamaṣṭāṅgamugrañca saptadhā natilakṣaṇam ||
dakṣiṇād vāyavīṃ gatvā diśaṃ tasyāśca śāmbhavīm |
tato'pi dakṣiṇāṃ gatvā namaskārastrikoṇavat ||
trikoṇākhyo namaskārastripurāprītidāyakaḥ |
dakṣiṇād vāyavīṃ gatvā vāyavyāḥ śāmbhavīṃ tathā ||
tato'pi dakṣiṇāṃ gatvā tāṃ tyaktvā'gnau praviśya ca |
agnito rākṣasīṃ gatvā kauberīñca tato viśet ||
āgneyīñca tato gatvā namaskāraḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
ṣaṭkoṇākhyo namaskāro durgāyāḥ prītidāyakaḥ ||
dakṣiṇād vāyavīṃ gatvā tasmādvyāvṛtya dakṣiṇam |
gatvā yo'sau namaskāraḥ so'rdhacandro mama priyaḥ ||
namaskāreṣu jānīyādāsāṃ prākṛtamadrije |
tyaktvā svamāsanasthānaṃ paścād gatvā namaskṛtaḥ ||
nipatya daṇḍavad bhūmau daṇḍa ityucyate budhaiḥ |
tathaiva daṇḍavad bhūmau nipatya hṛdayena ca ||
cibukena mukhenātha nāsayā hanukena ca |

<p. 718> (punardaṇḍavat praṇāmaḥ)

kṛtāñjalipuṭo bhūtvā bhūmiṣṭhaḥ praṇamettataḥ |
pratyekaṃ praṇamenmantrī daṇḍavat praṇipātayet || 557 ||

(devāgre bhramaṇaniṣedhaḥ)

devañca madhyagaṃ kṛtvā yo'gre ca bhramaṇañcaret |
namaskāro vṛthā tasya aparādho bhavedatha || 558 ||

(akṛtāñjaleḥ praṇāmaniṣedhaḥ)

akṛtāñjalinā yastu namaskāraṃ karoti vai |
mahāndhakāre narake pacyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 559 ||

(praṇāme mūrdhnā bhūmusparśasya kartavyatā)

pātrāntare ca praṇamenmūrdhnā na ca kṣitiṃ spṛśet |
śapanti devatāstasya viphalaṃ tat prakīrtitam || 560 ||

(daṇḍavatpraṇāmaphalam)

praṇāme devatāyāstu yāvanto reṇavastanau |
tāvadvarṣasahasrāṇi brahmaloke mahīyate || 561 ||


cakṣuṣā cātha karṇābhyāṃ brahmarandhreṇa caiva hi |
tadaṣṭāṅgamiti proktaṃ yad bhūmiṃ spṛśate kramāt ||
brahmarandhreṇa saṃsparśaḥ kṣiteryasyā namaskṛteḥ | 
sa ugra iti vijñeyo viṣṇostuṣṭipradāyakaḥ ||

<560 |> patrāntare iti kuḍyastambhādāvityarthaḥ |

<561 |> praṇāme iti | devatāyāḥ praṇāme yāvatyo dhūlikaṇāḥ śarīralagnā bhavanti 
tatsaṃkhyākasahasravarṣāṇi brahmalokāvāptiḥ phalamiti | gandharvatantre namaskārapraśaṃsā(-)

devamānuṣagandharvā yakṣarākṣasapannagāḥ |
namaskāreṇa tuṣyanti mahātmānaḥ samantataḥ || 
namaskāreṇa labhate caturvargaṃ mahodayam |
sarvatra sarvasiddhyarthaṃ natireva praśasyate ||

<p. 719> pradakṣiṇanamaskāraiḥ paritoṣya maheśvarīm || 562 ||

(punardarpaṇādidānam)

darpaṇaṃ cāmaraṃ chatraṃ bhūyo gandhādyamarpaṇam |

(punarmudrāpradarśanam)

bhūyo'pi mudrānavakaṃ mahādevyai pradarśayet || 563 ||

(nityahomaḥ)

nityahomaṃ tataḥ kuryāttripurāprītikārakam | 

(sthaṇḍilapramāṇam)

svadakṣiṇe hastamātrapramāṇaṃ sthaṇḍilaṃ likhet || 564 ||


natvā vijayate lokān natvā dharmaḥ pravartate |
namaskāreṇa dīrghāyuracchinnā labhate prajāḥ ||
caturvargaṃ labhed bhakto nacirādeva sādhakaḥ |
namaskāro mahāyajñaḥ prītidaḥ sarvataḥ sadā ||
namaskuru mahādevīṃ pradakṣiṇañca bhaktitaḥ |
kāyiko vāgbhavaścaiva mānasastrividhaḥ smṛtaḥ ||
namaskāraśca vijñeya uttamādhamamadhyamaḥ |
kāyikaistu namaskārairdevāstuṣyanti sarvataḥ ||
namaskāreṣu sarveṣu kāyikaḥ prathamaḥ smṛtaḥ |
jānubhyāmavanīṃ gatvā saṃspṛśya śirasā kṣitim ||
kriyate yo namaskāraḥ sa eva kāyikaḥ smṛtaḥ |
jānubhyāṃ kṣitimaspṛṣṭvā śirasā spṛśya medinīm || 
kriyate yo namaskāro madhyamaḥ kāyikastu saḥ |
puṭīkṛtya karau śīrṣe namaskāraḥ pradīyate | 
aspṛṣṭvā jānuśīrṣābhyāṃ kṣitiṃ so'dhama ucyate || iti |

<563 |> bhūyo'pīti | mudrānavakaṃ sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇyādimudrānavakamityarthaḥ | (dra0 pṛ0 640-
<644> |>

<564-570 |> nityahomamityādinā nityahomamāha | tatra sthaṇḍile maṇḍalamāha(-)

<p. 720> (maṇḍalakaraṇam)

trikoṇañcaiva ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vilikhettatra maṇḍalam |

(maṇḍalaṣaṭkoṇe ṣaḍaṅgapūjā madhye devīpūjā ca)

ṣaṭkoṇe ca ṣaḍaṅgāni madhye devīṃ prapūjayet || 565 ||


trikoṇamiti | atra homaprayogasyānullekhāt saṃkṣepahomaprayoga ucyate(-)niruktasthaṇḍile 
vīkṣaṇādibhiḥ saṃskṛte(,) tathāca(-)

vīkṣaṇaṃ mūlamantreṇa śareṇa tāḍanaṃ matam | 
tenaiva prokṣaṇaṃ proktaṃ varmaṇā'bhyukṣaṇaṃ matam ||
prāgagrā udagagrāśca tisro rekhāḥ samālikhet ||

tato mūlamuccārya kuṇḍāya namaḥ iti saṃpūjya prāgagreṣu mukundeśapurandarān udagagreṣu 
ca brahmavaivasvatendūn ṣaṭtārīḥ prayujya pūjayet yathā ai(/) hrī(/) śrī(/) ai(/) klī(/) sauḥ 
mukundāyanamaḥ ityādi | tataḥ kuṇḍamadhye sthaṇḍile vā hū(/)garbhaṃ ṣaṭkoṇavṛtatrikoṇaṃ 
tadbahiraṣṭadalapadmaṃ tadbahiścaturasraṃ caturdvārasametaṃ likhitvā tadupari bālābījena (ai(/) klī(/) 
sauḥ) puṣpāñjalīn dadyāt | tataḥ praṇavena sarvāṇi homadravyāṇyabhyukṣya 
vahneryāgapīṭhamarcayet | tathā(-)karṇikopari ādhāraśaktyādīn saṃpūjya agnyādikoṇacatuṣkeṣu oṃ 
dharmāya(,) jñānāya(,) vairāgyāya(,) aiśvaryāya(,) pūrvādidikṣu adharmāya(,) ajñānāya(,) 
avairāgyāya(,) anaiśvaryāya(,) madhye anantāya(,) padmāya(,) aṃ arkamaṇḍalāya dvādaśakalātmane(,) 
u(/) somamaṇḍalāya ṣoḍaśakalātmane(,) maṃ vahnimaṇḍalāya daśakalātmane(,) tataḥ keśareṣu 
pūrvādito madhye ca pītāyai(,) śvetāyai(,) aruṇāyai(,) kṛṣṇāyai(,) dhūmrāyai(,) tīvrāyai(,) sphuliṅginyai(,) 
rucirāyai(,) jvālinyai raṃ vahnyāsanāya | sarvatra praṇavādinamo'ntena pūjayet | tataḥ 
kāmeśvaraṃ kāmeśvarīṃ ca pūjayet |
	agnyāharaṇamāha gautamīye(-)

pāṣāṇabhavamagniñca yadi vā'raṇisambhavam |
śrotriyāṇāṃ gehajañca vanasthaṃ vā'thavā haret ||
niragnibrāhmaṇāllabdho hyardhalābhakaro bhavet |
kṣatrabandhoścaturthāśaṃ phalaṃ dadyāddhutāśanaḥ ||
vaiśyācchūdrācca viphalaṃ jāyate homakarma tat |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena vahnimuktaṃ samāharet ||

<p. 721> (kravyādāṃśatyāgo vahnisthāpanañca)

kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajya vahniṃ tatra niyojayet |

(vahnidevatayoraikyaṃ vibhāvya iṣṭapūjā)

vahnidevatayoraikyaṃ dhyātveṣṭaṃ tatra pūjayet || 566 ||


tantrāntare(-)

dvijātibhavanād vā'pi vahnimānīya sādhakaḥ |
vauṣaḍantena mūlena mantritaṃ tad vilokayet ||
agnimāvāhayedastramantreṇa tadanantaram |
huṃ phaḍantena mūlena kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajet ||

tataḥ oṃ vahneryogapīṭhāya namaḥ(,) caturdikṣu oṃ vāmāyai(,) jyeṣṭhāyai(,) raudryai(,) ambikāyai(,) 
mūlamuccāryāmukadevatākuṇḍāya nama iti kuṇḍaṃ saṃpūjya yathoktaṃ vahnimānīya 
vīkṣaṇādibhiḥ saṃskṛtya ramiti tasmād vahnimuddhatya mūlamuccārya hu(/) phaṭ kravyādevyaḥ 
svāhā ityanena kravyādāṃśaṃ parityajya phaṭ iti vahnimantreṇa saṃrakṣya hu(/) ityavaguṇṭhya 
vamiti dhenumudrayā'mṛtīkṛtya bāhubhyāṃ samuddhṛtya kuṇḍopari triḥ paribhrāmya 
jānuspṛṣṭamahītalaḥ śivabījabuddhyā ātmano'bhimukhaṃ devyā yonāvenaṃ nikṣipet | tato hrīṃ 
vahnimūrtaye namaḥ ityabhyarcya raṃ vahnicaitanyāya nama iti caitanyaṃ saṃyojya oṃ citpiṅgala 
hana hana daha daha paca paca sarvajñā''j~āpaya svāhā iti jvālayet |

oṃ agniṃ prajvalitaṃ vande jātavedaṃ hutāśanam |
suvarṇavarṇamamalaṃ samiddhaṃ viśvatomukham ||

ityupatiṣṭhet | tato'gre tvamamukadevatānāmā'sīti nāma kṛtvā oṃ vaiśvānara jātaveda 
lohitākṣa ihā''vaha sarvakarmaṇi sādhaya svāhā | ityanenārghyādibhiḥ saṃpūjya oṃ 
agnerhiraṇyādisaptajihvābhyo namaḥ(,) oṃ sahasrārciṣe hṛdayāya namaḥ(,) ityādi agniṣaḍaṅgebhyo 
namaḥ(,) oṃ agnaye jātavedase ityādyaṣṭamūrtibhyo namaḥ(,) oṃ brāhmyādyaṣṭaśaktibhyau namaḥ(,) 
tadbahiḥ padmādyaṣṭanidhibhyaḥ(,) tadbāhye indrādilokapālebhyaḥ(,) tadbāhye vajrādyastrebhyaḥ | 
tataḥ prādeśamātraṃ kuśapatradvayaṃ ghṛtamadhye nikṣipya savyāsavyamadhyabhāgeṣu iḍāṃ 
piṅgalāṃ suṣumṇāṃ dhyātvā homaṃ kuryāt | sruveṇa dakṣiṇabhāgādājyaṃ gṛhītvā oṃ 
agnaye svāheti agnerdakṣiṇanetre(,) tathā vāmabhāgādājyaṃ gṛhītvā oṃ somāya svāheti

<p. 722> (ghṛtaśodhanam)

ghṛtaṃ sthālyāṃ vinikṣipya mūlamantreṇa śodhayet |

(devyā vyāhṛtihomaḥ)

devyā vyāhṛtihomañca kṛtvā sādhakasattamaḥ |


vāmanetre(,) madhyabhāgādājyaṃ gṛhītvā oṃ agnīṣomābhyāṃ svāhetyagnerlalāṭanetre juhuyāt | 
punardakṣiṇataḥ oṃ namaḥ iti ghṛtaṃ gṛhītvā oṃ agnaye sviṣṭakṛte svāhetyāgnimukhe juhuyāt | 
tata oṃ bhūḥ svāhā(,) oṃ bhuvaḥ svāhā(,) oṃ svaḥ svāheti mahāvyāhṛtihomaḥ(,) oṃ vaiśvānara 
jātaveda ihā''vaha lohitākṣa sarvakarmāṇi sādhaya svāhetyanena trivāraṃ juhuyāt | tato 
mūlasya pīṭhadevatāṃ mūladevatāñcāgnau saṃpūjya tanmukhe mūlamantreṇa 
pañcaviṃśativāraṃ juhuyāt | vahnidevatayorātmanā sahaikyaṃ vibhāvya 
mūlamantreṇaikādaśā''hutīrjuhuyāt | tato mūladevasyāṅgadevatābhyaḥ svāhā(,) 
āvaraṇadevatābhyaḥ svāheti(,) śaktaścet pratyekamekaikāhutiṃ juhuyāt | tataḥ saṃkalpaṃ vidhāya 
svakalpoktadravyeṇa homaṃ kuryāt | tato mūlamantreṇa pūrṇāhutiṃ dattvā saṃhāramudrayā 
sveṣṭadevatāṃ hṛdaye samānīya kṣamasveti visarjayediti saṃkṣepahomavidhiḥ |

	gandharvatantre ekatriṃśapaṭale ca(-)

kiṃśukairhavanaṃ devyāḥ kusumbhakusumairapi | 
nāgakeśarapuṣpairvā madhūkai raktapadmakaiḥ ||
karavīrairjavāpuṣpairmadhuratrayamiśritaḥ |
sarvasiddhipradaṃ kuṇḍaṃ caturasraṃ varānane ||
kuṇḍaṃ sulakṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā homayet saṃskṛte'nale |
athavā parameśāni sthoṇḍilaṃ racayed budhaḥ || 
nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kuryānna kāmyaṃ sthaṇḍile caret |
hastamātraṃ caturasraṃ gomayenopalepitam ||
aṅguṣṭhaparvamātroccaṃ vālukāmaṇḍalaṃ tathā | 
tatrāpi lekhanaṃ kṛtvā tatra homaḥ phalapradaḥ ||
yavānāṃ taṇḍulairevamaṅgulañcāṣṭabhirbhavet |
adīrghayojitairhastaścaturviṃśatiraṅgulaiḥ ||
etatpramāṇahastaistu kuṇḍādikaṃ samācaret |
tripurāprītido homaḥ kuṇḍe trikoṇasaṃjñake ||

<p. 723> (japadaśāṃśahomaḥ)

svāhāntamūlamantreṇa daśāṃśaṃ homamācaret || 567 ||

(prāṇāhutyādidānam)

prāṇāhutistu mūlena ṣaḍaṅgena ṣaḍāhutīḥ || 568 ||


paścimāt pūrvāgrāstisro rekhāḥ prādeśapramāṇāḥ |
vilikhya ca mukundendupurandarasvarūpakāḥ ||
dakṣiṇāstisro rekhā vai vilikhya tadanantaram |
rekhāḥ syuśca vaivasvatabrahmānantasvarūpakāḥ ||
trikoṇaṃ madhyato devi kṛtvā vāhye tataḥ param |
ṣaṭkoṇaṃ vidhinā caiva kārayedatisundaram ||
aṣṭapatrañca tadbāhye vṛttena karṇikā śubhā |

caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ maṇḍalaṃ viracayya madhye puṣpāñjaliṃ nikṣipya śruvādikamāsādayet 
| sruva(-)ājyaṃ(-)dadhi(-)dūrvā(-)samidha(-)ājyasthālī(-)praṇītā(-)prokṣaṇī caiva vāmataḥ | evaṃ 
parikalpyāmbhasā prokṣaṇīmāpūrya vāratrayamutpūya tāni prokṣyābhimukhāni kṛtvā 
bālayā'bhimantrya(,) tathaiva dūrvābhirnūlādagraṃ punaragrānmūlaṃ triḥ parimṛjya dūrvābhiḥ 
pūrvāgramuttarāgrañca vistaret | mūlavidyāṃ samuccaran sthaṇḍilāya namaḥ iti saṃpūjya 
trikoṇamadhye kāmeśvarīkāmeśvarau yaṣṭvā tayormithunībhāvaṃ dhyātvā tāvabhyarcya tasyā 
garbhe vaiśvānarajātaveda ihā''vaha lohitākṣa sarvakarmāṇi sādhaya svāheti mūlodgataṃ 
saṃvidagniṃ lalāṭanetradvārā nirgataṃ vāyvagniyuktaṃ pātayet | oṃ uttiṣṭha puruṣa haripiṅgala 
lohitākṣa sarvakarmāṇi dehi me dāpaya svāheti vahnimutthāpya oṃ citpiṅgala hana hana daha 
daha paca paca sarvaṃ jñāpaya svāheti kāmeśvarīgarbhe dhṛtaṃ dhyātvā mūlamuccaran 
vauṣaḍiti vahniṃ vilokya astreṇa saṃrakṣya jvaladagnimādāya sthaṇḍilaṃ dakṣiṇāvartena triḥ 
paribhrāmya jvaladindhanamekaṃ huṃ phaḍityanena kravyādāgniṃ nairṛtyāṃ tyajet | 
jānubhyāmavanīṃ spṛṣṭvā vahniṃ madhye saṃsthāpya klīṃ mahātripurasundarīvahnimūrtaye 
namaḥ iti devīṃ saṃpūjya nābhimaṇḍalād vahannāsāpuṭena tadagninā bāhyāgnimekīkṛtya 
yajet | mūlamuccārya ai(/) klī(/) sauḥ āṃ so'haṃ vahnicaitanyāya namaḥ iti kāmeśvarīgarbhe 
vahniṃ sañcintya taddehe ṣaḍaṅgāni oṃ sahasrārciṣe hṛdayāya namaḥ(,) oṃ svastipūrṇāya śirase 
svāhā(,) oṃ uttiṣṭha puruṣāya śikhāyai vaṣaṭ(,) oṃ dhūmavyāpine kavacāya huṃ(,) oṃ 
saptajihvāyāṃ netrebhyo vauṣaṭ(,) oṃ dhanurdharāyāstrāya phaṭ

<p. 724> (āvaraṇadevatāhomaḥ)

tata āvṛtidevatārthamekaikāmāhutiṃ hunet |

(mūlena ṣaḍāhutihomaḥ)

punarmūlena mantreṇa ṣaḍāhutiṃ samācaret || 569 ||


iti yaṣṭvā taptajāmbūnadaprabhaṃ śaktisvastikadharaṃ varadābhayaśobhitakarapaṅkajaṃ 
divyālaṅkārabhūṣitavigraham ambhojasaṃsthaṃ śuklāmbaradharaṃ trinayanaṃ baddhamauliṃ 
dhyātvā cakre saptajihvāśca pūjayet(-)īśāne yūṃ lohitām(,) pūrve rū(/) raktām(,) āgneye lūṃ 
nīlām(,) nair(-)ṛte vū(/) kṛṣṇām(,) paścime śū(/) śubhrām(,) dakṣe kāṃ karālīm uttare bahurūpām 
iti | tataḥ kāmeśīgarbhādbhavavahneḥ sarvabhāvebhyo namaḥ iti mantreṇa amukāgneramukakarma 
kalpayāmīti vahnergarbhādhāna(-)puṃsavana(-)sīmantonnayana(-)jātakarma(-)nāmakaraṇānnaprāśana(-)
cūḍopanayana(-)godāna(-)vivāhakarma nirvartya pariṣicya(,) paristīrya(,) paridhāya(,) punardhyātvā 
agnimantreṇāgniṃ trikoṇe pūjayitvā saptajihvāsu saptāhutiṃ hutvā vaiśvānara uttiṣṭha citpiṅgala 
iti mantratrayeṇā''hutitrayaṃ vidhāya ṣaḍaṅgāni ṣaṭkoṇeṣu aṣṭadaleṣu(-)agnaye(,) jātavedase(,) 
saptajihvāya(,) havyavāhanāya(,) asrodarāya(,) vaiśvānarāya(,) kaumāratejase(,) devamukhāya nama iti 
lokapālāṃśabhūgṛhe pūjayet | vahnerdakṣiṇato brahmāṇamārādhya ājyasthālīṃ purato 
nidhāya bahurūpāyāṃ jihvāyāṃ śrīcakrarājaṃ tadantaḥsthāṃ citkalām 
aśeṣaraśmimaṇḍitāmālocya yaṣṭvā nityaṃ hutvā kuṇḍaṃ maṇḍapadhūpairāpūrya 
dīpairujjvālya samidhaṃ hutvā juhuyādiṣṭameva ca | valīn pradāya oṃ bhūragnaye ca(,) pṛthivyai 
ca(,) mahate ca svāhā | oṃ bhūyo vāyave cāntarikṣāya ca divye ca mahate ca svāhā | oṃ 
svarādityāya dive ca mahate ca svāhā | oṃ bhūrbhuvaḥ svaścandramase ca nakṣatrebhyaśca 
mahate ca svāhā | iti caturbhirmantrairmahāvyāhṛtihomaṃ kṛtvā brahmārpaṇamataḥ param | 
samidhaṃ hutvā devīmabhyarcya visṛjediti |

nityahomo mayā proktaḥ kāmyahomamataḥ śṛṇu |
mallikā(-)mālatī(-)jātikusumairmadhumiśritaiḥ ||
ghṛtapūrṇaiḥ kulairvā'pi vāgīśatvaṃ prajāyate |
javāpuṣpairājyayuktaiḥ karavīraistathāvidhaiḥ ||

<p. 725> (āhutitrayam)

praṇavañcāgnaye svāhā tridhāhutimanena tu |

(devyā visarjanam)

visarjayettato devīṃ nityahoma iti smṛtaḥ || 570 ||


havanānmohayenmantrī lokatrayanivāsinaḥ |
campakaiḥ pāṭalairhutvā śriyamāpnotyanuttamām ||
kamalairvaruṇairhomaḥ samyaksampattidāyakaḥ |
raktotpalairjagadvaśyaṃ nīlairduṣṭān vaśaṃ nayet |
śvetotpalaiḥ śriyaṃ rājyaṃ labhate havanāt priye ||
kahlārahavanairlakṣmīṃ sarvasaubhāgyameva ca |
bandhūkakusumairhomaiḥ sarvasattvān vaśaṃ nayet ||
kṣīraṃ dadhi madhu tvājyaṃ pṛthag hutvā varānane |
āyurbalamathā''rogyaṃ samṛddhirjāyate nṛṇām ||
rudhirāktena chāgasya māṃsena niśi homataḥ |
madhuratrayayogena guruṇoktavidhānataḥ ||
pararāṣṭraṃ vaśaṃ nītvā kāmabhogī bhavennaraḥ |
drākṣābhirlakṣahomena nārikelaphalaistathā |
rājāno vaśamāyānti samṛddhiratulā tathā ||
jambūphalaiḥ striyaḥ sarvā vaśyā bhavanti niścitam | 
śrīphalairatulāṃ lakṣmīṃ patraiścāpi tathā bhavet ||
ikṣukhaṇḍaiḥ sukhāvāptistadrasairvaśagā nṛpāḥ |
tilājyahomato devi sarvakāryāṇi sādhayet ||
ghṛtapāyasahomena sitājyamadhunā saha | 
trailokyaṃ vaśamāyāti dhanadhānyamavāpnuyāt ||
sopaskāraiśca vaṭakairupasargān vināśayet |
karpūrasya ca homena vāg vaśyā jāyate nṛṇām || 
kuṅkumairhomato devi sarvaduḥkhān vināśayet ||
kastūrīhomato devā vaśagā nātra saṃśayaḥ |
candanāguruhomena sarvāllokān vaśaṃ nayet ||

<p. 726> (homadaśāṃśena tarpaṇam)

tato homadaśāṃśena tarpayejjātibhedataḥ |

(dugdhena tarpaṇopadeśaḥ madyena tarpaṇaniṣedhaśca)

dugdhena tarpaṇaṃ kuryānna tu madyena tarpayet || 571 ||

(madyasya traividhyam)

tarpaṇaṃ bahudhā vindyānmadhupiṣṭaguḍodbhavam || 572 ||

(brāhmaṇādīnāṃ tarpaṇadravyāṇi)

gokṣīraṃ brāhmaṇo dadyād gavyaṃ madyañca bāhujaḥ |


havanadravyāṇāṃ pramāṇañcoktaṃ tatraiva(-)

śṛṇu devi pravakṣyāmi mānaṃ havanasiddhaye |
puṣpaṃ samagraṃ juhuyācchatasaṃkhyāstilāstathā ||
lājā muṣṭipramāṇāḥ syurghṛtaṃ karṣapramāṇakam ||
cullukārdhaṃ madhu kṣīramannaṃ grāsamitaṃ bhavet |
samagraiśca sakhaṇḍaiśca phalānāñca yathecchayā ||
rambhāphalaṃ catuḥkhaṇḍaṃ laghu cet khaṇḍitaṃ nahi | 
nārikelasya khaṇḍastu sthūlaṃ kuryānmanaḥpriyam ||
parvasthāne cekṣudaṇḍaṃ manaḥsantoṣakārakam |
drākṣāphalaṃ samagraṃ syād guñjāmānaṃ tato bhavet ||
karpūrakauṣikādīnaṃ manaḥsantoṣakārakam ||
etadāhutimānañca kathitaṃ sarvasiddhikṛt |
kiṃśukaiḥ pāpasaṅghātanāśakairathavā priye |
nānādravyaiḥ pṛthagbhūtaiḥ saṃgṛhītairvarānane ||
yathāśaktyā tu militairhomaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
sarvavighnasamūhaṃ tannāśayennātra saṃśayaḥ || iti |

<571-573 |> tato hometi | jātibhedata iti brāhmaṇa(-)kṣatriya(-)vaiśya(-)śudrāḥ 
svasvajātyuktadravyairhomasaṃkhyādaśamāṃśa(-)saṃkhyākaistarpayedityarthaḥ | tatrāpi brāhmaṇo 
dugdhena tarpaṇaṃ kuryāt na tu madyena tarpayediti punaḥ punarniṣedhati niṣedhadārḍhyārtham | 
tarpaṇaṃ bahudheti(,)

<p. 727> vaiśyastu mākṣikaṃ dadyācchūdraḥ puṣparasādikam || 573 ||

(devyai madyadānaniṣedhaḥ)

na dadyād brāhmaṇo madyaṃ mahādevyai kadācana |

(brāhmaṇasya vāmācāriṇo'pi madyadānaniṣedhaḥ)

vāmakāmo brāhmaṇo'pi madyaṃ māṃsaṃ na bhakṣayet || 574 ||


atra lakṣaṇayā tarpaṇaśabdasya madyārthakatvaṃ gṛhītvā tasya bahuvidhatvaṃ darśayati(-)
madhupiṣṭaguḍodbhavamiti | surāyastraividhyamuktaṃ manusaṃhitāyāmekādaśādhyāye(-)

gauḍī paiṣṭī ca mādhvī ca vijñeyā trividhā surā |
yathaivaikā tathā sarvā na pātavyā dvijottamaiḥ || iti |

<574-575 |> na dadyāditi vacanamidamuktaṃ śrīkrame | atra saṃvādipramāṇamuktaṃ merutantre 
prathamapaṭale(-)

vāmamārgeṇa taccā''dyavarṇaṃ hitvā praśasyate |
brāhmaṇastu surāṃ pītvā rauravaṃ narakaṃ vrajet |
vāmamārgī brāhmaṇo'pi madyaṃ māsaṃ na bhakṣayet || iti |

rudrayāmale ca(-)

vedatyāgānmadyapānācchūdradāraniṣevaṇāt |
tatkṣaṇājjāyate vipraścāṇḍālādapi garhitaḥ || iti |

kālīkulāmṛte caturthapaṭale ca(-)

brāhmaṇastu surāṃ dattvā brāhmaṇyādeva hīyate |
brāhmaṇaḥ paśurākhyātaḥ pāśavaṃ kalpamācaret ||

kālīkulārṇave ca(-)

surā vai malamannānāṃ purīṣaṃ malamucyate |
tasmād brāhmaṇarājanyau vaiśyaśca na surāṃ pibet ||
surādarśanamātreṇa kuryāt sūryāvalokanam |
tatsamāghrāṇamātreṇa prāṇāyāmatrayañcaret || iti |

<p. 728> (madye'nukalpaḥ)

yatraiva vihitaṃ madyaṃ tatra tatra dvijottamaḥ |
nārikelodakaṃ kāṃsye tāmrapātre sṛjenmadhu || 575 ||

(bṛhacchrīkramatantramatena niruktatarpaṇaprakāraḥ)

evameva prakāreṇa tarpayettripureśvarīm |
bṛhacchrīkramatantrasya matametadudīritam |
satyatretādvāpareṣu krameṇa parikīrtitaḥ || 576 ||

(jñānārṇavamatollekhaḥ)

jñānārṇavamatenāpi varṇānukramabhedataḥ |
kathyante dravyabhedāstu savikalpasya mantriṇaḥ || 577 ||

kṣīrājyamadhumaireyadravyabhedā bhavanti hi || 578 ||


kubjikātantre ca(-)

bhuktvā matsyañca māṃsañca spṛṣṭā hetuñca bhairavi |
trirātropoṣito bhūtvā pañcagavyena śudhyati || iti |

vārāhītantre navamapaṭale'pi(-)

madyaṃ māṃsaṃ tathā matsyaṃ maithunaṃ parameśvari |
mānuṣeṇa baliṃ pañca brāhmaṇo na smaret kvacit || ityādi |

yatraiveti | madye anukalpavidhāyakaṃ vacanaṃ kulacūḍāmaṇau(-)

yatrā''savamavaśyantu brāhmaṇastu viśeṣataḥ |
guḍārdrakaṃ tadā dadyāt tāmrevā visṛjenmadhu || iti |

<577-578 |> varṇānukramabhedata iti | brāhmaṇakṣatriyavaiśyaśūdrabhedenetyarthaḥ | kathyante iti | 
tathā ca savikalpānāṃ brāhmaṇādisādhakānāṃ yathāsaṃkhyaṃ dugdha(-)ghṛta(-)madhu(-)
mairayaistarpaṇaṃ bhavatīti bhāvaḥ | maireyalakṣaṇe śabdakalpadramadhṛtaṃ mādhavācāryoktaṃ 
pramāṇam(-)

sīdhurikṣurasaiḥ pakvairapakvairāsavo bhavet |
maireyaṃ dhātakīpuṣpaṃ guḍadhānāmlasaṃhitam || iti |

<p. 729> (ātmanaḥ kāmakalārūpacintanam)

kāmī kāmakalārūpamātmānaṃ cintayettataḥ |
pūrvoktenaiva vidhinā cintayet sundarīṃ parām || 579 ||


<579 |> kāmīti | ātmānaṃ kāmakalārūpaṃ cintayedityarthaḥ | kāmakalāyāḥ svarūpamuktaṃ 
gandharvatantre triṃśapaṭale(-)

tattraividhyaṃ śṛṇu prājñe sarvatantreṣu gopitam |
sthūlaṃ samaṃ tathā nāma sūkṣmaṃ mantratanūṃ tathā ||
nabhobindumukhī sā ca candra(-)sūrya(-)tamaḥprabhā |
svameru(-)hārdakalayā śobhamānā mahī yadā ||
pātālatalavinyastā trilokīyaṃ kalātmikā |
lalitāyāstribhirbījaiḥ prakāśārtho ya īryate ||
teṣāṃ vimarśa īkāro bindunā yat tridhāgatam |
tat turīyasvarūpārṇabindutrayavadīritam ||
īkārordhvagato bindurmadhyatāñca gate ravau |
stanau dahanaśītāṃśū yonirhārdakalā bhavet ||
tadātmakastu devyāste sādhakasya ca tad bhavet |
tadudbhavaṃ śṛṇu prājñe mahodayakaraṃ param ||
ūrdhvabindvātmakaṃ vaktramadho bindudvayātmakam |
kucadvayantu taccheṣaiḥ śeṣāṅgāṇi vibhāvayet ||
iti te gaditā kāmakalāyā bāhyabhāvanā |
tāmeva tvāṃ punarvakṣye bhāvanāmāntarātmikām ||
mūlādibrahmarandhrāntaṃ sphuradvidyullatākṛtim |
dhyāyet kuṇḍalinīṃ devi tadvidyāsvarūpiṇīm ||
ṣaṭcakrabhedinīṃ devīṃ bindutrayātmikāṃ parām |
tāñca hārdakalārūpāṃ cintayet padmamadhyagām ||
evaṃ kāmakalārūpā jāgartiṃ sacarācare |
sā ca trayīmayī proktā nāsti kiñcit tayā vinā ||

<p. 730> sṛṣṭicakre yajet pūrvāṃ malayāṃ dakṣiṇāṃ sthitau |
paścimāṃ pralaye cakre granthisthāneṣu cottarām || 580 ||

tāsāṃ mantraṃ pravakṣyāmi jñānārṇavānusārataḥ | 
śivacandrāgnidīrghākṣibindunādakalātmakam || 581 ||

candreśavahnivāmākṣinādabindukalānvitam |
śaktiṃ kalāḍhyamante ca turyabījamudīritam || 582 ||

śrībījaṃ kuru tārttīyaṃ vidyā vedākṣarī bhavet |
eṣā pūrvāmnāyavidyā rudraśaktiriyaṃ bhavet || 583 ||

vākklinne kāmabījañca madadrave kule hasauḥ |
varṇitā rudravarṇeyaṃ dakṣiṇāmnāyadevatā || 584 ||


sāmnā mukhaṃ samākhyātamṛgyajurbhyāṃ stanadvayam |
atharvaṇā samākhyātā hārdarūpā parā kalā ||
turīyaṃ parameśāni sākṣād brahmaiva kevalam |
etat kāmakalādhyānaṃ guhyād guhyatamaṃ param || iti |

<580-583 |> caturāmnāyavidyāmāha(-)sṛṣṭicakre ityādi | tatra pūrvāmnāyavidyāmantroddhāramāha(-)
śiveti | śivo hakāraḥ(,) candraḥ sakāraḥ(,) agnī rephaḥ(,) dīrghākṣirīkāraḥ(,) tathāca 
prathamākṣaraḥ hasarīṃ(,) evaṃ mantroddhāreṇa dvitīyaḥ saharīṃ(,) tṛtīyaḥ śrīṃ(,) kalāḍhyaṃ 
śaktibījamiti caturthaḥ kalahrīm iti caturakṣarī pūrvāmnāyarudraśaktiḥ | vyaktamāha jñānārṇave 
daśamapaṭale(-)

caturāmnāyavidyābhirmānyaṃ siṃhāsanaṃ priye |
hasrīmātmakamuccārya sahrīmātmakamadrije ||
śaktiḥ kalābhyāmante ca turyaṃ bījamudāhṛtam |
śrībījaṃ kuru tārtīyaṃ vidyā vedākṣarī bhavet ||
unmanī nāma vidyeyaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradā ||
pūrvāmnāye mahāvidyeti |

<584 |> vākklinne iti | tathāca aiṃ klinne klīṃ madadrave kule hasauḥ iti

<p. 731> avadhūteśvarīnāmnīṃ jñātvā tāṃ sādhako'rcayet |
vāgbhavañca mahāmāyāṃ śrībījaṃ hasakhaphremiti || 585 ||

rudreśvareṇa saṃbhidya bindunādāṅkitaṃ hasauḥ |
pañcapraṇavamuddiṣṭaṃ sarvapakṣeṣu durlabham || 586 ||

etatsaṃpuṭitāṃ vidyāṃ dvātriṃśārṇāṃ likhed budhaḥ |
namo bhagavati prānte caturthaṃ praṇavaṃ likhet || 587 ||

īśvarākhyaṃ krameṇaiva kubjike ca padantathā |
aimātmakaṃ parāṃ vidyāṃ śrīmātmakamataḥ param || 588 ||


ekādaśākṣarī dakṣiṇāmnāya vidyā | enām avadhūteśvarīṃ sādhakaḥ pūjayet | 
jñānārṇave mantroddhārastu(-)

(-)dakṣiṇāmnāya ucyate |
vāgbhavaṃ bījamuccārya klinne kāmasya bījakam |
madadrave kule hasrau vidyeyaṃ bhiginī priye |
dakṣiṇāmnāya vidyeyamiti |

<585-590 |> vāgbhavamityādi | tathāca ai(/)(,) hrī(/)(,) śrī(/)(,) hasakhaphre(/)(,) hasarau(/)(,) iti ete pañca praṇavāḥ 
| etatsaṃpuṭitāṃ dvātriṃśadvarṇāṃ vidyāṃ likhet | sā ca(-)namo bhagavati hasakhaphre(/) hau(/) 
kubjike ai(/) hrī(/) śrī(/) aghore ghore aghoramukhi kliṃ kliṃ kilikili vicce | iti dvātriṃśadakṣarī ṛk | 
iyaṃ bhogamokṣapradāyinī paścimāmnāyadevīti viśado'rthaḥ | atra yadyapi granthakāreṇa 
jñānārṇavamatamullikhya mantravinyāsaḥ kṛtaḥ(,) tathā'pi mudritajñānārṇave mantro'yamaṃśato 
bhinna iti granthapāṭhaḥ pradarśyate(-)

(-)paścimāmnāya ucyate |

vāgbhavañca parā śrī(/) ca hasakhaphremiti priye | 
hasrau mantāstato devi pañcaite praṇavāḥ smṛtāḥ ||
bhagavatyamba ālikhya pṛthak padamatheśvari |
caturthaṃ praṇavañcaiva khasahaphremiti priye ||

<p. 732> aghore caiva ghore aghoramukhi ca saṃlikhet |
kliṃ kliṃ kiliyugaṃ vicce kubjikā śāmbhavī parā || 589 ||

paścimāmnāyadeveśī bhogamokṣapradāyinī |
kaphremātmakamuccārya mahācaṇḍapadaṃ likhet || 590 ||

yogeśvarīpadaṃ paścād vidyaiṣā kālikā matā |
uttarāmnāyavidyeyaṃ navārṇā parameśvarī || 591 ||

(grahādīnāṃ pūjā)

navagrahāṃśca meṣādīnnakṣatrāṇi samarcayet |
yogāṃśca karaṇānyeva tithimāsānṛtūnapi || 592 ||

(kalādīnāṃ ḍākinyādīnāṃ ca pūjā)

kalākāṣṭhāni pakṣāṃśca ḍākinīṃ yākinīṃ tathā | 
lākinīṃ kākinīñcaiva sākinīṃ hlākinīmapi || 593 ||


kubjike caiva hasrāṃ ca hasrīṃ hasrau(/) tataḥ param |
aghore caiva ghore ca tvaghoramukhi cā''khilet ||
hasrāṃ hasrīṃ kiṇidvandvaṃ vicce dvātriṃśadakṣarī ||
kubjikeyaṃ mahāvidyā paścimāmnāyadevatā || iti |

<590-591 |> khaphremiti | tathāca khaphre(/) mahācaṇḍayogeśvarī iti navākṣarī kālikānāmnī 
uttarāmnāyavidyā bhavati | mantrasyāsyoddhāro jñānārṇavatantre(-)

khaphremātmakamuccārya mahācaṇḍapadaṃ likhet | 
yogeśvarīpadaṃ paścād vidyeyaṃ kālikā priye ||
uttarāmnāyavidyeyaṃ nāmnā kālīti viśrutā | 
etābhiḥ parameśāni pūjyaṃ siṃhāsanaṃ sadā || iti |

<p. 733> (pūjāsthānaṃ phalañca)

śrīcakramadhye saṃpūjya sādhakaḥ śivatāṃ vrajet |

(aṅgabalidānam)

athavā'ṅgabaliṃ dadyādadhunā sādhakottamaḥ || 594 ||

(balidānamantraḥ)

svāhāntenā''tmatattvādyairmūlabījapuraḥsaraiḥ |

(prasādasvīkaraṇam)

tasyāḥ prasādaṃ svīkṛtya cullukārghyodakena ca || 595 ||

(ātmasamarpaṇam)

ātmārpaṇaṃ tataḥ kuryāt pūrvoktaṃ mantramuccaran |

(īdṛśī pūjā puraścaraṇe'pi)

puraścaraṇakāle'pi saparyaiṣā prakīrtitā || 596 ||

(parāṅmukhārghyadānam)

mūlamantraṃ samuccārya tripurāsundarīti ca |
parāṅmukhārghyasvāheti parāṅmukhārghya īritaḥ || 597 ||

(devyaṅge sarvadevatāvilayanam)

śrīmattripurasundaryāḥ śarīre sarvadevatāḥ |
vilīnāḥ santu mūlena devyaṅge vihitāḥ smaret || 598 ||

(ātmanaḥ punaḥ kāmakalārūpacintanam)

punaḥ kāmakalārūpamātmānaṃ paricintayet |

(visarjanam)

dhyātvā cakreṇa sahitāṃ śrīmattripurasundarīm || 599 ||

khecaryā śakticakrantu kṣamasveti visarjayet |

<p. 734> (devyaṅge ṣaḍaṅganyāsaḥ)

devīmūrtau ṣaḍaṅgāni nyasya mūlaṃ samuccaran |

(yantrasthapuṣpāghrāṇam)

yantrasthaṃ puṣpamāghrāya baddhvā saṃhāramudrikām || 600 ||

(visarjanamantraḥ)

gaccha gaccha paraṃ sthānaṃ svasthānaṃ parameśvari |
yatra brahmādayo devā labheyuḥ paramaṃ padam || 601 ||

(visarjanānantarakṛtyopadeśaḥ)

visṛjyānena tāṃ devīṃ tataḥ pūrakavāyunā |
dhyāyettu mantreṇānena devīṃ saṃsthāpayed hṛdi || 602 ||

(śevikāsundarīpūjanamantraḥ)

lehyacoṣyānnapānādi tāmbūlamanulepanam |
nirmālyabhojanaṃ tubhyaṃ dadāmi śrīśivājñayā || 603 ||

anena manunā mantrī śevikāṃ sundarīṃ yajet |

(kāmakalādhyānam)

tataḥ kāmakalāṃ dhyāyeddurvārāmindumālinīm | 
sendukhaṇḍāñca sākārāṃ nirākāre'tha melayet || 604 ||

(prāṇāyāmaḥ ṣaḍaṅganyāsaśca)

prāṇāyāmaṃ vidhāyātha ṣaḍaṅgāni nyased budhaḥ |

(śrīpādukāpūjā)

tanutrayaṃ samuccārya tataḥ śrīpādukāṃ yajet || 605 ||


<605 |> tanutrayamiti mūlabījatrayamityarthaḥ | śiṣṭaṃ sugamam |

<p. 735> (mānasakarmayogaḥ)

athavā mānase karmayoge tu paramavyayam |
mūlodgataṃ śakticakraṃ punarmūlaṃ nayet kramāt || 606 ||

mūlaṃ cā''tmani cidrūpe yajjuṣṭaṃ tat tadeva hi |
asminnevāvyaye tattve vilīnaṃ tad vicintayet || 607 ||

pravāhaṃ nāśayet saṃvidagnau saṃbhedakarmaṇi | 
idantālakṣaṇaṃ dravyaṃ juhuyādabahirmukhaḥ || 608 ||

puṣpādikaṃ tato ghrātvā hyantardeśe vinikṣipet |
kathitaḥ karmayogo'yaṃ yena tanniṣṭhatā bhavet || 609 ||

(karmayogābhyāse siddhiḥ)

etadabhyāsataścaiva siddho bhavati yogirāṭ || 610 ||

(nirmālyādīnāṃ dhāraṇādyupadeśaḥ)

nirmālyaṃ śirasā dhāryaṃ sarvāṅgamanulepanam | 
naivedyaṃ copabhuñjīta dattvā tadbhaktiśāline || 611 ||


<606-609 |> athaveti | mānase karmayoge iti jñānayoge iti bhāvaḥ | tatra paramamavyayatattvaṃ 
mūlādhāre śakticakraṃ vicintya tat tattvaṃ cidrūpe ātmani brahmarandhrasthitasahasradalakamale 
melayitvā śakticakreṇa militaṃ tanmūlādhāraṃ samānayet | punaḥ śakticakramilitamātmacakram 
asminnevāvyaye tattve vilīnaṃ vibhāvayet | asmin melanakarmaṇi jāte jñānāgnau 
bāhyavastupravāhaṃ bhasmīkuryāt(,) evañca antarmukho ghaṭādibāhyavastūni tatra nāśayet | 
tathāca jñānamayaṃ nityaṃ vastu eva prakāśitaṃ bhavedātmanīti saṃkṣepaḥ | anena 
karmayogābhyāsena ātmaniṣṭhatā bhavediti bhāvaḥ |

<611 |> nirmālyadhāraṇādikamupadiśati(-)nirmālyamiti | vyaktamuktaṃ 
śivārcanacandrikādhṛtamālinītantre(-)

arghyatoyena deveśi gandhaṃ pūjāvaśeṣitam |
āloḍya kiñcinmūlena mantreṇa tvaṣṭakaṃ śive ||

<p. 736> (gurupraṇāmaḥ)

tataśca gurave dadyānnamaskāratrayaṃ sidhīḥ || 612 ||

(śaṅkhajalapraśaṃsā)

devārcanāvaśiṣṭaṃ yat salilaṃ śaṅkhamadhyagam | 
aṅge lagnaṃ manuṣyāṇāṃ brahmahatyāṃ vyapohati || 613 ||

(śrīcakrapādodakapraśaṃsā)

gaṅgāpuṣkaranarmadāsu yamunāgodāvarīgomatī(-)
gaṅgādvāragayāprayāgabadarīvārāṇasīsindhuṣu | 
revāśoṇasarasvatīprabhṛtiṣu brahmāṇḍabhāṇḍodare
tīrthasnānasahasrakoṭiphaladaṃ śrīcakrapādodakam || 614 ||

(bhaṅgyā svoktau prāmāṇyopanyāsaḥ)

nānātantramataṃ jñātvā śrīgurormatameva ca |
pūrṇānandena kṛtinā saparyaiṣā prakīrtitā || 615 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrītattvacintāmaṇau saparyāvivaraṇaṃ nāmāṣṭādaśaḥ 
prakāśaḥ] || 18 ||


prokṣayet tena toyena svātmānaṃ mūlamantrataḥ |
nirmālyaṃ mastake dhāryaṃ mūlamantreṇa mantriṇā ||
prāśya pādodakaṃ devi navedyaṃ vibhajet priye |
tadbhaktebhyaḥ svayaṃ bhuktvā tanmayo viharet sukham || iti |

tatrāpi viśeṣaḥ picchilātantre ekādaśapaṭale(-)

javāpuṣpaṃ maheśāni dadyānna dhārayet kvacit || iti |



[ekonaviṃśaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(tripurārṇavoktaṃ tripurasundarīstotram)

atha stotraṃ pravakṣyāmi tripurārṇava īritam

kiṃ kiṃ dvandvaṃ danujadalini kṣīyate na śrutāyāṃ
kā kā siddhiḥ kulakamalini prāpyate nārcitāyām |
kā kā kīrtiḥ suravaranute vyāpyate na stutāyāṃ
kaṃ kaṃ bhogaṃ tvayi na cinute cittamālambitāyām || 1 ||

sakusaṃ saku(?)saṃ rambha svāritā mokṣavibhrame |
ciccandramaṇḍalāntaḥsthe namaste haravallabhe || 2 ||

jagaduddhāraṇodyoga(-)yogabhogaviyogini |
sthitibhāvasthite devi namaḥ sthāṇupriye'mbike || 3 ||

bhāvābhāvapṛthagbhāvānubhāve vedakarmaṇi |
caitanyapañcake devi namastubhyaṃ harāṅgane || 4 ||

sṛṣṭisthityupasaṃhārapratyurjitapadadvaye |
cidviśrāntimahāsattāmātre mātarnamo'stu te || 5 ||


<1 |> kiṃ kimiti | padyamidaṃ tantrasāroktakiṅkiṇīstotrasya prathamaślokamanuvadati pāṭhabhedena |

<p. 738> vahṇyarkaśītakiraṇabrahmacakrāntarodite |
catuḥpīṭheśvari śive namaste tripureśvari || 6 ||

carācaramidaṃ viśvaṃ prakāśayasi tejasā |
mātṛkārūpamāsthāya tasyai mātarnamo'stu te || 7 ||

smṛtā bhavabhayaṃ haṃsi pūjitā'si śubhaṅkari (rī) |
stutā tvaṃ vācchitaṃ vastu dadāsi karuṇāvare || 8 ||

bhaktasya nityapūjāyāṃ ratasya mama sāmpratam |
vāgbhavādimahāsiddhiṃ dehi tripurasundari || 9 ||

paramānandasandohapramodabharanirbhare | 
duḥkhatrayaparimlānavadanaṃ pāhi māṃ śive || 10 ||

śabdabrahmamayi yacca devi tripurasundari |
yathāśakti japaṃ pūjāṃ gṛhāṇa madanugrahāt || 11 ||

ajñānādalpabuddhitvādālasyād duṣṭabhāvataḥ |
mamāparādhaṃ kārpaṇyaṃ kṣamasva paradevate || 12 ||

ajñānāmasamarthānāmasvasthānanivāsinām |
aśuddhaṃ balamasmākaṃ śiśūnāṃ haravallabhe || 13 ||

kṛpāmayi kṛpāṃ bhadre sakṛnmayi niveśaya |
tāvadahaṃ kṛtārtho'smi na te kiñcana hīyate || 14 ||


<8 |> smṛteti | padyamidamupalabhyate kiṅkiṇīstotre'pi |

<p. 739> yanmayā kriyate karma jāgratsvapnasuṣuptiṣu |
tat sarvaṃ tāvakī pūjā bhūyād bhūtyai rame śive || 15 ||

dravyahīnaṃ kriyāhīnaṃ vidhihīnañca yad bhavet |
tat sarvaṃ kṛpayā devi kṣamasva paradevate || 16 ||

yanmayoktaṃ mahājñānaṃ tanmahat svalpameva vā |
tāvat sarvaṃ jagaddhātri kṣantavyamayamañjaliḥ || 17 ||


śrītattvacintāmaṇiḥ

(śaṅkarācāryoktaṃ stotram)

imaṃ stavaṃ pravakṣyāmi śaṅkarācāryabhāṣitam |
ratnāmitāmbunidhimadhyalasatpravāla(-)
dvīpasphuratparamanandanakānanāntaḥ |
śrīvṛkṣamūlatalapaścimavaktraratna(-)
gehāntarādbhutamahāmaṇipīṭhikāyām || 1 ||

bindutrikoṇabahiraṣṭakakoṇabāhyā(-)
ddikkoṇadikparacaturdaśakoṇayuktam |
vṛttāṣṭaṣoḍaśadalānatavṛttaloka(-)
bhūpūścaturmukhamahaṃ praṇamāmi cakram || 2 ||

pāśāṅkuśāmṛtakapālasuśūlahastaṃ
hastyānanaṃ vividhabhūṣaṇanīladeham |
nityotsavaṃ sakalavighnavināśahetuṃ
śrīmadgaṇeśvaramahaṃ praṇamāmi nityam || 3 ||

pīyūṣabhāṇḍamasidaṇḍakapālakhaṇḍa(-)
caṇḍāticaṇḍabhujadaṇḍamatipracaṇḍam |
śrīkuṇḍaladbyavimaṇḍitagaṇḍamīḍe
nīlaṃ vaṭuṃ vaṭukanāthamahīndrahāram || 4 ||

cañcatkapālasukṛpāṇasaśūladaṇḍa(-)
mudyadḍamaḍḍamarumaṇḍitapāṇidaṇḍam |

<p. 741> nīlāñjanapracayapuñjamiva prasannaṃ
śrīkṣetrapālakamamuṃ śaraṇaṃ śrayāmi || 5 ||

cakrāticakraparidāritadaityacakra(-)
cakrākṣikambuparicumbikarāṃ kumārīm |
durgāṃ nisargamunivanditadurgadurga(-)
siṃhāsanoparigatāṃ satataṃ śrayāmi || 6 ||

padmadvayābhayavarodyatapāṇipadmāṃ
padmāsanena samalaṅkṛtapādapadmām |
padmāṃ supadmavadanāṃ khalu padmanābha(-)
hṛtpadmamadhyavasatiṃ satataṃ prapadye || 7 ||

udyatsudhānidhisahasramarīcigaurīṃ
vāgīśvarīṃ sakalavāṅmayasāgarāṇām |
kaṇṭhe sadā luṭhatu me sphaṭikākṣamālā
śrīrjñānapustakavarābhayaśastahastā || 8 ||

bandhūkapuṣpavapuṣaṃ madaghūrṇamānaṃ
puṣpeṣucāpakusumeṣukaraṃ varākṣyā |
yadbandhanāt kanakakāntisāmānakāntyā
svāliṅgitaṃ ratipatiṃ satataṃ smarāmi || 9 ||

prītyāvaśaṃ bhuvi vasantamahaṃ bhavantaṃ
nṛtyantamadbhutamahotsavadaṃ vasantam |

<p. 742> vande sunandanavane śarabindukāntaṃ
santānasantatilatāsu vikāśayantam || 10 ||

bhaktyāśritābhayavarodyatapāṇipadmau
devau samānaracitāsanasanniviṣṭau | 
dvāre pure paramadaivatadevatāyāḥ
śrīśaṅkhapadma ca nidhī (?) nidadhāmi mūrdhni || 11 ||

cintāmaṇipraṇayadakṣiṇapāṇyabhīti(-)
dānollasatkamalakomalavāmapāṇīḥ |
raktadyutīḥ śaśidharāḥ prakaṭāṇimādyā(-)
strailokyamohanagatāḥ paripūjayāmi || 12 ||

raktotpalāmṛtakapāladharāḥ karābhyāṃ
vaṃśītamāladalakomalanīladehāḥ |
brāhmyādikā rudhirabhūṣaṇaraktavastrā
mātardvitīyacaturasragatā bhajāmi || 13 ||

pāśāṅkuśāktitayathāyathabaddhabaddha(-)
mudrāvimudritakarāṃ taruṇāruṇābhām |
śrīmattṛtīyacaturasragasarvapūrva(-)
saṃkṣobhapūrvadaladaivatamarcayāmi || 14 ||

śoṇāḥ sapāśaśṛṇipāṇiyugābhirāmāḥ
kāmādyakarṣaṇamukhāḥ subhagāśca nityāḥ |

<p. 743> guptāḥ kalānidhikalāḥ khalu sarvavāñchā(-)
saṃpūrṇaṣoḍaśadale paripūjayāmi || 15 ||

śrīdevyacintyamahimā abhidīpyamānā
raktāḥ suguptataranāmadharā dayārdāḥ |
śaktīranaṅgakusumādikayāṣṭa sarva(-)
saṃkṣobhake'ṣṭadalake paripūjayāmi || 16 ||

śoṇāḥ sabāṇadhanuṣaḥ khalu sarvapūrva(-)
saṃkṣobhaṇādikacaturdaśadevatāstāḥ |
satsampradāyavidhinā paripūjayāmi
saubhāgyadāyakacaturdaśakoṇacakre || 17 ||

śubhrā varābhayakarāḥ khalu sarvapūrva(-)
siddhipradā daśadiśodbhutaśaktiśaktīḥ |
sarvārthasādhakabahirdaśakoṇacakre
saṃpūjayāmi kulakaulikayoginīstāḥ || 18 ||

karpūrapūrarucirāṅgadharākṣamālāḥ
śrītattvapūjakabhṛto'tinigarbhadevī | 
sarvārtharakṣaṇakare daśakoṇacakre
sarvajñikā pramathikā daśa pūjayāmi || 19 ||

cāpeṣupustakalasatsphaṭikākṣamālāṃ
bālapravālarucirāṃ vaśinīpradhānām |

<p. 744> sarvādirogaharacakravare trikoṇe
vāgdevatāṣṭakamahaṃ sarahasyamīḍe || 20 ||

raktā varābhayakarāḥ śirasā dadhānāḥ
pāśāṅkuśeṣudhanurāyudhabhūṣaṇāni |
śrīmattrikoṇabahirātmakadevatāstā
rakṣantu santatamanantaguṇāścatasraḥ || 21 ||

śrīmattrikoṇabahirātmakadevatāstā
devīḥ ṣaḍaṅgayuvatīḥ paripūjayāmi |
kundendukajjalakaḍārapiśaṅgahavya(-)
vāhaśriyo'bhayavarodyatapāṇipadmāḥ || 22 ||

śrīmattrikoṇaparamādbhutasarvapūrva(-)
siddhipradeti paramāmṛtahavyadevyaḥ |
kāmeśvarī mama dadātu samastakāmān
vajreśvarī bhagavatī bhagamālinī ca || 23 ||

śrīmattrikoṇapuravisphuritāṃ trinetrāṃ
bālātapāruṇatanuṃ taruṇendumaulim |
pīyūṣabhājanadharāṅkuśapāśahastāṃ
kāmeśvarīṃ bhagavatīṃ paripūjayāmi || 24 ||

pāśāṅkuśāmṛtakapālakamātulaṅga(-)
cāpeṣusaṅgatakarāmaruṇāṃ trinetrām |
śrīmattrikoṇaparadaivatadakṣiṇasthāṃ
vajreśvarīṃ bhagavatīṃ paripūjayāmi || 25 ||

<p. 745> candrānanāṃ trinayanāṃ taruṇendumastāṃ
pāśāṅkuśākṣaguṇapustakaśastahastām |
śrīmattrikoṇaparadaivatavāmabhāge
śubhrāṃ bhaje bhagavatīṃ bhagamālinīñca || 26 ||

cakrātiguhyaparamādbhutasarvapūrvā(-)
nandātmake'tiparame navameṣu pūrve |
bhaktyā parāparatarātirahasyadevīṃ
seve parāparamayīṃ parameśvarīṃ tām || 27 ||

pratyagrajāgradaruṇāmbujavaktrabimba(-)
cumbālikālakuṭilālakapallavāṃ tām |
ānandasādrakaruṇāmayasuprasannā(nna(-))
līlāni(ti)lolanalinotpalalocanālim || 28 ||

sindūrasundaraśarīravirājamāna(-)
rājīvadāḍimajavānavabandhujīvām |
śrīmanmahāmukuṭakoṭimahārghyaratna(-)
sabrahmacāriparamāmṛtacandrarekhām || 29 ||

subhrūtayā vijitarūpapinākapāṇe(-)
rbāṇāsanarddhiviniveśitabāṇalīlām |
tadviśvakarmaparisūtritanāsikāgrāṃ
padmāsanāṃ trinayanāṃ taruṇendumastām || 30 ||

<p. 746> īṣadvikāśitamanoharahāsadanta(-)
vāsaḥśriyā jitanavoditacandrarekhām |
saundaryadaivatamahāmṛganābhicitra(-)
patrāṃśumindukamanīyalalāṭapaṭṭām || 31 ||

lāvaṇyabhāṇḍaśubhagaṇḍayugābhirāmā(-)
naupamyakānticikurābhivirājamānām |
śrīkuṇḍaladvayavimaṇḍitagaṇḍaśobhā(-)
pāṇḍityakhaṇḍitasudhānidhimaṇḍalābhām || 32 ||

karpūrapūraparipūritacārunāga(-)
vallīrasārdrakhapurāḍhyanibhādharauṣṭhīm |
graiveyacumbitamaṇidyutidīpyamāna(-)
sacchāyayā dviguṇaśobhitakambukaṇṭhīm || 33 ||

lākṣārasasnapitabālamṛṇālanāla(-)
līlālayāmalarasāñcitabāhuvallīm | 
raktotpalojjvaladalāmalakomalābhi(-)
rbālapravālalalitāṅgulipāṇilīlām || 34 ||

tadviśvakarmapariyatnavinirmitaśrī(-)
ratnāṅgurīyakanakhadyutidīpyamānām |
kenāpi kāraṇavaśena gṛhītabaddha(-)
pāśāṅkuśeṣudhanurāyudhabhūṣaṇānām(ṇāṃ tām) || 35 ||

<p. 747> trailokyadurlabhamahāmaṇināyakaśrī(-)
saṃsaktamauktikaphalojjvalahāralakṣmīm |
lāvaṇyavāriparipūrṇasuvarṇakumbha(-)
śobhābhibhāvikucamaṇḍalapūrṇakumbhām || 36 ||

lokatraye'pyatisudurlabhasāmyasaumya(-)
śobhāvibhākaravalitrayaśobhimadhyām |
lāvaṇyanābhigahanābhigṛhapraviṣṭa(-)
śrīmanmahādyutimayīṃ navalomarājīm || 37 ||

cañcanmarīcinicayāñcitakāñcanāñcat(-)
kāñcīvikāśiruciraktavicitravastrām |
śrīkāmakānanasamudbhavarāmarambhā(-)
stambhābhibhāvisukumārataroruyugmām || 38 ||

vṛttānupūrvavidhidurghaṭasanniveśa(-)
jaṅghāyugābhiramaṇāṃ maṇigūḍhagulphām |
vācaspaterapi vacoracanābhiśobhi(-)
saundaryagocaramanoharapādapadmām || 39 ||

śrībrahmaviṣṇuśivamaulilasadvimāna(a(-))
mālokyamānakaruṇāruṇapādapadmām |
śrīsādhakāya karuṇāmayasuprasanna(-)
dṛṣṭātidiṣṭavaradānamadhaḥprasannām || 40 ||

<p. 748> trailokyamohanamayīṃ parameśvarīṃ tāṃ
trailokyakāraṇamayīṃ parameśvarīṃ tām |
trailokyavismayamayīṃ parameśvarīṃ tāṃ
cakreśvarīṃ śubhakarīṃ paripūjayāmi || 41 ||

trailokyamohanamukhābjakacakrametat
sthāne'ṇimādiprakaṭādikasiddhidevīm |
śrīmadgurukramasamastasamantramudrāḥ
puṣpaiḥ prapūjya parameśvari te'rcayāmi || 42 ||

padmādibhūtamaṇipañcadaśīrna yāva
nnityā tithikramamayīṃ khalu ke'pi dhanyāḥ |
kāmeśvarīprabhṛtipañcadaśādinityā
mantraiḥ paraṃ paramayīṃ paripūjayāmi || 43 ||

tvaṃ gīyase prathamatastripureti mātaḥ
paścāddvitīyanavamatripureśvarīti |
tārtīyake tripurasundariketi turye
mātaḥ parā tripuravāsinikā tvameva || 44 ||

tvaṃ pañcame bhagavatī tripurā parāśrīḥ
ṣaṣṭhe parā tripuramālinikā tvameva | 
tvaṃ saptame bhagavatī tripurādisiddhā
tvañcāṣṭame bhagavatī tripurātmaketi || 45 ||

<p. 749> pūrṇe parāparamaye parame'tiguhye
śrīmanmahātripurasundarikā tvameva |
śrīmanmahātmakamahādbhutacakrarāje
tvaṃ gīyase sukṛtibhiḥ khalu kaiśca devī || 46 ||

ādau daśāṣṭa daśa ṣoḍaśa cāṣṭa cāsi
paścāccaturdaśa daśāsi tato daśāṣṭau
paścāccatuṣṭayamasi tritayañca ṣaṭkaṃ
saptottarā śatamayī tvamasi tvamekā || 47 ||

kāmeśvarīti bhagamāliniketi nitya(-)
klinneti tairuparatā'pi hiraṇḍaketi |
tvaṃ vahnivāsanirateti mahādibhūta(-)
vidyeśvarīti ca tathā śivadūtiketi || 48 ||

mātaḥ parā tvaritikā kulasundarīti
nityātinityaparanīlapatākinīti |
tvaṃ sarvalokavijayākhilamāliketi
jvālāmayīti nigadanti vicitraketi || 49 ||

mātastavākṣaramanakṣararūpikāyaṃ
saṃsādhya śuddhamatayo gaṇayanti naiva |
śrībrahmaviṣṇuśivatārkṣyaravīndracandra(-)
yakṣendradarpakagaṇeśvaravahnimukhyān || 50 ||

<p. 750>  saṃpūjya ke'pi sakalairvaraṇopacārai(-)
rgranthiṃ vibhidya parameṣṭhinamudvahantīm |
mārātmikāṃ madanadhāmani dīparūpāṃ
jihvāgrataḥ sukṛtinaḥ paripālayanti || 51 ||

ādhāravāriruhamadhyalasattrikoṇa(-)
vāmāśikhāgrajaparāṃ paramāṅkurābhām |
jñānakriyeṣṭamayi śaktivināśanāśa(-)
śrībrahmaviṣṇuguṇaśaktivarā tvamekā || 52 ||

sṛṣṭisthitipralayakāraṇakartṛbhūtaṃ
vedāntavedyamajamavyayamaprameyam |
anyonyabhedakalahākulamānasāste
jānanti kiṃ jaḍadhiyastava rūpamamba || 53 ||

stotraṃ tvameva parameśvari gīyase cet
stotā tvameva parameśvari gīyase cet |
stutyaṃ tvameva parameśvari gīyase cet
kiṃ stūyase khalu tadā parameśvari tvam || 54 ||

yaḥ kālakalpatarumetadananyabuddhiḥ
śrīmatkramastavanṛpaṃ paṭhatāha nityam | 
muktiḥ kare vasati siddhibhiraṣṭabhirvā
kiṃ tasya mātaraṇimādibhiralpikābhiḥ || 55 ||

<p. 751> tvāṃ pūjayet kramakulāṃ sakalārthasiddhi(-)
stotraṃ paṭhiṣyati janastvayi jātabhaktiḥ |
tasmānmayā'pi tava bhaktirasena devi
bhaktārthasiddhikararatnamidaṃ vyadhāyi || 56 ||


<55-56 |> yaḥ kaleti | stavasyāsya kramastava iti nāmoktaṃ stavakāreṇa(,) tatra ca 
śrīcakravarṇanamārabhya pūjākrameṇa sarvāsāmāvaraṇadevatānāmullekho varṇanañcātreti 
kāraṇaṃ sambhāvyate(,) ata eva bhaṅgyā tamevārthamullikhati tvāṃ pūjayedityādinā granthakāra 
|



[śrītattvacintāmaṇiḥ]

[tripurārṇavoktaṃ tripurasundarīkavacam]

atha vakṣyāmi kavacaṃ tripurārṇavalakṣitam |
samastāpadvimuktyarthaṃ samastasampadāptaye || 1 ||

bhūtapretapiśācādipīḍāśāntyai sukhāptaye |
samastaroganāśāya samare vijayāya ca || 2 ||

caurasiṃhadvīpigajagaralādabhayānake |
araṇye śailagahane mārge durbhikṣake tathā || 3 ||

salilāgnimarutpīḍā ṛkṣau(?) pīḍādisaṅkaṭe | 
prajapya nityakavacaṃ sakṛt sarvaṃ tyajatyasau || 4 ||

sukhī jīvati nirdvandvo niḥsapatno jitendriyaḥ | 
śṛṇu tat kavacaṃ devi vakṣye bhavabhavāntakam || 5 ||

yenāhamapi yuddheṣu devāsurajayī tathā | 
sarvataḥ sarvadātmānaṃ lalitā pātu sarvadā || 6 ||

kāmeśī purataḥ pātu bhagamālā tadantaram |
diśaṃ pātu tathā dakṣaṃ pārśvaṃ pātu sa sarvadā || 7 ||

nityaklinnā cottarato diśaṃ pātu sadā mama | 
athaiva paścime bhāge rakṣet sā vahnivāsinī || 8 ||

<p. 753> mahācakreśvarī rakṣedanantaṃ vidiśaṃ sadā |
vāmapārśvaṃ sadā pāyāduḍḍī me tvaritā tataḥ || 9 ||

pālayantu diśaścānyā rakṣenmāṃ kulasundarī |
nityā mā mūrdhvataḥ pātu mādhavaḥ pātu sarvadā || 10 || 

nīlā nīlapatākākhyā vijayā sarvataśca mām |
karotu me maṅgalāni sarvadā sarvamaṅgalā || 11 ||

dehe pātu manaḥprāṇān jvālāmālinivigrahā |
vicitrā sarvato rakṣet ṣoḍaśī pātu sundarī || 12 ||

apārabhavasaṃsārasindhunistārahetave | 
catvāro guravaḥ pāntu mamāniṣṭavināśakāḥ || 13 ||

vihitārthapradāyinyaścintyamānamahaujasaḥ |
vighnaṃ mama parighnantu prasiddhāḥ siddhayo daśa || 14 ||

vṛndārakaśirovṛndavandyamānapadāmbujā | 
aṣṭau vāgdevatā bhavyamūrtayaḥ pālayantu mām || 15 ||

sarvavighnavināśinyo nityānityakalāmayāḥ | 
kāmākarṣaṇakāriṇyo vighnaṃ vighnantu ṣoḍaśa || 16 ||

sarvāśāpūrake cakre tripureśīsamanvitā |
vasantyo guptayoginyo mama kurvantu maṅgalam || 17 || 

jagatstambhanakāriṇyo jagadvandyapadāmbujāḥ |
sādhayantu mahābhīṣṭaṃ manojñamiṣṭadevatāḥ || 18 ||

<p. 754> yuktāstripurasundaryāḥ sarvakṣobhakare sthitāḥ | 
cakre guptatarāḥ pāntu yoginyo māṃ mahaujasaḥ || 19 ||

dūrvāvataradurmohatimirārkamarīcayaḥ |
māṃ mahāśaktiyoginyaḥ pālayantu caturdaśa || 20 ||

sarvasaubhāgyade cakre tripurāvāsinīyutā |
satsampradāyayoginyo vardhayantu mama śriyam || 21 ||

sarvasiddhipradāyinyo vanditā daśa devatāḥ |
madirānanditamukhāḥ sarvārthān sādhayantu tāḥ || 22 ||

tripurāśrīyutā devyaḥ kulakaulakulodbhavāḥ |
sarvārthasādhake cakre sthitā etāḥ punantu mām || 23 ||

sarvajñānena sampannāḥ sarvanirvāṇahetavaḥ | 
rakṣantu māṃ mahādevyo daśarekhopakārikāḥ || 24 ||

yuktāstripuramālinyaḥ sarvarakṣākare sthitāḥ | 
cakre nigarbhayoginyaḥ kurvantu mama maṅgalam || 25 ||

adhikānalpasaṅkalpāḥ kalpanākāmabandhakāḥ |
aṣṭau vāgdevatāḥ santu sadā sakaruṇā mayi || 26 ||

tripurāsiddhisaṃyuktāḥ sarvayogahare sthitāḥ |
cakre rahasyayoginyo rogānapanayantu me || 27 ||

mahojambhe mahāstambhe mahāmohe mahāraṇe |
hetavo'smatpriye santu catasro mantradevatāḥ || 28 ||

<p. 755> cakrāgre dakṣavāme ca ṣaṭkoṇe vihitāspadāḥ |
tisro rakṣantu me etāḥ kāmeśvaryādidevatāḥ || 29 ||

sarvasiddhiprade cakra tripurāmbāsamanvitāḥ |
yoginyo'tirahasyā me vitanvantu samīhitam || 30 ||

etāsāmapi sarvāsāmīśvarīmiṣṭadevatām |
durlabhāmapi devānāṃ bālātripurasundarīm || 31 ||

yadādiñca yadantañca yanmadhyañca na jānate |
brahmādayo'pi pāntu śrīmahātripurasundarī || 32 ||

sarvānandamaye cakre baindave vihitānayā |
parāvararahasyāḥ syuryoginyaḥ santu saṃmude || 33 ||

samayārcanaviddevi vidveṣaṇaparāyaṇaḥ |
dakṣe dakṣiṇabhāgastho māṃ pātu vaṭukeśvaraḥ || 34 ||

mahāvighnavināśinyo vāmabhāge kṛtāspadāḥ |
jāgrattritayavāsinyo yoginyaḥ santu sammude || 35 ||

pratyūhavyūhavidhvaṃsakāraṇaṃ karuṇāmayaḥ |
mama prītyarthato hantu kṣetrapālaḥ puraḥ sthitaḥ || 36 ||

apasmārādidurddharṣasaṃhāraikapadakramaḥ | 
pṛṣṭhasthāne sthito devo māṃ pātu ca gaṇeśvaraḥ || 37 ||

yaścedaṃ paṭhati stotraṃ kadācana śṛṇoti ca |
acirādeva naśyanti tasya sarvepyupadravāḥ || 38 ||

<p. 756> tanmukhaṃ kavitārūpaṃ tadgṛhaṃ kamalālayam |
sa deśaḥ sattvaśuddhaḥ syād yatrāyaṃ paṭhyate svataḥ || 39 ||

rogārto mucyate rogairbaddho mucyeta bandhanāt |
vighnavān mucyate vighnaiḥ paṭhan stotrādikaṃ naraḥ || 40 ||

dhyeyaiṣā tripurā rakṣā paṭhanīyā prayatnataḥ |
anayā kamalāsiddhiranayā pāpanāśanam || 41 ||

tripurārṇavatantrasya samāptaṃ kavacaṃ śubham |
athānyat kavacaṃ vakṣye ṣoḍaśīnāṃ sukhāvaham ||

devyuvāca(-)

bhagavan devadeveśa lokānugrahakāraka |
tvatprasādānmahādeva śrutā mantrāstvanekaśaḥ || 1 ||

sādhanaṃ vividhaṃ deva kīlakoddhāraṇantathā |
śāpādidūṣaṇoddhāraḥ śrutastvatto mayā prabho || 2 ||

rājarājeśvarīdevyāḥ kavacaṃ sūcitaṃ mayi |
idānīṃ śrotumicchāmi kathayasva mayi prabho || 3 ||

īśvara uvāca(-)

lakṣavārasahasrāṇi vāritāsi punaḥ punaḥ |
strīsvabhāvāt punardevi pṛcchasi tvaṃ mayi priye || 4 ||

atyantaguhyaṃ kavacaṃ sarvakāmaphalapradam |
prīyate devadeveśi kathayāmi śṛṇuṣva tat || 5 ||

asya śrīrājarājeśvarīmahātripurasundarīṣoḍaśīvidyākavacasya

<p. 757> mahādeva ṛṣiḥ prastārapaṅkticchando rājarājeśvarī śrīmahātripurasundarī devatā 
sarvārthasādhane viniyogaḥ |

oṃ pūrve māṃ bhairavī pātu bālā māṃ pātu dakṣiṇe |
mālinī paścime pātu vaśinī tūttare'vatu || 6 ||

ūrdhvaṃ pātu mahādevī mahātripurasundarī |
adhastāt pātu deveśī pātālatalavāsinī || 7 ||

ādhāre vāgbhavaḥ pātu kāmarājastathā hṛdi |
ḍāmaraḥ pātu māṃ nityaṃ mastake sarvakāmadaḥ || 8 ||

brahmarandhre sarvagātre chidrasthāneṣu sarvadā |
mahāvidyā bhagavatī pātu māṃ parameśvarī || 9 ||

ai(/) klī(/) lalāṭe māṃ pāyād hrīṃ haṃsaḥ pātu netrayoḥ |
nāsāyāṃ karṇayoścaiva śrīṃ hrīṃ hrīṃ cibuke tathā || 10 ||

hasau pātu gale hṛdaye strīṃ ca nābhideśake |
kalahrīṃ krīṃ śrīṃ guhyadeśe pātu hū(/) hrī(/) ca pādayoḥ || 11 ||

strī(/) māṃ sarvataḥ pātu saklo(/) pātu ca sandhiṣu |
jale sthale tathākāśe dikṣu rājagṛhe tathā || 12 ||

huṃ kṣeṃ māṃ tvaritā pātu sahrīṃ saklīṃ manobhavā |
haṃsaḥ pāyānmahādevī paraṃ niṣkaladevatā || 13 ||

vijayā maṅgalā dūtī kalyāṇī bhagamālinī |
jvālā ca mālinī nityā sarvadā māṃ sadā'vatu || 14 ||

ityevaṃ kavacaṃ devi devanāmapi durlabham |

<p. 758> tava prītyā mayākhyātaṃ gopanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ || 15 ||

idaṃ rahasyaṃ paramaṃ guhyād guhyataraṃ priye |
dhanyaṃ yaśasyamāyuṣyaṃ bhogamokṣaphalapradam || 16 ||

duḥsvapnanāśaṃnaṃ puṃsāṃ naranārīvaśaṅkaram |
ākarṣaṇakaraṃ devi stambhamohakaraṃ śive || 17 ||

idaṃ kavacamajñātvā rājarājeśvarīṃ śivām |
yor'cayed yoginīvṛndaiḥ sa bhakṣyo nātra saṃśayaḥ || 18 ||

na tasya mantrasiddhiḥ syāt kadācidapi śaṅkari |
iha loke ca dāridryaṃ rogaśokabhayāni ca || 19 ||

paratra narakaṃ gatvā paśuyonimavāpnuyāt |
tasmādetat sadā'bhyasyedadhikārī bhavettataḥ || 20 ||

madvaktranirgatamidaṃ kavacaṃ supuṇyaṃ
pūjāvidhau ca purato yadi vā paṭhecca |
saubhāgyabhogalalitāni śubhāni bhuktvā
devyāḥ padaṃ bhajati tat punarantakāle || 21 ||

kulārṇavasya tantrasya samāptaṃ kavacaṃ param ||

tripurāsundarīśatanāmastotram

samāsena pravakṣyāmi devyā nāmaśatāṣṭakam |
tad guhyaṃ paramaṃ jāpyaṃ mahādbhutavināśanam || 1 ||

śrī(ḥ) cetanā mahāmāyā mahāgaurī maheśvarī | 
mahābuddhirmahācaṇḍī mahākālī mahākalā || 2 ||

<p. 759> mahākṣudhā mahāmudrā mahānidrā mahodayā |
mahālakṣmīrmahābhogā mahāmohā mahodayā || 3 ||

mahājayā mahātuṣṭirmahālajjā mahādhṛtiḥ |
mahāghorā mahādaṃṣṭrā mahākāntirmahāsmṛtiḥ || 4 ||

mahāpadmā mahāmedhā mahābodhā mahātapā |
mahāsvadhā mahāsvāhā mahābādhā mahāsurā || 5 ||

mahābandhanasaṃhantrī mahābhayavināśinī |
mahānetrā mahāvaktrā mahājihvā mahābhujā || 6 ||

mahāmahīruhā pūrṇā mahāchāyā mahānaghā |
mahāśaktirmahāśvāsā mahāparvatanandinī || 7 ||

mahābrahmamayī mātā mahāsārā mahāvarā |
mahāsuraghnī mahatī pārvatī carcikā śivā || 8 ||

mahākṣāntirmahābhrāntirmahāmātā mahīyasī |
mahākulā mahālolā mahāmāyā mahāphalā || 9 ||

mahānīlā mahāśīlā mahāśubhrā mahākalā | 
mahācitrā mahāseturmahāheturyaśasvinī || 10 ||

mahāvidyā mahāsādhyā mahāsatyā mahāgatiḥ |
mahāsurī mahādurgā mahāduḥsvapnanāśinī || 11 ||

mahāmokṣapradā mokṣā mahādakṣā mahīyasī |
mahābhadrā mahāvāṇī mahārogavināśinī || 12 ||

<p. 760> mahādārurmahākārā mahāmārī maheśvarī |
mahākṣemaṅkarī kṣemā mahaiśvaryapradāyinī || 13 ||

mahāviṣaghnī viṣadā mahādurgavināśinī |
mahādurgā mahātārā mahākailāsavāsinī || 14 ||

mahāsubhadrā subhagā mahārghyā ca mahāsatī |
mahāpratyaṅgirā nityā mahāpralayakāriṇī || 15 ||

mahāśaktirmahāmuktirmahāmaṅgaladāyikā |
idaṃ yaḥ kīrtayed bhaktyā viṣamastho bhaved yadi || 16 ||

lauhapañjaramadhyasthastasya naśyati bandhanam |
rājāno dāsatāṃ yānti bhavet sarvajanapriyaḥ || 17 ||

uttamāṃ bhūtimāpnoti tasya naśyantyupadravāḥ |
saṃgrāme vijayecchatrūn garuḍaḥ pannagāniva || 18 ||

na viṣaṃ kramate tasya na mṛtyuḥ pāvake jale |
nākāle maraṇaṃ tasya kadācidapi sambhavet || 19 ||

yad yat kāmayate kāmī tattadāpnoti nānyathā |
bahunā ca kimuktena sarveṣāṃ mūrdhni varttate || 20 ||

rudrayāmalatantroktaṃ śataṃ nāma samīritam ||

[iti pūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrītattvacintāmaṇāvūnaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 19 ||



[viṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(mantrāṇāṃ puraścaraṇakathanam)

atha vakṣyāmi mantrāṇāṃ puraścaraṇamuttamam || 1 ||

(puraścaraṇaṃ vinā mantrasiddhyabhāvaḥ)

vinā yena na siddhaḥ syānmantro varṣaśatairapi |
tat puraścaraṇaṃ nāma mantrasiddhyarthamātmanaḥ || 2 ||

jīvahīno yathā dehaḥ sarvakarmasu na kṣamaḥ |
puraścaraṇahīno'pi tathā mantraḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 3 ||

(ādau puraścaraṇasya karttavyatā)

tasmādādau puraścaryā kartavyā sādhakottamaiḥ |
yenānuṣṭhitamātreṇa vaśamāyānti devatāḥ || 4 ||

(puraścaraṇetikarttavyatā)

atha pūrvamupoṣyātha kṛtanityakriyaḥ śuciḥ |
dvijadevagurūn bhaktyā saṃpūjya mantravidvaraḥ || 5 ||


<1 |> atheti | puraścaraṇalakṣaṇamuktaṃ haṃsamaheśvaratantre(-)

japahomau tarpaṇañca seko brāhmaṇabhojanam |
pañcāṅgopāsanaṃ loke puraścaraṇamucyate ||

rāmārccanacandrikāyāmapi (-)

gurorlabdhasya mantrasya prasannena yathāvidhi |
pañcāṅgopāsane siddhiḥ puraścaitad vidhīyate | iti |

<3 |> jīvahīna iti |
padyamidaṃ gandharvatantre saṃptaviṃśapaṭale'pi(,) tatra ca dehīti pāṭha upalabhyate(,) sa ca 
dehārthaka eveti puraścaraṇabodhinī |

<p. 762> gaṇeśaṃ sādhakāṃścaiva pitṝṃścaiva prapūjayet |
sarveṣāmeva mantrāṇāṃ vidyānāñca tathaiva ca || 6 ||

gurorājñāṃ samādāya śuddhāntaḥkaraṇo budhaḥ |
yatnāt puraskriyāṃ kuryād guruṃ vā kārayed budhaḥ |
gurorabhāve vipro'nyaḥ sarvaprāṇihite rataḥ || 7 ||

(puraścaraṇasthānāni)

puṇyakṣetraṃ nadītīraṃ guhā parvatamastakam |
tīrthapradeśaḥ sindhūnāṃ saṅgamaḥ pāvanaṃ vanam || 8 ||

udyānāni vicitrāṇi vilvamūlaṃ taṭaṃ gireḥ |
tulasīkānanaṃ goṣṭhaṃ vṛṣaśūnyaṃ surālayam || 9 ||

aśvatthāmalakīmūlaṃ gośālaṃ jalamadhyataḥ |
devatāyatanaṃ kūlaṃ samudrasya nijaṃ gṛham |
eṣāmanyatamaṃ sthānamāśritya japamācaret || 10 ||


rudrayāmale ca (-)


puraścaraṇasampanno manto hi phaladāyakaḥ |
tataḥ puraskriyāṃ kuryānmantravit siddhikāṅkṣayā ||
kiṃ homaiḥ kiṃ japaṃścaiva kiṃ mantranyāsavistaraiḥ |
rahasyānāñca mantrāṇāṃ yadi na syāt puraskriyā ||
puraskriyā hi mantrāṇāṃ pradhānaṃ jīvamucyate || iti |

<8-10 |> puṇyakṣetramityādi | yoginīhṛdaye'pi ayameva pāṭhaḥ |
eṣāmanyatamamityādi padyārddhantu sādhane tu praśastāni sthānānyetāni mantriṇām ityeva 
mupalabhyate tatra |
sthānanirṇayaśca prapañcasārasaṃgrahe(-)

samudratīre'pyathavā'driśṛṅge samudragāṇāṃ saritāñca pāṭe |
japed vivikte nijavaryagehe viṣṇorgṛhe vā puruṣo manasvī ||

<p. 763> (puraścaraṇe bhojananiyamāḥ)

bhuñjāno vā haviṣyānnaṃ śāktaṃ yāvakameva vā |
payovā mūlamevātra yadvā yatnopalabhyate || 11 ||

(puraścaraṇe varjyāṇi)

vivarjayenmadhu kṣāraṃ lavaṇaṃ tailameva ca |
tāmbūlaṃ kāṃsyapātrañca divābhojanameva ca || 12 ||

(mantrajapānantarakarttavyāni)

mantraṃ japtvā'nnapānīyaiḥ snānācamanabhojanam |
kuryād yathoktavidhinā trisandhyaṃ devatārccanam || 13 ||

trisandhyamekasandhyaṃ vā na mantraṃ kevalaṃ japet || 14 ||


śivagītāyāmapi(-)

vilvavṛkṣaṃ samāśritya yo mantrān vividhān japet |
ekena divasenaiva tat puraścaraṇaṃ bhavet ||
yastu vilvamaye nityaṃ kuṭīṃ kṛtvā japennaraḥ |
sarve mantrāḥ prasiddhyanti japamāntreṇa kevalam || ityādi |

gaṅgāmadhikṛtya kuloḍḍīśe(-)

na vedī nāsanañcātra na pūjā na vidhistathā |
uktasaṃkhyaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā homādyantu samācaret || iti |

vāyavīyasaṃhitāyāñca (-)

sūryasyāgre gurorindordīpasya ca jalasya ca |
viprāṇāñca gavāścaiva sannidhau śasyate japaḥ || iti |

nibandhe ṣoḍaśapaṭale (-)

vīrāṇāntu mahānadyāstīraṃ devālayastathā |
ekaliṅgaṃ śmaśānantu śūnyāgāraṃ catuṣpatham ||

<p. 764> (giruvandanam)

ekagrāme sthito nityaṃ gatvā vandeta vai gurum |
gurureva paraṃ brahma tasmādādau tamarcayet || 15 ||

(nityanaimittikādikartavyatā)

nityaṃ naimittikaṃ kuryāt saṃsargaṃ sādhubhiḥ saha |
snāyācca pañcagavyena kevalāmalakena vā || 16 ||

(snāna-tarpaṇopadeśaḥ)

śaktau trisavanasnānamanyathā dviḥ sakṛcca vā |
asnātasya phalaṃ nāsti na cātarpayataḥ pitṝn || 17 ||

(tyājyāni)

strīśūdrapativrātyanāstikocchiṣṭabhāṣaṇam |
asatyabhāṣaṇañcaiva kauṭilyaṃ dūratastyajet || 18 ||

varjayed gītavādyādiśravaṇaṃ nṛtyadarśanam |
abhyaṅgaṃ gandhalepañca puṣpadhāraṇameva ca || 19 ||

maithunaṃ tatkathālāpaṃ tadgoṣṭhīṃ parivarjayet |
asnānañca dvijān striyo naiva spṛśettadā || 20 ||

tyajeduṣṇodake snānamaniveditabhojanam |
prāṇihiṃsāṃ na kurvīta puraścaraṇakṛnnaraḥ || 21 ||

(anyato vastugrahaṇaniṣedhaḥ)

vihāya vahniṃ nahi vastu kiñcid
grāhyaṃ parebhyaḥ sati sambhave ca |
asambhave tīrthavahirviśuddhāt
parvātirikte pratigṛhya japyāt || 22 ||

<p. 765> (daśāviśeṣaṃ japaniṣedhaḥ)

uṣṇīṣī kañcukī gango muktakeśo'pyanāvṛtaḥ |
apavitrakaro'śuddhaḥ prasarpanna japet kvacit || 23 ||

anāvṛtakaro bhūtvā śirasā prāvṛto'thavā |
cintāvyākulacitto vā kruddho bhrāntastvarānvitaḥ || 24 ||

muktakacchaḥ śayāno vā gacchannutthita eva vā |
rathyāyāmaśive sthāne na japettimirālaye || 25 ||

(jape viśeṣopadeśaḥ)

śanaiḥ śanaiḥ parispaṣṭaṃ na drutaṃ na vilambitam |
na nyūnaṃ nātiriktañca japaṃ kuryāddine dine || 26 ||

(jape dinalaṅghananiṣedhaḥ)

nairantaryavidhiḥ prokto na dinaṃ vyatilaṅghayet |
divasātikramāttteṣāṃ siddhihāniḥ prajāyate || 27 ||

(jape kālakathanam)

anyanyamānasaḥ prāyo japenmadhyandināvadhi |

(jape vastraniyamaḥ)

naikavāsā japenmantraṃ bahuvāsākulo'pi vā || 28 ||

(japato japatyāgakāraṇāni)

patitānāmantyajānāṃ darśane bhāṣaṇe śrute |
kṣute'dhovāyugamane jṛmbhaṇe japamutsṛjet || 29 ||


<25 |> rathyāyāmiti | ninditasthānamuktaṃ nibandhe ṣoḍaśapaṭale'pi(-)

rājānaḥ sacivā yatra puruṣāḥ prabhavo janāḥ |
caranti yena mārgeṇa na vaset tatra sādhakaḥ || iti |

<p. 766> (punarjape karttavyāni śaucādīni)

utthāyācamya tatprāptau prāṇāyāmaṃ ṣaḍaṅgakam |

(evaṃ kṛtvā prātyahikajapakaraṇam)

kṛtvā samyag japeccheṣaṃ yadvā sūryādidarśanam || 30 ||

(puraścaraṇe śayyāniyamaḥ)

śayīta kuśaśayyāyāṃ śucivastradharaḥ sadā |
pratyahaṃ kṣālayecchayyāmekākī nirbhayaḥ svapet || 31 ||

(devīpūjādhārakathanam)

liṅgasthāṃ pūjayeddevīṃ pustakasthāṃ tathava ca |
sthaṇḍilasthāṃ mahāmāyāṃ pādukāpratimāsu ca || 32 ||

citrine tridinenātha jalasthāṃ vā'pi pūjayet |

(khaḍgādīnāṃ viśeṣaḥ)

pañcāśadaṅgulaṃ khaḍgaṃ triśikhañca triśūlakam || 33 ||

śilāyāṃ parvatasyāgre tathā parvatagahvare |
devīṃ saṃpūjayennityaṃ bhaktiprabhāsamanvitaḥ || 34 ||

(deśaviśeṣe devīpūjāphalam)

vārāṇasyāṃ kṛtā pūjā sampūrṇaphaladāyinī |
tataścaturguṇā proktā puruṣottamasannidhau || 35 ||

tato'pi dviguṇā pūjā dvāravatyāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
sarvakṣetreṣu pīṭheṣu pūjā dvāravatosamā || 36 ||

vindhye śataguṇā proktā gaṅgāyāmapi tatsamā |
āryāvarte madhyadeśe brahmāvarte tathaiva ca || 37 ||

<p. 767> vindhye ca phaladā pūjā prayāge puṣkare tathā |
tataścaturguṇā proktā karatoyānadījale || 38 ||

tasmāccaturguṇā proktā nandikeśvarasannidhau |
tataḥ siddheśvarīyonau tasmād dviguṇasiddhidā || 39 ||

tataścaturguṇā proktā lauhityanadakuṇḍake |
tatsamā kāmarūpeṇa sarvatraiva jale sthale || 40 ||

sarvaśreṣṭho yathā viṣṇurlakṣmīḥ sarvottamā yathā |
devīpūjā tathā śastā kāmarūpe surālaye || 41 ||

devīkṣetraṃ kāmarūpaṃ vidyate na hi tatsamam |
anyatra viralā devī kāmarūpe gṛhe gṛhe || 42 ||

tataḥ śataguṇaṃ proktaṃ nīlakūṭasya maṇḍalam |
tato'pi dviguṇaṃ proktaṃ hairake śivaliṅgake || 43 ||

tataḥ śataguṇaṃ proktaṃ kāmākhyāyonimaṇḍale |
kāmākhyāyāṃ mahāmāyā(-)pūjāṃ yaḥ kṛtavān sakṛt || 44 ||

sa ceha labhate kāmān paratra śivarūpatām |
na tasya sadṛśo'pyasti kṛti tasya na vidyate |
vāmakeśvaratantreṣu prabhuṇoktamidaṃ matam || 45 ||

(puraścaraṇavidhiḥ)

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi vidhānamatra yadbhavet |

(bhūmisaṃskāre kīlakasthāpanam)

aṣṭau ca kīlakān kuryādabhīṣṭasahitān punaḥ || 46 ||


<46-48 |> aṣṭau ca kīlakāniti | kīlakāropaṇamuktaṃ puraścaraṇabodhinīdhṛtanibandhe(-)

<p. 768>  mūlamantrāstramantreṇa pratyekaṃ śatamaṣṭa ca |
abhimantrya aṣṭadikṣu bhūmau tān vilikhet sudhīḥ || 47 ||

(kīleṣu dikpatipūjanam)

teṣu kīleṣu pūrvādikramato dikpatīnapi |
aṣṭau saṃpūjya gandhādyaiḥ kadalīmodakādibhiḥ || 48 ||

(dikpatibhyo balidānaṃ vāstudevatāpūjanañca)

baliṃ tebhyo'thavā dattvā pūjayed vāstudevatām |
kṣetre ca kīlite mantrī na vighnaiḥ paribhūyate || 49 ||

(kṣetrapālādīnāṃ pūjā)

kṣetrapālaṃ gaṇeśañca vaṭukaṃ yoginīṃ tathā | 
pūjayed gandhapuṣpādyaistataḥ kṣetraṃ samāśrayet || 50 ||


kṣīrivṛkṣodbhavān kīlānastramantrābhimantritān |
nikhaned daśadigbhāge teṣvastrañca prapūjayet ||
kṣetre ca kīlite mantrī na vighnaiḥ paribhūyate ||

kīlakāropaṇe niṣiddhasthānamuktaṃ kālīkulāmṛte ṣaṣṭhapaṭale(-)

mahātīrthe śūnyagehe devatāyatane'pi vā |
na kīlakān khanet tatra japamātreṇa sidhyati || iti |

viśeṣastu nibandhe(-)

sudarśanāstraṃ saṃjapya cāṣṭottaraśataṃ tataḥ |
vedikādaśadigbhāge tān kīlān nikhanet kramāt ||
oṃ ye cātra vighnakartāro bhuvi divyantarikṣagāḥ |
vighnabhūtāśca ye cānye mama mantrasya siddhiṣu ||
mamaitat kīlitaṃ kṣetraṃ parityajya vidūrataḥ |
apasarpantu te sarve nirvighnaṃ siddhirastu me ||
anena nikhanet kīlāṃsteṣu lokeśvarān yajet | iti |

<p. 769> (kūrmacakralikhanam)

kṣetramadhyaṃ samāśritya kurmacakraṃ likhet sudhīḥ |
dīpasthāṃ guṭikāṃ kuryāt sitapatranivāriṇīm || 51 ||


<51 |> kṣetramadhyamiti | kūrmacakrapramāṇamuktaṃ puraścaraṇabodhinīdhṛtanibandhe(-)

yatra grāme japenmantrī tatra kūrmaṃ vicintayet | 
dīpasthānaṃ samāsādya kṛtaṃ karma phalapradam ||

dīpasthānaṃ yathā gautamīye(-)

dīpasthānaṃ dvidhā proktaṃ mukhaṃ pṛṣṭhañca mantriṇaḥ |
dīpasthāne bhavet siddhirnānyatha koṭijāpanaiḥ ||

nibandhe(-)

caturasraṃ bhuvaṃ bhittvā koṣṭhānaṃ navakaṃ likhet |

kūrmacakraniṣedhasthānamuktaṃ gautamīye(-)

parvate sindhutīre vā puṇyāraṇye nadītaṭe |
yadi kuryāt puraścaryāṃ tatra kūrmaṃ na cintayet ||

vaiśampāyanasaṃhitāyāñca(-)

puṇyakṣetraṃ gṛhī tīrthaṃ devatāyatanaṃ śubham |
vilvamūlaṃ samudraśca vanamudyānameva ca ||
eṣu sthāneṣu viprendra kūrmamudrāṃ na cintayet || iti | 

kūrmacakraṃ yathā(-)

pūrvakoṣṭhādi vilikhet saptavargānanukramāt |
lakṣamīśe madhyakoṣṭhe svarān yugmakramāllikhet | 
dikṣu pūrvādito yatra grāmādyakṣarasaṃsthitiḥ ||
mukhaṃ tat tasya jānīyāddhastāvubhayataḥ sthitau |
koṣṭhe kukṣī ubhe pādau dve śiṣṭaṃ pucchamīritam |
krameṇānena vibhajenmadhyasthamapi bhāgataḥ ||

<p. 770> mukhastho labhate siddhiṃ karasthaḥ svalpajīvanaḥ |
udāsīnaḥ kukṣisaṃsthaḥ pādastho duḥkhamāpnuyāt ||
pucchasthaḥ pīḍyate mantrī bandhanoccāṭanādibhiḥ ||
kūrmacakramidaṃ proktaṃ mantriṇāṃ siddhidāyakam ||

piṅgalāyām(-)

kūrmacakramavijñāya yaḥ kuryād japayajñakam |
tasya yajñaphalaṃ nāsti sarvānarthāya kalpate ||



(citra)




      yadyapi granthakṛtā pūrṇānandena tṛtīyaprakāśe kūrmacakramabhihitam(,) tathāpyatra 
prakāraviśeṣo vartate tantrasāre puraścaraṇabodhinyāṃ ceti ṭippaṇyāṃ punarullikhyate |
      
<p. 771> (evaṃ pūrvadine bhūmeḥ saṃskāraḥ)

iti bhūmestu saṃskāraṃ kuryāt pūrvadine sudhīḥ |

(ārambhadine prātaḥkṛtyādi)

atha prātaḥ samutthāya kṛtanityakriyaḥ śuciḥ || 52 ||

rajobhirdhūpadīpādyaiḥ kalpayenmaṇḍalojjvalam |
kṛtvā kalpoktavidhinā pūjayet parameśvarīm || 53 ||

(jape upaveśanādiprakāraḥ)

padmāsanaḥ prāgvadano'pralāpī
śuddhendriyastarjanivarjitābhiḥ |
akṣasrajātmāṅgulibhiryajettāṃ
nātidrutaṃ nātivilambitañca || 54 ||

(pratidinajapasaṃkhyā)

yāvatsaṃkhyaṃ japedahni pūrvasyāṃ tāvadeva tu |
dināntare'pi prajapedanyathā siddhirodhakṛt || 55 ||

(śivapratimādi sannidhau japopadeśaḥ)

śivasya sannidhāne vā sūryāgnyośca gurorapi |
dīpasya jvalitasyāpi japakarma samārabhet || 56 ||

(prātarārabhya madhyāhnaparyattaṃ japaḥ kartavyaḥ)

prātarārabhya mantrajño japenmadhyandināvadhi |

(jape āsananirṇayaḥ)

athāsanaṃ pravakṣyāmi yena siddhirbhavet kila || 57 ||



<57-58 |> athāsanamityādi | āsane viśeṣa uktaḥ puraścaraṇabodhinyāṃ

<p. 772> kuśāsane jñānasiddhiḥ śrīkāmo vyāghracarmaṇi |
ūrṇāsane duḥkhahāniḥ kambale sarvasiddhayaḥ || 58 ||


haṃsamāheśvare(-)

kambalaṃ komalaṃ kauśaṃ dāravaṃ karmasādhanam |
eteṣāmāsanaṃ grāhyaṃ carmāsanaṃ sureśvari ||
lomni caiva yadāsīnastadā sarvaṃ vinaśyati |
lomasparśanamātreṇa siddhihāniḥ prajāyate ||

tathāca nirlomacarmāsanaṃ kāryamityarthaḥ |

kāmyārthaṃ kambalañcaiva śreṣṭhañca raktakambalam |
kṛṣṇājine jñānasiddhirmokṣaṃ śrīvyāghracarmaṇi |
kuśāsane mantrasiddhirnātra kāryā vicāraṇā ||
dharaṇyāṃ duḥkhasambhūtirdaurbhāgyaṃ dārujāsane |
vaṃśāsane daridraḥ syāt pāṣāṇe vyādhipīḍanam ||
tṛṇāsane yaśohāniḥ pallave cittavibhramaḥ |
japadhyānatapohāniṃ vastrāsanaṃ karoti hi ||

	tatra vastrāsanaṃ kevalameva niṣiddhaṃ(,) vastrāsanaṃ rogaharamityādinā viśiṣṭasya 
phalajanakatvābhidhānāt(,) celājinakuśottaramiti bhagavadvacanācca | atra sarvādhaḥ kuśāsanaṃ 
tadupari carma(,) tadupari vastram(-)

tatastu sādhako nityaṃ sarvādhaḥ kauśamāsanam |
ajinaṃ sthāpayaṃstatra kuryād vastrāvṛtaṃ dvayam ||

iti ratnagarbhadhṛtatantrārṇavāt | evaṃ dārujāsanaṃ kevalameva niṣiddham(,) 
kuśādisamabhivyāhāreṇa tu vihitam(,) dāravaṃ karmasādhanamityekavākyatvāditi bodhyam | athavā 
kāṣṭhāsananiṣedha āmrādikāṣṭhaniṣayaḥ(,) vidhistu gāmbhāryādiparaḥ | tārābhaktisudhārṇave 
ca(-)

tṛṇapallavakāṣṭhāni pāṣāṇaṃ mṛnmayaṃ tathā | 
vaṃśāsanañca vastrañca kevalaṃ kṣitimāsanam ||
evamaṣṭavidhaṃ devi cāsanaṃ parivarjayet || iti | 

brahmayāmalavacanamapi tatparaṃ vyākhyeyam | gautamīye'pi(-)

tathā mṛdvāsane mantrī paṭājinakuśottare | iti |

<p. 773> śvetaṃ vā raktavasanaṃ svāsanāya prakalpayet |

(yatibrahmacāriṇorviśeṣaḥ)

viśed yatirbrahmacārī kṛṣṇasārājine sadā || 59 ||

(āsanaparimāṇam)

ekahastaṃ dvihastaṃ vā caturaṅgulamucchritam |
svastike vātha padme vā viśettatra nirākulam || 60 ||

(bhūmyādyāsanānāṃ phalavaiśiṣṭyam)

bhūmau bhūpamayaṃ kulakṣayakaraṃ vaṃśāsane rogadam |
kāṣṭhañcaiva tathāsanaṃ prakurute śailaṃ mahāduḥkhadam |
patraṃ duḥkhakaraṃ jalaṃ bhayakaraṃ tantuśca vidveṣaṇam |
meṣaṃ krai (trai) bhṛmikamāsanādi sakalaṃ
				mokṣādisiddhipradam || 61 ||

(abhicārādikarmasvāsanaviśeṣaḥ)

abhicāre kṛṣṇaraktaṃ vaśyādisarvakarmaṇi |
śāntike dhavalaḥ proktaḥ sarvārthaścitrakambale || 62 ||


yoginīhṛdaye(-)

nādīkṣito viśejjātu kṛṣṇasārājine gṛhī |
viśed yatirvanasthaśca brahmacārī ca bhikṣukaḥ ||

tripurāmahārṇave(-)

na bhūmau vyajane patre na vasedityādiḥ |

kaulikānāmāsanaviśeṣastu tārābhaktisudhārṇavadhṛtamatsyasūkte(-)

mṛdu kambalamāsīno'pyanyeṣu komaleṣu vā |
viṣṭare vā sukhāsīnaḥ sādhayet siddhimuttamām || iti |

<p. 774> (mālānirūpaṇam)

atha mālāvidhānañca pravakṣyāmi samāsataḥ |
akārādikṣakārāntā varṇamālā prakīrtitā || 63 ||

(sabinduvarṇoccāraṇānantaraṃ mantrajapanirūpaṇam)

sabinduvarṇamuccārya paścānmantraṃ japet sudhīḥ |

(mālāmerunirūpaṇam)

anulomavilomena kṣakāro merurucyate || 64 ||

(mālāviśeṣa-phala-nirūpaṇam)

atha muktāphalamayī caturvargapradāyinī |
vāksiddhiśca tathā mālā sphāṭikena caret kila || 65 ||

raktā'kṣamālikā mokṣe bhavet sarvasamṛddhidā |
prabālamālā vaśye tu sarvakāmārthasiddhidā |
putrajīvakamālā tu lakṣmī(-)vidyāpradāyinī || 66 ||

kramākhyā mālayā lakṣmīrjāyate sumahīyasī |
raktacandanamālā tu vaśyā saubhāgyadā bhavet || 67 ||

sauvarṇaraupyaghaṭitā mālā kāmān prayacchati |
nirmitā śaṅkhamaṇibhiḥ kurute kīrtimavyayām |
sarvairebhirviracitā mālā syānmuktaye nṛṇām || 68 ||

(mālāyāṃ saṃkhyānirūpaṇam)

pañcaviṃśatibhirbījairmālā mokṣaṃ prakalpayet |
saptaviṃśatibhiḥ puṣṭau triṃśadbhirmokṣakarmaṇi || 69 ||

<p. 775> triṃśadbhiḥ pañcapūrvābhirabhicāre ca karmaṇi |
pañcāśadbhiśca yā mālā sarvakarmaṇi sā śubhā || 70 ||

caturādyā bhavet sā tu sarvakarmaphalapradā |
aṣṭottaraśataiḥ sarvasiddhiḥ syādapavargadā || 71 ||

(kāśyāṃ siddhidoṣakathanam)

kāśyāmeva mahādoṣā na tu sidhyanti sādhakāḥ |

(sūtravarṇakathanam)

śuklaṃ raktaṃ tathā kṛṣṇaṃ śāntivaśyābhicārake || 72 ||

(sūtra-sampātanam)

sūtraṃ sampātayed vidvān paṭṭasūtramathāpi vā |

(sūtra(-)tantu(-)viśeṣeṇa mālāviśeṣagranthanam)

kārpāsairvaiṣṇavī mālā padmasūtrairathāpi vā || 73 ||

ūrṇābhirvā phalairvāpi śaivī mālā prakīttitā |

(kalpoktasaṃkhyayā japakathanam)

gṛhītvā saṃskṛtāṃ mālāṃ candanena prapūjitām || 74 ||

samāśritya japed vidvān kalpamānena sādhakaḥ |

(homasaṃkhyāniyamaḥ)

saṃpūrṇena prajaptvā vai japasaṃkhyādaśāṃśataḥ || 75 ||


<70-71 |> triṃśadbhiriti | abhicārakarmaṇi pañcatriṃśadbhirjapaḥ kāryaḥ 
catuḥpañcāśatsaṃkhyākā mālā sarvakarmaphalapradā bhavatītyarthaḥ |

<75-76 |> saṃpūrṇeneti | tathāca tattatkalpoktapūrṇasaṃkhyāvadhika(-)mantrajapānantaraṃ 
taddaśāṃśaṃ taccaturthāṃśa vā svāhāntaṃ mantramuccārya pūrvapaṭaloktalakṣaṇakuṇḍe 
juhuyāt |

<p. 776> yadvā japacaturthāṃśaṃ svāhāntaṃ mantramuccaran |
yathoktakuṇḍe juhuyād yathāvidhi vidhānataḥ || 76 ||

(atra prakārāntaram) 

athavā pūjayejjaptvā juhuyāttaddaśāṃśataḥ |

(tarpaṇakathanam)

tato homadaśāṃśena jale saṃpūjya devatām || 77 ||

sāyudhaparivārāntāṃ devīṃ salilamadhyagām |
tarpayāmīti mantreṇa tarpayeddevatāmukhe || 78 ||

(tarpaṇe vastuniyamaḥ)

tarpayet kusumaiḥ sarvaiḥ sarvāpat(-)pariśāntaye |
ghṛtaiḥ pūrṇāyuṣaḥ siddhyai kṣaudraiḥ saubhāgyasiddhaye || 79 ||

dugdhairārogyasaṃsiddhyai tribhiraiśvaryasiddhaye |
nārikelodakaiḥ prītyai himatoyairnṛpāptaye |
sarvārthasiddhaye toyairabhiṣiñcejjaganmayīm || 80 ||


śāktānandataraṅgiṇyāñca(-)

svakalpoktakrameṇaiva japaṃ kṛtvā varānane |
homayet taddaśāṃśena taddaśāṃśena tarpaṇam ||

ityādyuktam | nibandhe aṣṭādaśapaṭale ca(-)

japānte pratyahaṃ mantrī homayet taddaśāṃśataḥ |
tarpaṇañcābhiṣekañca tattaddaśāṃśataḥ priye |
pratyahaṃ bhojayed viprān nyūnādhikapraśāntaye ||
athavā sarvasampūrttau homādikamathācaret ||

puraścaraṇacandrikāyām(-)

athavā lakṣasaṃkhyāyāḥ saṃpūrtau homamācaret |
kiṃvā yasya japo yāvāṃstatpūrtau homamācaret || iti |

<p. 777> (abhiṣekanirūpaṇam)

tarpaṇasya daśāṃśena namo'nte mūlamuccaran |
abhiṣiñcet svamūrddhānaṃ jalaiḥ kumbhākhyamudrayā || 81 ||

(brāhmaṇabhojananirūpaṇam)

mārjanasya daśāṃśena kuryād brāhmaṇabhojanam || 82 ||

(prakārāntareṇāṅganirūpaṇam)

athavā'nyaprakāreṇa mantrajāpī sukhaṃ vrajet |
pūjā traikālikī nityaṃ japastarpaṇameva ca |
homo brāhmaṇabhuktiśca japāṅgeyaṃ puraskriyā || 83 ||

(homādyaśaktau tattatsaṃkhyādiguṇādijapaḥ)

yad yadaṅgaṃ vihīyeta tatsaṃkhyādviguṇaṃ japam |
kurvīta tricatuḥpañcasaṃkhyayā jātibhedataḥ || 84 ||

(mantraduṣṭatvakathanam)

ekamaṅgaṃ vihīyeta mantro duṣṭatvamāpnuyāt || 85 ||

(uttamabhojanadāne sarvasya saphalatā)

annaiśca vividhaiścaiva padārthaiḥ ṣaḍrasānvitaiḥ |
subhojiteṣu sarveṣu sarvaṃ hi saphalaṃ bhavet || 86 ||

(gurave dakṣiṇādānam)

gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyād yathāvibhavapūrvakam || 87 ||


<84 |> yad yadaṅgamiti | tathā ca brāhmaṇo homāśaktau homasaṃkhyādviguṇaṃ japaṃ kuryāt(,) 
kṣatriyastu triguṇaṃ(,) vaiśyaścaturguaṇaṃ(,) śūdraḥ pañcaguṇamiti |

<p. 778> (jñāti(-)dvijapūjā)

jñātīn dvijān paraṃ bhaktyā pūjayenmadhumāṃsakaiḥ |
evaṃ kṛte puraścaryā sādhayediṣṭadevatām || 88 ||

(kṛtasaṅkalpasya puraścaraṇasyātyājyatā)

puraścaraṇakāle tu yadi syānmṛtasūtakam | 
tathā'pi kṛtasaṅkalpī vrataṃ naiva parityajet || 89 ||

(akṛtasaṅkalpinaḥ kṛtyam)

yadāpyakṛtasaṅkalpī nityanaimittike sthitaḥ | 
snātvā nityantu nirvartyamānasya(a) kriyayātu vai || 90 ||

vāhyapūjākrameṇaiva dhyānayogena pūjayet |

(mānasajape doṣābhāvaḥ)

na doṣo mānase japye sarvadeśe'pi sarvadā || 91 ||

(japasya śreṣṭhatvam)

japaniṣṭho dvijaśreṣṭhaḥ sarvayajñaphalaṃ labhet | 
sarveṣāmeva yajñānāṃ japayajñaḥ praśasyate || 92 ||

(puraścaraṇānmantrāsiddhau upāyāntarakathanam)

evamanuṣṭhito mantro yadi siddho na jāyate |
upāyāstatra kartavyāḥ santu śaṅkarabhāṣitāḥ || 93 ||

(drāvaṇādīnāmuddeśaḥ)

drāvaṇaṃ rodhanaṃ vaśyaṃ pīḍanaṃ poṣa(-)śoṣaṇe |
dahanāntaṃ punaḥ kuryāttataḥ siddho bhaved dhruvam || 94 ||

<p. 779> (drāvaṇakathanam)

drāvaṇaṃ vāruṇe bīje grathite kramayogataḥ |
tanmantrayantramālikhya sihlakarpūrakuṅkumaiḥ || 95 ||

uśīracandanābhyāntu mantraṃ saṃlikhitaṃ likhet |
kṣīrājyamadhutoyānāṃ madhye tallikhitaṃ bhavet || 96 ||

pūjanājjapanāddhomād drāvitaḥ siddhido bhavet |

(rodhanakathanam)

drāvito'pi na siddhaścedrodhanaṃ tasya kārayet || 97 || 

sārasvatena bījena saṃpuṭīkṛtya saṃjapet |

(vaśyakathanam)

evaṃ ruddho bhavet siddho no cettadvaśyamācaret || 98 ||

alaktaṃ candanaṃ kuṣṭhaṃ haridrāmadasihlakam |
etaiḥ svamantramālikhya bhūrjapatre suśobhane |

(pīḍanakathanam)

dhārya kaṇṭhe bhavet siddho na cettat pīḍanaṃ caret || 99 ||

adharottarayogeṇa padāni parijapya ca |
dhyāyet svadevatāṃ tadvadadharottararūpiṇīm || 100 ||

vidyāmādityadugdhena likhitvā kramataḥ sudhīḥ |
tathābhūtena mantreṇa homaḥ kāryo dine dine || 101 ||


<95 |> drāvaṇamiti | vāruṇaṃ bījam vaṃ iti | sihlaḥ(,) yāvanaḥ(,) turuṣkaḥ piṇḍakaḥ sihlo yāvana 
ityamaraḥ (;) lohavān iti khyātaḥ |

<98 |> sārasvateneti | ai(/) iti bījaṃ mantrasyādāvante ca saṃyojya japedityarthaḥ |

<p. 780> (poṣaṇakathanam)

pīḍito lajjayāviṣṭaḥ siddhaḥ syādatha poṣayet |
bālāyāstritayaṃ bījamādyante tasya yojayet || 102 ||

gokṣīramadhunā''likhya vidyāṃ pāṇau vidhārayet || 103 ||

(śoṣaṇakathanam)

poṣito'yaṃ bhavet siddho na cet kurvīta śoṣaṇam |
vidyāñca vāyubījena mantrī kuryād vidarbhatām || 104 ||

eṣā vidyā gale dhāryā likhitvā varabhasmanā |

(dahanakathanam)

śoṣito'pi na siddhaśceddahanīyo'gnibījataḥ || 105 ||

āgneyena tu bījena mantrasyaikaikamakṣaram |
ādyantamadhya ūrddhvantu yojayeddāhakarmaṇi || 106 ||

brahmavṛkṣasya tailena mantramālikhya dhārayet |
kaṇṭhadeśe tato mantraḥ siddhaḥ syācchaṅkaroditaḥ || 107 ||

(puraścaraṇānantaram gurupūjā)

puraścaryāṃ vidhāyaivaṃ guruṃ saṃpūjayet sudhīḥ |

(mantrādīnāṃ gopanam)

guruṃ saṃpūjayeddhīmān mantraṃ yatnena gopayet |
akṣamālāñca mudrāñca gurorapi na darśayet || 108 ||

(mantradevatāguruṣu bhaktiḥ kartavyā)

mantre tu devatāyāntu tathā mantravide gurau |
triṣu bhaktiḥ sadā kāryā sā hi prathamasādhanā || 109 ||

<p. 781> (mantradevatayoraikyam)

mantro hi devatā jñeyā devatā mantrarūpiṇī |
dvayorbhedo na kartavyo yadīcchet paramaṃ padam || 110 ||

(mantrasiddhau sarvasiddhiḥ)

samyak siddhyaikamantrasya nāsiddhamiha bhūtale || 111 ||

(ekadvyādilakṣasaṃkhyābhedena phalabhedaḥ)

atha lakṣaprabhedena japamāhātmyamucyate |
lakṣamātraṃ japenmantrī mahāpāpaiḥ pramucyate || 112 ||

lakṣadvayena pāpāni saptajanmabhavānyapi |
mahāpātakamukhyāni nāśayennātra saṃśayaḥ || 113 ||

tato lakṣatrayaṃ japtvā mantra(-)yantrakalevaraḥ |
mahāpātakakoṭīstu nāśayennātra saṃśayaḥ || 114 ||

caturlakṣaṃ japenmantrī mahāvāgīśvaro bhavet |
kubera iva ratnāḍhyaḥ pañcalakṣajapānnaraḥ || 115 ||

ṣallakṣajapamātreṇa mahāvidyādharo bhavet |
saptalakṣajapānmantrī khecarīmelako bhavet || 116 ||

aṣṭalakṣajapānmantrī devapūjyo bhaved dhruvam |
aṇimādyaṣṭasiddhīnāṃ nāyakaḥ sādhako bhavet |
vaśagāstasya rājāno yoṣitaśca viśeṣataḥ || 117 ||

navalakṣapramāṇena japettripurasundarīm | 
rudramūrtiḥ svayaṃ kartā hartā sākṣānna saṃśayaḥ || 118 ||

<p. 782> (navalakṣajape sthānabhedaḥ)

meḍhrasthāne śikhākāramādhāre kanakaprabham | 
nābhisthaṃ sūryavimbābhaṃ hṛdi jyotiḥśikhāmayam || 119 ||

tadūrddhve bhāskaramayaṃ kaṇṭhe dīpaśikhāmayam |
lambike candrabimbābhaṃ bhrūmadhye ratnavadruciḥ || 120 ||

navame viśvatejaśca navalakṣāṇi yāni ca |
ebhiḥ sthānasthito yogī navalakṣaṃ samabhyaset || 121 ||


<119-121 |> meḍhrasthāne ityādi | navacakravivekānusāreṇoktamidaṃ(,) tadūrddhve ājñācakre(,) 
lambike tālucakre ityarthaḥ | navacakravivekastu saubhāgyalakṣmyupaniṣadi(-) atha hainaṃ devā 
ūrcunavacakravivekamanubrūhīti | tatheti sa hovāca(-) ādhāre brahmacakraṃ trirāvṛtti 
bhagamaṇḍalākāraṃ tatra mūlakaṃ devaśaktiḥ(,) pāvakākāraṃ dhyāyet(,) tatraiva 
kāmarūpapīṭhaṃ sarvakāmaphalapradaṃ bhavati | ityādhāracakram | dvitīyaṃ 
svādhiṣṭhānacakraṃ ṣaḍdalaṃ(,) tanmadhye paścimābhimukhaṃ liṅgaṃ prabālāṅkurasadṛśaṃ 
dhyāyet(,) tatraivoḍyānapīṭhaṃ jagadākarṣaṇasiddhidaṃ bhavati | tṛtīyaṃ nābhicakraṃ 
pañcāvartaṃ sarpakuṭilākāraṃ tanmadhye kuṇḍalinīṃ bālārkakoṭiprabhāṃ tanumadhyāṃ 
dhyāyet | sāmarthyaśaktitaḥ sarvasiddhipradā bhavati | maṇipūrakacakraṃ 
hṛdayacakramaṣṭadalamadhomukham(,) tanmadhye jyotirmayaliṅgākāraṃ dhyāyet | saiva haṃsakalā 
sarvapriyā sarvalokavaśyakarī bhavati | kaṇṭhacakraṃ caturaṅgulam(,) tatra vāme iḍā candranāḍī(,) 
dakṣiṇe piṅgalā sūryanāḍī(,) tanmadhye suṣumṇāṃ śvetavarṇāṃ dhyāyet(,) ya evaṃ 
vedānāhatasiddhido bhavati | tālucakraṃ tatrāmṛtadhārāpravāha(,) ghaṇṭakālidimūlacakrarandhre 
rājadaṇḍāvalambinī vivaraṃ daśamadvāraṃ tatra śūnyaṃ dhyāyet(,) cittalayo bhavati | saptamaṃ 
bhrū(-)cakramaṅguṣṭhamātraṃ(,) tatra jñānanetraṃ dīpaśikhākāraṃ dhyāyet(,) tadeva pālakadaṃ 
vāksiddhidaṃ bhavati | ājñācakramaṣṭamaṃ brahmarandhranirvāṇacakraṃ tatra sūcikāgṛhetaraṃ 
dhūmraśikhākāraṃ dhyāyet | tatra jālandharapīṭhaṃ mokṣapradaṃ bhavati |
	paraṃ brahmacakraṃ navamamākāśacakraṃ(,) tatra ṣoḍaśadalapadmamūrddhvamukhaṃ 
tanmadhyakarṇikāṃ

<p. 783> (navacakrabhedena navalakṣajape siddhiḥ)

navasthānasthitaṃ lakṣaṃ navalakṣaṃ taducyate |
nava sthānāni mantreṇa kramāt saṃbhidya kuṇḍalīm || 122 ||

visargasthāmṛtaṃ pītvā punarādhāramāviśet | 
sthānāt sthānagataṃ mantraṃ smaredevaṃ krameṇa tu |
mandabhāgyo'pi niyataṃ sidhyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 123 ||

(prakārāntareṇa japasiddhiḥ)

athavādhārapadme tu liṅgaṃ vā paścimāmukham |
jyotīrūpāñca yoginyaṃ svayambhūvācakaṃ param || 124 ||

hṛdi trikoṇamadhye vā bāṇaliṅgaṃ tathākṛtim |
mūrdhni trikoṇamadhye tu uttaraṃ paścimāmukham || 125 ||

tatra sthitvā japellakṣaṃ yatra kutra samāhitaḥ |
tato bhagavatī vidyā trailokyavaśakāriṇī || 126 ||

(mālāsaṃskārakathanam)

atha vakṣyāmi mālāyāḥ saṃskāraṃ sarvasiddhidam || 127 ||

(apratiṣṭhitamālayā mantrajapanindā)

apratiṣṭhitamālābhirmantraṃ japati yo naraḥ |
sarvaṃ tanniṣphalaṃ vidyāt kruddhā bhavati caṇḍikā || 128 ||

(mālāsūtranirmāṇam)

kāntayā racitā sā tu drutaṃ siddhikarī smṛtā |
ūrddhvantu trivṛtaṃ kāryaṃ tantutrayamadhovṛtam || 129 ||


trikuṭākārāṃ tanmadhye ūrddhvaśaktikāṃ paśyan dhyāyet(,) tatraiva pūrṇagiripīṭhe 
sarvecchasiddhisādhanaṃ bhavati | iti yadyapyatra pūrṇānandamatataḥ kvacit kiñcid vaiṣamyaṃ 
dṛśyate tathāpi mūlamekameveti kāmamupanyastam |

<p. 784> puṇyastrīracitaṃ sūtraṃ kārpāsaṃ paṭṭameva vā |
mūlāstrañca paṭhan sūtraṃ bījaṃ prakṣālayettataḥ || 130 ||

(mālāyāṃ granthikaraṇam)

ekaikamālāmādāya brahmagranthiṃ prakalpayet |
granthihīnaṃ na kartavyaṃ spṛṣṭāspṛṣṭe na duṣyati || 131 ||

(śaivādau granthyabhāve doṣābhāvaḥ)

śaive ca vaiṣṇave saure gāṇeśe śrīkare'pi ca |
bījakalpān punaḥ kuryāttatra nāsti vicāraṇā || 132 ||

(granthihīne doṣābhāvo devīviśeṣe)

yā devyo granthihīnāḥ syurlikhyate tadaśeṣataḥ || 133 ||

kālikātvaritāyāśca śakrādyāḥ ṣaṭkabhedataḥ |
tenācaraṇavāsinyo vārāhyāśca prapūjayet || 134 ||

(mālāśodhane kriyāviśeṣaḥ)

anulomavilomābhyāṃ mātṛkā'ntaritaṃ nyaset |

(mālāyāḥ pañcagavyena śodhanam)

pañcagavye kṣipenmālāṃ śivamantreṇa mantritām || 135 ||

(mālāyāṃ gandhādidānam)

sadyojātena gandhādyairvāmadevena gharṣayet |
dhūpayettāmaghoreṇa lepayet puruṣeṇa tu || 136 ||

mantrayet pañcamenaiva pratyekantu śataṃ śatam |

(mantrakathanam)

meruñca pañcamenaiva matreṇānena mantrayet || 137 ||

<p. 785> oṃ sadyojātaṃ prapadyāmi sadyojātāya vai namaḥ |
bhave bhave'nādibhave bhavodbhavāya vai namaḥ || 138 || (1)

ṃ vāmadevāya nao jyeṣṭhāya namo rudrāya namaḥ 
kālāya namaḥ kālavikaraṇāya namo balāya namo
balapramathanāya namaḥ sarvabhūtadamanāya namaḥ
(oṃ namo) (mano)nmathanāya namaḥ || 139 || (2)

oṃ aghorebhyo'tha ghorebhyo ghoraghoratarebhyaḥ |
sarvataḥ sarvasarvebhyo namaste'stu rudrarūpebhyaḥ || 140 || (3)

oṃ tatpuruṣāya vidmahe mahādevāya dhīmahi
tanno rudraḥ pracodayāt || 141 || (4)

oṃ īśānaḥ sarvavidyānāmīśvaraḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ
(brahmādhipatirvidyānāmīśvaraḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ
(brahmādhipatirbrahmaṇo'dhipatirbrahmā)
śivo me'stu sadāśivom || 142 || (5)

(śaktiviṣaye mantrābhāvamatanirāsaḥ)

iti pañca(-)ṛcā śuddhirna śaktiviṣaye tathā |
tanna samīhitaṃ muṇḍamālāyāṃ saṃsmṛtā yataḥ || 143 ||

(mālāsthāpanam)

tataḥ saṃjapitāṃ mālāṃ sthāpayeddhemapātrake |
padmākāre'śvatthapatranavakeḥ sthāpayecca vā || 144 ||

(mālāyāḥ pañcāmṛtādinā snāpanādi)

pañcāmṛtena susnāpya śītalena jalena ca |
mahāpretāsanaṃ bījaṃ nyasettatra ca sādhakaḥ || 145 ||

<p. 786> tatra devīṃ supūjyaiva parivāragaṇaiḥ saha |
vidhivadagnimāropya ghṛtena śaktito hunet || 146 ||

homakarmaṇyaśaktaśced dviguṇaṃ japamācaret |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā gururmālāṃ samācaret || 147 ||

śiṣyahaste tataḥ so'pi prajapyāṣṭottaraṃ śatam |
gurave dakṣiṇāṃ dadyād yathāvibhavapūrvakam || 148 ||

(mālāyāḥ svayaṃ saṃskārakālaḥ)

gurorabhāve mālāyāḥ saṃskāraṃ svayamācaret |

(pratyahaṃ pūjānte mālājapaḥ)

abhyukṣyādau japenmālāṃ pūjānte'pi tathaiva ca || 149 ||

(mālāpūjāyāṃ mantraviśeṣaḥ)

vāgbhavaṃ bhuvaneśānī akṣamālāñca ṅeyutām |
hṛnmantrañca samuccārya pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ || 150 ||

(mālāprārthanamantraḥ)

oṃ māle māle mahāmāle sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇi |
caturvargastvayi nyastastasmānme siddhidā bhava || 151 ||

(mālā'bhimantraṇam)

abhimantrya tato mālāṃ gṛhītvā dakṣiṇe kare |
māyāṃ siddheśvarīṃ ṅentāṃ hṛdayānto manuḥ smṛtaḥ || 152 ||


<150 |> vāgbhavamityādi | etena ai(/) drīṃ akṣamālāyai namaḥ iti mantro bhavati |

<152 |> abhimantryeti | etena hrī(/) siddheśvaryai namaḥ iti mantraḥ sidhyati |

<p. 787> eṣa pañcākṣaro mantro grahaṇe ca japāntike |
hṛtpradeśe samānīya na tu vāmena saṃspṛśet || 153 ||

(mālājape aṅguliniyamaḥ)

madhyamāyā madhyabhāge sthāpayitvā samāhitaḥ |
tarjanyā na spṛśenamālāmaṅguṣṭāgreṇa cālayet || 154 ||

pratyekaṃ bījamādāya meruñcāpi na laṅghayet |
aṅguṣṭhānāmikābhyāntu japeduttamakarmaṇi |
tarjanyaṅguṣṭhayogena vidveṣoccāṭane japaḥ || 155 ||

kaniṣṭhāṅguṣṭhayogena japenmāraṇakarmaṇi |

(japānte mālāsthāpanam)

japānte mastake mālāṃ kṣiptvā'nena samarcayet || 156 ||

tvaṃ māle sarvadevānāṃ prītidāśu sadā mama |
śivaṃ kuruṣva me bhadre yaśo vīryañca sarvadā || 157 ||

(mālāyāḥ saṃgopanam)

japāntakāle tāṃ mālāṃ gopayet prayataḥ sudhīḥ |
japakāle'pi goptavyā japamālā suśobhanā || 158 ||

(saṃkhyāṃ vinā japaniṣedhaḥ)

gaṇanāvidhimullaṅghya yo japettajjapaṃ punaḥ |
gṛhṇanti rākṣāstena gaṇayet sarvathā budhaḥ || 159 ||


<157 |> tvaṃ māle iti | ayaṃ mantrastu tantrāntare (-)

tvaṃ māle sarvadevānāṃ sarvasiddhipradā matā |
tena satyena me siddhiṃ dehi mātarnamo'stu te || iti |

<159 |> gaṇaneti | gaṇanasyāvaśyakatvamuktam | pramāṇamidaṃ tantrasāre'pi | anyacca 
tantrasāradhṛta viśvasāre (-)

<p. 788> (mālāyāḥ punaḥ sūtragranthanakālaḥ)

jīrṇe sūtre punaḥ sūtraṃ grathayitvā śataṃ japet |

(mālāyāḥ karabhraṃśādidoṣe kartavyopadeśaḥ)

karād bhraṣṭe śabdakṛte japedaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 160 ||

niṣiddhasparśane tadvajjapet prakṣālya mantravit || 161 ||

(prakārāntareṇa mantrasiddhikathanam)

athānyat saṃpravakṣyāmi mantrasiddhikaraṃ param |

(mantra(-)sādhakayoraikyakathanam)

mantrasādhanayoraikyaṃ durlabhaṃ bhuvi mānavaiḥ || 162 ||

uktaṃ saṅkarṣaṇe tantre śivenākhilavedinā |
ānandākhye pañcarātre śukrāya kavaye purā || 163 ||

(śiṣyamantrayoraikyakathanam)

saṃskṛtaṃ pūjitaṃ mantraṃ dattvā śiṣyāya deśikaḥ |
kuryādatha tayoraikyaṃ śāstradṛṣṭena vartmanā || 164 ||

(tatra niyamaviśeṣaḥ)

mantraṃ vidarbhitaṃ kṛtvā nāmavarṇairyathākramam |
ādyante sakalaṃ nāma tataḥ praṇavamālikhet || 165 ||


japasaṃkhyā tu kartavyā nāsaṃkhyātaṃ japet sudhīḥ |
asaṃkhyākārakasyāsya sarvaṃ bhavati niṣphalam ||

tantre (-)

hṛdaye hastamāropya tiryak kṛtvā karāṅgulīḥ |
ācchādya vāsasā hastau dakṣiṇena sadā japet ||

japasaṃkhyādhāraṇe niṣiddhāniṣiddhānyāha (-)

nākṣatairhastaparvairvā na dhānyairna ca puṣpakaiḥ |
na candanairmṛttikayā japasaṃkhyāstu kārayet ||

lākṣākuśīdasindūraṃ gomayañca karīṣakam |
viloḍya gulikāṃ kṛtvā japasaṃkhyāstu kārayet || iti |

 <p. 789> svarāḥ pātreṣu saṃlekhyā dhyāyettānamṛtātmakān |
bhūrje rocanagandhādyaiḥ padmamadhye suśobhane || 166 ||

mṛdā pavitrayāveṣṭya tat punaḥ sikthakena tu |
niḥkṣipenmadhure tattu mṛnmaye laghu bhājane || 167 ||

kṣīrapūrṇe nave kumbhe tat kṣipellaghubhājanam |
dhārayeddeśikaḥ kumbhamagnikuṇḍasamīpataḥ |
mantrasādhakayoraikyasiddhyarthaṃ juhuyāttataḥ || 168 ||

mulamantreṇa mantrajñaḥ sahasraṃ śatameva vā |
kumbhe sampātayenmantrī madhurāṇāṃ trayaṃ śubham || 169 ||

nidhāya niḥkṣipet kumbhaṃ śanaistaṃ mahadambhasi |
mantrasādhakayoraikyaṃ bhavedevaṃkrameṇa tu || 170 ||

(deśikasyaitajjñānābhāve nindā)

etad yo na vijānāti nāsau deśika ucyate || 171 ||

(yatra kutra rahasyaṃ na vaktavyam)

rahasyaṃ kathitañcaiva na vaded yasya kasyacit |
uttamāya svaśiṣyāya priyaputrāya vā vadet || 172 ||

(trimadhurasaṃjñā)

payo madhu ghṛtañcaiva samaṃ trimadhuraṃ smṛtam || 173 ||

(rahasyapuraścaraṇādikaṃ śyāmārahasyato jñātavyam)

rahasyādi puraścaryā dūtīyāgādikāḥ kriyāḥ |
śyāmārahasye vijñeyāḥ saṃjñāyāṃ sādhakottamaiḥ || 174 ||


<174 |> rahasyādīti | śyāmārahasye pañcamaparicchede rahasyapuraścaraṇaṃ jñātavyam | 
dūtīyāgavidhiśca śyāmārahasye(,) śrīkrame (-)

<p. 790> yāmamātragate rātrau kulagehagataḥ pumān |
tāmbūlapūritamukho dhūpāmodasugandhibhiḥ ||

raktacandanaliptāṅgo raktamālyānulepitaḥ |
raktavastraparīdhāno lākṣāruṇagṛhe sthitaḥ |
raktamālyena saṃvīto raktapuṣpavibhūṣitaḥ ||
pañcīkaraṇasaṃketaiḥ pūjayet kulanāyikām ||

kulanāyikālakṣaṇamuktaṃ tatraiva (-)

naṭī kāpālinī veśyā pukkasī nāpitāṅganā |
rajakī rañjakī caiva sairindhrī ca subhāṣiṇī ||

khaṭikā ghaṭikā caiva tathā gopālakanyakā |
viśeṣavaidagdhyayutāḥ sarvā eva kulāṅganāḥ ||

gurubhaktā devabhaktā ghṛṇālajjāvivarjitāḥ |
saṅgopanaratāḥ prāyastaruṇyaḥ sarvasiddhidāḥ ||

evaṃ yathoditāṃ prasūnatūlikopari saṃsthāpya pūjāmārabhet ||

taduktaṃ tatraiva (-)

advaitācārasampannāṃ ghṛṇālajjāvivarjitām |
sadanuṣṭhānaniratāṃ sāttvikīṃ bhaktisaṃyutām ||

devatābhāvasaṃyuktāṃ gurubhaktāṃ dṛḍhavratām |
īrṣyālasyena rahitāṃ sadayāṃ bhaktavatsalām ||

cāturyaudāryadakṣiṇyakaruṇādiguṇānvitām |
rūpayauvanasampannāṃ śīlasaubhāgyaśālinīm ||

sadā parigṛhītāṃ vā yadvā saṅketamāgatām |
athavā tatkṣaṇāyātāṃ madanānalatāpitām ||

viliptāṃ raktagandhena raktāmbaravibhūṣitām |
sugandhikusumābaddhāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām ||

sudhūpadhapitāṃ tanvīṃ dūtīkarmaṇi yojayet |
evambhūtāṃ yajet tāñca prasūnatūlikopari ||

ityādi | navamaparicchede śyāmārahasye viśeṣeṇollikhito vartate iti tatraivānusandheyaḥ | 
vistarabhayānna sākalyena likhitamiti |

<p. 791> (balidānakathanam)

athāto balidānantu vakṣyāmi śrī(-)priyaṅkaram |
praṇavaṃ pūrvamuddhṛtya padme yugmaṃ paṭhettataḥ || 175 ||

mahāpadme padaṃ brūyāt padmāvati padaṃ tataḥ |
vahnijāyāvadhiḥ paścād baliṃ dadyāccatuṣpathe || 176 ||

praṇavaṃ bhuvaneśānīmekajaṭe padaṃ tataḥ |
mahāyakṣmādhipaṃ brūyāttāraya(-)padaṃ samuddharet || 177 ||

mamopanītakaṃ brūyād baliṃ gṛhṇa dvidhā padam |
gṛhṇāpaya yugaṃ mama sarvaśāntiṃ kurudvayam || 178 ||

paravidyāṃ dvidhākṛtya truṭa(-)dvandvañca chindhiyuk |
māyābījaṃ tato huñca baliṃ dadyānmahāniśi || 179 ||

balimantradvayaṃ proktaṃ vīrāṇāṃ siddhikāmyayā || 180 ||


[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇau viṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 20 ||


<175-76 |> balidānamantrastu (-) oṃ padme padme mahāpadme padmāvati svāhā iti | anena 
catuṣpathe baliṃ dadyāt |

<177-80 |> praṇavamityādi | dvitīyamantrastu (-) oṃ hrī(/) ekajaṭe mahāyakṣmādhipaṃ tāraya(,) 
mamopanītaṃ baliṃ gṛhṇa gṛhṇa(,) gṛdṇāpaya(,) mama sarvaśāntiṃ kuru kuru(,) 
paravidyāmākṛṣyākṛṣya truṭa truṭa(,) chindhi chindhi hrī(/) hu(/) | iti | vīrācāriṇāṃ siddhyarthaṃ 
balimantradvayamatra kathitamiti |



[ekaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(brahmahatyādiprāyaścittakathanam)

brahmahatyādidoṣāṇāṃ prāyaścittaṃ vadāmyatha || 1 ||

(tatra kramaḥ)

raktapuṣpairyajeccakraṃ samastaraśmi saṃyutam |
kulācārakrameṇaiva karpūrakṣodamaṇḍitam || 2 ||

(tatra kālaniyamaḥ)

māsatrayeṇa niyataṃ mahāpātakakoṭayaḥ |
janmāntarakṛtāḥ sarve kṣaṇānnāśaṃ prayānti ca |
lakṣmīstasya gṛhe vaśyā susthirā sarvakāmadā || 3 ||

(javāpuṣpena pūjāpraśaṃsā)

javāpuṣpaiśca mantrajñaḥ pūrvavat pūjayecchivām |
brahmahatyādipāpāni pūrvajanmakṛtānyapi |
nāśayennātra sandeho dhanavān jāyate naraḥ || 4 ||

(sugandhikusumaiḥ pūjāphalam)

śivāṃ saṃpūjayennityaṃ sugandhikusumairapi |
mahāpātakayuktātmā tatkṣaṇāt pāpahā bhavet || 5 ||

(śamyādibhiḥ pūjāphalam)

śamīdūrvāṅkurāśvattha(-)pallavairatha sādhakaḥ |
māsena hanti kaluṣaṃ saptajanmani yat kṛtam || 6 ||

<p. 793> (ketakīpatraiḥ pūjāphalam)

ketakītaruṇaiḥ patraiḥ pūrvavat pūjayed yadi |
upapātakasaṅghāṃśca nāśayennātra saṃśayaḥ |
saubhāgyamatulaṃ tasya jāyate paramādbhutam || 7 ||

(śatapatraiḥ pūjāphalam)

pūjanācchatapatraiśca sarvapāpaṃ vināśayet |

(śvetapadmaiḥ pūjāphalam)

pūrvajanmakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ śvetapadmaiḥ prapūjanāt || 8 ||

kulācārakrameṇaiva bhavet saubhāgyavallabhaḥ |
viṃśajanmakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ śvetapadmaiḥ prapūjayet |
māsamātreṇa sakulaṃ mokṣastasya kare sthitaḥ || 9 ||

(bandhūkakusumaiḥ pūjāphalam)

bandhūkakusumaiḥ śuddhaiḥ sarvavat pūjayed yadi |
trailokyaṃ vaśagaṃ tasya sarvapāpaṃ hared dhruvam || 10 ||

(vilvapatraiḥ padmaiśca pūjāphalam)

vilvapatraiśca jalajaiḥ sahaiva paripūjanāt |
samṛddhimān bhavettadvat sarvapāpaharaḥ svayam || 11 ||

(mallikādipuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

mallikā(-)mālatī(-)jātī(-)kundaiśca śatapatrakaiḥ |
śvetotpalaiśca saṃśuddhaiḥ pūjayenmāsamātrakam || 12 ||

viṃśajanmakṛtaṃ pāpaṃ campakaiḥ pūjanādapi |
kulācārakrameṇaiva pātakaṃ śatajanmajam || 13 ||

<p. 794> brahmahatyādijanitaṃ nāśayennātra saṃśayaḥ |
muktistasya kare nūnaṃ vācā jīvasamo bhuvi || 14 ||

(agastyādipuṣpaḥ pūjanaphalam)

agastya(-)bāṇā(-)bandhūka(-)javā(-)raktotpalairapi |
pātakaṃ nāśayettadvat sākṣāt kāmasamo bhavet || 15 ||

(campakādipuṣpaiḥ pūjanaphalam)

campakaiḥ pāṭalaiścaiva vakulairnāgakeśaraiḥ |
kahlāraiḥ sindhuvāraiśca pūjayed yadi sādhakaḥ |
saubhāgyamatulaṃ tasya māsamātreṇa vai bhavet || 16 ||

(ratnapūjāvidhānakathanam)

ratnapūjāvidhānantu kathayāmi viśeṣataḥ || 17 ||

puṣpāṇi racayenmantrī māṇikyaghaṭitāni ca |
taistu pūjā prakartavyā cakrarājasya pūrvavat |
nānāpuṣpaiḥ sugandhaiśca karpūrakṣodacarcitaiḥ || 18 ||

(ratnapuṣpādibhiḥ pūjāphalam)

ekaviṃśatirātreṇa viṃśatirdharaṇībhujām |
dāsabhūtā bhavatyeva mahārogāṃśca nāśayet || 19 ||

sūryavat kāntimān mantrī jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 20 ||


<15-16 |> agastyeti | agastyaṃ vakapuṣpaṃ(,) bāṇā nīlajhiṇṭī(,) nīlā jhiṇṭī dvayorbāṇā dāsī 
cārtagalaśca sā || ityamaraḥ |
	bandhūkaḥ bandhujīvakaḥ (dupahariyā iti khyātaḥ) bandhūko bandhujīvakaḥ ityamaraḥ | 
pāṭalaṃ pāṭalāyāḥ puṣpam (golābākhyaṃ puṣpamiti kecit) |

<p. 795> muktāratnairaṅkitāni svarṇapuṣpāṇi yāni ca |
taistu pūjā prakartavyā nānāratnaistu pūrvavat || 21 ||

ekaviṃśatirātreṇa rājapatnyo vaśānugāḥ |
kalākāntiyuto mantrī jāyate śubhagaḥ kṣitau || 22 ||

(prabālapuṣpaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiśca pūjāphalam)

prabālaracitaiḥ svarṇaiḥ puṣpaiśca bahubhiryajet |
anyairnānāvidhaiḥ puṣpaiḥ saptāhaṃ kulavartmanā || 23 ||

krūrāstasya vaśāḥ sarve vairivargān vināśayet |

(marakatapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

tathā marakatakṣiptaivarī mitraṃ dhruvaṃ bhavet || 24 ||

(padmarāgapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

padmarāgamahāratnanirmitaiḥ svarṇasaṃyutaiḥ |
kusumaiḥ pūjayeccakraṃ trisaptāhaṃ krameṇa tu |
surāstasya vaśāḥ sarve bṛhaspatisamo bhavet || 25 ||

(hīrakayuktasvarṇapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

suvarṇaracitaiḥ puṣpairvajra(-)ketakavāsitaiḥ |
ekaviṃśatirātreṇa mohayejjagatīmimām || 26 ||

devā daityā vaśāstasya jāyante nātra saṃśayaḥ || 27 ||

(nīlakāntamaṇiyuktasvarṇapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

indranīlamayaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiścakraṃ prapūjayet |

<p. 796> ekaviṃśatirātraiśca tathā nīlaiśca nīrajaiḥ |
vairiṇo nāśamāyānti śeṣā vaśyā bhavanti ca || 28 ||

(gomedayuktasvarṇapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

gomedaghaṭitaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiḥ kundaiśca kiṃśukaiḥ |
saptāhād vairiṇī vaśyā ghātasteṣu prajāyate |
trisaptāhānmahāpāpasañcayaṃ nāśayed dhruvam || 29 ||

(nūtanasvarṇaratnamayapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

svarṇaratnamayaiḥ puṣpairnavaiścāpi prapūjayet |
tadā'śvamedhadaśakaṃ phalaṃ bhavati niścitam || 30 ||

kravyādajīvā vaśyā hi bhavantyeva na saṃśayaḥ |

(vaidūryayuktasvarṇapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

vaidūryaghaṭitaiḥ svarṇapuṣpaiścampakajātibhiḥ |
cakrarājaṃ samabhyarccya trailokyaṃ stambhayet kṣaṇāt || 31 ||

ekaviṃśatibhirvārairmahāpāpaharo bhavet || 32 ||

(nānāratnayuktasvarṇapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

nānāratnamayaiḥ svarṇapuṣpairyadi śivāṃ yajet |
tadā devāśca munayaḥ pannagā rākṣasādayaḥ || 33 ||

sarve vaśyā bhavantyeva trisaptāhānna saṃśayaḥ |
janmakoṭibhavaṃ pāpaṃ sādhakasya vināśayet || 34 ||

(svalpasvarṇaratnādiyuktapuṣpaiḥ pūjāphalam)

svarṇaratnādipūrṇatvaṃ yadi na syāttathā punaḥ |
taireva puṣpaiḥ pūjā hi karttavyā sādhakottamaiḥ || 35 ||

<p. 797> alaṅkārasvarūpeṇa pūjayeccakranāyikām |
kevalaṃ yaistu puṣpaistu trailokyaṃ stambhayet khalu || 36 ||

māsamātreṇa pāpāni saptajanmabhavāni ca |
nāśayenmohayet sarvaṃ samudravalayāṃ dharām || 37 ||

(paryupitapuṣpaiḥ pūjananiṣedhaḥ)

puṣpaiḥ paryuṣitaiścaiva nārccayet svarṇajairapi |

(nirmālyādipuṣpaiḥ pūjananiṣedhaḥ)

nirmālyabhūtaiḥ kusumairucchiṣṭairapi nārccayet || 38 ||

(apāmārgādidalaiḥ pūjanaphalam)

apāmārgadalairbhṛṅgairvilvairmarakatairapi |
patrairebhiḥ prayatnena pūjayet parameśvarīm || 39 ||

(śāktapuṣpakathanam)

ambhojotpala(-)bandhujīva(-)vijayā(-)punnāga(-)nāgānyathojātī(-)kunda(-)kuraṇṭa(-)campaka(-)javā(-)yūthī(-)ramā(-)
pāṭalaiḥ |
vilvāśoka(-)hayāri(-)kubja(-)madanairmandāra(-)dūrvāṅkurairdroṇāgastyaparājitāni kusumānyuktāni 
śāktānyalam || 40 ||

(mallikātagarādibhiḥ pūjā kartavyā)

sarvakālodbhavaiḥ puṣpairmallikā(-)tagarādibhiḥ |
sitaraktaiḥ prayatnena pūjayet parameśvarīm || 41 ||



<40 |> ambhojotpaleti | vijayā śephālikā(,) punnāgaṃ keśara(-)puṣpam(,) nāgaṃ nāgakeśarapuṣpam(,) 
kuraṇṭaṃ raktajhiṇṭīpuṣpam(,) hayāri karavīrapuṣpam(,) kubjam apāmārgaphalam(,) madanaṃ 
vakulapuṣpam(,) (mayanā iti khyātaṃ vā) mandāram arkapuṣpam (ākanda iti khyātam) |

<p. 798> (kalikābhiḥ pūjāniṣedhaḥ)

kalikābhistathā neṣṭaṃ vinā campakapaṅkajaiḥ |

(jalajacampakayoḥ paryuṣitadoṣābhāvaḥ)

na paryuṣitadoṣo'sti jalaje campake'pi ca || 42 ||

(yantrapuṣpakathanam)

yatrāparājitāpuṣpaṃ puṣpaṃ javākhyamuttamam |
karavīre śuklarakte droṇāpuṣpañca eva hi || 43 ||

eṣu devī vasennityaṃ tadyantre tāṃ prapūjayet |
ataḥ prayatnato mantrī puṣpairebhiḥ samarcayet || 44 ||

yoginītantre tripurāprakaraṇe (-)

(puṣpaviśeṣe kecana vidhiniṣedhāḥ)

śephālikāntu kahlāraṃ śaratkālaṃ vinā tyajet || 45 ||

bakulasya tvaśokasya arjunasya maheśvari |
pūjayed vṛntavarjena savṛntena vivarjayet || 46 ||

viṣṇukrāntā javā nāgakeśaraṃ nāgavallabham |
bandhūkañcaiva kahlāraṃ savṛntena samarccayet || 47 ||

na spṛśed vṛntavarjañca bhūmiṣṭhañca na saṃspṛśet |
śephāli vakulañcaiva bhūgatena samācaret || 48 ||

puṣpañcākṣatasaṃyuktaṃ tathā raktavilepitam |
sarvānte sundarīṃ nyasya raktapuṣpaṃ tathā nyaset || 49 ||

<p. 799> (vilvapatrasya prāśastyam)

patreṣu vilvapatrāṇi dattvā devyai prayatnataḥ |
vilvapatrairvinā pūjā śākte śaive na dṛśyate || 50 ||

(aṅgaraṅgeṣu sindūrasya praśastatā)

aṅgaraṅgeṣu sindūraṃ devyāḥ prītikaraṃ param |
ataḥ prayatnato mantrī sindūraṃ vinivedayet |

(mukhavāseṣu tāmbūlasya praśastatā)

mukhavāseṣu tāmbūlaṃ devyānandakaraṃ param || 51 ||

evameva vidhānena pūjayed yadi pārvatīm |
abhīṣṭaṃ saptarātreṇa labhate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 52 ||

(vāraviśeṣe puṣpaviśeṣaprāśastyam)

ravivāre'ruṇāmbhojaiḥ kumudaiḥ somavāsare |
bhaume raktotpalaiḥ saumyavāre tagarasambhavaiḥ || 53 ||

guruvāre ca kahlāraiḥ śukravāre sitāmbujaiḥ |
utpalaiḥ śanivāre ca pūjayedabdamādrāt || 54 ||

(vāraviśeṣe nivedanīyadravyāṇi)

nivedayet kramātteṣu ravivārādisaptasu |
pāyasaṃ dugdha(-)kadalī(-)navanītaṃ sitā(-)dhṛtam || 55 ||

(varṣamātradevīpūjanaphalam)

ekamabdaṃ samārādhya devīṃ gandhādibhiḥ kramāt |
grahapīḍāṃ vijityāśu sukhāni ca samaśnute || 56 ||


<55 |> nivedayediti | sitā śarkarā |

<p. 800> (parvatāgre devīpūjanaphalam)

parvatāgre yajeddevīṃ palāśakusumairniśi |
siddhadravyaiśca saptāhāt khecarīmelanam bhavet || 57 ||

(araṇyādiṣu pūjāphalam)

araṇye vaṭamūle vā kuñje vā dharaṇībhṛtām |
kadambajātipuṣpābhyāṃ siddhadravyaiḥ śivāṃ yajet |
māsena siddhaḍākinyaḥ pratyakṣā vāñchitapradāḥ || 58 ||

(samudratīre pūjāphalam)

ketakīkusumaiḥ siddhāśceṭakā vāridhestaṭe |
ājñāmabhīṣṭāṃ vanitāṃ kāmamāyāṃ mahādbhutām |
vasūni mālāṃ bhūṣāñca dadyurasyecchayā bhṛśam || 59 ||

(akṣadrumapīṭhopari devīpūjāphalam)

pīṭhamakṣadrumaiḥ kṛtvā tatra devīṃ yajenniśi |
śālmalīkusumaiḥ siddhadravyairmāsantu nirbhayaḥ || 60 ||

(śmaśāne pūjanaphalam)

pitṛbhūmau sādhakendraḥ sidhyantasya piśācikāḥ |

(vetālasiddhuyapāyaḥ)

nirjane vipine rātrau māsamātrantu nirbhayaḥ || 61 ||

yajeddevīṃ cakragatāṃ siddhadravyasamanvitām |
mālatījātipunnāgaketakīmadhubhiḥ kramāt || 62 ||


<60 |> pīṭhamakṣeti | akṣadramaiḥ vibhītakavṛkṣaiḥ |

<p. 801> tena siddhyanti vetālānatha vai svecchayā caret |

(madhyarātre sthānaviśeṣe devīpūjāphalam)

śmaśāne caṇḍikāgehe nirjane vipine'thavā || 63 ||

madhyarātre yajeddevīṃ kṛṣṇavastrādibhūṣitaḥ |
kṛṣṇacakre'tikṛṣṇāṃ tāmabhivādya prapūjayet || 64 ||

sādhyayoniṃ tadagre tu baliṃ chindannivedayet |
siddhadravyasamopetaṃ māsāttadbhāvalocanāt || 65 ||

jāyante bhīṣaṇāḥ kṛṣṇāstābhyaḥ sādhyaṃ nivedayet |
viśvasaṃhārasantuṣṭāṃ punaretya nijecchayā || 66 ||

(tirodhānasiddhayapāyaḥ)

devyā lalāṭanetre syuḥ prārthanena tirohitā || 67 ||

(māhāsiddhyupāyaḥ)

raktabhūṣāmbarā nopamālābhūṣitavigrahaḥ |
udyāne nirjane devīṃ cakre sañcintya pūjayet || 68 ||

kahlāracampakāśokapāṭalāśatapatrakaiḥ |
siddhadravyasamopetairmāyāḥ sidhyanti māsataḥ || 69 ||

(kāmarūpasiddhyupāyaḥ)

māsaṃ prasādalābhena kāmarūpo bhavennaraḥ |
yābhirviśvaṃ yayau viśvacārī viśvavinodavān || 70 ||

<p. 802> (trikālajñatvasiddhyupāyaḥ)


ṣaḍādhārāramadhye tu cakraṃ sañcintya pūjayet |
candracandanakastūrīmṛganābhimadodbhavaiḥ |
trikālajño bhaveddevīṃ teṣu samyag vicintayet || 71 ||

(pūgodyāne devīpūjāphalam)

pūgodyāne yajeddevīṃ siddhadravyairdivāniśam |
nivasaṃstatra tatpuṣpairjāyate manmathopamaḥ || 72 ||

(pūrṇāsu kanyakāyāṃ devīpūjāphalam)

pūrṇāsu niyataṃ devīṃ kanyakāyāṃ samarccayet |
kṛtyāḥ pareritā mantrā vimukhāstān grasanti vai || 73 ||

(madanāropaṇakathanam)

madanāropaṇaṃ vakṣye sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca |
saṃvatsarakṛtā pūjā yenaiva pūrṇatā bhavet || 74 ||

śivasya madanaḥ pūrvaṃ tapobhaṅganibandhanāt |
bhasmābhavattadā patnī ratiḥ prītiśca duḥkhitā || 75 ||

tannetravārisambhūtā madanasya tadā bhavet |
tat saurabhañca saubhāgyaṃ mahadāsīttadadbhutam || 76 ||

tena santuṣṭahṛdayād varo dattaḥ śivena tu |
ratyai prītyai ca tasmāttu madanaḥ prakṛtīkṛtaḥ || 77 ||

madanañcaiva yo mantrī varṣamadhye prapūjayet |
tasya sāṃvatsarī pūjā madanāya bhaviṣyati || 78 ||


<71 |> ṣaḍādhāreti | candraḥ karpūraḥ |
<73 |> pūrṇāsviti | pūrṇāsu pūrṇimāsu |

<p. 803> iti tasyai varo dattaḥ śaṅkareṇa mahātmanā |

(madanapūjanasya kartavyatvam)

tasmānmadanapūjā ca kartavyā sādhakottamaiḥ || 79 ||

samūlamadanaṃ vāpi gucchairvāpi prapūjayet |
madanaṃ navadhā kuryāt pūjayettadanantaram || 80 ||

ānandeśvarabījena navadhā bindunā saha |
nānāprakārasaṃbhinnaṃ madanaṃ pūjayet kramāt || 81 ||

aghorākhyeṇa mantreṇa abhiṣiñcettameva hi |
māyā sphuradvayaṃ bhūyaḥ prasphuradvitayaṃ punaḥ || 82 ||

ghoraghoratarebhyastu tavarūpapadaṃ likhet |
caṭadvayaṃ tadante'pi prakaṭadvitayaṃ punaḥ || 83 ||

kahayugmaṃ vaśayugmaṃ bandha bandha padaṃ tataḥ |
ghātaya dvitayaṃ varma phaḍanto ghorako manuḥ || 84 ||

śivacandrau mādanāntaṃ pāntaṃ vahnisamanvitam |
śaktibhinnaṃ bindunādakalāḍhyaṃ vāgbhavaṃ tvidam || 85 ||


<81-84 |> ānandeśvareti | ānandabhairavamantrastu (-)hasakṣa malavarayū(/) ānandabhairavāya vaṣaṭ iti 
prāṇatoṣaṇī |
	aghorākhyeṇa aghorebhyo'tha ghorebhya ityādinā (draṣṭavyaṃ pṛ0 785> |
	māyetyādi | mantroddhārastu (-) hrī(/) sphura sphura prasphura prasphura ghora ghoratarebhyaḥ 
tava rūpaṃ caṭa caṭa prakaṭa prakaṭa kaha kaha vaśa vaśa bandha bandha ghātaya ghātaya 
huṃ(/) phaṭ || iti |

<p. 804> śivaśaktī māmaśakrau vahnivāmākṣimaṇḍitam |
bindunādakalākrāntaṃ kāmarājamidaṃ mahat || 86 ||

sadāśivasya bījantu dakṣiṇā tvatibhairavī |
anena śaramantreṇa rakṣaṇaṃ kavacena tu || 87 ||

baddhvā triśūlamudrāntu bhrāmayenmadanopari || 88 ||

aṅguṣṭhena kaniṣṭhāntu baddhvā śiṣṭāṅgulitrayam |
prasārayet triśūlasya mudreyaṃ parikīrttitā || 89 ||

(madanāropaṇakālaḥ)

caitre māsi caturddaśyāṃ madanāropaṇaṃ bhavet |

(madanāropaṇakramaḥ)

uddharedastramantreṇa hṛdayena vilopayet || 90 ||


       <85 |> śivacandrāvityādi | śivo hakāraḥ(,)
candraḥ sakāraḥ(,) mādanaḥ kakāraḥ(,) pāntaṃ
phakāraḥ(,) vahnīrakāraḥ(,) śaktirekāraḥ(,) tena
ha sa ka phre(/) iti mantro bhavati |

      <86 |> śivaśaktī ityādi | śivo hakāraḥ(,)
śaktirekāraḥ(,) kāmaḥ kakāraḥ(,) śakro lakāraḥ(,)
vahnīrakāraḥ(,) vāmākṣirīkāraḥ(,) tena ha e ka la
rīṃ iti mantro bhavati |

      <87 |> sadāśivasyeti | sadāśivasya bījaṃ hau(/) dakṣiṇāyā bījaṃ krī(/) bhairavī(-)bījaṃ 
hasarai(/)(,) śaramaṇḍaḥ phaṭ(,) kavacaḥ hū(/)(,) tena hau(/) krī(/) hasarai(/) phaṭ hū(/) iti mantroddhāro bhavati 
|

      <88- 89 |> baddhveti | aṅguṣṭhena kaniṣṭhāṃ baddhvā tarjanīṃ madhyamāmanāmāñca 
prasārayediti triśūla(-)mudrāyāḥ prakāraḥ |

<p. 805> (tatra madanādhivāsaḥ)

śrīkhaṇḍaghanamūladyairadhivāsañca kārayet |
nityapūjāṃ vidhāyaiva niśi saṃsthāpya vidyayā || 91 ||

prathame divase kuryādadhivāsanamuttamam |
sadyo'dhivāsanaṃ vāpi varṣapūjārthasiddhaye || 92 ||

(madanapūjāprakaraṇam)

prātaḥkāle caturddaśyāṃ nityapūjāṃ samāpya ca |
navakoṇaṃ vidhāyātha sindūreṇa mahāprabham || 93 ||

kalasānanusaṃsthāpya hemaratnādipūritān |
ekaṃ vā sakalaṃ ramyaṃ sthāpayeddeśikottamaḥ || 94 ||

dakṣiṇe maṇḍalaṃ kuryādaṅkurādyairvicitritam |
aśokatarumālikhya trikoṇaṃ maṇḍalaṃ likhet || 95 ||

(kāmasya dhyānam)

tanmadhye pūjayet kāmaṃ taruṇaprabham |
raktapuṣpaṃ raktavastraṃ vāmadakṣiṇayoḥ kramāt || 96 ||

ratiprītiviśobhāḍhyaṃ pañcabāṇadhanurdharam |
vasantasahitaṃ kāmaṃ pūjayet siddhihetave || 97 ||

(kāmamantraḥ)

vāgbhavaṃ bhuvaneśānīṃ śriyaṃ kāmātmakaṃ tathā |
kāmāya nama alikhya vidyeyantu navākṣarī || 98 ||


      <93 |> prātaḥkāle iti | sindūreṇa navakoṇaṃ maṇḍalaṃ vidhāyetyarthaḥ |

	<98 |> vāgbhavamityādi | mantroddhārastu (-) ai(/) hrī(/) śrī(/) klī(/) kāmāya namaḥ(,) iti |

<p. 806> (ratimantraḥ)

kāmabījatrayañcoktvā kāmayātmaikamuccaret |
ratyai namaścāṣṭavarṇā ratividyā prakīrttitā || 99 ||

(prītimantraḥ)

prītiṃ vadedratisthāne prītimantro'ṣṭavarṇakaḥ || 100 ||

(ratiprītyorddhānam)

gauraśyāme ratiprīti krameṇa maṇibhūṣaṇe |
padmatāmbūlahaste ca raktavarṇavibhūṣite || 101 ||

vidyābharaṇabhūte ca puṣpadāmavirājite |
vāmadakṣiṇayordhyānaṃ kāmadevasya kīrttitam || 102 ||

(paścād vasantapūjanam)

vasantaṃ pūjayet paścāt kadambavanamadhyagam |
sauvarṇaṃ vāmahaste ca sudhāpūrṇaghaṭānvitam || 103 ||

dakṣahaste ca dadhataṃ nānāpuṣpasamuccayam |
sāṅgaṃ kāmaṃ prapūjyātha dhūpadīpādi darśayet || 104 ||

(madanapūjānantaraṃ devīpūjā tataḥ kumārīpūjā ca)

madane pūjitaḥ kāmaḥ sarvakāryārthasādhakaḥ |
tañca samyak prapūjyātha mahātripurasundarīm || 105 ||


      <99 |> kāmabījeti | kāmabījatrayamuktvā punaḥ kāmamuccarediti | tena klī(/) klī(/) klī(/) klī(/) 
ratyai namaḥ ityaṣṭākṣaramantro bhavati |

	<100 |> ratisthāne prītiṃ vadediti | tena klī(/) klī(/) klī(/) klī(/) prītyai namaḥ iti prīti(-)mantraḥ |

<p. 807> yajettatkālasambhūtaiḥ kusumaiścandracandanaiḥ |
saugandhikaiḥ sakāśmīrairnānāphalarasairapi || 106 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ kṛtvā kumārīṃ pūjayettataḥ |

(suvāsinīpūjā yonipūjā ca)

suvāsinīñca saṃpūjya yonimaṇḍalamarccayet || 107 ||

(mahādevīpūjā pūrṇahomaśca)

pūjayitvā mahādevīṃ pūrṇāhuti samācaret |

(brāhmaṇapūjānantaraṃ gurudakṣiṇādānam)

brāhmaṇānapi saṃpūjya pradadyād gurudakṣiṇām || 108 ||

(madanāropaṇaphalam)

anena vidhinā mantrī madanāropaṇaṃ yajet |
tasya sāṃvatsarī pūjā saphalā nānyathā bhavet || 109 ||

(vaiśākhapūrṇimāyāṃ viśeṣapūjā)

vaiśākhe māsi pūrṇāyāṃ svarṇapuṣpairyajet parām |
athavā candrakastūrīcandanaiḥ śiśirodakaiḥ || 110 ||

(jyaiṣṭhapūrṇimāyāṃ viśeṣapūjā)

jyaiṣṭhe māsi ca pūrṇāyāṃ kadalīpanasāmrajaiḥ |
phalaiḥ prapūjayeddevīṃ pūrvavat sarvasiddhaye || 111 ||

(pavitrāropaṇakathanam)

pavitrāropaṇaṃ vakṣye sādhakānāṃ hitāya ca || 112 ||


<107 |> suvāsinīmiti | pativatnīmityarthaḥ | yonipūjāprakāraśca prāṇatoṣaṇyādau saptamakāṇḍe 
caturthaparicchede draṣṭavyaḥ |

<p. 808> (pavitrapūjāyāḥ karttavyatā)

varṣamātrakṛtā pūjā saphalā bhavati dhruvam |
tasmāt pavitrapūjā hi karttavyā siddhihetave || 113 ||

(pivitrāropaṇakālaḥ)

ārabhya mithunārkeṇa tulāsaṃkramaṇāntaram |
atiramyāṃ mahāpūjāṃ pavitrāṇāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 114 ||

pakṣadvayoḥ prapūjyā syāccaturthyāmaṣṭamīdine |
navamyāṃ vā caturddaśyāṃ pavitrāropaṇañcaret || 115 ||

(āṣāḍhapaurṇamāsyāṃ viśeṣaḥ)

āṣāḍhe paurṇamāsyāṃ vā pavitraiḥ pūjayecchivām |
sauvarṇaraupyatāmrairvā sūtraiḥ paṭṭasamudbhavaiḥ || 116 ||

(navatantunirmāṇam)

yajñasūtrasamudbhūtaiḥ padmanālasamudbhavaiḥ |
trasarī(-)sūtrasambhūtaiḥ kāṣāyasūtrasambhavaiḥ || 117 ||

darbhamuñjaśaṇodbhūtairnavadhā guṇitaiḥ śubhaiḥ |
kuryāt pavitraśaktīnāṃ sarvāsāṃ ṣoḍaśāṅgulaiḥ || 118 ||

navāṅgulairvā tatsaṃkhyā śaragranthisamanvitam |
home tvekaśaragranthiṃ kṛtvā tairarccitaḥ kramāt || 119 ||

(navatantuṣu devapūjā)

prāleyacandramā vahnibrahmanāgo guho hariḥ |
madākṣa(-)sarvadevāṃśca navatantuṣu pūjayet || 120 ||


      <120 |> prāleyeti | etān prāleya(-)candramā(-)vahni(-)brahma(-)nāga(-)guha(-)hari(-)madākṣasarvadevān 
navatantuṣu navān pūjayedityarthaḥ |

<p. 809> śiromantreṇābhimantrya hṛnmantreṇa śubhairjalaiḥ |
prakṣālyābhyukṣaṇaṃ kuryācchivamantreṇa deśikaḥ || 121 ||

avarūdhya ca netreṇa grathitaṃ kavacena tu |
rocanākuṅkumābhyāñca raktacandanacandanaiḥ || 122 ||

kastūrīghusṛṇādyaiśca karpūrairvimalairapi |
gairikādyairvicitrañca kārayet sumanoharam || 123 ||

mūlamantreṇa cābhyukṣya sthāpayeddaśakoṇake |

(pavitravṛndasthāpanam)

pavitravṛndasakalaṃ ṣaḍaṅgena prapūjitam || 124 ||

(pūrvadine ghaṭasthāpanam)

kṛtvā tu pūrvadivase ghaṭasthāpanameva ca |

(pavitre sūtrasaṃkhyā)

aṣṭotaraśataiḥ sūtrairmantreṇa parikalpitam || 125 ||

(saṃkhyātāratamyenottamamadhyamādhamatvakathanam)

uttamaṃ tad vijānīyāttadarddhaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet |
tasyāpyarddhaṃ kaniṣṭhaṃ syāttrividhaṃ kathitaṃ kramāt || 126 ||


      <121-24 |> śiromantreṇetyādi | śiromantreṇa svāhā ityanenābhimantrya namaḥ iti 
hṛnmantreṇa śubhairjalaiḥ prakṣālya hau iti śivamantreṇābhyukṣaṇaṃ kuryāt | vauṣaṭ iti 
netramantreṇa avarudhya hu(/) iti kavacamantreṇa saṃgrathya gorocanā(-)kuṅkumādibhirvicitraṃ kārayet 
|
ghusṛṇaṃ kuṅkumam | kuṅkumaṃ pītakāveraṃ ghusṛṇaṃ kusumātmakam | iti hārāvalī |

<p. 810> pavitramūlaśaktīnāṃ ṣaṇṇavatyaṅgulairyutam |
śaragranthyādikaṃ kṛtvā tritayantu samarpayet || 127 ||

(adhivāse pūjādi)

adhivāsanavelāyāṃ yavān vistīrya sādhakaḥ |
devīkumbhaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya pūrṇaṃ cāmīkarādibhiḥ || 128 ||

devīmāvāhya tatkumbhe mūlamantreṇa pūjayet |
candanaiḥ kumudādyaiśca puṣpaiḥ phalayutairapi |
elā kakkolajātībhirupetaiḥ pūjayecchivām || 129 ||

(pavitrārpaṇam)

tataḥ kramaṃ samabhyarccya pavitrārpaṇamācaret |
śrīvidyayā pavitrāṇi gurornāmnā samarpayet || 130 ||

gurubhyastrividhebhyaśca tithinityāgaṇeṣu ca |
pavitrāropaṇaṃ kuryānnavacakreśvarīmapi || 131 ||

raśmivṛndāsu sarvāsu pratyekaṃ tārapūrvakam |
tataśca kurukullāyai pavitrañca samarpayet || 132 ||

(guroḥ santoṣotpādaḥ)

yathāvibhavarūpeṇa guruṃ santoṣayed budhaḥ |
svarṇālaṅkāravastraiśca nānāratnasamuccayaiḥ || 133 ||

tatprasādaṃ pavitrañca dhārayet sādhakottamaḥ |
tadaṅgahomaṃ nirvartya pavitreṇa samarpayet || 134 ||


<131 |> gurubhya iti | trividhebhyaḥ(,) parama(-)parāpara(-)parameṣṭhi(-)bhedāt trividhatvam |

<p. 811> (kumāryādīnāṃ pūjanam)

kumārīpūjanaṃ kāryaṃ tataḥ suvāsinīgaṇam |
yoginyo yoginaścaiva brāhmaṇā vividhā gaṇāḥ |
pūjyā hi sādhakendreṇa yadīccheddhitamātmanaḥ || 135 ||

(śrāvaṇapūrṇimāyāṃ kartavyam)

śrāvaṇe māsi pūrṇāyāṃ sarvāpatpariśāntaye |
sindūrakuṅkumādyaiśca candanairvividhaiḥ phalaiḥ |
utpalaiḥ kumudaireva pūjayet parameśvarīm || 136 ||

(bhādrapūrṇimāyāṃ kartavyam)

atha bhādrapade māsi pūrṇāyāṃ ketakodbhavaiḥ |
prasūnairarccayeddevīṃ nānāvibhavavistaraiḥ || 137 ||

(āśvinapūrṇimāyāṃ karttavyam)

āśvayujyāṃ viśeṣeṇa darśāntaṃ pratipattithim |
ārabhya pūjayeddevīṃ paurṇamāsyantameva ca || 138 ||

javāparājitādroṇaiḥ karavīraiḥ supaṅkajaiḥ |
saugandhikaiśca kahlārairvastrabhūṣaṇadarpaṇaiḥ || 139 ||

vyajanaiḥ śuddhasindūraiścāmaraiścandanādibhiḥ |
nānāvidhaphalairdravyairnānārasarasāyanaiḥ || 140 ||

pūjayitvā japed vidyāṃ hunet pratidinaṃ śatam |
sahasraṃ vāpi juhuyāttripurāprītihetave || 141 ||

tena vidyā bhavet siddhā nṛpatiṃ kurute'rccanāt |

<p. 812> saptamyāmathavāṣṭamyāṃ navamyāṃ vā prapūjya ca |
avaśyameva jānīyāllaṅghane tadviparyayaḥ || 142 ||

(kārttikapūrṇimāyāṃ karttavyam)

kārttike māsi pūrṇāyāṃ kuṅkumādibhirarccayet |
rātrau dīpān nivedyātha homaṃ kuryād ghṛtena ca || 143 ||

devyagre sthāpayeddīpān vidyayā ṣoḍaśa kramāt |
śaktīnāmekamekantu sthāpayettattadagrataḥ || 144 ||

athavā bhājane madhye ekaṃ tadabhito nava |
kṛtvā nivedayenmūlavidyayā saprasūnakam || 145 ||

(mārgaśīrṣapūrṇimāyāṃ karttavyam)

vṛścike māsi pūrṇāyāṃ nārikelāmbu candrayuk |
nivedyābhyarccayenmāsaṃ piṣṭapūpairyathāvidhi || 146 ||

(pauṣapūrṇimāyāṃ karttavyam)

pauṣe māsi ca pūrṇāyāṃ śarkarābhirguḍena vā |
pūjayed bhūmisaṃsiddhyai gavyaṃ dugdhaṃ nivedayet || 147 ||

(māghapūrṇimāyāṃ karttavyam)

māghe māsi ca pūrṇāyāṃ tilaiḥ śuklaistathetaraiḥ |
pūjayed gandhanaivedyaiḥ sitapuṣpādibhiḥ saha || 148 ||

(phālgunapūrṇimāyāṃ karttavyam)

phālgune māsi pūrṇāyāṃ campakaiḥ svarṇarājataiḥ |
cūtasaugandhikusumaiḥ pūjayedīpsitāptaye || 149 ||

<p. 813> (caitrādipūrṇimāsu karttavyatopadeśaḥ)

viṣuvāyanadarśeṣu yugādiṣu samarccanam |
kuryād vaiśeṣikaṃ teṣu āgamokteṣu teṣvapi || 150 ||

(dvādaśamāsīyakṛtyānāmavaśyakarttavyatā)

iti dvādaśamāsīyakṛtyaṃ kuryāt prayatnataḥ |
varṣe varṣe ca mantrajño hyanyathā pāpabhāg bhavet |
yoginīnāṃ bhavet bhakṣyaḥ kruddhā śrītripurā bhavet || 151 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇāvekaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 21 ||


	<150 |> viṣuvāyaneti | mahāviṣuvapūrṇimāyāṃ (,) jalaviṣuvapūrṇimāyāṃ(,) 
uttarāyaṇapūrṇimāyāṃ(,) dakṣiṇāyanapūrṇimāyāṃ(,) yugādyā(-)manvantarādiṣu(,) darśeṣu 
amāvasyāsu ceti sarvāsveva viśeṣapūjā karttavyā iti bahuvacanena sūcitam |


[dvāviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(jñānadūtīkathanam)

jñānadūtīmatho vakṣye yayā brahma sanātanam |
prakāśākhye yāgagehe praviśed varamandire || 1 ||

icchājñānakriyādūtīracite svabhagānvite |
anayā parayā dūtyā tatra jñānamaye śive || 2 ||

paryaṅke puruṣārthaiśca vedaiśca parimaṇḍite |
ātmāntarātmaparamātmajñānātmaparibhūṣite || 3 ||

tatpadārthaḥ padārthastvaṃ tattvaṃ padasamuccayaḥ |
padārthatrayametattu jñānād brahmaprakāśakam || 4 ||

etatsūtramayaiḥ paṭṭairgumphite sumanohare |
prapūjayet parāṃ tatra bhaved bhūtiścaturvidhā || 5 ||

hastinī śaṅkhinī cānyā citriṇī padminī tathā |
sarvābharaṇasampannāḥ sundaryaścārulocanāḥ || 6 ||

vaikharī hastinī jñeyā sthūlāvasthā parā kalā |
yayedaṃ dhāryate sarvaṃ brahmāṇḍaparimaṇḍalam || 7 ||

vargāṣṭakena niyataṃ sūte diggajasañcayam |
tenaiva kariṇī proktā madhyamā śaṅkhinī bhavet || 8 ||


<7 |> vaikharī akārādikṣakāraparyantavarṇamālā(,) vidyeti śridharaḥ |

<p. 815> śaṅkhinī ca mahāśuddhā sarvapāpavivarjitā |
sarvadevapriyā sā hi kāntisaurabhyaśobhitā || 9 ||

tathā vanaspatigatā madhyamāśuśubhagrahā |
citriṇī vallarī devī sarvaśaktisvarūpiṇī || 9 ||

śivaśaktimayī devī pāti caiva jagattrayam |
teṣu sarveṣu paśyantī jīveṣu paramāśrayā || 10 ||

evaṃ brahmaṇi saṃlīnā parārādhyā pareśvarī |
tāṃ dūtīṃ tatra saṃpūjya śamādikusumaiḥ śuciḥ || 11 ||

tadaṅgeṣu kalāḥ pūjyāḥ krameṇa sādhakottamaiḥ |
yathā śāntikalā bodhakalā vyāptikalā parā || 12 ||

jñānātmanaḥ kalā jñeyā caturthī syāttataḥ param |
padminī cāparā jñeyā haṃsa (ḥ?) svacchavikāśitā || 13 ||

haṃsaḥ (?) dvandvena padmaṃ hi ghalkā (?) saṅkocameva tu |
vikāśaṃ mātri (?) saubhāgyaṃ tathā varṇavilāsataḥ || 14 ||

parā prakāśamāyāti padminī tu matā bhavet |
tasya dehe sādhakendraiḥ kalāḥ pūjyāstu ṣoḍaśa || 15 ||

citkalā sakalā śāntikalā kālākalā parā |
ājñāvāstu kalā jñeyā saṃlīnā paravastuni || 16 ||

bhūyaḥ śāntikalādyāstu jñānātmanaḥ prakāśitāḥ |
virāgatā mokṣakalā paramātmakalā tathā || 17 ||

<p. 816> vidyākalācatasrastu vijñeyāścāntarātmani |
vidyāsantoṣatā tṛptiḥ paraṃ brahmaprakāśikāḥ || 18 ||

paramātmakalā jñeyā saṃlīnā paravastuni |
etāstu ṣoḍaśa kalāḥ śrīvidyānteṣu saṃsthitāḥ || 19 ||

ṣoḍaśāntā brahmarūpā kalā ṣoḍaśarūpiṇī |
ātmayogasvarūpeṇa trailokyaṃ racayatyasau || 20 ||

antarātmā sattvarūpo rajorūpaśca viśrutaḥ |
ata eva sattvarūpo rajorūpaḥ paraḥ śivaḥ || 21 ||

paramātma(a) vidhirjñeyo jñānātmā tūryasādhakaḥ |
etāḥ kalāśca niyataṃ paradehe prakāśayet || 22 ||

tatpadārthantu jānīhi mukhamasyā na saṃśayaḥ |
tataḥ padapadārthābhyāṃ kucayugmakrameṇa tu || 23 ||

nādo mūlaṃ hi yogasya śāstrasyeti vinirṇayaḥ |
nādastu sarvabhūtānāṃ bhaved yonirna saṃśayaḥ || 24 ||

śaktiṃ saṃpūjayettatra trikoṇe bhagamālikām |
sarvānandamaye madhye sundarīṃ pūjayet parām || 25 ||

svātmaliṅge tato mantrī śivañca paripūjayet |
tārañca bhuvaneśānīṃ mahātripurasundarīm || 26 ||

namaḥ śivāya vidyeyaṃ daśārṇā parikīrttitā |
parasparasvabhāvena brahmānandaraso bhavet || 27 ||

<p. 817> taṃ rasaṃ manasā mantrā vahannāsāgataṃ smaret |
arghyāmṛtena saṃyojya tataḥ śrīcakramarccayet || 28 ||

kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ dravyaṃ proktaṃ paramadurlabham |
brahmānandamaye jñāne pāpapuṇyavivarjite || 29 ||

na brāhmaṇo brāhmaṇastu na kṣattraḥ kṣattriyastathā |
vaiśyo'pi na ca vaiśyaḥ syānna śūdraḥ śūdra eva ca || 30 ||

cāṇḍālo naiva cāṇḍālaḥ pukkaso naiva pukkasaḥ |
sarvaṃ samaṃ vijānīyāt paramārthaviniścayāt || 31 ||

ākāśāt patitaṃ toyaṃ bindumārgeṇa gacchati |
grāmamadhye sthitaṃ toyaṃ viṣṭhāmūtrādipūritam || 32 ||

mṛgago'śvādimārjārakharādirudhirānvitam |
samastamapi gaṅgāyāṃ prayāti militaṃ yathā || 33 ||

gaṅgāmṛtaṃ bhavet sarvaṃ kāluṣyaṃ naiva niṣṭhati |
yathā saṃvinmaye jñāne samatā sarvajantuṣu || 34 ||

sarvadravyeṣu niyataṃ samatā nātra saṃśayaḥ |
yathā sūryaprakāśo'yaṃ sattvenaiva pravarttate || 35 ||

tataḥ svasyāpi cāntyasya tamaḥ saṃharati kṣaṇāt |
śoṣaya(n) dugdhamūtrādicandanaṃ naiva karddamam || 36 ||

ata eva vicārajño mantrī sarvamayo bhavet |
siddhistadaiva vijñeyā śrīguroḥ kṛpayā parā || 37 ||

<p. 818> (adbhutatrikūṭasādhanaprakārakathanam)

tathādbhutaṃ pravakṣyāmi trikūṭasyāpi sādhanam |
śuklāmbaradharo dhīro gandhakastūrīmaṇḍitaḥ || 38 ||

muktāphalasphuradbhūṣābhūṣitaḥ śuklamālyadhṛk |
dhavalāgāramadhye tu brahmacaryavrato naraḥ || 39 ||

pūjayecchubhrakusumairnaivedyañca samujjvalam |
pāyasaṃ ghṛtasaṃpūrṇaṃ tathā'mṛtaphalaudanam || 40 ||

dugdhaṃ modakasaṃyuktaṃ nānāpūpānnapūritam |
naivedyaṃ darśayeddevyai vāgīśvaryai susādhakaḥ || 41 ||

(tatra vāgbhavakūṭasādhanam)

manaḥsaṅkalpaśubhrairvā sādhayed vāgbhavākṣaram |
vāgbhavākhyāṃ japed vidyāṃ vāgīśīṃ saṃsmared budhaḥ || 42 ||

(vāgīśīdhyānam)

karpūradhavalāṃ śubhrāṃ śubhrābharaṇabhūṣitām |
muktāphalāmalamaṇijapamālālasatkarām || 43 ||

pustakaṃ varadānañca dadhatīmabhayapradām |
kucabhārabharākrāntāṃ dīpābhāṃ tanturūpiṇīm || 44 ||

gacchantīṃ brahmamārgeṇa liṅgabhedakrameṇa tu |

(devyā viśeṣacintā)

visargasthāmṛtaṃ divyaṃ kṣīradhāropamaṃ dhruvam || 45 ||


      <42 |> vāgbhavākhyāmiti ai(/) iti bījamityarthaḥ |

<p. 819> pītvā kulāmṛtañcaiva punareva viśet kulam |
punareva kulaṃ gacched dvādaśānte niveśayet || 46 ||

sahasrāre mahāpadme vāgbhavaṃ pūrṇacandrakam |
brahmagranthiṃ tato bhittvā saptaṣaṣṭhākṣadhārayā || 47 ||

lambikāṃ brahmamārgeṇa tālumūle praveśayet |
jihvāmāpūrya mantrajño mātṛkāvarṇarūpiṇīm || 48 ||

bahirgatāśca vāgrūpā(ṃ) jihvāgre'mṛtarūpiṇīm |
ā mūlād brahmarandhrāntaṃ tasmājjihvāpradeśakam || 49 ||

vāgbhavāṃ bījarūpāntāṃ dīpākārāṃ vicintayet |
hastayoḥ pādayormantrī tathā nāḍītrayeṣu ca || 50 ||

ādhārāttu samutthāpya vāgbhavaṃ dvādaśe nayet |
dvādaśādhāramānīya tadgranthiṃ paribhedayet || 51 ||

tasmājjihvāgramānīya dīpābhāṃ paribhāvayet |

(asya lakṣavārajapaphalam)

lakṣamekamidaṃ japtvā sarvapāpaharaḥ svayam || 52 ||

vākpatirjāyate sadyo mūko'pi sukavirbhavet |
vāde sadasi sadvākyastambhakaḥ prativādinaḥ || 53 ||

satpaṇḍitaghaṭāṭopajetā pratihataprabhaḥ |
sattarkaprativākyārthasarvālaṅkāraśāstravit || 54 ||

padagumphairmahāvākyakarttā mantrī prajāyate |
avyāhatamatiḥ śāstre vijñeyo vākpatirbhavet || 55 ||

<p. 820> (bālakajihvāyāṃ mantralekhanam)

bālakasya tu jihvāyāṃ tridinābhyantare likhet |
madhunā śvetadūrvābhiḥ kiṃ vā svarṇaśalākayā || 56 ||

amṛtaṃ vāgbhavaṃ kūṭaṃ vāgīśatvapradāyakam |
sa eva paṇḍitaḥ śrīmān sa cāmūrkho bhavet kila || 57 ||

(bālakasya mūrdhni japaphalam)

etad vāgbhavakūṭantu bālakasyāpi mūrddhani |
hastaṃ dattvā yadi japecchatamaṣṭottaraṃ budhaḥ || 58 ||

so'pi ślokān sarvathaiva karoti vākpatiryathā |
etattu kathitaṃ sāraṃ vāgbhavasyāpi sādhanam || 59 ||

(culukapānam)

atho devīṃ sacakrāntaculuke salile smaran |
mātṛkāsahitāṃ vidyāṃ trirāvṛttyā'mṛtātmikām || 60 ||

nāḍīṃ sarasvatīṃ jihvāṃ dīpākārāṃ smaran pibet |

(culukapānaphalam)

abdāccaturvidhaṃ tasya pāṇḍityaṃ bhuvi jāyate || 61 ||

(prātaḥkāle pānaphalam)

evaṃ nityamuṣaḥkāle yaḥ kuryācchuddhamānasaḥ |
sa yogī satyavijñānī sa kavirbhavati dhruvam || 62 ||

(kāmakūṭasādhanaphalam)

atha vakṣyāmi saubhāgyaṃ kāmakūṭasya sādhanam |

(kāmakūṭasādhanaprakāraḥ)

raktālaṅkārasubhago raktamālyānulepanām || 63 ||

<p. 821> raktavastrānvitāṃ samyaṅmadhyakāmakalātmanā |
raktapuṣpaiśca vividhaiḥ kusumādibhirarcayet || 64 ||

(kāmakalācintā)

tataḥ kāmakalārūpāṃ madanāṅkuramadhyame |
udyadādityasaṅkāśāṃ sphuraddīpaśikhāprabhām || 65 ||

gacchantīṃ brahmamārgeṇa brahmarandhrāntameva ca |
patadbhirindudhārābhīraktalākṣārasopamām || 66 ||

bandhūkakusumākārāṃ kāntibhūṣaṇabhūṣitām |
ikṣukodaṇḍapuṣpeṣuvarābhayalasatkarām || 67 ||

kāmarājasvarūpāntu bālārkakiraṇāruṇām |
cintayet kulapīṭheṣu saṃkṣobho jāyate kṣaṇāt || 68 ||

kāmakalā(ṃ) hṛdo madhye bandhūkasadṛśaprabhām |
cittākarṣaṇakārī ca nārīṇāñca viśeṣataḥ || 66 ||

mūrdhni bhāge kāmakalā varṣantī raktadhārayā |
dhāraṇāt saṃprayogeṇa karoti vaśagaṃ jagat || 70 ||

(kāmakūṭaprayogakathanam)

toṣayantī jagat sarvaṃ prayogaṃ kathayāmyatha |
vidarbhyādyena kāmena manmathāntakṛtaṃ kuru || 71 ||

kandarpasaṃpuṭaṃ kṛtvā koṇagarbhagataṃ tataḥ |
makaradhvajasaṃjñantu kārayet sādhakottamaḥ || 72 ||

<p. 822> mīnaketugataṃ kṛtvā bhūrjapatre suśobhane |
rocanāgurukastūrīkarpūrakuṅkumādibhiḥ || 73 ||

sādhyaṃ pratiṣṭhitaṃ prāṇaṃ kārayeddhemamadhyagam |
japet pañcasahasraṃ vā kāmabījantu sādhakaḥ || 74 ||

mūlaṃ bhānusahasrantu yatnena sādhayedapi |
athavā nābhimadhye tu hṛdaye mukhamaṇḍale || 75 ||

padmarāgapratīkāśaṃ kāmarājaṃ manoharam |
manasā cintayed yastu tasyaiśvaryaṃ bhavet kila || 76 ||

ādhārānnābhiparyantaṃ pradīpasya śikhāṃ smaret |
tasmādudaraparyantaṃ padmarāgasamaprabham || 77 ||

eteṣu vāgbhavaṃ bījaṃ hṛdaye kāmarājakam |
tasyaiva karṇikāmadhye sūryābhāṃ cintayedatha || 78 ||

tasmāt bhrūmaṇḍalaṃ yāvat padmarāgasamaprabham |
raktavastraparīdhāno lākṣārasagṛhe sthitaḥ || 79 ||

raktāsanopaviṣṭastu raktamālyairvibhūṣitaḥ |
paramānandahṛdayastripurīkṛtavigrahaḥ |
evambhūtavapuḥ kāntaṃ kāmarājaṃ vicintayet || 80 ||

(śaktikūṭasādhanam)

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi śaktikūṭasya sādhanam || 81 ||

sṛṣṭisaṃhāraparyantaṃ śarīraṃ cintayet parām |
sravatpīyūṣadhārābhirbalantīṃ viṣahāriṇīm || 82 ||

<p. 823> hemaprabhābhāsamānāṃ vidyunnikarasuprabhām |
sphuraccandrakalāpūrṇakamalāṃ varadābhayau || 83 ||

jñānamudrāñca dadhatīṃ sākṣādamṛtarūpiṇīm |
dhyātvā viṣaṃ harenmantrī nānākāravyavasthitam || 84 ||

hṛdi śāntādinānnantaṃ(?) jagadāhlādanaṃ param |
puraḥ kaṇṭhāditālvantaṃ śaktikūṭaṃ vicintayet || 85 ||

ādhārād brahmarandhrāntaṃ tasmādādhārakāvadhi |
atha madhyācchaktikūṭaṃ vidyudagnisamaprabham || 86 ||

kevalaṃ padmarāgantu bhruvormadhye vicintayet |
tasmādābrahmarandhrāntaṃ turīyaṃ padmarāgadhṛk || 87 ||

sahasrārāttu mūlāntaṃ padmarāgasamaprabham |

(kulaśakticintā)

tasmādābrahmarandhrāntaṃ kulaśaktiṃ vicintayet || 88 ||

vainateyasamo mantrī viṣabhārasahasranut |
bhūtapretapiśācāṃśca nāśayennātra saṃśayaḥ || 89 ||

cāturthakajvarān sarvānapasmārāṃśca nāśayet || 90 ||

(trukūṭasampanna(-)mahātripurasundarīcintāphalam)

atha trikūṭasampannā mahātripurasundarī |
cintitā sādhakasyāśu trailokyavaśakāriṇī || 91 ||

krameṇa nābhihṛdvaktramaṇḍalasthā'ruṇaprabhā |
padmarāgamaṇisvacchacintanāt sādhakasya ca || 92 ||

<p. 824> aṇimādiguṇaiśvaryaṃ saubhāgyañca prajāyate |
tannāma saṃsmaranmantrī yoginīnāṃ bhavet priyaḥ || 93 ||

mātṛcakraṃ tasya kāye tena sārddhaṃ sukhī bhavet |
patravān dhanavānmantrī mantradhyānānna saṃśayaḥ || 94 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇau dvāviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 22 ||


[trayoviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(tripurasundarīvidyāyā jīvanaprāptyupāyakathanam)

mahātripurasundaryā yathā syājjīvanānvitā |
bhuvi vidyā tathedānīṃ vakṣyāmi ca sudurlabhām || 1 ||

(vidyāyāḥ svarūpaviśeṣakathanam)

vidyudā(?)kṣīṃ parāṃ nityāṃ kālikāṃ kālabhāṣiṇīm |
khaḍgamuṇḍavikaṭāsyāṃ vyāghracarmavibhūṣitām || 2 ||

raktamālyāmbaradharāṃ ghorarūpāṃ caturbhujām |
khaḍgaśūlakapālañca varadāṃ tīkṣṇanāsikām || 3 ||

siddhyarthaṃ jīvayeddevīṃ sarvavidyāsujīvinā || 4 ||

(vidyāyāḥ svarūpāntaram)

raktāmbhodhisthapotollasadaruṇasarojādhirūḍhā karābjaiḥ |
pāśaṃ kodaṇḍamikṣūdbhavakamaṭhamathāpyaṅkuśaṃ pañca bāṇān |

vibhrāṇāsṛkapālaṃ trinayanavilasatpīnavakṣoruhāḍhyā |
devī bālārkavarṇā bhavatu śubhakarī prāṇaśaktiḥ parā naḥ || 5 ||


      <1 |> maheti | mahātripurasundaryā vidyā yathā bhuvi jīvanānvitā (dīptimatī) syāt(,) tathā 
idānīṃ tāṃ sudurlabhāṃ vidyāṃ vakṣyāmītyanvayaḥ |

<p. 826> (dīpanīvidyākathanam)

śrīṅkāraṃ prathamañcaiva drīṃklīṃkāraṃ tataḥ param |
haiṃ haiṃ kalahrīṃ sauḥ kalahrīṃ tataḥ paṭhet || 6 ||

klīṃ klīṃ tadadho bījaṃ drīṃkāraṃ śrīṃ tataḥ param |
sarveṣāṃ dīpanīvidyā sarvacakreṣu yojitā || 7 ||

(pratimāyāṃ pūjāviśeṣakathanam)

pratimāyāṃ tathā kāryā baliṃ dadyāt samāhitaḥ |
anaṅgakusumādiñca cakramadhye prapūjayet || 8 ||

svayambhu kusumaṃ dattvā kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ tathā |
pūjayeccakramadhye tu vādyairnānāvidhai rasaiḥ || 9 ||

huṃkāraśabdaiḥ karpūrairgītaiśca candanāruṇaiḥ |
narādibalidānaiśca mahiṣairmeṣachāgalaiḥ || 10 ||

gṛhītvā śoṇitaṃ pātre svakīyahṛdayodbhavam |
pūjayettripurāṃ devīṃ juhuyādagnisammukhe || 11 ||

(devyā dakṣiṇapārśve jīvanījapaprakāraḥ)

devyā dakṣiṇapārśve tu jīvanījapamācaret |
balīnāṃ śoṇitaṃ dattvā kālikāṃ pūjayettataḥ || 12 ||

krodhīśottarasaṃyuktaṃ nādabindukalānvitam |
krodhānantastataḥ paścāt saṃyuktena paṭhet sudhīḥ || 13 ||


	<6-7 |> śrīṅkāramiti | sarvacakrasādhāraṇīṃ dīpanīmāha(-)śrīṃkāramityādinā | tathā ca 
śrī(/) hrī(/) klī(/) hai(/) hai(/) kalahrī(/) sauḥ kalahrī(/) klī(/) klī(/) hasauḥ hrī(/) śrī(/) iti mantro bhavati |

<p. 827> pinākī ca susūkṣā ca krodhyānantastataḥ paṭhet |
anilo bhautikaścaiva tadadhaḥ praṇavaṃ likhet || 14 ||

eṣā jñeyā mahāvidyā mahācakrasamanvitā |
mahāmedhāpradā vidyā mahāghoravināśinī || 15 ||

mahāvidyā mahākāmā mahāpretāsanasthitā |
śvetarūpā ca candrasthā bālā ca bhagamālinī || 16 ||

anantarūpamākhyātā sā ca pripurasundarī |
parameyaṃ parā śaktiḥ prathamaṃ pārśvasaṃsthitā || 17 ||

dvitīyā kṣitivikhyātā tatparā paścimottarā |
sā ca devī mahādevī mahākālikasundarī || 18 ||

yasyā merorjagad vyāptaṃ surāsuranarādikam |
mahāpadmāsanā devī mahājīvanakāriṇī || 19 ||

pratimāṃ jīvitāṃ kṛtvā anayā śoṇitaṃ kṣipet |
sarvaduṣṭanivārāñca dhyāyeddevīṃ sulocanām || 20 || 

(pretāsane japaphalam)

pretāsane japed yastu sarvakāmaphalaṃ labhet |
kṣitau ca khyātivikhyāto'sādhyaṃ sādhayet parām || 21 ||

(mahādhyānakathanam)

mahādhyānaṃ pravakṣyāmi parāṃ śaktisvarūpiṇīm |
nīlapadmāsanāṃ devīṃ nīlapadmasamaprabhām || 22 ||

caturbhujāṃ trinayanāṃ raktamālyavibhūṣitām |
vāme khaḍgañca śūlañca vajramaṅkuśadakṣiṇe || 23 ||

<p. 828> candramaṇḍalamūrddhānaṃ sūryamaṇḍalasaṃsthitām |
raktavastraparīdhānāṃ raktagandhānulepanām || 24 ||

brahmaviṣṇuśivādīnāṃ śirasā pādasevitām |
unmattayauvanopetāṃ pretasthāṃ liṅgapīḍitām || 25 ||

evaṃrūpāṃ mahādevīṃ cintayet sādhakottamaḥ || 26 ||

(parameśvarīpūjānantaraṃ cakraṃ pūjanam)

anayā vidyayā mantrī saṃpūjya parameśvarīm |
tadā cakre padaṃ kṛtvā pratimāṃ caṇḍikāṃ yajet || 27 ||

saṃhāramudrayā devīṃ sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ |

(tato balidānam)

balidānaṃ tataḥ kuryād yathāśaktyā vidhānataḥ |
ānandarūpavān bhūtvā sundarīputravat kṣitau || 28 ||

kālīṃ kāmāturāṃ bhīmāṃ pracaṇḍagaṇaveṣṭitām |
kālakhaḍgadharāṃ devīṃ rudhiraughañca bhakṣitām || 29 ||

durlabhāṃ paramāṃ devīṃ mahātripurasundarīm |

(ākarṣaṇabījakathanam)

kathayāmi paraṃ bījamākarṣaṇakaraṃ param || 30 ||

viṣṇoḥ padaṃ vahnibījaṃ caturthasvarabhūṣitam |
nādabindukalātītaṃ śaktiṃ visargasaṃyutām || 31 ||

amukī(ṃ?) jīvamākarṣa dviṭhāntaṃ sādhakaḥ paṭhet |

(trikoṇacakramadhye devakanyādilikhanam)

śivarephakayormadhye trikoṇacakramadhyage || 32 ||

<p. 829> śiśurūpākarṣakarīṃ devakanyāṃ surāṅganām |
nāgagandharvakanyāñca ṛṣikanyāñca khecarīm || 33 ||

vilikhya sādhakaḥ śrīmānaruṇā(ṃ) cintayet satīm |
hṛdi maulau varāṅge ca javāṃ dattvā ca kanyakām || 34 ||

raktapuṣpaṃ samādāya kuṅkumaṃ gandhavāsitam |
cakramadhye śataṃ dattvā kanyānāma prapūjayet |
samāgacchati sā nārī mārabāṇena pīḍitā || 35 ||

(cāmuṇḍādhyānakathanam)

mahātripurasundaryā mūlavidyā yathoditā |
cāmuṇḍā bheditānāmnī dhyānaṃ vakṣyāmi durlabham || 36 ||

sūryakoṭinibhāṃ bālāṃ trinetrāmaruṇāmbarām |
dhanuḥpustakabāṇākhyadharāṃ bandhūkasannibhām || 37 ||

cakraliṅge samāviṣṭāṃ kāñcīyuktanitambinīm |
stanabhāronnatākārāṃ sindūrapūritānanām || 38 ||

sphuranmukuṭamāṇikyakiṅkiṇījālamaṇḍitām |
muktāhārasamāyuktāṃ tribalīmadhyabhūṣitām || 39 ||

sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyāṃ kāmāveśanakāriṇīm |
nityānandādibhirddevīṃ pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ || 40 ||

(vaktavya(-)paramadurlabhavidyā(-)praśaṃsā)

eṣā ca vidyā kathitā kathayāmi sudurlabhām |

<p. 830> yā devī jagati khyātā mahāparvatavāsinī |
paramānandahṛdayaḥ sādhayenmohanātmikām || 41 ||

yasyānandājjagad vyāptaṃ yā devī paramā kalā |
mahāmohanadātrī ca devāsuranarādiṣu || 42 ||

rajyate sakalaṃ nityaṃ tadā devyā carācaram |
duṣṭavairī bhaveddāsa īśaḥ sarvajanasya ca || 43 ||

athātaḥ saṃpravakṣyāmi vidyāṃ paramadurlabhām |
śivaśaktisamāyuktāṃ turīyasvarabhūṣitām || 44 ||

nādabindusamāyuktāṃ sarvalokamanoharīm |
rephahakārayormadhye trikoṇe cakramadhyage || 45 ||

sambodhanapadañcaiva sādhyaṃ karmapadānvitam |
pāśāṅkuśapuṭā śaktirnādabinduvibhūṣitā || 46 ||

(prāṇamantrakathanam)

yādyāḥ sapta sakārāntā vyomasargendusaṃyutā |
tadnte haṃsamantraḥ syāttato'muṣyapadaṃ vadet || 47 ||

prāṇā iti vadet paścādiha prāṇāḥ padaṃ tataḥ |
amuṣya jīva ihataḥ sthito'muṣyapadaṃ vadet || 48 ||


	<47 |> yādyāḥ sapteti | tathāca (-) yaṃ(/) raṃ(/) laṃ(/) vaṃ(/) śaṃ(/) ṣaṃ(/) saṃ(/) haṃ(/) saḥ(,) 
amuṣya prāṇā iha prāṇāḥ(,) amuṣya jīva iha sthitaḥ(,) amuṣya sarvendriyāṇi(,) amuṣya 
vāṅmanaścakṣuḥśrotraghrāṇaprāṇā ihāgatya sukhaṃ ciraṃ tiṣṭhantu svāhā iti prāṇamantro 
bhavati |

<p. 831> sarvendriyāṇyamuṣyānte vāṅmanaścakṣurantataḥ |
śrotraghrāṇapadāt prāṇā ihāgatya sukhaṃ ciram |
tiṣṭhantu vahnijāyāntaḥ prāṇamantro'yamīritaḥ || 49 ||

pratyamuṣyapadasyādau pāśādīni prayojayet |
amuṣyetipadasthāne sādhyanāma samuccaret || 50 ||

prayogeṣu samākhyātaḥ prāṇamantro manīṣibhiḥ |
sādhyaṃ pratiṣṭhitaprāṇamākarṣaṇādi yojayet || 51 ||

etā vidyāgaṇāḥ sarvāḥ pūjayet sādhakottamaḥ |
bṛhacchīkramatantrasya matametadudīritam || 52 ||

(mahāyantradhāraṇakathanam)

athocyate mahāyantraviśeṣadhāraṇaṃ param |
śubhe'hni snānamācarya śubhe lagne śubhe kṣaṇe || 53 ||

siddhiyoge mahāparve pūjāṃ kṛtvā likhedidam |

(mantralikhanadravyoddeśaḥ)

kuṇḍagolodbhavaṃ dravyaṃ svayambhu kusumaṃ tathā || 54 ||

rocanā kuṅkumaṃ kṣaudraṃ karpūraṃ candanaṃ madam |
etaddravyeṇa vilikheccakrarājaṃ manoharam || 55 ||

(likhanaprakāraḥ)

trikoṇāntaragatāṃ māyāṃ vilikhet sādhakottamaḥ |
rephahakārayormadhye devānāmābhimukhyadam || 56 ||

<p. 832> sādhyanāma dvitīyāntaṃ tasyorddhve vilikhenmanum |
tatraiva mātṛkāṃ sarvāṃ vilikhet kramavāhyataḥ || 57 ||

(yantraśodhanaprakāraḥ)

pañcagavyāmṛtenaiva mūlena pariṣecayet |
tataḥ pratiṣṭhitaprāṇāṃ vidyāmaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 58 ||

tat spṛṣṭvā prajapenmantrī devīdhyānaparāyaṇaḥ |

(dhāraṇaprakāraḥ)

hemno madhyagataṃ kṛtvā rajatasyāpi vā punaḥ || 59 ||

kare kṛtvā labhedvaśyaṃ hṛdaye strī suvallabhe |
kaṇṭhe dhanaṃ labhed bhāle stambhanaṃ jṛmbhaṇaṃ bhavet || 60 ||

śikhāyāṃ mokṣamāpnoti tasmād yatnena dhārayet |
dhāraṇīyaṃ prayatnena gopanīyaṃ punaḥ punaḥ || 61 ||

(mantradāne pātrāpātrollekhaḥ)

asatyāya na dātavyaṃ putraśiṣyāya caiva hi |
bhaktiyuktāya śiṣyāya suputrāya prakāśayet || 62 ||

paśubhyo bāndhavebhyo'pi na kadācit prakāśayet |

(apātre mantradānaphalam)

kṛte tu aśubhaṃ tasya mantrā yānti parāṅmukhāḥ || 63 ||

duḥkhañca varddhate nityaṃ tasmād yatnena varjayet |

(gorocanādinā cakralikhanaphalam)

gorocanādibhirmantrī cakrarājaṃ samālikhet || 64 ||

<p. 833> atīva sundarīṃ ramyāṃ tanmadhye pratimāṃ varām |
jvalantīṃ sāmasahitāṃ kāmarājavidarbhitām || 65 ||

(cintāviśeṣe phalaviśeṣaḥ)

cintayet sādhakendro'pi janānāñca sahasraśaḥ |
adṛṣṭapūrvā yuvatī śrutamāśu sudurlabhā || 66 ||

rājakanyā'tha cārvaṅgī bhayalajjāvivarjitā |
āyāti sādhakaṃ samyaṅmantramūḍhā satī dhruvam || 67 ||

cakramadhyagato bhūtvā sādhakaścintayedatha |
udyatsūryasahasrābhamātmānamaruṇantathā || 68 ||

sādhyamapyaruṇībhūtaṃ cintayet sādhakottamaḥ |
anena kramayogena svayaṃ kandarparūpavān || 69 ||

sarvasaundaryasubhagaḥ sarvalokavaśaṅkaraḥ |
sarvaiḥ pūjopahāraistu mudrāsahitavigrahaḥ || 70 ||

(cakre nāmalikhane phalaviśeṣaḥ)

cakraṃ saṃpūjayed yastu yasya nāma vidarbhitam |
sa bhaveddāsavadāśu dhanāḍhyo vā'pi bhūpatiḥ || 71 ||

cakramadhyagataṃ kuryānnāma yasyāntu yojayet |
adṛṣṭāmapi mantrajño yonimudrāsamanvitaḥ || 72 ||

haṭhādānayate śīghraṃ yakṣiṇīṃ rājakanyakām |
nāgakanyāmapsarasaṃ khecarīṃ vā surāṅganām || 73 ||

<p. 834> vidyādharīṃ divyarūpāmṛṣikanyāṃ ripustriyam |
madanodbhavasantāpasphurajjaghanamaṇḍalām || 74 ||

kāmabāṇaprabhinnāntaḥkaraṇāṃ lolacakṣuṣam |

(cakre mahākalādhyānaphalam)

mahākāmakalādhyānayogādeva na saṃśayaḥ |
kṣobhayet svargabhūrlokapātālatalayoṣitaḥ || 75 ||

(vaśīkāritilakakathanam)

rocanābhāgamekantu bhāgamekantu kuṅkumam |
atha bhāgadvayaṃ mantrī candanaṃ mardayet samam || 76 ||

ekatra tilakaṃ kuryāttrailokyavaśakāraṇam |
aṣṭottaraśatāvṛttyā mantrayitvā vaśaṃ nayet || 77 ||

rājānaṃ nagaraṃ grāmaṃ yena yad yat pradṛśyate |
mantriṇā sādhakendreṇa tat sarvaṃ tasya vaśyagam || 78 ||

(vaśīkaraṇārthaṃ tāmbūlādyabhimantraṇam)

tāmbūlaṃ dhūpamudakaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ dadhi |
dugdhaṃ ghṛtaṃ dantapatraṃ vastraṃ karpūrameva ca || 79 ||

kastūrīṃ ghusṛṇañcailāṃ lavaṅgaṃ jātipatrakam |
śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japtvā yasmai kasmai prayacchati || 80 ||

sa vaśyo jāyate nūnaṃ nātra kāryā vicāraṇā |
striyaśca sakalā vaśyā dāsībhūtā bhavanti hi || 81 ||

haṭhākarṣaṇametattu kathitaṃ nānyathā bhavet |

(yoṣidākarṣaṇaprakāraḥ)

rahasyasthānake mantrī likhedrocanayā bhuvi || 82 ||

<p. 835> cāruśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām |
pratimāṃ sundarīṃ prītāṃ vilikhya sumanoharām || 83 ||

tadbhālagalahṛnnābhijanmamaṇḍalayojitām |
janmanāmamahāvidyāmaṅkuśāntavidarbhitām || 84 ||

sarvasandhiṣu dehasya madanākṣaramālikhet |
sphuraddāḍimapuṣpābhaṃ cintayeddehasandhiṣu || 85 ||

tadāśābhimukho bhūtvā svayaṃ devīsvarūpadhṛk |
mudrāntu kṣobhaṇīṃ baddhvā mantramaṣṭaśataṃ japet || 86 ||

niyojya dahanāgāre candrasūryakalātmake |
tato vikalacārvaṅgīṃ mārabāṇaprapīḍitām || 87 ||

evamākarṣayennārīṃ yojanānāṃ śatādapi || 88 ||

(avadhyatvopāyakathanam)

mātṛkāṃ vilikheccakre bāhyataḥ sakalāṃ budhaḥ |
bhūrjapatre svarṇapatre raupyapatre'pi tāmraje |
so'vadhyaḥ sarvajantūnāṃ vyāghrādīnāṃ viśeṣataḥ || 89 ||

(rājavallabhatopāyaḥ)

tathaiva mārasaṃyuktāṃ sasaṃjñāṃ cakramaṇḍitām |
karpūrakuṅkumādyaiśca rājavallabhatāṃ vrajet || 90 ||

(vaśīkaraṇaprakāraḥ)

anena vidhinā śuddho rocanāgurukuṅkumaiḥ |
vilikheccakra rājena sādhyanāma ca mantravit || 91 ||

<p. 836> vidarbhitaṃ svanāmnā tu yasmin kasminnupasthitam |
sthāvaraṃ jaṅgamaṃ vāpi sakalaṃ janamaṇḍalam || 92 ||

vaśīkuryāt sādhakendro nūnameva na saṃśayaḥ |

(trailokyavaśīkaraṇopāyaḥ)

mahātripurasundaryāḥ kāmakoṭikalā smṛtāḥ || 93 ||

evamevamavaṣṭabhya sādhyanāmākṣarāṇi tu |
dhanamapyarthane bāṇairmātṛkāyāḥ praveṣṭaye || 94 ||

hemamadhyagataṃ kuryācchikhāyāṃ vāmake bhuje |
dhārayed yatra kutrāpi trailokyavaśakāraṇam |
rājendravṛndasakalaṃ dāsabhūtāṃ karoti ca || 95 ||

rājāno vājinaḥ sarpā mahāduṣṭā mahotkaṭāḥ |
vyāghrāḥ keśariṇo mattā vaśyāstasya bhavanti hi || 96 ||

(mahākṣobhakaraṇam)

pūrvakrameṇa nagaranāmasaundaryamantravit |
madhye catuṣpathe vāpi caturdikṣu nidhāpayet || 97 ||

mahākṣobho yoṣitāñca janānāṃ mahatāmapi |
tathaiva sarvajantūnāṃ purasthānañca jāyate || 98 ||

(kāmatulyatvaprāptyupāyaḥ)

etanmadhyagatāṃ pṛthvīṃ saśailavanakānanām |
jvalantīṃ sarvarājendramaṇḍitāṃ sāgarāmbarām || 99 ||

māsamekaṃ cintayeyuḥ sākṣātkāmasamo bhavet |
dṛṣṭyā'karṣayate mantrī trailokyaṃ sacarācaram || 100 ||

<p. 837> (dṛṣṭimātreṇa viṣādināśakṣamatāprāptiḥ)

dṛṣṭyā viṣaṃ nāśayate tatkṣaṇānnātra saṃśayaḥ |
bhūtapretapiśācāṃśca jvarāṃścāturthikādikān || 101 ||

śūlagulmākṣirogāṃśca dṛṣṭyā nāśayate kṣaṇāt |

(śrīsamākarṣaṇasāmarthyaprāptiḥ)

etat sindūrasubhagaṃ rātrau saṃpūjayed yadi || 102 ||

yojanānāṃ śatādeva samyagākarṣayecchriyam |

(digvidiksthajanavaśīkāraḥ)

yadā dikṣu vidikṣvevaṃ samyag devīṃ prapūjayet || 103 ||

tatra dikṣu sthitān lokān vidikṣusthān janānapi |
vaśamānayate śīghraṃ saputrapaśubāndhavān || 104 ||

(trailokyavaśīkaraṇam)

bhūrjapatre samālikhya rocanā'gurukuṅkumaiḥ |
tanmadhye nagaraṃ deśaṃ maṇḍalaṃ khaṇḍameva vā || 105 ||

nāmnā vidarbhitaṃ samyak pūjayitvā yathāvidhi |
bhūmimadhyagataṃ kṛtvā trailokyaṃ vaśamānayet || 106 ||

(kaṇṭhādau dhāraṇe phalaviśeṣaḥ)

athavā dhārayet kaṇṭhe śikhāyāṃ bāhumūlake |
yatra kutra sthito mantrī kṣobhayennagaraṃ mahat || 107 ||

(arkakṣīrādibhiścakralikhanaphalam)

arkakṣīreṇa saṃyuktaṃ dhustūrakarasaṃ tathā |
rocanā kuṅkumañcaiva lākṣākastūrīraktakam || 108 ||

<p. 838> ebhirlikheccakrametad yasya nāmnā ca sādhakaḥ |
tasya vyāghrabhayavyādhiripusargagajādikam || 109 ||

cauragrahajanāviṣṭaḍākinīśākinībhavam |
bhayaṃ na vidyate nūnaṃ paramantrābhicārakam || 110 ||

(nityaṃ cakradhāraṇaphalam)

nityaṃ sandhārayenmantrī kālamṛtyuṃ vināśayet |
trikoṇamadhyagāṃ devīṃ trikoṇomayamadhyagām || 111 ||

adhastānnāmasaṃyuktāṃ rocanākuṅkumānvitām |
nidhāpayet saptamāhe dāsavat kiṅkaro bhavet || 112 ||

(sarvavādistambhanam)

pītadravyaiḥ samālikhya pītadravyaiḥ samarcayet |
pūrvāśābhimukho bhūtvā stambhayet sarvavādinaḥ || 113 ||

sahasravadano'pyeva mūko bhavati tatkṣaṇāt |
nāmnā yasya sa vāgmī tu pāṣāṇa iva jāyate || 114 ||

(śatrumāraṇaprakāraḥ)

cakraṃ vilikhya mantrajño mahānīrarasena tu |
nāma saṃyojya vidhivad dakṣiṇābhimukho budhaḥ || 115 ||

vahnau dagdhvā tu taccakraṃ mārayed vairisaṅkulam |

(vidveṣaṇakaraṇam)

mahiṣāśvapurīṣābhyāṃ rasamākṛṣya mantravit || 116 ||

gomūtreṇa ca saṃlikhya nāma sandarbhya pūrvavat |
kṣiptvā palāśamadhyasthaṃ vidveṣaṇakaraṃ bhavet || 117 ||

<p. 839> (uccāṭanakaraṇam)

kṛtvā rocanayā droṇakākapakṣasya madhyagam |
lambamānaṃ tathākāśe śatrūccāṭanakārakam || 118 ||

(sarvavaśīkaraṇam)

mahānīlīrocanābhyāṃ dugdhakṣārarasādibhiḥ |
vilikhya dhārayenmantrī sarvavarṇān vaśaṃ nayet || 119 ||

(prakārāntareṇa sarvavaśīkaraṇam)

anenaiva vidhānena sthāpayed vārimadhyagam |
tenodakena susnātaḥ pītaṃ tat sarvavaśyakṛt |
saubhāgyaṃ jāyate tena pānīyena na saṃśayaḥ || 120 ||

(kṣobhaṇaprakāraḥ)

etanmadhyagatāṃ pṛthvīṃ nagaraṃ vāpi sādhakaḥ |
saptāhāt kṣobhayet sarvaṃ jvālāmālāṃ vicintayet || 121 ||

(strīvaśīkaraṇaprakāraḥ)

daśadaṇḍagate rātrau sarāve dāhavarjite |
sindūrakuṅkumābhyāñca cakrarājaṃ samālikhet || 122 ||

sādhyapratikṛtiṃ kanyāṃ tanmadhye vilikhed budhaḥ |
tadūrdhve mūlamantrañca tadbāhye mātṛkāṃ likhet || 123 ||

sāvaraṇāṃ sveṣṭadevīṃ tatraiva paripūjayet |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ kundaṃ mūlaṃ sādhyasamanvitam || 124 ||

pratyekakṣepaṇāccaiva haṭhāt kuṇḍamidaṃ mahat |
calajjalendusadṛśīṃ trikoṇāmaruṇāruṇām || 125 ||

<p. 840> pralayānalasaṅkāśāṃ sādhyāyā yonimadhyataḥ |
dhyāyan sahasraṃ japtvaiva tāmānayati niścitam || 126 ||

(strīvaśīkaraṇe prakārāntaram)

upaviśya ca śayyāyāṃ nirjane śūnyaveśmani |
yasya nāmnā svayaṃ bhuṅkte tāmbūlaṃ niśi vā divā |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā sāyātyeva tadantikam || 127 ||

(prakārāntareṇa strīvaśīkaraṇam)

aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā pānīyaṃ prāśayedatha |
yasyāḥ prāṇaiḥ kalpayitvā sāyāti madavihvalā || 128 ||

(dāsīkaraṇaprakāraḥ)

candra(-)candana(-)kastūrī(-)raktasindūramiśritam |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ japtvā tilakaṃ kārayed yadi |
yaṃ yaṃ paśyati tacchīghraṃ sa sa dāso bhaved dhruvam || 129 ||

(strīvaśīkāre kalpāntaram)

madhusarpiḥ samunmiśrya sitākalpitaputtalīm |
sādhyaprāṇaiḥ kṛtaprāṇāṃ japtvā aṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 130 ||

bhānuvāraṃ samāsādya yaḥ khādet saptarātrakam |
sā ca yāti vihvalāṅgī sādhakasyāntikaṃ dhruvam || 131 ||

(sarvavādistambhanam)

pūrvāśābhimukho bhūtvā pītadravyaiḥ samarcayet |
pīṭhasthāne samālikhya stambhayet sarvavādinaḥ || 132 ||

<p. 841> (prakārāntareṇa sarvalokavaśīkaraṇam)

uttarābhimukho bhūtvā sindūrarajasā likhet |
saṃpūjya vidhivad vidvān sarvalokaṃ vaśaṃ nayet || 133 ||

(sarvayoṣinmanoharaṇam)

paścimābhimukho bhūtvā candanena samālikhet |
saṃpūjya vidhivad vidyāṃ sarvayoṣinmano haret || 134 ||

vallabho jāyate mantrī dāsīmiva vaśaṃ nayet |

(mahāhānikaraṇam)

yamāśābhimukho bhūtvā cakraṃ kṛṣṇaṃ samarccayet || 135 ||

yasya nāmnānvitaṃ tatra mahāhāniḥ prajāyate |

(stambhavidveṣaṇādiprakāraḥ)

agni(-)rākṣasa(-)vāyavya(-)śambhu(-)koṇeṣu yojitam || 136 ||

pūrvavat sādhakaśreṣṭhaḥ krameṇaiva niyojitam |
stambhavidveṣaṇavyādhiśatrūccāṭanakaṃ bhavet || 137 ||

(sarvavaśīkaraṇam)

rocanābhirlikheccakraṃ kṣīramadhye kṣiped budhaḥ |
sarvavaśyakarañcaiva bhavatyeva na saṃśayaḥ || 138 ||

(śatroruccāṭanakaraṇam)

gomūtramadhyagaṃ samyak śatroruccāṭanaṃ bhavet |

(vidveṣaṇakaraṇam)

tailasthaṃ cakrarājantu vidveṣaṇakaraṃ bhavet || 139 ||

(śatrunāśakaraṇam)

jvalajjvalanamadhyasthaṃ śatrunāśakaraṃ bhavet |

<p. 842> (khecaratvasiddhiḥ)

yadaikānte caturmārge sindūrarajasā likhet || 140 ||

sarvabāhyata ārabhya yāvanmadhyañca sādhakaḥ |
akārādikṣakārāntāṃ mātṛkāṃ tatra saṃlikhet || 141 ||

pūjayedrātrisamaye kulācārakrameṇa tu |
sādhakaḥ khecaraścaiva jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 142 ||

(ajarāmaratvaprāptiḥ)

girāvekatarau tadvadarccayet kulamārgataḥ |
ajarāmaratāṃ labdhvā sukhī bhavati māntrikaḥ || 143 ||

(khaḍgādi sarvasiddhilābhaḥ)

śmaśāne pūjayeccakraṃ mahābhūtadine budhaḥ |
yathāvidhividhānena sādhakaḥ sthiramānasaḥ || 144 ||

khaḍgasiddhiñca vetālasiddhiñca guṭikāñjanam |
pādukāñjanasiddhiñca manaḥsiddhiñca dhātujam || 145 ||

mahāvīraṇasiddhiñca yakṣiṇīṃ caṭakodbhavām |
sarvaṃ tallabhate mantrī nātra kāryā vicāraṇā || 146 ||

(sarvapāpanāśaprakāraḥ)

śivāṃ saṃpūjayeddevīṃ sagandhikusumaiḥ sudhīḥ |
mahāpātakayuktātmā tatkṣaṇāt pāpahā bhavet || 147 ||

śamīdūrvāṅkurāśvatthapallavairathavā'mbujaiḥ |
māsena hanti kaluṣaṃ saptajanmakṛtaṃ naraḥ || 148 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇau trayoviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 23 ||



[caturviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(devatāstavapāṭhanirṇayaḥ)

athocyate devatāyāḥ stavapāṭhavinirṇayaḥ |

(pāṭhasyāvaśyakatā)

na mānasaṃ bhavet stotraṃ vācikantu praśasyate || 1 ||

(pāṭhaniyamaḥ)

ante ca praṇavaṃ dadyādityuvācādipūrvakam |
sarvatra pāṭhe vijñeyamanyathā viphalaṃ bhavet |
śuddhenānanyacittena paṭhitavyaṃ prayatnataḥ || 2 ||

(pustakasyādhārasthāpananiyamaḥ)

ādhāre sthāpayitvā tu pustakaṃ prajapet sudhīḥ |

(haste pustakasthāpane doṣaḥ)

hastasaṃsthāpanādeva yasmādalpaphalaṃ bhavet || 3 ||

(pustakalekhakanirṇayaḥ)

na svayaṃ likhitaṃ tacca kṛtinā likhitaṃ paṭhet |
abrāhmaṇena likhitaṃ taccāpi viphalaṃ bhavet || 4 ||

(kalau sādhāraṇamanuṣyādikṛtastavapāṭhaniṣedhaḥ)

na ca svayaṃkṛtaṃ stotramanyenāpi kṛtaṃ na ca |
yasmāt kalau na praśastamṛṣibhirbhāṣitaṃ paṭhet || 5 ||

(ṛṣicchanda(-)ādīnāṃ pāṭhaḥ karttavyaḥ)

ṛṣicchandādikaṃ nyasya paṭhet stotraṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ || 6 ||

<p. 844> (prathamaṃ sahasranāmapāṭhaḥ)

yasya yasya ca devasya tasya tasya sahasrakam |
paṭhitvā prathamaṃ mantrī tasya stotraṃ tataḥ paṭhet || 7 ||

saṃhitājapane stotraṃ śubhaṃ prāpya samāpayet |

(adhyāyamadhye pāṭhavirāmo na karttavyaḥ)

adhyāyaṃ prāpya viramenna tu madhye kadācana |
kṛte virāme madhye tu adhyāyādiṃ punarjapet || 8 ||

(balidānavidhikathanam)

athāto balidānasya vidhānamatra vakṣyate |
camaraḥ kṛṣṇasāraśca matsyo meṣaśca śūkaraḥ || 9 ||

mahiṣo vānaraḥ khaḍgo balirmeṣādito bhavet |
kṛṣṇacchāgadvayaṃ dadyāt paścāddadyānmahābalim || 10 ||

(chāgalasya ṣaḍvidhatvakathanam)

śvetaḥ kṛṣṇo lohitaśca kapilaścitrapāṇḍarau |
ṣaḍvidhaśchāgalaḥ prokto gṛhasthānāṃ paro baliḥ || 11 ||

(balīnāmuttamamadhyamādhamatvakathanam)

uttamau śvetakṛṣṇau ca madhyamau citrapāṇḍarau |
lohitaḥ kapilaścaiva kaniṣṭhaḥ parikīrttitaḥ || 12 ||

trimāsāt parataścaiva yāvadekantu vatsaram |
kṛṣṇo vā śvetataruṇaḥ praśasto balirucyate || 13 ||

ṣaṇmāsāt parataścaiva yāvad varṣadvayaṃ bhavet |
uttamo'sau baliḥ proktastasmāddhīno'dhamaḥ smṛtaḥ || 14 ||

<p. 845> (tyājyabaliḥ)

kṛṣṇavarṇo baliryastu śvetapuccho yadā bhavet |
chāgalaṃ tādṛśaṃ vidvān dūrataḥ parivarjayet || 15 ||

evaṃ site kṛṣṇapucche varjayenmatimān naraḥ || 16 ||

ākṛṣṇavarṇo yaśchāgaḥ pṛṣṭhavaṃśe sito yadi |
praśastaṃ taṃ vijānīyād viparītantu varjayet || 17 ||

(khañjādīnāṃ balau tyājyatā)

khañjaṃ kāṇaṃ tathā kubjaṃ sacchidraṃ vyādhisaṃyutam |
viṣāṇadantarahitaṃ varjayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ || 18 ||

(uttamamahiṣabaliḥ)

pañcābdaṃ māhiṣaṃ śvetaṃ praśastaṃ parikīrttitam |

(adhamamahiṣabaliḥ)

sa eva mahiṣaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ pāṇḍaraścādhamo baliḥ || 19 ||

(baliṣu pakṣiṇāṃ praśastatā)

pakṣiṇastu praśastāḥ syuḥ sarve varṇāḥ suśobhanāḥ |
tripakṣāt parataścaiva hīne cāpi vivarjayet || 20 ||

(baliviśeṣeṇa devatātṛptikālakathanam)

manuṣyaiḥ koṭivarṇāṇi tṛptiṃ gacchanti devatāḥ |
gaṇḍairvarṣasahasrāṇi mahiṣaiḥ śaradāṃ śatam || 21 ||

chagalairvatsarādūrddhvaṃ dvādaśābdaṃ daśābdakam |
pūrṇasāṃvatsareraiva trivarṣaṃ kacchapena tu || 22 ||

varāheṇa tu pañcāśattadarddhaṃ cāmareṇa tu |
abdaikaṃ godhikābhiśca ṣaṇmāsaṃ gātraśoṇitam || 23 ||

<p. 846> pāyasenāpi ṣaṇmāsaṃ tṛptiṃ gacchanti devatāḥ || 24 ||

(strīpaśubalidānaniṣedhaḥ)

na dadyāt strīpaśormāṃsaṃ havyakavye viśeṣataḥ |

(home māṃsanirūpaṇam)

home bukkāgrajaṃ māṃsaṃ saromañcārddharātrake || 25 ||

siṃhavilvākṛtiñcaiva vastu ca pūgameva ca |
bukkāgramāṃsamānaṃ syāllulāpasya narasya ca || 26 ||

tathā pramāṇamātraṃ syādajasya vadanasya ca |
dhātakīphalamānantu godhikāyā itīritam || 27 ||

etadāmamayasyaiva bharjite mānavarjitam |
hīnendriyapaśormāṃsaṃ dūrataḥ parivarjayet || 28 ||

(māṃsahome kālaniyamaḥ)

divā na juhuyānmāṃsaṃ sandhyāyāṃ sāvasānake |
brāhmye muhūrte juhuyādathavā sandhiparvasu || 29 ||

ekena ca sahasraṃ syād dviguṇaṃ cārddharātrake |
brāhmye muhūrtte dviguṇaṃ sandhyāyāñca caturguṇam |
parvasandhau śataguṇaṃ tithisandhau śatottaram || 30 ||

kāmye ca juhuyānmāṃsaṃ puraścaraṇaśeṣakaiḥ |
yonyāvaṭe śataguṇaṃ sthaṇḍile'pi na cācaret || 31 ||

(balyutsargaprakāraḥ)

atha saṃprokṣaṇaṃ kṛtvā baliṃ samutsṛjed budhaḥ |
svayaṃ pūrvamukho bhūtvā baliṃ kuryādudaṅmukham || 32 ||

<p. 847> athavaitadvyatyayaḥ syāt sindūrādyairalaṅkṛtam |
arghyapātrodakaiḥ śuddhairmūlena prokṣayettriśaḥ || 33 ||

(paśusnāpanamantraḥ)

oṃ vārāhī yamunā gaṅgā kāratoyā sarasvatī |
kāverī candrabhāgā ca sindhubhairavasāgarāḥ |
ajasnāne maheśāni sānnidhyamiha kalpaya || 34 ||

oṃ paśupāśavināśāya hemakūṭasthitāya ca |
parāparāya parameṣṭhine hū(/) kārāya ca mūrttaye || 35 ||

oṃ sahasraśīrṣā puruṣaḥ sahasrākṣaḥ sahasrapāt |
sa bhūmiṃ sarvato vṛtvā atyatiṣṭhaddaśāṅgulam || 36 ||

vilvapatrodakairebhiḥ prokṣaṇaṃ kārayedpi |
triśaḥ saṃpūjayettañca tatreṣṭaṃ gandhacandanaiḥ || 37 ||

tato nirīkṣya taṃ mantrī paṭhet karapuṭaṃ svayam || 38 ||

(balipraṇāmamantraḥ)

chāga tvaṃ balirūpeṇa mama bhāgyādupasthitaḥ |
praṇamāmi tataḥ sarvarūpiṇaṃ balirūpiṇam || 39 ||

caṇḍikāprītidānena dāturāpadvināśanam |
cāmuṇḍābalirūpāya bale tubhyaṃ namo'stu te || 40 ||

yajñārthe paśavaḥ sṛṣṭāḥ svayameva svayambhuvā |
atastvāṃ ghātayiṣyāmi tasmād yajñe vadho'vadhaḥ || 41 ||

(balimūrddhni mantrajapaḥ)

vāṅmāyākamalābījaistanmūrddhni trirmanūn japet || 42 ||

<p. 848> tato baliṃ samutsṛjya kāmyaṃ kṛtvā viśāladhīḥ |
ānīya khaḍgaṃ purato gandhādibhiḥ samarccayet || 43 ||

(khaḍgadhyānam)

kṛṣṇaṃ piṇākapāṇiñca kālarātrisvarūpiṇam |
ugraṃ raktāsyanayanaṃ gandhānulepanam || 44 ||

raktāmbaradharañcaiva pāśahastaṃ kuṭumbinam |
pibamānañca rudhiraṃ bhuñjānaṃ kravyasaṃhatim || 45 ||

(khaḍgapūjāmantraḥ)

iti dhyātvā yajet tañca mantreṇānena yājakaḥ |
rasanā tvaṃ caṇḍikāyāḥ suralokaprasādaka || 46 ||

māyādvayaṃ khaḍgapadaṃ kāli kāli padantataḥ |
vajreśvarī tato lauhadaṇḍāyai ṅe'ntāṃ namaḥ padam || 47 ||

kūrccabījaṃ likhet khaḍge sindūracandanādinā |
devyā bījaṃ likhettatra pūjayitvā namaścaret || 48 ||

iti dhyātvā sādhakastu namaskāraṃ samācaret || 49 ||

(khaḍganamaskāramantraḥ)

asirviśasanaḥ khaḍgastīkṣṇadhāro durāsadaḥ |
śrīgarbho vijayaścaiva dharmapāla namo'stute || 50 ||

tataḥ khaḍgaṃ gṛhītvā tu devatārasanādhiyā |
abhimantrya ca mūlena vakṣyamāṇena ca svayam || 51 ||

<p. 849> viṣaṃ māyādvayaṃ kāliyugaṃ vikaṭarūpataḥ |
daṃṣṭre sphe(/) sphe(/) tato brūyāt phetkāriṇīti khādaya || 52 ||

dvitayaṃ chedayayugaṃ sarvān duṣṭāṃstataḥ param |
mārayadvitayaṃ paścādajaṃ khaḍgena chindhiyuk || 53 ||

kāli kāli kicidvandvaṃ pibayugrudhiraṃ padam |
sphrau(/) sphrau(/) kiliyugaṃ kāliyugmamityabhimantraṇe |

(baliskandhe khaḍganiyojanamantraḥ)

hū(/) hū(/) phaḍiti mantreṇa skandhe khaḍgaṃ niyojayet || 54 ||

(khaḍgalakṣaṇakathanam)

atha vakṣyāmi khaḍgānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ tantravartmanā |
yena saṃchedanenāpi sādhakaḥ siddhimālabhet || 55 ||

(candrahāsalakṣaṇakathanam)

sarveṣāmuttamaḥ khaḍgaścandrahāsaḥ sukhāvahaḥ |
pañcāśadaṅgulaiḥ kāryaḥ kiṃvā tālatrayeṇa tu || 56 ||

(khaḍgam karabīraphalākārādikathanam)

karabīraphalākāraḥ kiṃvā padmadalākṛtiḥ |
athavā kubjakaḍgena bhedayet khalu sādhakaḥ || 57 ||

      
      <52-54 |> viṣamiti | tathāca (-) oṃ hrī(/) hrī(/) kāli kāli vikaṭarūpadaṃṣṭre spheṃ spheṃ 
phetkāriṇi khādaya khādaya chedaya chedaya sarvān duṣṭān māraya māraya ajaṃ khaḍgena 
chindhi chindhi kāli kāli kici kici piva piba rudhiraṃ sphrau(/) sphrau(/) kili kili kāli kāli hū(/) hū(/) 
phaṭ iti mantreṇa baleḥ skandhe khaḍgaṃ sthāpayet ityarthaḥ | 

<p. 850> (balicchedane dātrādīnāṃ vidhiḥ)

mahābalīnāṃ sarveṣāṃ dātramatra prakīrttitam |

(churikādinā chedananiṣedhaḥ)

karttṛkayā kṣureṇāpi chindyācchurikayā na ca || 58 ||

kuṭhāraparaśubhyāṃ vā bhedayenna kadācana |

(tīkṣṇakhaḍgena chedanakathanam)

chedayettīkṣṇakhaḍgena acchidreṇa mukhena ca || 59 ||

nākāśe cchedayettantu same deśe śucau tathā |
chedayedaniśaṃ śastaṃ baliṃ pūrvamukhaṃ śubham |
udaṅmukhaḥ svayaṃ netrabījenaiva tu sādhakaḥ || 60 ||

(chāgādipaśūnāṃ pūrvābhimukhena cchedanam)

chāgalādipaśūnāñca viparītamukhena tu |

(balicchedakakathanam)

prahārāṇāñcādhikārī teṣāmevaṃ vidhīyate || 61 ||

svayaṃ vā bhrātṛputro vā bhrātā vā suhṛdeva vā |
sapiṇḍaśchedayed vāpi śuddhāntaḥkaraṇo yadi || 62 ||

(ripuprabhṛtyanupayuktānāṃ kathanam)

na ripuṃ nāṅgahīnaṃ vā na kāṇaṃ nāpi kubjakam |
na yojayecchatrupakṣaṃ balicchedanakarmaṇi || 63 ||
 

	<60 |> nākāśe iti | śūnyasthāne baliṃ na cchedayet | netrabījena vauṣaṭ itimantreṇa |

<p. 851> (digviśeṣe balermastakapatane phalaviśeṣaḥ)

yadi vāyavyadigbhāge nair(-)ṛte dakṣiṇe'pi vā |
mastakaṃ patate caiva hānimatra vinirddiśet || 64 ||

śeṣeṣu dikṣu sarvāsu vidikṣu ca phalaṃ śṛṇu |
pūrvottaravidigbhāge patate yadi mastakam |
sarvasampatkaraṃ vidyād rājñāṃ rājyaṃ vinirdiśet || 65 ||

bhramitvā dakṣiṇenāpi yadā patati vai śiraḥ |
tadā siddhiñca māsānte vāmakarṇe vipad bhavet || 66 ||

rājñāmagnau tathā hānirgṛhasthānāṃ śubhaṃ bhavet || 67 ||

aiśānyamadhyayoścaiva patate yadi mastakam |
tadā svalpena kālena sarvasiddhirbhaved dhruvā || 68 ||

chinnaṃ śiro nipatitaṃ sahāsyaṃ yadi dṛśyate |
vibhūtiṃ tasya jānīyādrājñāṃ rājyaṃ vinirddiśet || 69 ||

ekavāre bhavet siddhirdvivāre hānirucyate |
gṛhasthānāṃ vijānīyādrājñāntu viparītakam || 70 ||

(balicakṣuṣi aśrudarśanaphalam)

yadāśru dṛśyate netre tadā hāniṃ vinirddiśet |

(dantānāṃ kaṭakaṭāśabdaśravaṇaphalam)

yadā kaṭakaṭāśabdo dantānāṃ śrūyate kvacit |
tadā tu maraṇaṃ vidyāddhāniṃ vā tatra nirddiśet || 71 ||


	<67 |> rājñāmiti | agnau pūrvadakṣiṇakoṇe |

<p. 852> (baliśiraḥsthāpanam)

dadyādrākṣasadigbhāge mantrī baliśiraḥ svayam |

(raktapātrasthāpanam)

taddakṣiṇe raktapātraṃ viparītaṃ na saṃdadet || 72 ||

mahābalīnāṃ vāyavye pradadyāt sādhakottamaḥ |
balīnāmarisaṃjñānāṃ śirāṃsi purato dadet || 73 ||

devasya sammukhaṃ kṛtvā cchinnabhāgān prakalpayet |
tadeva śastaṃ jānīyānmadhyamaṃ viparītakam || 74 ||

kīlakānte nyasecchirṣaṃ yathā kampo na jāyate |

(balimastakopari dīpadānam)

śirṣopari jvaladdīpaṃ pradadyāccandanokṣitam || 75 ||

ghṛtena sārvabhaumaḥ syāttaile siddhiñca vindati |
sūtravarttīn pradadyād vā vastravarttyā pradṛśyate || 76 ||

(varttikāpramāṇam)

aṅguṣṭhasya pramāṇantu dīrghe caiva ṣaḍaṅgulam |
kārpāsasūtrairvā dadyādekaviṃśatisūtrakaiḥ || 77 ||

sugandhagarbhaistat kuryāt karpūrāgurucandanaiḥ || 78 ||

(grāhādīnāṃ śirasi dīpadānaniṣedhaḥ)

grāhāṇāṃ kacchapānāñca godhāyāśca viśeṣataḥ |
matsyānāmapi pakṣiṇāṃ na dīpaṃ dāpayecchire || 79 ||

(dīpasya dīrghakālajvalanaphalam)

śīrṣopari jvaladdīpo yāvatkālaṃ pravarttate |
tāvatkālaṃ vaset svarge tasmād yatnena dāpayet || 80 ||

<p. 853> lomadāhodbhavaṃ gandhaṃ dhyātvā devī prasīdati |
tasmin saṃvarddhayeddevīṃ tasmāt pātraṃ vivarjayet || 81 ||

nirvāṇe mṛtyumāpnoti nīyamāne pradīpake |
na kṣīraśoṇitaṃ dadyānna cājyañca kadācana || 82 ||

śarkarākṣatadūrvādi pradadyāttrirmahāśatam |
saindhavaṃ śṛṅgaverañca kadalyāḥ phalameva ca || 83 ||

pātayenmadhurāṇāñca śṛtamuddiśya sādhakaḥ |
baliḥ pradāne tūddiṣṭo vārāhīsaṃhitākramāt || 84 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇau caturviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 24 ||



[pañcaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(śrīmahātripurasundarī-sahasranāmastotram)

atha śrīmanmahādevyāḥ sahasraṃ nāma kathyate |
kailāsaśikhare ramye nānāratnopaśobhite || 1 ||

kalpapādapamadhyasthe siddhagandharvasevite |
maṇimaṇḍapamadhyasthe nānāpuṣpopaśobhite || 2 ||

taṃ kadācit samāsīnaṃ bhagavantaṃ jagadgurum |
kapālakhaṭvāṅgadharaṃ candrārddhakṛtaśekharam || 3 ||

triśūlaḍamarukaraṃ mahāvṛṣabhavāhanam |
jaṭājūṭadharaṃ devaṃ vāsukikaṇṭhabhūṣaṇam || 4 ||

vibhūtibhūṣaṇaṃ devaṃ nīlakaṇṭhaṃ trilocanam |
dvīpicarmaparīdhānaṃ śuddhasphaṭikasannibham || 5 ||

sahasrādityasaṅkāśaṃ girijārddhāṅgabhūṣaṇam |
praṇamya śirasā nāthaṃ kāraṇaṃ viśvarūpiṇam |
kṛtāñjalipuṭo bhūtvā prāha taṃ śikhivāhanaḥ || 6 ||

kārttikeya uvāca |

deva deva mahādeva sṛṣṭisthityantakāraka |
tvaṃ gatiḥ sarvadevānāṃ tvaṃ gatiḥ sarvadehinām || 7 ||

tvaṃ gatiḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ dīnānāñca tvameva ca |
tvameva jagadādhārastvameva viśvakārakaḥ || 8 ||

<p. 855> tvameva pūjyaḥ sarveṣāṃ tvadanyā nāsti me gatiḥ |
kiṃ guhyaṃ paramaṃ loke kimekaṃ sarvasiddhidam || 9 ||

kimekaṃ paramaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ kiṃ bhogaṃ svargamokṣadam |
vinā tīrthena tapasā vinā vedyairvinā makhaiḥ || 10 ||

vinā layena dhyānena kena siddhimavāpnuyāt |
kasmādutpadyate sṛṣṭiḥ kasmiṃśca pralayo bhavet || 11 ||

kasmāduttīryate deva saṃsārārṇavasaṅkaṭāt |
tadahaṃ śrotumicchāmi kathayasva maheśvara || 12 ||

śrīmahādeva uvāca |

sādhu sādhu tvayā pṛṣṭaṃ tattvaṃ pārvatīnandana |
iti guhyatamaṃ putra kathayiṣyāmyasaṃśayaḥ || 13 ||

sattvaṃ rajastamaścaiva brahmaviṣṇuśivādayaḥ |
ye cānye bahavo bhūtāḥ sarve prakṛtisambhavāḥ || 14 ||

saiva devī parā śaktirmahātripurasundarī |
saiva prasūyate sarvaṃ saiva viśvaṃ prapālyate || 15 ||

saiva saṃharate viśvaṃ jagadetaccarācaram |
ādhāraḥ sarvabhūtānāṃ sā vai rogārttihāriṇī || 16 ||

icchā kriyā tathā jñānā brahmaviṣṇuśivātmikā |
tridhā śaktisvarūpeṇa sṛṣṭisthitivināśinī || 17 ||

sṛjyate brahmarūpeṇa viṣṇurūpeṇa pālyate |
saṃharedrudrarūpeṇa jagatīṃ sacarācarām || 18 ||

<p. 856> yasyā yonau jagat sarvamadyāpi varttate'khilam |
yasyāṃ pralīyate cāntye yasyāñca jāyate punaḥ || 19 ||

yāṃ samārādhya trailokye saṃprāptaṃ padamuttamam |
tasyā nāmasahasraṃ te kathayāmi śṛṇuṣva tat || 20 ||

      oṃ asyā śrīmahātripurasundaryāḥ sahasranāmastotrasya dakṣiṇā(-)mūrttirbhagavān 
vāmadeva ṛṣirgāyattrīcchandaḥ prakaṭaguhyatarasaṃpra(-)
dāyakulakaulikagarbharahasyātirahasyaparāpararahasyācintyaprabhāvavatī śrīmahātripurasundarī 
devatā ākāśabījaṃ māyā śaktiḥ kāmabījaṃ kīlakaṃ buddhiśaktirudānabījaṃ suṣumṇā 
nāḍī sarasvatīśaktisiddhyarthakāmamokṣārthe viniyogaḥ || 21 ||

hrī(/) kalyāṇī kamalā kālī karālī kāmarūpiṇī |
kāmākhyā kāmadā kāmyā kamalā kāmacāriṇī || 22 ||

kālarātrirmahārātriḥ kaulinī kaulyarūpiṇī |
kumārī karuṇā kīrttiḥ kalmāṣanāśinīti ca || 23 ||

kātyāyanī kalādhārā kaumudī kamalāpriyā |
kīrttidā muktidā medhā nītijñā nītivatsalā || 24 ||

māheśvarī mahāmāyā mahātejā maheśvarī |
mahālolā mahājihvā mahādaṃṣṭrā mahābhujā || 25 ||

mahāmohāndhakāraghnī mahāmokṣaprakāśinī |
mahādāridryaśamanī mahāśatruvināśinī || 26 ||

mahāśaktirmahāśūramahiṣāsuramarddinī |
mahāmāyā mahāvīryā mahāpātakanāśinī || 27 ||

<p. 857> mahākāmā mahākālyā mahāpātakahāriṇī |
mahāmantrā mantramayī maṇipūrakavāsinī || 28 ||

mānasī mānadā mānyā manaścakṣuragocarā |
gaṇanītā ca gāyattrī gaṇagandharvasevitā || 29 ||

girijā giriśā sādhvī giristhā girisambhavā |
caṇḍeśvarī caṇḍarūpā pracaṇḍā caṇḍamālinī || 30 ||

carccitā carccitakalā caṇḍikā caṇḍarūpiṇī |
yajñeśvarī yajñarūpā japayajñaparāyaṇā || 31 ||

yajñamātā yajñabhokttrī yajñeśī yajñasambhavā |
siddhā yajñapriyā siddhiryajñāṅgī yajñabandhikā || 32 ||

yajñapriyā yajñarūpā yājñī yajñakṛtālayā |
jālandharā jaganmātā jātavedā jagatpriyā || 33 ||

jitendriyā jitakrodhā jananī janmadāyinī |
gaṅgā godāvarī gaurī gomatī ca śatadrukā || 34 ||

ghargharā vedagarbhā ca devikākarasambhavā |
sindhurmandākinī viprā yamunā ca sarasvatī || 35 ||

candrabhāgā vipāśā ca gaṇḍakī vindhyavāsinī |
narmadā kadrukāverī vetravatī ca kauṣikī || 36 ||

mahendratanayā caiva ahalyā campakāvatī |
ayodhyā mathurā māyā kāśī kāñcī avantikā || 37 ||

dvārāvatī ca śikhinī mahākilviṣanāśinī |
padminī padmahastā ca padmakiñjalkavāsinī || 38 ||

<p. 858> padmavaktrā ca padmākṣī padmasthā padmasambhavā |
drī(/)kārī kuṇḍalī rātrirhṛtpadmasthā sulocanā || 39 ||

ai(/)kārī bhūṣaṇā lakṣmīḥ klī(/)kārī kleśanāśinī |
haripriyā harermātā harinetrakṛtāśrayā || 40 ||

harivaktrodbhavā śāntā harervakṣaḥsthalasthitā |
vaiṣṇavī viṣṇurūpā ca viṣṇumāyāsvarūpiṇī || 41 ||

viṣṇumāyā viśālākṣī viśālanayanojjvalā |
viśveśvarī ca viśvātmā viśveśī viśvarūpiṇī || 42 ||

viśvātmikā viśvavidyā viśvapāśavidāriṇī |
viśvāsakāriṇī viśvā vidhiśaktirvicakṣaṇā || 43 ||

śiveśvarī śivārādhyā śivanāthā śivapriyā |
śivamātā śivākhyā ca śivadā śivarūpiṇī || 44 || 

bhaveśvarī bhavārādhyā bhavānī bhavanāyikā |
bhavamātā bhāvagamyā bhavakaṇṭakanāśinī || 45 ||

bhavapriyā bhavānandā bhavakaṇṭakahāriṇī |
gatirvareṇyā sāvitrī brahmāṇī brahmarūpiṇī || 46 ||

brahmeśī brahmadā brāhmī brahmāṇī brahmavādinī |
durgasthā durgarūpā ca durgā durgārttināśinī || 47 ||

sugamā durgamā dātā dayā gaurī durāpahā |
duritaghnī duradhyakṣā dūraduṣkṛtanāśinī || 48 ||

pañcamyā pañcamī pūrṇā pūrṇapīṭhanivāsinī |
sattvasthā sattvarūpā ca kalpasthā kalparūpiṇī || 49 ||

<p. 859> nānāratnavicitrāṅgī nānābharaṇabhūṣitā |
viśvāmbikā viśvamātā viśvapāśavidāriṇī || 50 ||

viśālakāriṇī viśvā viśvaśaktirvilakṣaṇā |
javākusumasaṅkāśā dāḍimīkusumāruṇā || 51 ||

caturaṅgī caturvāhā caturdvāravyahāsinī |
sarveśī sarvadā sarvā sarvajñā sarvadāyinī || 52 ||

viśveśvarī ca sarvādyā sarvāṇī sarvamaṅgalā |
nalinī nandinī nandā ānandānandavarttinī || 53 ||

vyāpinī sarvabhūteṣu bhavabhāravināśinī |
kulīnā kulamadhyasthā kuladharmopadeśinī || 54 ||

sarvaśṛṅgāraveśāḍhyā pāśāṅkuśakarodyatā |
sūryā sūryasahasrābhā candrakoṭinibhānanā || 55 ||

gaṇeśakoṭilāvaṇyā siṃhakoṭivimarddinī |
dāvāgnikoṭijvalinī kadrukoṭisvarūpiṇī || 56 ||

samudrakoṭigambhīrā vāyukoṭimahābalā |
ākāśakoṭivistārā yamakoṭibhayaṅkarā || 57 ||

merukoṭisamucchrāyā garutkoṭisamṛddhidā |
niṣkalaṅkā nirādhārā nirguṇā guṇavarjitā || 58 ||

viśiṣṭā viśvajananī viśvākhyā viśvavarddhinī |
citrā vicitrā citrāṅgī hetugarbhā raṇeśvarī || 59 ||

icchāśaktirjñānaśaktiḥ kriyāśaktiḥ śucismitā |
śrutiḥ śrutimayī satyā śrutirūpā śrutipriyā || 60 ||

<p. 860> śrutiprājñā mahātattvā pañcatattvoparisthitā |
pārvatī himavatputrī pārasthā pārarūpiṇī || 61 ||

jayantī bhadrakālī ca ahalyā kulanāyikā |
bhūtadhātrī ca bhūteśī bhūtasthā bhūtabhāvinī || 62 ||

mahākulamayī śaktirmahāvibhavavarddhinī |
haṃsākhyā haṃsarūpā ca haṃsasthā haṃsarūpiṇī || 63 ||

somasūryāgnimadhyasthā mūlādhāranivāsinī |
dvādaśārasarojasthā sūryamaṇḍalavāsinī || 64 ||

dvipatradalamadhyasthā lalāṭatalavāsinī |
ḍākinī rākiṇī caiva lākinī kākinī tathā || 65 ||

śākinī hākinī caiva ṣaṭcakravinivāsinī |
sṛṣṭisthitivināśā ca sṛṣṭisthityantakāriṇī || 66 ||

śrīkaṇṭhapriyā śrīkaṇṭhā nādākhyā bindumālinī |
catuḥṣaṣṭikalādhārā dehadaṇḍakalāśrayā || 67 ||

māyā kālī dyutirmedhā svadhā puṣṭirmahādhṛtiḥ |
hiṅgulā maṅgalā sītā suṣumṇāmadhyagāminī || 68 ||

parā ghorā karālākṣī vijayā jayaśālinī |
hṛtpadmanilayā caiva bhīmā bhairavanādinī || 69 ||

menakāgarbhasambhūtā taptakāñcanasannibhā |
antakūṭabījasthā ca trikūṭavanavāsinī || 70 ||

varṇākṣī varṇarahitā pañcāśadvarṇarūpiṇī |
vidyādharī lokadhātrī amarā apsaraḥpriyā || 71 ||

<p. 861> dākṣā prajāvatī dhanyā dhanadhānyasamṛddhidā |
īśānī bhuvaneśānī bhuvanā bhuvaneśvarī || 72 ||

anantā'nantamahimā jagatsārā jagadbhavā |
acintyaśakticittātmā cintā cittasvarūpiṇī || 73 ||

jñānagamyā jñānamūrttirjñāninī jñānaśālinī |
asitā ghorarūpā ca sudhādhārā sudhāvahā || 74 ||

bhāskarā bhāsvatī bhītirbhāsvaddhṛṣṭānusāpinī |
anudyamā kṣamānandā durlabhā bhavanātmikā || 75 ||

viśvavandyā viśvavīrā viśvaghnī viśvasaṃsthitā |
śīlasthā śīlarūpā ca śīlā śīlapradāyinī || 76 ||

bodhinī bodhakuśalā bodhanā bodhinī sadā |
vidyotinī vicitrātmā vidyutpāṭalasannibhā || 77 ||

viśvayonirmahāyoniḥ karmayoniḥ priyaṃvadā |
rohiṇī rogaśamanī mahārogāpahāriṇī || 77 ||

vasudā rudrarūpā ca raudrī raudrārttināśinī |
prajā dākṣāyaṇī dakṣā dakṣayajñavināśinī || 78 ||

yaśaśvinī yaśaḥpūrṇā yaśodāgarbhasambhavā |
devakī devamātā ca rādhikā kṛṣṇavallabhā || 79 ||

arundhatī śacīndrāṇī gāndhārī gandhamālinī |
dhyānātītā dhyānagamyā dhyānākhyā dhyānadhāriṇī || 80 ||

lambodarī ca lamboṣṭhī jāmbavatyā jalodarī |
mahodarī muktakeśī muktikāmārthasiddhidā || 81 ||

<p. 862> tapasvinī rāgahanā guhyaratnanirañjanā |
aśarīrā śarīrasthā saṃsārārṇavatāriṇī || 82 ||

amṛtā niṣkalā bhadrā sakalā kṛṣṇapiṅgalā |
cakreśvarī cakrahastā paracakravidāriṇī || 83 ||

padmarāgapratīkāśā nirmalākāśasannibhā |
rasajñā rasamadhyasthā gandhasthā gandharūpiṇī || 84 ||

paraṃbrahmasvarūpā ca paraṃbrahmasvarūpiṇī |
śabdabrahmasvarūpā ca śabdākhyā śabdavarjitā || 85 ||

ṛddhivṛddhiḥ parā siddhiḥ satkīrttirdīptasaṃsthitā |
āpūjyā śāmbhavī śaktiḥ sundarāṅgī tattvarūpiṇī || 86 ||

śāśvatī bhūtamātā ca mahābhūtādhipapriyā |
śrutiprājñā dharmasiddhirdakṣakanyā'parājitā || 87 ||

kāmasandīpanī kāmā sadā kāmakutūhalā |
bhogāpacārakuśalā amarā kamalānanā || 88 ||

bhaktānukampinī maitrī śaraṇāgatavatsalā |
kṣobhaṇī mohanī caiva stambhanī jṛmbhaṇī tathā || 89 ||

rathinī dhvajinī senā sarvamantramayī trayī |
jñānamudrā mahāmudrā jaganmudrā mahotsavā || 90 ||

sahasrabhujā cicchaktiḥ sahasrākṣī sanātanī |
siddhalakṣmīrmahālakṣmī rājalakṣmīḥ sulakṣaṇā || 91 ||

yajñasārā tapaḥsārā dharmasārā janeśvarī |
viśvodarī viśvapūjyā viśvākhyā viśvatomukhī || 92 ||

<p. 863> viśvāsyā śravaṇā ghrāṇā viśvaprāṇā padātmikā |
taruṇādityasaṅkāśā kiraṇānekasaṅkulā || 93 ||

jaṭājūṭadharā mukhyā śuṣkamāṃsātibhīṣaṇā |
dvīpicarmaparīdhānā cīravalkaladhāriṇī || 94 ||

triśūlaḍamarukarā naramālāvibhūṣaṇā |
atyugrarūpiṇī cogrā kalpāntadahanopamā || 95 ||

trailokyadhāriṇī sādhyā siddhiḥ sādhakavatsalā |
savavidyāmayī sārā vairivargavināśinī || 96 ||

subhagā sumukhī ramyā mukharā somabhūṣaṇā |
śuddhasphaṭikasaṅkāśā mahāvṛṣabhavāhinī || 97 ||

mahiṣī mahiṣārūḍhā mahiṣāsuramarddinī |
daminī dāminī dāntā dayā dogdhrī durāpagā || 98 ||

agnijihvā mahāghorā ghoraghoratarānanā |
nārāyaṇī nārasiṃhī nṛsiṃhahṛdayasthitā || 99 ||

yogeśvarī yogarūpā yogamātā ca yoginī |
khecarī bhūcarī khelā nirvāṇapadasaṃśrayā || 100 ||

nāginī nāgakanyā ca suvanā nāganāyikā |
viṣajvālāvatī tīkṣṇā phaṇāśatavibhūṣaṇā || 101 ||

bhīmavaktrā mahāvaktrā vaktrāṇāṃ koṭidhāriṇī |
mahāvaktrā ca dharmākhyā dharmādisukhadāyinī || 102 ||

kṛṣṇamūrddhā mahāmūrddhā ghoramūrddhā varānanā |
sarvendriyā sarvasaṃsthā sarvendriyamanomayī || 103 ||

<p. 864> sarvasaṃgrāmajayadā sarvapraharaṇodyatā |
sarvapīḍopaśamanī sarvābhīṣṭapradāyinī || 104 ||

sarvaiśvaryasamutpattiḥ sarvagrahavināśinī |
bhītighnī bhaktigamyā ca bhaktāpamṛtyunāśinī || 105 ||

mātaṅgī mattamātaṅgī mataṅgakulamaṇḍitā |
gaṇḍamaṇḍitasaṅkāśā guñjāhāravibhūṣaṇā || 103 ||

saṅgītaraṅgaracanā vīṇāvādyakutūhalā |
amṛtodadhimadhyasthā prabālarasanojjvalā || 107 ||

maṇimaṇḍapamadhyasthā ratnasiṃhāsanasthitā |
paramānandamuditā īṣatprahasitānanā || 108 ||

kumudā lalitā lolā lākṣālalitalocanā |
digvastrā devadūtī ca devadevādhidevatā || 109 ||

siṃhoparisamārūḍhā mahācalanivāsinī |
aṭṭaṭṭahāsinī ghorā ghoradantavināśinī || 110 ||

atyugrā raktavarṇā ca nāgakeyūramaṇḍitā |
muktāhāralatopetatuṅgapīnapayodharā || 111 ||

raktotpaladalākāramadamūrcchitalocanā |
samastadevatāmūrttirasurakṣayakāriṇī || 112 ||

khaḍginī śūlahastā ca cakriṇī cākṣamālinī |
śaṅkhinī cāpinī vāṇī vajriṇī raktadantikā || 113 ||

ānandodadhimadhyasthā kaṭisūtrairalaṅkṛtā |
nānābharaṇadīptāṅgī nānāmaṇivibhūṣitā || 114 ||

<p. 865> jagadānandasaṃbhūticintāmaṇiguṇākarā |
trailokyanamitā pūjyā cinmayānandarūpiṇī || 115 ||

trailokyavarddhinī devī duḥkhaduḥsvapnanāśinī |
ghorāgnidāhaśamanī bījadaivādimālinī || 116 ||

mahāparādharāśighnī mahācaurabhayāpahā |
rāgādirogarahitā jarāmaraṇavarjitā || 117 ||

candramaṇḍalasaṅkāśā pīyuṣārṇavasambhavā |
sarvadevaiḥ stutā devī sarvasiddhairnamaskṛtā || 118 ||

acintyaśaktirūpā ca maṇimantramahauṣadhī |
svasti svastimatī bālā malayācalavāsinī || 119 ||

dhātrī vidhātrī sambhāvā ratijñā ratidāyinī |
rudrāṇī rudrarūpā ca raudrī raudrārttināśinī || 120 ||

sarvajñā caiva dharmajñā rasajñā dīnavatsalā |
anāhatā trinayanā nirbhavā nirvṛtiḥ parā || 121 ||

parā ghorā karālākṣī sumatiḥ priyabhāṣiṇī |
mahāmbikā mantramasyā mantramātā suputriṇī || 122 ||

śuddhānandā mahābhadrā nirgatā nirguṇātmikā |
dhariṇī dhāriṇī pṛthvī dharā dhātrī vasundharā || 123 ||

merumandaramadhyasthā sthirā śaṅkaravallabhā |
śrīmatī śrīmatāṃ śreṣṭhā śrīkarī śrīvibhāvinī || 124 ||

śrīdātrī śrīvidhātrī ca śrīmatī śrīmatāṃ gatiḥ |
umāśā śārṅgiṇī kṛṣṇā kuṭilā kuṭilālakā || 125 ||

<p. 866> trilocanā trilokasthā puṇyasthā puṇyakīrttidā |
amṛtā satyasaṅkalpā pretyā sā prasthitodanī || 126 ||

pareśī paramārādhā parā vidyā parāparā |
sundarāṅgī suvarṇābhā surāsuranamaskṛtā || 127 ||

rudrāṇī puṣṭidā devī mānadā mānasapriyā |
kṛṣṇāṅgavāhinī caiva kṛṣṇā kṛṣṇamahodarā || 128 ||

śāmbhavī śambhurūpā ca śambhusthā śambhusambhavā |
bimbo(śvo)darī yogamudrā yogarūpā ca yoginī || 129 ||

yogamudrā yoganidrā yoginīkoṭisevitā |
kuṭilā nandikanyā ca śṛṅgārapīṭhavāsinī || 130 ||

kṣemaṅkarī sarvarūpā divyarūpā divīśvarā |
dhūmravaktrā dhūmrakeśī dhūmravaktāvadhūsarā || 131 ||

pinākī rudravetālī mahāvetālarūpiṇī |
bhaginī bhāginī dakṣā viṣṇuvidyā anāśritā || 132 ||

mantharā jaṭharā tīvrā agnijihvā bhayāpahā |
paśughnī paśurūpā ca paśuhā paśuvāhinī || 133 ||

pitā santoṣitā dhātā paśupāsavināśinī |
candraprabhā candrarekhā candrakāntivibhūṣaṇā || 134 ||

kuṅkumāṅkitasarvāṅgī sudhābudbudalocanā |
niṣṭhurā krūrahṛdayā akrūrāmṛtabhāṣiṇī || 135 ||

ākāśaliṅgasambhūtā bhuvanadhyānavāhinī |
nirupākṣī sahasrākṣī śatākṣī bahulocanā || 136 ||

<p. 867> daṇḍāvatāriṇī tārā taruṇī tārarūpiṇī |
sudhādhārā ca dharmajñā dharmaśāstropadeśinī || 137 ||

bhaveśvarī bhavārādhyā bhaginī bhaganāyikā |
bhagavidyā bhagaklinnā bhagayonirbhagapradā || 138 ||

bhageśī bhagarūpā ca bhagaguhyā bhagāvahā |
bhagodarā bhagānandā bhagādyā bhagamālinī || 139 ||

mālinī mādhavī sādhvī madhurūpā mahotkaṭā |
candrikā candrimā jyotsnā viśvacakṣustamo'pahā || 140 ||

suprasannā mahādūtī yamadūtī bhayaṅkarī |
unmādinī mahārūpā divyarūpā surārcitā || 141 ||

trailokyaphalinī nityā nityānandamadoddhatā |
madirānandakaivalyā madirākṣī madālasā || 142 ||

siddheśvarī siddhavidyā siddhādyā siddhavanditā |
siddhārcitā siddhamātā siddhiḥ sarvārthasiddhidā || 143 ||

māyāmayī guṇātītā paraṃ jyotiḥsvarūpiṇī |
pareśī paragā pārā parā siddhiḥ parā gatiḥ || 144 ||

vimalā mohinī ādyā madhupānaparāyaṇā |
vedavedāṅgajananī sarvaśāstraviśāradā || 145 ||

sarvadevamayī nityā sarvaśāstramayī tathā |
sarvayajñamayī devī sarvadharmamayīśvarī || 146 ||

sarvayajñā mahāyajñā sarvamantrādhikāriṇī |
sarvasampattyadhiṣṭhātrī sarvavidyāvalī tathā || 147 ||

<p. 868> sarvasaṃkṣobhaṇī devī sarvamaṅgalakāriṇī |
trailokyākarṣiṇī devī sarvāhlādanakāriṇī || 148 ||

sarvasammohinī devī sarvastambhanakāriṇī |
trailokyajṛmbhiṇī devī tathā sarvavaśaṅkarī || 149 ||

trailokyarañjinī devī sarvānmādasvarūpiṇī |
sarvārthasādhanī devī sarvaduḥkhavimocanī || 150 ||

sarvamṛtyupraśamanī sarvaduḥkhavināśinī |
sarvāṅgasundarī mātā sarvasaubhāgyadāyinī || 151 ||

sarvajñā sarvaśaktiśca sarvaiśvaryaphalapradā |
sarvajñānamayī devī sarvavyādhivināśinī || 152 ||

sarvādhārasvarūpā ca sarvapāpavināśinī |
sarvānandamayī devī sarvarakṣāsvarūpiṇī || 153 ||

sarvalakṣmīmayī nityā sarvepsitaphalapradā |
sarvaduṣṭapraśamanī paramānandadāyinī || 154 ||

trailokyanilayā tristhā trimātā tritalasthitā |
trividyā ca trayī māyā trailokyā tripurākṣarā || 156 ||

triyādavasthā trividhā tripurā tripurāsthitā |
tridhāmnī tridaśādhyakṣā trighnī tripuravāsinī || 156 ||

trivargā trigudī stristhā trimūrttistripureśvarī |
trividhā tridiveśānī tribhistripurasundarī || 157 ||

tripurā śrīstrijananī tribhuk tripurabhairavī | oṃ || 158 ||

<p. 869> iti śrīpurasundaryā mantraṃ nāmasahasrakam |
guhyād guhyataraṃ putra tava prītyā prakīrttitam || 159 ||

gopanīyaṃ prayatnena paṭhanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ |
nātaḥ parataraṃ stotraṃ nātaḥ parataraṃ japaḥ || 160 ||

nātaḥ parataraṃ puṇyaṃ nātaḥ paratarā gatiḥ |
stotraṃ nāmasahasrākhyaṃ mama vaktravinirgatam || 161 ||

yaḥ paṭhet parayā bhaktyā śṛṇuyād vā samāhitaḥ |
mokṣārthī labhate mokṣaṃ svargārthī svargamāpnuyāt || 162 ||

kāmānavāpnuyāt kāmī dhanārthī labhate dhanam |
vidyārthī labhate vidyāṃ yaśo'rthī labhate yaśaḥ || 163 ||

kanyārthī labhate kanyāṃ sutārthī labhate sutam |
gurviṇī janayet putraṃ kanyā vindati satpatim || 164 ||

mūrkho'pi labhate śāstraṃ cauro'bhilabhate gatim || 165 ||

saṃkrāntyāñca caturddaśyāmaṣṭamyāñca viśeṣataḥ |
paurṇamāsyāmamāvāsyāṃ navamyāṃ bhaumabhārgave || 166 ||

paṭhed vā pāṭhayed vāpi śṛṇuyād vā samāhitaḥ |
gopanīyaṃ prayatnena paṭhanīyaṃ prayatnataḥ || 167 ||

sa muktaḥ sarvapāpebhyaḥ kāmeśvarasamo bhavet |
lakṣmīvān putravāñ śrīmān vallabhaḥ sarvayoṣitām || 168 ||

tasya vaśyaṃ bhavedāśu trailokyaṃ sacarācaram |
rudraṃ dṛṣṭvā yathā devā viṣṇuṃ dṛṣṭvā yathāmarāḥ || 169 ||

pannagā garuḍaṃ dṛṣṭvā siṃhaṃ dṛṣṭvā yathā gajāḥ |
maṇḍūkā bhoginaṃ dṛṣṭā mārjjāraṃ mūṣikā yathā || 170 ||

<p. 870> śatravastu pālayante tasya vaktrāvalokanāt |
agnicaurabhayaṃ tasya darśanānnaiva sambhavet || 171 ||

pātakā bahavaḥ santi merumandarasannibhāḥ |
bhasmasāt kurute śrīghraṃ tṛṇaṃ vahnihutaṃ yathā || 172 ||

ekadhā paṭhanādeva sarvapāpakṣayo bhavet |
naśyanti bahavo rogā daśadhāvarttanena ca || 173 ||

śatadhāvarttanādeva vācāṃ siddhimavāpnuyāt |
sahasraṃ paṭhate yastu khecaro jāyate naraḥ || 174 ||

sahasradaśakaṃ yastu paṭhed vai bhaktimān naraḥ |
sā tasya jagatāṃ dhātrī pratyakṣā bhavati dhruvam || 175 ||

lakṣavārantu saṃpūrṇaṃ stotrarājaṃ paṭhet sudhīḥ |
bhavapāśād vinirmukto mama tulyo na saṃśayaḥ || 176 ||

sarvatīrtheṣu yat puṇyaṃ sarvayajñeṣu yat phalam |
sarvavedeṣu yaddharmaḥ sarvadāneṣu yat phalam || 177 ||

sarvaśāstreṣu prokteṣu yat phalaṃ parikīrttitam |
tat phalaṃ koṭiguṇitaṃ sakṛt pāṭhāllabhennaraḥ || 178 ||

śrutvā mahātibalavān putravān dhanasampadaḥ || 179 ||

dehānte paramaṃ sthānaṃ yat surairapi durlabham |
sa yāsyati na sandehaḥ stavarājasya kīrttanāt || 180 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇau pañcaviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 25 ||



[ṣaḍviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ]

(mahāyantrasaṃskārakathanam)

athocyate mahāyantrasaṃskāraḥ sarvabhūtidaḥ || 1 ||

śubhe'hni snānamācarya śubhe lagne śubhe kṣaṇe |
kṛtanityakriyo mantrī prāṅmukho vāpyudaṅmukhaḥ || 2 ||

bhūtaśuddhyādikaṃ kṛtvā kalpoktanyāsamācaret |
tataḥ saṅkalpya śuddhātmā śivamantraviśodhitam || 3 ||

pañcagavyaṃ samānīya tatra yantraṃ samāhitaḥ |
suvarṇādimaṇau kḷptaṃ kṣipet praṇavamuccaran || 4 ||

taduddhṛtya suvarṇādau pātraṃ saṃsthāpya mantravit |
pañcāmṛtena tīrthena jalena śītalena ca || 5 ||

sahasraśīrṣamantreṇa mūlamantrapuraḥsaram |
susnāpya ca viśuddhena jalamuttolya taijase || 6 ||

siṃhāsanādāvāropya kuṅkumādyairvilepayet |
pīṭhapūjāṃ tataḥ kuryāt svakalpoktavidhānataḥ || 7 ||

kuśaiḥ spṛśan mantrarājaṃ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ japet || 8 ||

(yantra-gāyattrī)

praṇavaṃ mantrarājāya vidmahe padamuddharet |
mahāmantrāya dhīrūpaṃ likhettato mahīti ca || 9 ||

<p. 872> tanno yantraḥ pracorūpaṃ dayādeṣā prakīrttitā |
imāṃ yantrasya gāyattrīṃ japtvā devatvamālabhet || 10 ||

(iṣṭadevatāpūjanopadeśaḥ)

yatheṣṭadevatāṃ dhyātvā mudrayāvāhayet kramāt |
jīvanyāsaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā pūjayediṣṭadevatām || 11 ||

upacāraiḥ ṣoḍaśabhirnānāvibhavavistaraiḥ |
nṛtyagītaiśca vādyaiśca pañcaghoṣapuraḥsaram || 12 ||

tato japediṣṭamantramaṣṭottarasahasrakam |
tataḥ kalpoktamāsādyahaviṣā saṃskṛte'nale || 13 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā guruṃ vibhavapūrvakam |
toṣayet svarṇaratnādyaiḥ pradadyāddakṣiṇāmapi || 14 ||

(upacāramudropadeśaḥ)

ṣoḍaśopacāramudrāyā ucyante lakṣaṇānyatha |
prasārayedubhau hastau hṛddeśe viniyojayet || 15 ||

aṅgulyo vistṛtāḥ kāryā madhye'ṅguṣṭhau tu vinyaset |
devatāsanavinyāsapañcamudrāṃ pradarśayet || 16 ||

īṣannamrāṅgulirjñeyā saṃvṛtāṅguṣṭhakandaram |
namre kaniṣṭhatarjanyau karayoragrasaṅgate || 17 ||

madhyamānāmikā kuryādiyamāsanamudrikā |
iṣannamrāṅgulirdakṣā saṃveṣṭyāṅguṣṭhakaṃ param || 18 ||

svāgate svastikā mudrā madhyamūlagatāṅgulī |
upacāre svāgate tu prayoktavyā vipaścitā || 19 ||

<p. 873> tau ca prasāritau hastau pādyamudrā prakīrttitā |
saṃyuktānāmikāṅguṣṭhau tisro'nyāḥ saṃprasāritāḥ || 20 ||

madhuparkasya sā mudrā gaditā tantravedibhiḥ |
muṣṭiyuktaṃ tathā netramaṅguṣṭhāgramadhomukham || 21 ||

madhyamāṅguṣṭhakau lagnau tisro'nyāḥ suprasāritāḥ |
vastramudrā samākhyātā vastramudrāpravarddhinī || 22 ||

kaniṣṭhāṅgulikau lagnau trisro madhyāḥ prasāritāḥ |
yajñopavītamudreyaṃ kathitā mantrapāragaiḥ || 23 ||

madhuparkaṃ samuttānā mudrā lagnāṅgulī matā |
yuktā'nāmikayā'ṅguṣṭhā gandhamudreti kīrttitā || 24 ||

utthitā'dhomukhī madhyā baddhāṅguṣṭhā yadītarā |
puṣpamudrā samākhyātā puṣpadānavivarddhinī || 25 ||

aṅguṣṭhaṃ tarjjanīlagnaṃ tisraḥ saṅkucitāḥ parāḥ |
mudrā dhūpapradāne syāddevānāṃ tuṣṭikāriṇī || 26 ||

uttānā pauṣpikī mudrā dīpamudreti kathyate |
pañcāṅgulyagrasaṃlagnaprotthitā'dhomukhī yadi || 27 ||

tridhā nibaddhā mudreyaṃ naivedyasya prakīrttitā |
dvau karau pṛṣṭhasaṃlagnau bhrāmayed grathitāṅgulī |
sphoṭiketi samākhyātā praṇāme tāṃ pradarśayet || 28 ||

<p. 874> (gandhādimudrāṇāṃ prakārabhedaḥ)

athavā darśayenmudrā imā gandhādibhiḥ kramāt |
kaniṣṭhā'ṅguṣṭhasaṃsaktā gandhamudrā prakīrtitā || 29 ||

aṅguṣṭhasya ca pṛṣṭhasya yuktā dhūpasya tarjjanī |
dīpasya madhyamānāmā naivedyasya prakīrttitā || 30 ||

itarāṅgulisaṃyogāt pañca mudrāḥ prakīrttitāḥ || 31 ||

gandhādiṣvapi datteṣu mudrāścaitāḥ pradarśayet |

(mudrāmāhātmyam)

mudrayā yat kṛtaṃ karma tadanantaphalaṃ bhavet || 32 ||

(devatāyāḥ pratiṣṭhāvidhiḥ)

atha vakṣye devatāyāḥ pratiṣṭhānavidhikramam |
puṇyakṣetre puṇyakāle śalyādirahite sthale || 33 ||

mantrakalpāvasāne ca pūrvedyuradhivāsayet |
sāyaṃ saṅkalpya vidhivad ghaṭasthāpanapūrvakam || 34 ||

gaṇeśādīn samabhyarcya dikpālān paripūjayet |
yathāśaktyupacārādyaiḥ pūjayenmūladaivatam || 35 ||

sugandhitailagandhādyairdivyāntamadhivāsayet |
candreṇetyādimantreṇa jayaghoṣapuraḥsaram || 36 ||

ityadhivāsanaṃ kṛtvā saṃyato vijitendriyaḥ |
prātarnirvarttya nityantu kḷptayāgasthale viśet || 37 ||

patākādhvajasaṃkīrṇe divyamaṇḍapamaṇḍite |
vitānacāmaracchatrapuṣpamālāvibhūṣite || 38 ||

<p. 775> maṅgalāṅkurapātrādyaiḥ sakalaiḥ paripūrite |
maṇḍalaṃ sarvatobhadraṃ vedyā upari saṃlikhet || 39 ||

prāṅmukho vāgyato bhūtvā saṅkalpyābhīṣṭasiddhaye ||
pañcaśuddhiṃ samācarya kumbhamakṣatasaṃyutam || 40 ||

saṃsthāpya maṇḍale tatra yajetādhāraśaktikām |
pīṭhamanvantimāstatra sthāpayet sakalaṃ budhaḥ || 41 ||

dīkṣā kramoktavidhinā'bhiṣekakalasaṃ tathā |
pañcagavyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā śivamantraviśodhitam || 42 ||

tena susnāpayenmantrī pratimāṃ praṇavaṃ japan |
pañcāmṛtena haviṣā dadhnā ca payasā kramāt || 43 ||

tata udvarttanaṃ kṛtvā jalena snāpayedapi |
vāsasā jalamuttolya dukūle paridhāpayet || 44 ||

nayet sthāpitakumbhasya samīpe devatāṃ budhaḥ |
tato dhyātvā yathoktāṃ tāṃ mudrayāvāhayet kramāt || 45 ||

lelihāmudrayā hastaṃ vinyasya devatāhṛdi |
prāṇapratiṣṭhāmantrantu daśadhā prajapettataḥ |
tattaddaivatagāyattrīṃ śatamaṣṭottarāmapi || 46 ||

tataḥ kalpoktavidhinā parivārasamanvitām |
pūjayeddevatāṃ paścāt svavāme sthānamaṇḍape || 47 ||

aṣṭapatrasamāyukte pīṭhopari nidhāya tām |
sugandhidivyatailena dadyādabhyaṅgameva hi || 48 ||

<p. 876> mūlena pāvamānena sahasraśīrṣayā budhaḥ |
snāpayed bhaktibhāvena abhiṣekaghaṭāmṛtaiḥ || 49 ||

karpūrāgurukastūrī prasūnacandanodakaiḥ |
nānātīrthodakenāpi svarṇaratnānvitairjalaiḥ |
sarvauṣadhijalairgandhajalairmūlena secayet || 50 ||

tataḥ śuddhadukūlena jalamuttolya sādhakaḥ || 51 ||

paridhāpya dukūle dve svarṇanirmitadolayā |
maṇḍale tāṃ samānīya nṛtyairgītairjayasvanaiḥ || 52 ||

ṣoḍaśairupacāraistu pūjayet kalpamānataḥ |

(homopadeśaḥ)

kuṇḍe vā sthaṇḍile mantrī haviṣā saṃskṛte'nale || 53 ||

aṣṭottaraśataṃ hutvā śrapayitvā caruṃ tataḥ |
yathāvidhividhānena srucā homaṃ samācaret || 54 ||

grāsapramāṇaṃ carukaṃ mūle nāhutimantravit |
ghṛtasruvaṃ tatra dattvā juhuyādagnisaṃmukhe || 55 ||

pañcaviṃśativāraṃ hi devatoddiśya yatnataḥ |
caruṇā dikpatibhyaśca dadyāt pūrvādito balim || 56 ||

tata āvṛtidevebhyo ghṛtenāhutimācaret |
athavā caruṇā tadvattato devasamīpage || 57 ||

gatvā puṣpāñjalīn pañca praddyācchatracāmare |
aṣṭottaraśataṃ mantraṃ japtvā mūlaṃ samāhitaḥ || 58 ||

abhiṣiñcettato devaṃ pūjākumbhasthapallavaiḥ |
mātṛkā mūlamantrañca japan jayajayasvanaiḥ || 59 ||

<p. 877> gatvā homasamīpantu dadyāt pūrṇāhutiṃ tataḥ |
dakṣiṇāṃ gurave dadyāt svarṇaṃ karṣapramāṇataḥ || 60 ||

arddhārddhāṃśaṃ caturthāṃśaṃ yathāvibhavapūvakam |
tataḥ santoṣayed vidvān gṛhītvā āśiṣo dvijān || 61 ||

iti devapratiṣṭhānamuktaṃ sarvasamṛddhidam |

(pratiṣṭhāphalakīrttanam)

yaḥ karoti pratiṣṭhānaṃ daivatasya mahātmanaḥ || 62 ||

vaseddvitrisahasrāṇi svarge devapramāṇataḥ |
tato lakṣasahasrāṇi brahmaloke mahīyate || 63 ||

athavā koṭikalpāntaṃ mohayedacyute pade || 64 ||

(maṭhotsargavidhiḥ)

atha vakṣye gṛhotsargaṃ vāstuyāgapuraḥsaram |
śaratkāle mahāpuṇye puṇyakṣetre śubhe'hani || 65 ||

durgāyai mandiraṃ dattvā sva(-)sva(-)mantrānusārataḥ |
pūrvoktaṃ sarvamācarya vṛddhiśrāddhapuraḥsaram || 66 ||

tataḥ saṅkalpya vidhivanmandire supariṣkṛte |
patākādhvajasaṅkīrṇe tuṅgatoraṇaśobhite || 67 ||

chatracāmaramālādyairvitānairupaśobhite |
vilikhya sarvatobhadraṃ sthāpayed kalasantathā || 68 ||

pūjayediṣṭadevantu ṣoḍaśairupacārakaiḥ |
aṅgadevān samabhyarcya tattaddevagaṇān yajet || 69 ||

<p. 878> vakṣyamāṇena manunā śatamaṣṭottaraṃ hunet |
daśākṣareṇa durgāyai dadyānmandiramuttamam || 70 ||

bhuvaneśīmahābījaṃ durgeyugamudāhṛtam |
rakṣiṇitryakṣaraṃ procya vahnijāyāvadhirmanuḥ || 71 ||

(maṭhadānaphalam)

mantreṇānena yo dadyānmandiraṃ supratiṣṭhitam |
sarvaiśvaryamavāpnoti vaset kalpāyutaṃ divi || 72 ||

(sādhanopadeśaḥ)

iha pīṭhavare divye sādhayet siddhimuttamām |
saptamyāṃ saṃyato bhūtvā mahāṣṭamyāṃ jayecchivām || 73 ||

mahāsnānaṃ mahāpūjāṃ dadyāt sandhau baliṃ tataḥ |
pradīpaṃ mastake dattvā tadraktaiḥ pūjayecchivām || 74 ||

kṛtvāsanaṃ chāgadehaṃ prajapenmanasā dhiyā |
tāñca dhyāyan vibhītaścet sādhako vijitendriyaḥ |
iha loke bhavedrājā paraloke śivopamaḥ || 75 ||

(sādhane phalaviśeṣopadeśaḥ)

yaḥ sadā bhāvayeddevīṃ svātmānaṃ tanmayaṃ naraḥ |
tasya vaśyaṃ jagat sarvaṃ yakṣarākṣasamānuṣam || 76 ||

bhāvena tanmayo bhūtvā yaṃ yaṃ paśyati cakṣuṣā |
sa sa dāso bhavet sārddhaṃ sā sā yāti kulāṅganā || 77 ||


	<71 |> bhuvaneśīti | etena hrīṃ durge durge rakṣiṇi svāhā iti mantro bhavati |

<p. 879> bhāvena tanmayo bhūtvā yaṃ paśyati ruṣānvitaḥ |
hataśrīrjāyate sadyaḥ sahasā duḥkhito bhavet || 78 ||

bhāvena tanmayo bhūtvā prasanno yaṃ prapaśyati |
sa muktaḥ sarvapāpebhyo dāsavajjāyate dhruvam || 79 ||

bhāvena tanmayo bhūtvā yaṃ yaṃ bhāvayate mṛtam |
āśu naśyati niśrīkaḥ sabhṛtyabalavāhanaḥ || 80 ||

bhāvena tanmayo bhūtvā yaṃ yaṃ vidveṣṭi sādhakaḥ |
sarvaloke sa vidviṣṭo jāyate nātra saṃśayaḥ || 81 ||

(homapraśaṃsā)

ekataḥ sarvakarmāṇi ekato japabhāvanā |
sarvādhikaṃ homakarma homāt kiṃ vā na sidhyati || 82 ||

(homākaraṇanindā)

anayā dīkṣito mantrī yadi homavivarjjitaḥ |
duḥkhaṃ prāpnoti manasā kāyena ca na saṃśayaḥ || 83 ||

akurvatāmagnihotramagnirbhūtvā maheśvarī |
dhanāni śīghraṃ grasati gṛhakṣetrapaśūnapi || 84 ||

bahuduḥkhenārjjitāni sañcitāni cireṇa yat |
ātmaprāṇādhikānyāśu bhūtvāgnirgrasatīśvarī || 85 ||

(agnihotrapraśaṃsā)

agnihotraṃ vinā naiva sampadāṃ bhājanaṃ bhavet |
agnihotraparasyeha cāgnirbhavati śītalaḥ || 86 ||

gṛhakṣetrādivītteṣu prayukto'pi dahenna tat |
agnau vasati deveśī tasmādagnau hunet sadā || 87 ||

<p. 880> gurumabhyarccayennityaṃ dhanaistribhiḥ suśobhanaiḥ || 88 ||

militvā sādhakaiḥ sarvairnityaṃ samayamāviśet |
adīkṣitān dvijāṃścāpi tyaktvā karma samācaret || 89 ||

(cakrapraśaṃsā)

cakre pravṛtte tatrasthāḥ sarve varṇā dvijātayaḥ |
nivṛtte bhairavīcakre sarve varṇāḥ pṛthak pṛthak || 90 ||

devīputreṣu tiṣṭhatsu naikaḥ samayamāviśet |
aśubhaṃ jāyate tasya siddhihāniśca jāyate || 91 ||

(vittaśāṭhyaniṣedhaḥ)

vittaśāṭhyaṃ parityajya sarvakarmāṇi sādhayet |
vittaśāṭhyaṃ nihantyāśu putramāyuryaśo dhanam || 92 ||

(gurudevavañcananiṣedhaḥ)

guruṃ devaṃ vañcayitvā yaḥ kuryāddhanasañcayam |
rājabhirnīyate caiva taskarairnīyate'thavā || 93 ||

adhitiṣṭhanti yakṣāśca vahnirdahati vā cirāt |
tyaktvā nikhātaṃ mriyate satyaṃ tena na bhujyate || 94 ||

(vahnau homasya gurave dānasya ca praśaṃsā)

hutamekaguṇaṃ vahnau dattamekaguṇaṃ gurau |
labhyate koṭiguṇitaṃ viśvasenna parāmṛśet || 95 ||

yasya nāsti kva viśvāsaḥ kurute dhanasañcayam |
rājabhirnīyate caiva taskarairnīyate'thavā || 96 ||

[iti śrīpūrṇānandaparamahaṃsaviracite śrī(-)tattvacintāmaṇau ṣaḍviṃśatitamaḥ prakāśaḥ] || 26 ||

[śrītattvacintāmaṇiḥ samāptaḥ] ||

